INSERT INTO `about_about` VALUES (1,'<p><span lang=\"EN-AU\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">Timor-Leste\r\niha infraestrutura ne\'ebé maka iha kualidade, integradu, seguru, no sustentável\r\nno reflete karater no kondisaun sósiu-ekonómiku, sósiu-kulturál povu\r\nTimor-Leste nian, liuliu ba ema vulnerável no difisiente, feto, ferik-katuas no\r\nlabarik sira.</span><br></p>','<p><span lang=\"EN-AU\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">Hasa’e\r\nprestasaun servisu ministériu nian iha área fornesimentu servisu no projetu,\r\nezekusaun orsamentu, kontabilidade no kombate korupsaun.</span><br></p>','<p>Timor-Leste possui infraestruturas de qualidade, integradas, seguras e sustentáveis, que refletem o caráter e as condições socioeconômicas e socioculturais do povo timorense, especialmente para pessoas vulneráveis, deficientes, mulheres, idosos e crianças.</p>','<p>Melhorar o desempenho dos serviços ministeriais nas áreas de fornecimento de serviços e projetos, execução orçamental, contabilidade e combate à corrupção.</p>','<p>Timor-Leste has infrastructure that is of quality, integrated, secure, and sustainable, reflecting the character and socio-economic and socio-cultural conditions of the Timorese people, particularly for vulnerable individuals, persons with disabilities, women, the elderly, and children.<br></p>','<p>Enhancing the performance of ministerial services in the areas of service procurement and projects, budget execution, accounting, and combating corruption.<br></p>','about_data/about_1.png','about_data/orgchart_1_fRNi47F.pdf','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Historia<o:p></o:p></span></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">VIII Governu Konstitusionál</span></u></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Hahú funsaun iha loron 22 fulan-Marsu 2022 to\'o 30 fulan- Juñu 2023</span></i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Ministru Obras Públikas</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Abel Pires da Silva, Ph.D</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-height: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: center; line-heig