-fareast-language:EN-AU\">João\r\nBaptista Alves</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:11.25pt;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:11.25pt;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:18.0pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\">Reestruturasaun\r\nI Governu Konstitusionál iha Loron 26 Jullu 2005</span></i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:11.25pt;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:18.0pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\">Ministra Obras\r\nPúblikas</span></i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\"><br>\r\n<b>Odete Vítor</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:11.25pt;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:18.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:11.25pt;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:18.0pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\">Vise-Ministru\r\nObras Públikas</span></i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU\"><br>\r\n<b>Raúl da Cunha Mousaco</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>');
