olor: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-08-18 07:26:07.110247','a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db',1,1,'2023-08-04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-68-1-1','None-68-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-samuel-marcal-simu-vizita-husi-ifc-1-1',NULL,NULL),(69,'Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal Simu vizita Enkarregada negósiu Austrália Mai Timor-Leste','Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal Simu vizita Enkarregada negósiu Austrália Mai Timor-Leste \r\nDili, 05 Agostu 2023:\r\nMinistru Obras Públika (MOP), Samuel Marçal, simu vizita Enkarregada Negósiu Austrália mai Timor-Leste (Australia’s Charge D’affairs to Timor Leste), Caitlin Wilson,  iha Gabinete Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli-Dili, sesta (04/08/2023).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal Simu vizita Enkarregada negósiu Austrália Mai Timor-Leste </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 05 Agostu 2023:</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika (MOP), Samuel Marçal, simu vizita Enkarregada Negósiu Austrália mai Timor-Leste (Australia’s Charge D’affairs to Timor Leste), Caitlin Wilson,  iha Gabinete Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli-Dili, sesta (04/08/2023).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>sorumutu ne\'e, enkarregada negósiu Austrália mai Timor Leste, Caitlin Wilson, kongratula Samuel Marçal, ne\'ebé hetan fiar hodi asume kargu Ministru Obras Publika iha Governu Konstitusionál Dasia.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Alem de ne\'e, Enkarregada negósiu Australia mai Timor Leste hato\'o mós Governu Austrália nia protidaun atu kontinua servisu hamutuk ho Governu Konstitusionál Dasia ne\'ebé lidera husi Priemiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão. *</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-08-23 06:17:23.920133','14bfa6bb14875e45bba028a21ed38046',1,1,'2023-08-05',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-69-1-1','None-69-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-samuel-marcal-simu-vizita-enkarregada-negosiu-australia-mai-timor-leste-1-1',NULL,NULL),(70,'Komemora Loron F-FDTL, MOP Orienta BTL-EDTL-IGEADI Apoia Tuir Ida-Idak Nia Parte','Komemora Loron F-FDTL, MOP Orienta BTL-EDTL-IGEADI Apoia Tuir Ida-Idak Nia Parte\r\nRelasiona ho komemorasaun loron Forsa Armada Libertasaun Nasionál Timor-Leste-Forças da Defesa de Timor-Leste (F-FDTL) ba dala 48 ne’ebé sei realiza iha suku Aiasa, postu-administrativu Lolotoe, munisípiu Bobonaro.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Komemora Loron F-FDTL, MOP Orienta BTL-EDTL-IGEADI Apoia Tuir Ida-Idak Nia Parte</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Relasiona ho komemorasaun loron Forsa Armada Libertasaun Nasionál Timor-Leste-Forças da Defesa de Timor-Leste (F-FDTL) ba dala 48 ne’ebé sei realiza iha suku Aiasa, postu-administrativu Lolotoe, munisípiu Bobonaro.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Samuel Marçal, liu husi enkontru urjenti ne’ebé halao iha sala reuniaun Ministeriu Obras Públika, orienta ona BTL, E.P, EDTL, E.P no IGE-ADE, I.P hodi bele apoia <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>tuir ida-idak nia parte, hanesan bee moos, jeradór no ekipamentu pezadu hodi hadi’a fatin seremónia nian ne’ebé mak komisaun organizadora identifika ona.Sesta 4/08/2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-08-23 06:44:10.100499','7cbbc409ec990f19c78c75bd1e06f215',1,1,'2023-08-07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-70-1-1','None-70-1-1','komemora-loron-f-fdtl-mop-orienta-btl-edtl-igeadi-apoia-tuir-ida-idak-nia-parte-1-1',NULL,NULL),(71,'Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal Vizita Institutu Boaventura Timor-Leste','Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal Vizita Institutu Boaventura Timor-Leste\r\nMANUFAHI-Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, hala’o vizita ba Instituto Boaventura Timor-Leste (IBTL), Bubur Laran-Luak, Suku Daisua, Postu Administrativu Same, Munisípiu Manufahi, tersa (08/08/2023).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal Vizita Institutu Boaventura Timor-Leste</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">MANUFAHI-Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, hala’o vizita ba Instituto Boaventura Timor-Leste (IBTL), Bubur Laran-Luak, Suku Daisua, Postu Administrativu Same, Munisípiu Manufahi, tersa (08/08/2023).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Vizit ne’ebé Ministru Obras Públika halo Bainhira simu konvite husi Ministru Edukasaun Superior, Siénsia no Kultura, José Honório da Costa Pereira Geronimo hodi observa direta ba konstrusaun Institutu <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>sira iha Munisípiu Manufahi.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha vizita ne’e, Ministru Obras Públika hetan akompaña husi Prezidenti EDTL.E.P, Paulo da Silva ho Diretór Ezekutivu Ajensia Dezenvolvimeno Nasionál, Institutu Públiku (ADN, I.P), Renato da Silva Cruz.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin remata vizita iha IPB, Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa kontinua kedan vizita ba Institutu Politeknika Betano (IPB) hodi haree direta progresu futuru konstrusaun Institutu refere.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-08-23 06:50:16.087483','e2c420d928d4bf8ce0ff2ec19b371514',1,1,'2023-08-09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-71-1-1','None-71-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-samuel-marcal-vizita-institutu-boaventura-timor-leste-1-1',NULL,NULL),(72,'Ministru Obras Públika Halo Inspesaun no Vizita Urjente ba Projeitu sira Area Tuana Laran ho Mota Komoro','Ministru Obras Públika Halo Inspesaun no Vizita Urjente ba Projeitu sira Area Tuana Laran ho Mota Komoro\r\n\r\nDíli, 17 Agostu 2023- Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi Sekretáriu Estadu Eletrisidade, Be’e no Saneamentu (SEEBS) Santos Noronha, hala’o inspesaun no vizita urjente ba projetu iha área mota ninin Maloa,Tuana Laran no projetu konstrusaun moru iha Mota Komoro, Area Kasnafar.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Ministru Obras Públika Halo Inspesaun no Vizita Urjente ba Projeitu sira Area Tuana Laran ho Mota Komoro</p><p>Díli, 17 Agostu 2023- Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi Sekretáriu Estadu Eletrisidade, Be’e no Saneamentu (SEEBS) Santos Noronha, hala’o inspesaun no vizita urjente ba projetu iha área mota ninin Maloa,Tuana Laran no projetu konstrusaun moru iha Mota Komoro, Area Kasnafar.</p><p>Iha vizita urjente ne\'e la\'ós de\'it ba hare projetu sira ne\'ebé kompañia lokál sira kaer, maibé ba hare mós kanu Bee Moos ne’ebé kanaliza ba komunidade sira iha área Mota ninin Maloa,Tuana Laran,Matadouro, Kinta ne\'e.</p><p>Hafoin ba hare tiha kanu ne\'ebé kanaliza bee moos ba komunidade sira, Ministru Obras Públika ho SEEBS inklui ekipa tékniku Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP), inklui na\'in ba kompañia SaliMagu, São Gomes, hakat kedan ba fatin konstrusaun Retaining Wall, Metodu Bore Pile, iha área Kasnafar, Mota Comoro. Konstrusaun retaining wall ne\'e rasik kaer husi kompañia, SaliMagu.*remata</p><p>Média MOP</p><p>Credit Photo : Mídia SEEBS</p></div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-06 06:19:46.113791','32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d',1,1,'2023-08-17',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-72-1-1','None-72-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-halo-inspesaun-no-vizita-urjente-ba-projeitu-sira-area-tuana-laran-ho-mota-komoro-1-1',NULL,NULL),(73,'Ministru Obras Públika Halao Inspesaun ba Projetu Rehabilitasaun Moru Protesaun no Vizita Mós Rotunda Nicolau Lobato','Ministru Obras Públika Halao Inspesaun ba Projetu Rehabilitasaun Moru Protesaun no Vizita Mós Rotunda Nicolau Lobato\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi asesór tékniku Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP)-Eng. Agus Widianto, hala\'o inspesaun ba projetu reabilitasaun Moru protesaun iha área JL Villa,Fatuhada no hala\'o vizita mós ba Rotunda Nicolau dos Reis Lobato Komoro- Dili','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Ministru Obras Públika Halao Inspesaun ba Projetu Rehabilitasaun Moru Protesaun no Vizita Mós Rotunda Nicolau Lobato</p><p>Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi asesór tékniku Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP)-Eng. Agus Widianto, hala\'o inspesaun ba projetu reabilitasaun Moru protesaun iha área JL Villa,Fatuhada no hala\'o vizita mós ba Rotunda Nicolau dos Reis Lobato Komoro- Dili</p><p>Segunda (21/08/2023).</p><p>Mídia MOP</p></div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-06 06:26:08.150422','d2ddea18f00665ce8623e36bd4e3c7c5',1,1,'2023-08-21',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-73-1-1','None-73-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-halao-inspesaun-ba-projetu-rehabilitasaun-moru-protesaun-no-vizita-mos-rotunda-nicolau-lobato-1-1',NULL,NULL),(74,'PN Aprova iha Jeneralidade Proposta Lei Orsamentu Retifikativu 2023','PN Aprova iha Jeneralidade Proposta Lei Orsamentu Retifikativu 2023\r\n\r\nDILI, 22 Agostu 2023- Proposta Lei Orsamentu Retifikativu ba tinan 2023 ne’e hetan ona aprovasaun iha jeneralidade husi Parlamentu Nasionál, iha sesaun plenária iha loron 22 fulan-agostu tinan 2023, ho votus afavór 41, kontra zeru no abstensaun 23.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">PN Aprova iha Jeneralidade Proposta Lei Orsamentu Retifikativu 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> DILI, 22 Agostu 2023- Proposta Lei Orsamentu Retifikativu ba tinan 2023 ne’e hetan ona aprovasaun iha jeneralidade husi Parlamentu Nasionál, iha sesaun plenária iha loron 22 fulan-agostu tinan 2023, ho votus afavór 41, kontra zeru no abstensaun 23.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Proposta Lei ne’e inklui alterasaun dahuluk ba Lei n. 15/2022, loron 21 fulan-dezembru, kona-ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu ba tinan 2023 no ba Lei n. 2/2022, loron 10 <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>fulan-fevereiru, kona-ba Enkuadramentu Orsamentu Jerál Estadu no jestaun finanseira públika, no alterasaun daruak ba Lei n. 8/2008, loron 30 fulan-juñu, kona-ba Lei Tributária.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ho OGE Retifikativu tinan 2023 nian, totál despeza iha Setór Públiku Administrativu tinan 2023 nian ho valór konsolidadu hamutuk dolar amerikanu billaun 1,77. Ho alterasaun ida-ne’e montante transferénsia autorizada husi fundu petrolíferu tun husi dolar amerikanu billaun 1,35 ba dolar amerikanu billaun 1,21.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Hafoin besik fulan ida Programa Governu nian hetan tiha aprovasaun, Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, iha ninia diskursu aprezentasaun Proposta Lei, hateten katak “Governu Konstitusionál IX totalmente komprometidu ba polítika fiskál ida ne’ebé haree liu ba dezenvolvimentu ekonómiku país nian, ne’ebé sei administra gastu no reseita sira ho forma rogoroza no efisiente, atu promove filafali konfiansa, la’ós de’it husi sidadaun sira maibé mós husi investidór sira.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Xefe Governu esplika katak prodús proposta Lei ne’e bazeia ba aspetu prinsipál lima:</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">-  Primeiru relasiona ho alterasaun hirak ne’ebé maka presiza halo ba orsamentu hodi haree ba estrutura governu nian ne’ebé foun, ho alterasaun ka kriasaun ministériu foun sira no mós ho redusaun númeru ba institutus públikus.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">-  Daruak, bazeia ba análize ezekusaun orsamentál to’o momentu ne’e no ho objetivu atu garante kontensaun ba despezas públikas, Governu propoin hodi hamenus despeza.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">-  Aspetu datoluk, kona-ba kompromisu Governu Konstitusionál IX nian atu hamenus presaun inflasionária, ne’ebé kria ona difikuldade boot ba populasaun, liuliu ba sira ne’ebé laiha liu kbiit, ho Governu propoin atu hamenus taxa impostu seletivu ba konsumu masin-midar no direitus aduaneirus ba importasaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">-  Ba dahaat, haree ba governasaun ne’ebé di\'ak impoin rigór no transparénsia iha ezekusaun Orsamentu Jerál Estadu no iha jestaun kontas públikas, Governu propoin alterasaun ba Lei n. 2/2022, loron 10 fulan-fevereiru, kona-ba Enkuadramentu Orsamentu Jerál Estadu no jestaun finanseira públika nian, atu nune\'e OJE 2024 bele hahú prepara ona tuir regra foun sira. Nune\'e, atu garante estabilidade ne’ebé boot tebes iha Orsamentu Jerál Estadu no atu garante sustentabilidade, rigór no transparénsia hosi kontas públikas, sei halakon Lei “Planu Opsaun Prinsipál”, no hodi kria Planu Anuál Investimentu Estratéjiku, hodi permite dalan ida ba vizaun ida kona-ba Orsamentu, tuir prátika internasionál sira ne\'ebé di\'ak liu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">-  Ikusliu, Primeiru-Ministru mós esplika katak propostas alterasoins ba Lei Tributária ne\'ebé ho objetivu atu esklarese no estabiliza rejime fiskál ne\'ebé vigora, atu nune\'e bele oferese seguransa legál no estabilidade fiskál ne\'ebé boot tebes ba investimentu estranjeiru.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> PM Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão  informa ho aprovasaun ne’e permite estrutura governu ne’e sei hala’o servisu ho di’ak liutan.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Aprovasaun ba Orsamentu ida-ne\'e mós permite estrutura foun governu nian atu kumpre ninia misaun, liuliu iha kompromisu atu implementa medida sira ne\'ebé prevee ona ba loron 120 dahuluk husi mandatu ida-ne\'e”, ne\'ebé Xefe Governu asume iha ninia diskursu simu pose Ezekutivu nian. Ho razaun ida-ne\'e no tanba ita-nia populasaun la bele hein tan atu sente benefísiu husi polítika sira ne\'ebé Governu ne’e hakarak implementa” Governu submete ona \"Proposta lei ida-ne\'e ho pedidu prioridade no urjénsia\", nia hatutan.(remata)</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-06 06:32:47.060009','ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251',1,1,'2023-08-22',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-74-1-1','None-74-1-1','pn-aprova-iha-jeneralidade-proposta-lei-orsamentu-retifikativu-2023-1-1',NULL,NULL),(75,'Orsamentu Retifikativu MOP Aprova Ona Iha PN','Orsamentu Retifikativu MOP Aprova Ona Iha PN\r\n\r\nDili, 23 Agosto 2023- Parlamentu Nasional aprova ona proposta orsamentu retifikativu hosi, Ministériu Obras Públika ho votus afavor 50, kontra 0 no abstensaun 13.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Orsamentu Retifikativu MOP Aprova Ona Iha PN</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 23 Agosto 2023- Parlamentu Nasional aprova ona proposta orsamentu retifikativu hosi, Ministériu Obras Públika ho votus afavor 50, kontra 0 no abstensaun 13.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Proposta orsamentu retifikativu Ministeriu Obras Públika (MOP) ne\'ebé Parlamentu Nasional aprova nia montante hamutuk $ 138.422.516.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Husi <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>montante $ 138.422.516 ne\'e sei aloka fali ba iha, salários e Vencimentos hamutuk, $ 5.561.193, bens e serviços, $ 30.049.123, transferências públikas $ 87.050.000, kapital nenor $ 984.200 no  kapital  Dezenvolvimento $ 14.778.000.*</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-06 06:34:09.591473','d09bf41544a3365a46c9077ebb5e35c3',1,1,'2023-08-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-75-1-1','None-75-1-1','orsamentu-retifikativu-mop-aprova-ona-iha-pn-1-1',NULL,NULL),(76,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Sesaun Aprezentasaun Jornada Orsamentais','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Sesaun Aprezentasaun Jornada Orsamentais\r\nDili, Setembru, 12/09/2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, inklui membru IX Governu Konstitusional sira seluk partisipa iha, diskusaun Jornadas Orsamentais, hodi deskuti preparasaun ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) tinan 2024.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Sesaun Aprezentasaun Jornada Orsamentais</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, Setembru, 12/09/2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, inklui membru IX Governu Konstitusional sira seluk partisipa iha, diskusaun Jornadas Orsamentais, hodi deskuti preparasaun ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) tinan 2024.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Governu liu hosi Ministériu Finansas, Iha loron tersa ne’e, organiza, diskusaun Jornadas Orsamentais, semináriu ida ne’ebé marka hahú husi preparasaun ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) tinan 2024 nian, iha auditóriu Xanana Gusmão, iha Ministériu Finansas, iha Dili.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tema hosi Jornada Orsamentais ne’e mak “Kontinua Konsolida no Transforma Prestasaun Servisu nian liuhusi Melloria Sistema Jestaun no Estratéjia sira Investimentu nian”.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu objetivu prinsipál husi semináriu ne’e maka atu define prioridade governamentál nian sira no estabelese tetu fizkál ba tinan oin mai. Jornada Orsamentál sira sei hahú ho diskursu sira abertura nian husi Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, no husi Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha sesaun segundu aprezentasaun Jornada Orsamentais, sei ko’alia kona-ba análize situasaun makro ekonómika, dezempeñu husi investimentu Fundu Petrolíferu, informasaun sira kona-ba empréstimus husi Parserias Públiku-Privadas (PPP), apoiu hudi doadór sira, dezenvolvimentu setór finanseiru iha kontestu konstrusaun Estadu, no papél fundamentál husi  husi Banku Nasionál Komérsiu Timor-Leste (BNCTL-sigla iha lian portugés) iha dezenvolvimentu ekonomia.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Sesaun terseiru nian halo aprezentasaun ba prioridade sira iha mandatu IX Governu Konstitusionál, nune’e mós objetivu sira ne’ebé maka sei alkansa. Iha kontestu ida ne’e sei analiza mos prioridades ba tinan oin mai no senáriu sira ne’ebé relasiona ho tetu fiskál tinan 2024 nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha sesaun ikus nian sei halo diskusaun kona-ba prioridades no tetu fiskál ba 2024, ne’ebé sei taka ho intervensaun husi Primeiru-Ministru.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Eventu ne’e sei konta ho partisipasaun husi membrus hotu Governu nian, husi Prezidente no membrus husi Parlamentu Nasionál, nune’e mós reprezentantes husi liña ministeriál oin-oin, ajénsias autónomas, autoridades munisipais no sosiedade sivil.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-13 07:27:45.525879','fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4',1,1,'2023-09-12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-76-1-1','None-76-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-iha-sesaun-aprezentasaun-jornada-orsamentais-1-1',NULL,NULL),(77,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Misa Komemorasaun Loron Konsulta Popular ba  Dala 24','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Misa Komemorasaun Loron Konsulta Popular ba  Dala 24\r\nDili, 30 Agosto 2023-Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal partisipa iha selebrasaun misa eukaristia, hodi komemorasaun aniversáriu loron konsulta populár ba dala 24 ,ne\'ebé monu iha loron 30 fulan-agostu.\r\nSelebrasaun misa ne\'e hahú iha tuku 9:00, ne’ebé hetan partisipasaun masimo husi membrus Governu Konstitusionál da-9 hotu inklui ho sira nia espoza, iha Igreja Parókia Balide, Dili, Kuarta ne\'e.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Misa Komemorasaun Loron Konsulta Popular ba  Dala 24</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 30 Agosto 2023-Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal partisipa iha selebrasaun misa eukaristia, hodi komemorasaun aniversáriu loron konsulta populár ba dala 24 ,ne\'ebé monu iha loron 30 fulan-agostu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Selebrasaun misa ne\'e hahú iha tuku 9:00, ne’ebé hetan partisipasaun masimo husi membrus Governu Konstitusionál da-9 hotu inklui ho sira nia espoza, iha Igreja Parókia Balide, Dili, Kuarta <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin misa remata, hahú hosi tuku 15:00 sei halo Marxa Saudavel ida, ne’ebé sei hahú iha pontu konsentrasaun tolu – Kuluhun- Ponte Maufelo; Sentru Konvensaun Dilii (CCD); no Jardín 12 de Novembro, Motaél - to’o Jardín Ponte BJ Habibie.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hosi CCD, sei abranje Postu Administrativu Vera Cruz no Na’in Feto, partisipante sira maihusi F-FDTL-PM, UNDIL, Ministériu Saúde, SEFOPE, PNTL Distritál. Dili, MTK, Tribunál Rekursu, MSSI, PDHJ, MAE, Autoridade Munisípiu Dili, Ministériu Justisa, UNTL, RTTL, KFP, MI, MOP, MAKLN, INFORDEPE, BTL, EDTL, Prokuradoria Dili, Komunidade Postu Adm. Vera Cruz no Na’in Feto maka sei hahú hosi ne’ebá. Abertura ba konsentrasaun ne’e sei halo hosi Vise-Ministru Administrasaun Estatál.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Husi Kuluhun-Ponte Maufelo, sei abranje Postu Administrativu Cristo Rei, partisipante sira maihusi Ministériu Justisa no Funsionárius Prizaun Bekora, PNTL Estasaun Bekora, SENAI/SEFOPE, UNITAL, Eskola Sekundária Bekora, MJDAC, Inspesaun Jerál Estadu, CVTL, BCTL, UNTL, Kuartél PNTL, no Komunidade Postu Administrativu Kristu Rei maka sei hahú hosi ne’ebá. Abertura ba konsentrasaun ne’e sei halo husi Sekretáriu Estadu Asuntus Toponímia no Organizasaun Urbana.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ikusliu hosi Jardín 12 de Novembro, Motaél, ne’ebé abranje Postu Administrativu Dom Aleixo, partisipante sira maihusi MAPPF, SEAK, Ministériu Defeza, MPIE, MESSK, MKI, MPM, MNEK, MF, Ministériu Turizmu no Ambiente, Rejistu Sivíl no Notariadu, Tribunál Distritál Dili no Komunidade Postu Dom Aleixo maka sei hahú hosi ne’ebá. Abertura ba konsentrasaun ne’e sei halo husi Ministru Administrasaun Estatál.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Komemorasoins ne’e sei kontinua iha Jardín Ponte B. J. Habibie nia sorin, hahú husi oras tuku 16:00 ho Orasaun. Entre diskursu sira no enserramentu serimónia nian sei hala’o dada-rifas no sorteius, no mós konsertu muzikál ida.*remata</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-13 07:35:10.522564','28dd2c7955ce926456240b2ff0100bde',1,1,'2023-08-30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-77-1-1','None-77-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-misa-komemorasaun-loron-konsulta-popular-ba-dala-24-1-1',NULL,NULL),(78,'Ministru Obras Públika Halo Verifikasaun Ba Estrada Maliana Vila Ne\'ebe Sei Konstrui Husi PT Hutama Karya','Ministru Obras Públika Halo Verifikasaun Ba Estrada Maliana Vila Ne\'ebe Sei Konstrui Husi PT Hutama Karya\r\nMaliana, 28 agostu 2023-Ministru Obra Públika,akompañia hosi ekipa tekniku MOP ho empreza Konstrutór PT Hutama Karya halo verifikasaun iha terrenu,antes implementa projetu kontrusaun estrada iha Maliana Vila.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Halo Verifikasaun Ba Estrada Maliana Vila Ne\'ebe Sei Konstrui Husi PT Hutama Karya</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Maliana, 28 agostu 2023-Ministru Obra Públika,akompañia hosi ekipa tekniku MOP ho empreza Konstrutór PT Hutama Karya halo verifikasaun iha terrenu,antes implementa projetu kontrusaun estrada iha Maliana Vila.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin halo verifikasaun ba estrada ne\'ebé sei konstrui hosi empreza PT Hutama Karya. Iha segunda ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika hateten, hafoin governu anterior asina <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>tiha kontratu no lansa iha loron 01 fulan Juñu 2023, deteta katak, dezenu anteriór ne\'e sai obstákulu boot ba obra refere atu la\'o, tanba Estrada ho nia luan metru 23.41 no naruk kilómetru 4,91. Ne\'e afeta ba komunidade inklui komunidade nia rai no uma privadu barak. Tanba ne’e mak tekniku sira sei hare fila fali husi 4.91 kilómetru 4.91 bele sai fali ba kilómetru 15 ou kilómetru 20.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Hafoin halo verifikasaun, estrada paket rua, hau sei fila fali marka reuniaun, para atu fahe paket, Paket ida toma konta atu hare ba estrada nasional no paket ida sei hare kona-ba Estrada urbana nian,\"haktuir Ministru Obras.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kompania ne’ebé sai responsavel ba obra ne’e mak PT.Hutama Karya ho durasaun kontratu fulan Sanulu Resin Ualu ho montante kontratu 21 Milloens ($21,228,762.00).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Husi verifikasaun no observasaun governante ne’e katak,montante kontratu ne’e sei la menus maibe aumenta volume servisu hosi distansia ne’ebe mensiona i kobre mos Estrada urbana Maliana.*</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-13 07:37:27.026161','35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551',1,1,'2023-08-28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-78-1-1','None-78-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-halo-verifikasaun-ba-estrada-maliana-vila-neebe-sei-konstrui-husi-pt-hutama-karya-1-1',NULL,NULL),(79,'PM Xanana Orienta Reabilita Rezidensia Ba Mediku Sira Atu Hela','PM Xanana Orienta Reabilita Rezidensia Ba Mediku Sira Atu Hela\r\nDili, 01 Setembru 2023- Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão fó orientasaun ba Ministériu Obras Publika (MOP), Ministériu Planeamentu  Investimentu Estrateziku (MPIE) no Ministériu Saúde (MS) atu halo reabilitasaun urjensia ba rezidensia dotor no mediku sira nia hela fatin iha Bidau Toko Baru Dili.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">PM Xanana Orienta Reabilita Rezidensia Ba Mediku Sira Atu Hela</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 01 Setembru 2023- Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão fó orientasaun ba Ministériu Obras Publika (MOP), Ministériu Planeamentu  Investimentu Estrateziku (MPIE) no Ministériu Saúde (MS) atu halo reabilitasaun urjensia ba rezidensia dotor no mediku sira nia hela fatin iha Bidau Toko Baru Dili.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Orientasaun ne’e, Xefe Governu fó, hafoin hamutuk ho Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, Ministra Saúde, Elia A. <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>A. dos Reis Amaral no Ministru Planeamentu Investimentu Estrateziku, Gastão Francisco de Sousa bainhira hala’o vizita no obserbasaun direita ba kondisaun fiziku rezidensia ne’ebé aat ona.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Ita presiza hadia urjensia para fasilita dotor sira bele hela ho di’ak,” dehan PM Xanana.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin halo obserbasaun, Ministru Obras Publiku, Samuel Marçal koordena kedas ho Ministra Saúde no Ministru Planeamentu  Investimentu Estrateziku hodi halo preparasaun atu reabilita iha semana ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Rezidensia ne’ebé mediku Kubanu sira hela halo komesa tempu Indonézia nian kompostu hosi uma boot tolu, no coby house rua dadaun ne’e kondisaun fiziku komesa aat hanesan, uma kakuluk kalen komesa tuan no plafon dodok hotu ona, inklui moru protesaun ne’ebé halo haleu uma komesa nakosu.(remata)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-09-13 07:40:18.723137','d1fe173d08e959397adf34b1d77e88d7',1,1,'2023-09-01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-79-1-1','None-79-1-1','pm-xanana-orienta-reabilita-rezidensia-ba-mediku-sira-atu-hela-1-1',NULL,NULL),(80,'Ministru Obras Públika Samuel Partisipa Reuniaun KAFI iha Ministériu Finansas','Ministru Obras Públika Samuel Partisipa Reuniaun KAFI iha Ministériu Finansas\r\nDili, 04 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal partisipa iha reuniaun Konsellu Administrasaun Fundu Infraestrutura (KAFI) hodi haree no analiza pontu situasaun husi projetu sira Fundu Infraestrutura (FI) ne’ebé daudauk la’o-hela no defini projetu prioritáriu sira ba tinan 2023, hodi garante projetu hirak-ne’e kumpri prosedimentu legál no obra sira iha duni kualidade.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Samuel Partisipa Reuniaun KAFI iha Ministériu Finansas</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 04 Setembru 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal partisipa iha reuniaun Konsellu Administrasaun Fundu Infraestrutura (KAFI) hodi haree no analiza pontu situasaun husi projetu sira Fundu Infraestrutura (FI) ne’ebé daudauk la’o-hela no defini projetu prioritáriu sira ba tinan 2023, hodi garante projetu hirak-ne’e kumpri prosedimentu legál no obra sira iha duni kualidade.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Reuniaun ne’ebé hala’o iha salaun enkontru Ministériu Finansas, Aitarak Laran, segunda (04/08/2023), hodi haree sustentabilidade husi Fundu Infraestrutura liga diretamente ba prioridade estratéjiku sira atu dezenvolve ekonomia, ho impaktu sosiál no ambientál, ne’ebé la’o sorin-sorin ho objetivu sira Dezenvolvimentu Sustentável no Planu Estratéjiku Dezenvolvimentu 2011-2030.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Aliende ne’e, aprova mós ajenda reuniaun nian bazeia ba assuntu importante sira ne’ebé nesesita desizaun imediata husi KAFI, teknikamente diskute no konfirma ona iha nível pre-KAFI iha loron 15, 17 no 21 agosto 2023 &amp; 28 agosto 2023. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ajenda reuniaun ne’e aktualiza nafatin servisu KAFI nian, bazeia ba koordenasaun, diskusaun tékniku inklui dokumentu justifikativu sira ne’ebé tenke fornese husi projetu nain, Inklui mós aktualiza nafatin pre-reuniaun KAFI sira ne’ebé hala\'o ona, liuhusi aprezentasaun sumáriu aktualizasaun pre-Reuniaun KAFI 2023.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha reuniaun KAFI ne’e atualiza mós Minutas reuniaun ne’ebé hala’o iha loron 25 Agostu ne’ebé halo ona aprovasaun ba extensaun kontratu Shanghai Construction Group Co.,Ltd. ba projetu New Construction of Quartel Geral da PNTL Office Building in Caicoli, Dili, Timor-Leste ne’ebé aprova iha reuniaun KAFI, iha loron 25/08/2023. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Reauniaun KAFI ne’e partisipa husi membru sira, inklui Diretór Ezekutivu Ajénsia Dezenvolvimentu Nasionál, Institutu Públiku (ADN, I.P), Eng. Mariano Renato Monteiro da Cruz, no Prezidente Komisaun Nasionál Aprovizionamentu (CNA), Hermingardo Albano Soares. (*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-13 07:49:30.152200','f033ab37c30201f73f142449d037028d',1,1,'2023-09-04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-80-1-1','None-80-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-samuel-partisipa-reuniaun-kafi-iha-ministeriu-finansas-1-1',NULL,NULL),(81,'Ministru Obras Públika Simu Vizita Kortezia Hosi JICA','Ministru Obras Públika Simu Vizita Kortezia Hosi JICA\r\nDili, 29 Agosto 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hetan vizita kortezia hosi, Xefe Reprezentativu JICA iha Timor Leste Dr. ITO Mimei ho ninia ekipa.\r\nEnkontru entre ekipa JICA ho Ministru Obras Públika, hala’o iha sala gabineti Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli, Sesta ne’e.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Simu Vizita Kortezia Hosi JICA</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 29 Agosto 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hetan vizita kortezia hosi, Xefe Reprezentativu JICA iha Timor Leste Dr. ITO Mimei ho ninia ekipa.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Enkontru entre ekipa JICA ho Ministru Obras Públika, hala’o iha sala gabineti Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli, Sesta ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Objetivu husi vizita ida ne\'e atu koalia kona ba inisiativu agora nian, liu hosi suporta ne\'ebé oferese hosi povu Japaun ba Povu Timor-Leste. Inklui progama sira ne\'ebé foka husi IX Governu Konstitusional.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne’e JICA lahaluha hato’o agradese wai’in ba Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,ne’ebe disponibiliza ona tempu atu simu JICA.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-25 01:31:21.584895','43ec517d68b6edd3015b3edc9a11367b',1,1,'2023-09-22',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-81-1-1','None-81-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-simu-vizita-kortezia-hosi-jica-1-1',NULL,NULL),(82,'Ministru Obras Públika Enkontru ho Federal Insurance','Ministru Obras Públika Enkontru ho Federal Insurance\r\nDili,21 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,simu vizita kortezia hosi ekipa Federal Insurance Timor,S.A. ne’ebé lidera hosi Director Manager- Perosi Su’a, objetivu hosi vizita ne’e mak diskute assuntu kona-ba atu promove servisu seguru nian ba membru governu sira, tanba haree ba situasaun rai laran presiza tebes promosaun seguransa jeral.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Enkontru ho Federal Insurance</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili,21 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,simu vizita kortezia hosi ekipa Federal Insurance Timor,S.A. ne’ebé lidera hosi Director Manager- Perosi Su’a, objetivu hosi vizita ne’e mak diskute assuntu kona-ba atu promove servisu seguru nian ba membru governu sira, tanba haree ba situasaun rai laran presiza tebes promosaun seguransa jeral.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Hafoin simu tiha ekipa hosi Federal Insurance, Ministru Ministru Obras Públika, kontinua halao enkontru iha sala Gabineti Ministériu Obras Públika,Caicoli, Kinta ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Antes atu remata vizita, Director Manager Federal Insurance-Perosi Su’a, hato\'o mos felisitasaun ba Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal ne\'ebé hetan fiar hodi asume kargu Ministru iha Membru IX Governu Konstitusional.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-25 01:33:50.225673','9778d5d219c5080b9a6a17bef029331c',1,1,'2023-09-21',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-82-1-1','None-82-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-enkontru-ho-federal-insurance-1-1',NULL,NULL),(83,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Reuniaun Proposta Orsamentu MOP','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Reuniaun Proposta Orsamentu MOP\r\nDili, 20 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika- Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo no Secretário de Estado da Eletricidade, Água e Saneamento-Santos Noronha, akompania aprezentasaun proposta Orsamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP) 2024, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Diretor Jeral em Ezersisiu-Dirasaun Jeral Adminitrasaun i Finansas-João Amaral.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Reuniaun Proposta Orsamentu MOP</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 20 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika- Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo no Secretário de Estado da Eletricidade, Água e Saneamento-Santos Noronha, akompania aprezentasaun proposta Orsamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP) 2024, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Diretor Jeral em Ezersisiu-Dirasaun Jeral Adminitrasaun i Finansas-João Amaral.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Aprezentasaun proposta orsamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP) hala’o iha sala reuniaun MOP, Caicoli, Kuarta ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Partisipante sira ne’ebé hola parte iha reuniaun ne’e mak diresaun hirak ne’ebe tutela ba iha Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu Objetivu hosi reuniaun ida ne’e mak atu trasa planu orsamentu, Ministériu Obras Públika hodi preve ba iha OJE 2024, hodi ba halo aprezentsaun iha Komité Revizaun Polítiku (KROP).(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-25 01:35:25.839675','fe9fc289c3ff0af142b6d3bead98a923',1,1,'2023-09-20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-83-1-1','None-83-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-reuniaun-proposta-orsamentu-mop-1-1',NULL,NULL),(84,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Reuniaun Konsellu Ministrus','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Reuniaun Konsellu Ministrus \r\nDili, 19 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal partisipa iha reuniaun Konsellu Ministru. Entretantu iha reuniaun Konsellu Ministru aprova projetu Proposta Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Ministru Administrasaun Estatál, Tomás do Rosário Cabral, kona-ba alterasaun dahaat ba Lei n. 11/2009, loron 7 fulan-outubru, ne’ebé aprova Divizaun Administrativa Territóriu.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Reuniaun Konsellu Ministrus </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 19 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal partisipa iha reuniaun Konsellu Ministru. Entretantu iha reuniaun Konsellu Ministru aprova projetu Proposta Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Ministru Administrasaun Estatál, Tomás do Rosário Cabral, kona-ba alterasaun dahaat ba Lei n. 11/2009, loron 7 fulan-outubru, ne’ebé aprova Divizaun Administrativa Territóriu. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Reuniaun Konsellu Ministru ne’e hala’o iha Palásiu Governu,Dili, Tersa ne’e. </div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tuir nota komunikadu ne’ebé fo sai hosi Media Prezidensia Konsellu Ministrus,  aprova ona projetu Proposta Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Ministru Administrasaun Estatál, Tomás do Rosário Cabral, kona-ba alterasaun dahaat ba Lei n. 11/2009, loron 7 fulan-outubru, ne’ebé aprova Divizaun Administrativa Territóriu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tuir saida maka prevee ona iha Programa Governu Konstitusionál IX, alterasaun ne’e ho atensaun atu halakon munisípiu Atauru no kria fali divizaun administrativa eskalaun dahuluk foun ida, ne’ebé hanaran “Atauru”, hanesan ne’ebé prevee ona iha artigu da-5 Konstituisaun Repúblika nian, hodi fó-hatene katak Atauru goza tratamentu administrativu no ekonómiku espesiál.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Halo mós eliminasaun referénsia ba “Sukus” hanesan parte husi divizaun administrativa, tanba Sukus mak entidade ne’ebé liga ba Administraun Autónoma no la’ós hanesan parte husi divizaun administrativa territóriu nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ho alterasaun ida-ne’e, territóriu Repúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste kompostu husi divizaun administrativa eskalaun dahuluk hanesan tuirmai ne’e: Ataúru; Munisípiu Aileu; Munisípiu Ainaru; Munisípiu Baukau; Munisípiu Bobonaru; Munisípiu Covalima; Munisípiu Díli; Munisípiu Ermera; Munisípiu Lautém; Munisípiu Likísa; Munisípiu Manatutu; Munisípiu Manufahi; Munisípiu Vikeke; no Rejiaun Administrativa Espesiál Oekuse Ambenu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Konsellu Ministru aprova mos projetu Dekretu-Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta mós husi Ministru Administrasaun Estatál, kona-ba alterasaun datoluk ba Dekretu-Lei n. 6/2014, loron 26 fulan-fevereiru, kona-ba rekursus materiais no insentivu finanseiru lideransa komunitária nian sira, no kria servisu administrasaun Suku nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ho intervensaun normativa ida-ne’e, halo kriasaun Servisu Administrasaun Suku, hanesan servisu administrativu apoiu ba Xefe Suku, no haforsa valór subvensaun públika ne’ebé fó husi Estadu ba Xefe Suku sira ba finansiamentu despeza sira ne’ebé relasiona ho pagamentu remunerasaun rekursu umanu sira ne’ebé presta atividade iha servisu administrasaun Suku nian ne’ebé kria agora. Diploma ne’e halo mós armonizasaun ba ninia redasaun ho Dekretu-Lei n. 49/2023 no permite pagamentu ajuda kustu ba lider komunitáriu sira, bainhira hirak-ne’e mobiliza ona husi administrasaun sentrál Estadu, direta ka indireta nian, hodi partisipa iha atividade ne’ebé organiza no hala’o ona husi órgaun no servisu sira-ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Konsellu Ministrus aprova projetu Dekretu-Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, Ministru Koordenadór Asuntus Ekonómikus no Ministru Turizmu no Ambiente, Francisco Kalbuadi Lay, kona-ba orgánika Ministériu Turizmu no Ambiente (MTA) nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministériu Turizmu no Ambiente ne’e hanesan departamentu governamentál ida ne’ebé responsavel ba konsesaun, ezekusaun, koordenasaun no avaliasaun polítika, ne’ebé define no aprova ona husi Konsellu Ministrus ba área turizmu no ambiente.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entre atribuisaun oioin husi MTA, inklui elaborasaun polítika no projetu lejizlasaun no regulamentasaun nesesáriu ba área sira ne’ebé iha nia tutela, apoiu ba implementasaun estratéjika dezenvolvimentu “Ekonomia Azúl”, avaliasaun no lisensiamentu emprendimentu turístiku, inspesaun no fiskalizasaun ba atividade turístika sira, nune’e mós protesaun ambiente no biodiversidade. Responsavel mós hodi estabelese mekanizmus kolaborasaun no kooperasaun ho organizmu nasionál no internasionál sira ne’ebé ninia asaun ba área sira atuasaun Ministériu nian hodi simplifika prosesu sira lisensiamentu nian iha setór turizmu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Konsellu Ministru Aprova ona mós projetu Dekretu-Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Ministru Marcos da Cruz, ne’ebé aprova orgánika Ministériu Agrikultura, Pekuária, Peska no Florestas.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministériu Agrikultura, Pekuária, Peska no Florestas ne’e hanesan departamentu governamentál ne’ebé responsavel ba konsesaun, ezekusaun, koordenasaun no avaliasaun polítika, ne’ebé define no aprova ona husi Konsellu Ministrus, ba área agrikultura, florestas, peskas no pekuária.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Konsellu Ministrus aprova Projetu Dekretu-Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Vise-Primeru-Ministru no hosi Ministru Koordenadór Asuntus Ekonómikus no Sekretáriu Estadu Kooperativas, Arsénio Pereira da Silva, kona-ba orgánika Sekretaria Estadu Kooperativas (SEKOOP) nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne’e Konsellu Ministru aprova mos projetu Dekretu-Lei, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru no Ministru Koordenadór Asuntus Ekonómikus nomos hosi Sekretáriu Estadu Formasaun Profisionál no Empregu, Rogério Araújo Mendonça, kona-ba orgánika Sekretaria Estadu Formasaun Profisionál no Empregu (SEFOPE) nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Polítika kriasaun empregu no melloria kualidade nian formasaun profisionál nu’udar prioridades hosi Governu Konstitusionál IX, ho objetivu atu kontribui ba redusaun taxa dezempregu, redusaun ba taxa moris-ki’ak ho mínimu sai 10%, no mós kondisaun ba inkluzaun, moris-di’ak no dignidade ida ne’ebé boot tebes iha sosiedade.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Alende ne’e Konsellu Ministrus delibera no fo ona autorizasaun ba negosiasaun no asinatura memorandum entendimentu ida entre Provínsia Hunan, Repúblika Populár Xina no Administrasaun Munisipál Manatutu nian ne’ebé sei reprezenta hosi Ministru Administrasaun Estatál, Repúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste, ho objetivu atu estabelese relasoins kooperasaun ba promosaun desentralizasaun administrativa no dezenvolvimentu lokál iha munisípiu Manatutu iha Timor-Leste. Konsellu Ministrus fó mós podér tomak ba Ministru Administrasaun Estatál hodi asina memorandum entendimentu ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Konsellu Ministrus mos delibera ona hodi fó autorizasaun ba asinatura memorandum entendimentu entre Ministériu Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku Repúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste no Komisaun Nasionál Dezenvolvimentu no Reforma Repúblika Populár Xina, kona-ba reforsu interkámbiu informasaun nian sira iha área jestaun makroekonómika no planeamentu dezenvolvimentu ba médiu no longu prazu, ho objetivu atu promove dezenvolvimentu ekonómiku no sosiál país rua ne’e nian, hodi permite promove, dezenvolve no reforsa komérsiu, investimentu, turizmu no interkámbiu kulturál.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu iha reuniaun Konsellu Ministru ne’e aprova ona mós projetu Rezolusaun Governu, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, Ministru Koordenadór Asuntus Ekonómikus no Ministru Turizmu no Ambiente, Francisco Kalbuadi Lay, hodi nomea Virgílio Smith ba kargu Prezidente Konsellu Diretivu ba Autoridade Turizmu Timor-Leste, I.P. (ATTL,IP) no Ildefonso de Carvalho ba kargu Vogál Konsellu Diretivu ATTL, IP, nian ba mandatu tinan haat, tau iha konsiderasaun ba ninia kompeténsia téknika no aptidaun hodi hala’o funsaun sira  temi ona.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ikus-liu, Konsellu Ministrus delibera ona hodi fó autorizasaun ba asinatura memorandum entendimentu entre Governu Timor-Leste, reprezenta husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, Ministru Koordenadór Asuntus Ekonómikus no Ministru Turizmu no Ambiente, no Governu Brunei Darussalam, ba programa haruka trabalhadór Timor-Leste ba servisu iha Brunei. Embaixador Timor-Leste nian ba Brunei, Abel Guterres, sei mai apoia iha preparasaun husi traballadores nasionais.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-25 01:36:59.665372','68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21',1,1,'2023-09-19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-84-1-1','None-84-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-iha-reuniaun-konsellu-ministrus-1-1',NULL,NULL),(85,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Aprezentasaun Relatoriu Projetu Hosi 2015-2023','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Aprezentasaun Relatoriu Projetu Hosi 2015-2023\r\nDili, 28 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompañia hosi Vise Ministru Infraestrutura-Julio do Carmo,Diretor Jeral em Ezersisiu-Dirasaun Jeral Adminitrasaun i Finansas-João Amaral inklui  Diretur Geral Direção Nasional das Estradas Ponte i Controlo dé Cheias-Rui Hernani Freitas Guterres, abertura aprezentasaun no diskusaun relatoriu projetu hosi 2015 to\'o 2023.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Aprezentasaun Relatoriu Projetu Hosi 2015-2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 28 Setembru 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompañia hosi Vise Ministru Infraestrutura-Julio do Carmo,Diretor Jeral em Ezersisiu-Dirasaun Jeral Adminitrasaun i Finansas-João Amaral inklui  Diretur Geral Direção Nasional das Estradas Ponte i Controlo dé Cheias-Rui Hernani Freitas Guterres, abertura aprezentasaun no diskusaun relatoriu projetu hosi 2015 to\'o 2023.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Aprezentasaun relatoriu projetu ne’e hala’o Salaun Auditoriu, Kampus UNTL Hera, Kinta ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Partisipante ne’ebe hola parte iha aprezentasaun relatoriu projetu 2015-2023, kompostu hosi kompañia lokal no konsultan lokal. Objetivu hosi diskusaun ne’e mak, husu kompania lokal sira ne’ebe kaer projeitu iha dentru tinan 2015 to mai 2023, seidauk finaliza sira nia projetu.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne’e Ministru Obras Públik, husu ba emprezariu sira atu hato sira nia preokupasaun ligado ho projeitu ne’ebe sira kaer, ne’ebe to ate a data obra ne’e seidauk finaliza.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-29 00:35:22.205727','3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193',1,2,'2023-09-28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-85-1-1','None-85-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-iha-aprezentasaun-relatoriu-projetu-hosi-2015-2023-1-1',NULL,NULL),(86,'KM Aprova Rezolusaun Governu Kona-ba Prezervasaun Bee Inklui Planu Intervensaun Hodi Reabilita Urjente Infraestrutura Ne\'ebé Hetan Estragus Hosi Kalamidade','KM Aprova Rezolusaun Governu Kona-ba Prezervasaun Bee Inklui Planu Intervensaun Hodi Reabilita Urjente Infraestrutura Ne\'ebé Hetan Estragus Hosi Kalamidade\r\nDili, 27 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha kuarta ne\'e, partisipa reuniaun Konsellu Ministru (KM), ne\'ebé lidera hosi Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, iha Palasiu Governu.\r\nIha reuniaun ne\'e Konsellu Ministrus aprova ona projetu Rezolusaun Governu kona-ba nesesidade vijilánsia no prezervasaun ba sistema abastesimentu bee nian.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">KM Aprova Rezolusaun Governu Kona-ba Prezervasaun Bee Inklui Planu Intervensaun Hodi Reabilita Urjente Infraestrutura Ne\'ebé Hetan Estragus Hosi Kalamidade</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 27 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha kuarta ne\'e, partisipa reuniaun Konsellu Ministru (KM), ne\'ebé lidera hosi Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, iha Palasiu Governu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>reuniaun ne\'e Konsellu Ministrus aprova ona projetu Rezolusaun Governu kona-ba nesesidade vijilánsia no prezervasaun ba sistema abastesimentu bee nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ho nunee, Ministériu Obras Públikas no Bee Timor-Leste (BTL.EP)  kontinua tau prioridade hodi rezolve problema abastesimentu nian ho lais, ho avaliasaun no reabilitasaun ba infraestrutura sira kanalizasaun nian ne’ebé eziste, nune’e mós nia eventuál rekonstrusaun, hodi garante fornesimentu bee ne’ebé adekuadu ba populasaun. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Autoridade públika kompetente sira mós iha responsabilidade hodi koordena inisiativa sira sensibilizasaun nian kona-ba importánsia husi poupa no uzu responsavel ba bee no infraestruturas kanalizasaun nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu iha reuniaun ne\'e mós Konsellu Ministrus aprova planu intervensaun ho karater urjente, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Ministru Obras Públikas\'Samuel Marçal, hodi reabilita no rekonstrui ho urjénsia infraestruturas ne’ebé afeta hosi kalamidade ne’ebé akontese iha munisípiu ualu hosi loron 2 to’o 7 fulan-jullu tinan 2023.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-09-29 00:37:25.046125','93db85ed909c13838ff95ccfa94cebd9',1,2,'2023-09-27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-86-1-1','None-86-1-1','km-aprova-rezolusaun-governu-kona-ba-prezervasaun-bee-inklui-planu-intervensaun-hodi-reabilita-urjente-infraestrutura-neebe-hetan-estragus-hosi-kalamidade-1-1',NULL,NULL),(87,'Ministru Obras Públika Observa Direta Kondisaun Mota, Antes Halo Dezenu ba Moru Protesaun','Ministru Obras Públika Observa Direta Kondisaun Mota, Antes Halo Dezenu ba Moru Protesaun\r\nDíli, 30  Setembru 2023,\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Prezidenti IGE-ADI- Eng. Ana Paula da Cruz, Diresaun Nasionál Estrada, Ponte no Kontrolu Cheias inklui ekipa tekniku Ministériu Obras Públika, hala’o observasaun urgente ba Mota Maloa inklui valeta sira iha area Tuana Laran, Area Perumnas, mota Manleu no mos Área nebe’e afeita ba inundasaun iha Dili Laran.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Observa Direta Kondisaun Mota, Antes Halo Dezenu ba Moru Protesaun</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Díli, 30  Setembru 2023,</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Prezidenti IGE-ADI- Eng. Ana Paula da Cruz, Diresaun Nasionál Estrada, Ponte no Kontrolu Cheias inklui ekipa tekniku Ministériu Obras Públika, hala’o observasaun urgente ba Mota Maloa inklui valeta sira iha area Tuana Laran, Area Perumnas, mota Manleu no mos Área nebe’e afeita ba inundasaun iha Dili Laran.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>vizita ne’e, Ministru Obras Públika, orienta ona IGE-ADI no ekipa tekniku Ministériu Obras Públika, atu halo dezenu moru protesaun iha Mota Maloa inklui loke dalan alternativu ba komunidade sira iha area refere.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika mos , husu ba IGE-ADI, se bele iha tempu badak, normaliza tiha bee dalan sira iha area Perumnas, Bairo Pite, e are sira seluk nune bainhira akontese udan boot, labele fo ameasa ba komunidade ne’ebe hela iha area mota ninin.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin remata vizita iha Mota Maloa no Valeta sira iha Perumnas, Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa, kontinua hakat fali mota Manleu no fatin sira Seluk.*remata</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-02 02:38:21.062116','c7e1249ffc03eb9ded908c236bd1996d',1,2,'2023-09-30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-87-1-1','None-87-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-observa-direta-kondisaun-mota-antes-halo-dezenu-ba-moru-protesaun-1-1',NULL,NULL),(88,'Ministru Partisipa Reuniaun Linã Ministérial Iha Finansas','Ministru Partisipa Reuniaun Linã Ministérial Iha Finansas\r\nDili, 30 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha loron Sabado ne\'e, partisipa reuniaun linã ministerial iha Ministériu Finansas.\r\nAsuntu ne\'ebé Ministru Obras Públika koalia iha reuniuan ne\'e mak, asuntu EDTL no BTL no  projeitu boot ne\'ebé sei implementa iha Tinan oin.\r\nEntretantu iha reuniaun ne\'e','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Partisipa Reuniaun Linã Ministérial Iha Finansas</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 30 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha loron Sabado ne\'e, partisipa reuniaun linã ministerial iha Ministériu Finansas.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Asuntu ne\'ebé Ministru Obras Públika koalia iha reuniuan ne\'e mak, asuntu EDTL no BTL no  projeitu boot ne\'ebé sei implementa iha Tinan oin.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu iha reuniaun ne\'e </div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Runiaun ne\'e rasik deskuti mos osan emprestimu ne\'ebé governu Timor Leste foti hosi ADB no Banku Mundial, hodi finansia ba projeitu sira iha Timor Leste.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">partisipa hosi Ministru Transporte no Komunikasuan-Miguel Manetelu,Ministra Finansas-Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku-Gastão Francisco de Sousa, Vise-Ministra Finansas-Felicia Claudina da Cruz Carvalho.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-02 02:41:09.648603','2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070',1,2,'2023-09-30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-88-1-1','None-88-1-1','ministru-partisipa-reuniaun-lina-ministerial-iha-finansas-1-1',NULL,NULL),(89,'Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, halao enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Mundial','Dili, 29 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, halao enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Mundial ne’ebé lidera hosi Bernard Harbone, hodi ko’alia kona-ba osan emprestimo ne’ebé Governu Timor Leste foti hodi finannsia projeitu sira Munisipiu Baucau no Dili, enkontru ne’e rasik hala’o iha sala reuniaun Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli, Sesta ne’e.(*)\r\nMídia MOP','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 29 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, halao enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Mundial ne’ebé lidera hosi Bernard Harbone, hodi ko’alia kona-ba osan emprestimo ne’ebé Governu Timor Leste foti hodi finannsia projeitu sira Munisipiu Baucau no Dili, enkontru ne’e rasik hala’o iha sala reuniaun Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli, Sesta ne’e.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-02 02:44:52.876134','7647966b7343c29048673252e490f736',1,2,'2023-09-29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-89-1-1','None-89-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-samuel-marcal-halao-enkontru-ho-delegasaun-banku-mundial-1-1',NULL,NULL),(90,'Realiza Festival Kultural no Desportu, PR Horta Enkontru Ho Membru Governu','Realiza Festival Kultural no Desportu, PR Horta Enkontru Ho Membru Governu\r\nDili,28 Setembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho membru Governu sira seluk, hasoru malu ho Prezidente Republika, José Ramos-Horta, hodi deskute planu asaun ba preparasaun eventu festival kultural no desportu ne\'ebe sei realiza iha tinan oin.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Realiza Festival Kultural no Desportu, PR Horta Enkontru Ho Membru Governu</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili,28 Setembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho membru Governu sira seluk, hasoru malu ho Prezidente Republika, José Ramos-Horta, hodi deskute planu asaun ba preparasaun eventu festival kultural no desportu ne\'ebe sei realiza iha tinan oin.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Enkontru ne\'e rasik hala\'o iha Palasiu Prezidensial, Aitarak Laran, Kinta ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin remata hasoru malu, Asesor  Prezidenti Republika Agostinho Caet, informa, enkontru ida ohin Prezidente Republika ho membru Governu sira deskuti kona-ba festival Kultural no desporto neebe realiza iha tinan 2024.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Festival Kultural no Desportu ne\'e realiza iha 15 de Setembru to\'o 15 Outubru 2024.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Objetivu hosi realiza atividade ne\'e mak atu hametin unidade nasional nomos atu promove Timor nia area turismo. Iha enkontru nee mos desidi ona atu establese komisaun ida, no koalia mos oinsa kada ministeriu prepara orsamentu para bele enkaisa iha mekanismo ida atu nunee bele realiza atividade bele susesu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entratantu orsamentu ne\'ebé atu aloka ba eventu sei deskuti, maibe hosi Palasiu Prezidensial rasik sei preve osan $ 2 Millaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Eventu ne\'e rasik Preziente Republika Jose Ramos-Horta sei konvida komunidade aborigin (Australia),  Komunidade Mauri (Nova Zelandia), Komunidade papua Indonezia hodi partisipa festival kultura no desportu, iha ne\'ebé Timor Leste sei sai uma nain ba eventu refere.*</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-02 02:46:40.332599','8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a',1,2,'2023-09-28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-90-1-1','None-90-1-1','realiza-festival-kultural-no-desportu-pr-horta-enkontru-ho-membru-governu-1-1',NULL,NULL),(91,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Seremónia Entrega Kargu ANE.I.P ho ANAS,I.P ba DGRSEAS','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Seremónia Entrega Kargu ANE.I.P ho ANAS,I.P ba DGRSEAS\r\nDili, 03 Outubru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompañia hosi Prezidenti Ezekutivu sesante Autoridade Nasionál ba Eletrisidade (ANE, I.P) -Ruben Jerónimo Freitas ho Prezidenti Ezekutivu sesante Autoridade Nasionál ba Be\'e no Saneamentu (ANAS, I.P)-Domingos Pinto, partisipa iha seremónia termus entrega kargu ANE,I.P no ANAS,I.P ba Diretora Geral Regulasaun Seitor Eletricidade, Agua e Saneamentu (DGRSEAS)-Arlinda Miranda.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Seremónia Entrega Kargu ANE.I.P ho ANAS,I.P ba DGRSEAS</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 03 Outubru 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompañia hosi Prezidenti Ezekutivu sesante Autoridade Nasionál ba Eletrisidade (ANE, I.P) -Ruben Jerónimo Freitas ho Prezidenti Ezekutivu sesante Autoridade Nasionál ba Be\'e no Saneamentu (ANAS, I.P)-Domingos Pinto, partisipa iha seremónia termus entrega kargu ANE,I.P no ANAS,I.P ba Diretora Geral Regulasaun Seitor Eletricidade, <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Agua e Saneamentu (DGRSEAS)-Arlinda Miranda.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Seremónia termus entrega kargu ANE-IP ho ANAS,I.P ba Diretora Geral Regulasaun Seitor Eletricidade, Agua e Saneamentu, hala’o iha sala reuniaun EDTL, E.P.Caicoli, Tersa ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha nia deskurusu Ministru Obras Públika hato’o agradese wain ba Prezidenti Ezekutivu ANE,I.P no ANAS,I.P, ne\'ebé iha tinan hira nia laran hala’o ona kna’ar ho diak, hodi servi ba rai ida ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Hau hato’o agradese wain ba ita bo’ot nain rua, ba servisu ne’ebe ita boot nain rua halo ona iha tibnan hira nia laran. Seremonia ida ohin ita hotu mai partisipa iha ne’e laos atu dehan ita bo’ot nain rua la halo servisu ka kapasidade la iha mak troka ita bo’ot nain rua, lae ?, \"hatete Ministru Obras Públika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne’e, Diretora DGRSEAS-Arlinda Miranda haktuir, agradese ba aman Maromak, tamba ho deit nia hakarak mak, ohin hau bele hetan oportunidade bele hamrik iha ne\'e nu’udar DGRSEAS.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> \"Hau fiar katak,konfiansa ne’ebé ita bo\'ot sira depozita ona mai hau hodi assume kargu nu’udar Diretora DGRSEAS. Ho fiar ida katak, ba oin Dirasaun Geral nia servisu kontinua halaó servisu sira ne’ebé ANE,I.P no ANAS,I.P halo ona no ajusta tan aktividades balu hodi bele melhora servisu iha Dirasaun Geral ida ne ho diak, nu’udar reguladora ba aktividades hotu iha seitor eletrisidade, Agua no Saneamento. Atu bele alkansa objetivu ka metas ne’ebé iha presija servisu hamutuk ho parte hotu, tamba ne ho haraik an hakarak husu ita bot sira nia hanoin diak, servisu hamutuk ho kordenasaun ne’ebé diak, liu-liu parte ne’ebé  relevantes hanesan EDTL-EP, BTL-EP,\"dehan DGRSEAS.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Diretora Geral Regulasaun Seitor Eletricidade, Agua e Saneamentu haktuir, nia hamrik iha ne’e ho Orgulho, nu’udar Diretora Geral para Regulacao dos seitores da Eletricidade, Agua i Saneamento, hanesan kargu ne’ebé a’as liu mos iha funsaun publiku. Kargu ida ne’ebé nia hetan laos deit tamba kbit ne’ebé nia iha, maibe mos tamba apoio husi ema hotu ne’ebé nia hasoru iha nia moris tomak, nu’udar oan, nu’udar maun alin, nu’udar kaben, nu’udar inan no liu liu iha momentu ne’ebé  sira presiza nia prezensa nu’udar funsionariu publiku ne’ebé  hetan konfiansa husi superior sira hodi assume kargu importante nudar Diretora Geral.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-04 08:06:04.182586','54229abfcfa5649e7003b83dd4755294',1,2,'2023-10-03',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-91-1-1','None-91-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-seremonia-entrega-kargu-aneip-ho-anasip-ba-dgrseas-1-1',NULL,NULL),(92,'Loron Daruak Reuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu, Diskuti Orsamentu Ministériu Haat','Loron Daruak Reuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu, Diskuti Orsamentu Ministériu Haat\r\nDili, 25 Outubru 2023\r\nReuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu (KRO) hodi deskuti Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) ba tinan 2024, iha loron daruak ne\'ebé kontinua lidera hosi Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, iha kuarta-feira ne\'e \r\nTama ba loron daruak, Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana kontinua prezide reuniaun Komité Revizaun Orsamentu (KRO) ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE), tinan 2024 hodi rona aprezentasaun hosi Ministériu Haat (4) iha Auditóriu Ministériu Finansa, Aitarak','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron Daruak Reuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu, Diskuti Orsamentu Ministériu Haat</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 25 Outubru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Reuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu (KRO) hodi deskuti Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) ba tinan 2024, iha loron daruak ne\'ebé kontinua lidera hosi Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, iha kuarta-feira ne\'e </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tama <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>ba loron daruak, Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana kontinua prezide reuniaun Komité Revizaun Orsamentu (KRO) ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE), tinan 2024 hodi rona aprezentasaun hosi Ministériu Haat (4) iha Auditóriu Ministériu Finansa, Aitarak</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tuir ajenda diskusaun, iha dader ne\'e KRO hahu deskuti uluk proposta orsamentu hosi Ministériu  Transporte  no Telekomunikasaun ho nia entidade tutela sira, Administrasaun Portu Timor-Leste (APTL), Autoridade Aviasaun Sivil Timor-Leste (AVCTL), Autoridade Nasionál Telekomunikasaun (ANC), Tekonologia Informasaun Komunikasaun (TIC,I.P) no Ministériu Saúde ho diresaun sira hotu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha parte lokoraik KRO,kontinua rona aprezentasaun hosi, Ministériu Komersiu Industria no Ministériu Agrikultura ni Peskas.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu iha sorin seluk, reuniaun Konsellu Ministru nian ne\'ebé hala\'o iha Palásiu Governu kuarta-feira ne\'e, lidera hosi lidera husi Vise Primeiru Ministru-Francisco Kalbuady Lay,aprova ona rezolusaun Governu nian hodi define kompozisaun Komité Revizaun Polítika bá Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) tinan 2024 nian, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Vise-Ministra Finansas, Felicia Claudinanda da Cruz Carvalho, kona-ba definisaun kompozisaun Komité Revizaun Polítiku ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu tinan 2024.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Komité Revizaun Polítiku mak iha kompeténsia hodi verifika alokasaun estratéjika kona-ba rekursu submisaun orsamentál nian, ho objetivu atu atinje kompromisu no objetivu sira ne’ebé hatuur iha dokumentu estratéjiku no analiza kapasidade atu ezekuta planu ba tinan finanseiru 2024 nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Komité Revizaun Polítiku ne’e sei lidera hosi Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão no kompostu hosi Primeiru Vise-Primeirus Ministrus-Francisco Kalbuadi Lay no Segundu Vise-Primeirus Ministrus-Mariano \"Assanami\" Sabino Lopes, Ministra Finansas (MF), Santina José Rodriguês Viégas Cardoso, Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal ho Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku (MPIE)-Gastão de Sousa.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2023-10-26 05:53:16.411013','92cc227532d17e56e07902b254dfad10',1,2,'2023-10-25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-92-1-1','None-92-1-1','loron-daruak-reuniaun-komite-revizaun-orsamentu-diskuti-orsamentu-ministeriu-haat-1-1',NULL,NULL),(93,'Komite Revizaun Orsamentu Hahu Diskuti Orsamentu 2024','Komite Revizaun Orsamentu Hahu Diskuti Orsamentu 2024\r\nDili, 24 Outubru 2023\r\nPrimeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão lidera reuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu (KRO) Tinan 2024, ne’ebé hala’o iha Auditóriu Ministériu Finansa,Aitarak-laran.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Komite Revizaun Orsamentu Hahu Diskuti Orsamentu 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 24 Outubru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão lidera reuniaun Komite Revizaun Orsamentu (KRO) Tinan 2024, ne’ebé hala’o iha Auditóriu Ministériu Finansa,Aitarak-laran.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Reuniaun ida ne\'e importante tebes, tanba ne\'e persija partisipasaun ne\'ebé masimu hosi membru Governu, Autoridade RAEOA, responsáveis husi Instituisaun Estadu, responsáveis husi Ajensia Publikas Autonomas, Autoridade</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">no Administrador Munisipius atu fo importância hodi atende no halo diskusaun ho membru Komité</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Revisaun Orsamentu, nune\'e, hodi hetan konsiderasaun final ba Orsamentu Jeral Estadu 2024 nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu tuir ajenda reuniaun KRO ne\'e </div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">hahú iha 24 outubru 2023 no sei ramata iha loron 09 novembru 2023. Iha loron dahuluk Komite Revizaun Orsamentu hahu\'u diskute uluk orsamentu Ministériu Edukasaun, Ministériu Ensinu Superór Siénsia no Kultura (MESSK), Ministériu Juventude, Desportu, Arte no Kultura (MJDAK) no RAEOA.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-26 06:00:48.977954','98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b',1,2,'2023-10-24',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-93-1-1','None-93-1-1','komite-revizaun-orsamentu-hahu-diskuti-orsamentu-2024-1-1',NULL,NULL),(94,'Ministru Obras Públiku Partisipa Sorumutu KAFI Iha Ministériu Finansas','Ministru Obras Públiku Partisipa Sorumutu KAFI Iha Ministériu Finansas\r\nDili, 23 Outubru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públiku-Samuel Marçal, iha Segunda-feira ne\'e partisipa sorumutu estraordinariu KAFI, iha Ministeriu Finansas, Aitarak Laran. Sorumutu Estraordinaria ne\'e lidera hosi, Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku (MPIE)-Gastão Francisco de Sousa aumesmu tempu asume mós kna\'ar hanesan Prezidenti Konsellu Administrasaun Fundu Infraestrutura (KAFI).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públiku Partisipa Sorumutu KAFI Iha Ministériu Finansas</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 23 Outubru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públiku-Samuel Marçal, iha Segunda-feira ne\'e partisipa sorumutu estraordinariu KAFI, iha Ministeriu Finansas, Aitarak Laran. Sorumutu Estraordinaria ne\'e lidera hosi, Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku (MPIE)-Gastão Francisco de Sousa aumesmu tempu asume mós kna\'ar hanesan Prezidenti Konsellu Administrasaun Fundu Infraestrutura (KAFI).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Membru Governu ne\'ebé partisipa iha sorumutu KAFI, kompostu hosi Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku (MPIE)-Gastão Francisco de Sousa, Ministru Obras Públiku-Samuel Marçal, Ministra Finanças-Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, Ministru Transportes no Komunikasaun-Miguel Marques Gonçalves Manetelu no Vise Ministra Finanças-Felicia Claudinanda da Cruz Carvalho.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-26 06:01:59.696492','f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef',1,2,'2023-10-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-94-1-1','None-94-1-1','ministru-obras-publiku-partisipa-sorumutu-kafi-iha-ministeriu-finansas-1-1',NULL,NULL),(95,'Ministru Obras Públika Reuniaun Ho Entidade Sira  Ne’ebé Tutela Iha MOP','Ministru Obras Públika Reuniaun Ho Entidade Sira  Ne’ebé Tutela Iha MOP\r\nDili, 23 Outubru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika- Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo, hala’o reuniaun ho entidade sira ne’ebe tutela ba iha Ministériu Obras Públika, nune’e bela trasa planu ba proposta Orsamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP) 2024, ne’ebé sei halo aprezentsaun ba iha Komité Revizaun Polítiku (KROP), iha Minsitériu Finansas.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Reuniaun Ho Entidade Sira  Ne’ebé Tutela Iha MOP</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 23 Outubru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika- Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo, hala’o reuniaun ho entidade sira ne’ebe tutela ba iha Ministériu Obras Públika, nune’e bela trasa planu ba proposta Orsamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP) 2024, ne’ebé sei halo aprezentsaun ba iha Komité Revizaun Polítiku (KROP), iha Minsitériu Finansas.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Reuniaun ne’e rasik realiza iha sala reuniaun MOP, Caicoli, segunda-feira ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Partisipante sira ne’ebé hola parte iha reuniaun ne’e mak diresaun hirak ne’ebe tutela ba iha Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu Objetivu hosi reuniaun ida ne’e mak atu trasa planu ezekusaun orsamentu Ministériu Obras Públika iha Tinan 2024.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-26 06:03:45.481384','812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb',1,2,'2023-10-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-95-1-1','None-95-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-reuniaun-ho-entidade-sira-neebe-tutela-iha-mop-1-1',NULL,NULL),(96,'Ministru Obras Públika Hare Direta Konstrusaun Moru protesaun Ne’ebé Hetan Estragus Hosi Inundasaun','Ministru Obras Públika Hare Direta Konstrusaun Moru protesaun Ne’ebé Hetan Estragus Hosi Inundasaun\r\nCovalima, 21 Outubru 2023 \r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi ekipa tekniku Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP), iha loron sabado ne’e, hala’o vizita ba Covalima hodi observa direta, kondisaun ponte no moru protesaun ne’ebé hetan estragus hosi inundasaun ne’ebé akontese durante loron tolu nia laran, hahú husi 02 to’o 04 fulan-Jullu tinan 2023.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Hare Direta Konstrusaun Moru protesaun Ne’ebé Hetan Estragus Hosi Inundasaun</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Covalima, 21 Outubru 2023 </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi ekipa tekniku Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP), iha loron sabado ne’e, hala’o vizita ba Covalima hodi observa direta, kondisaun ponte no moru protesaun ne’ebé hetan estragus hosi inundasaun ne’ebé akontese durante loron tolu nia laran, hahú husi 02 to’o 04 fulan-Jullu tinan 2023.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>vizita ne’e Ministru Obras Públika, orienta ona ekipa kompañia ne’ebé kaer obra ponte no moru protesaun, atu aselera lalais sira nia servisu atu nune’e bainhira udan monu rai, obra moru protesaun ne’e remata, hodi nune’e bele salva komunidade sira hosi risku inundasaun, bainhira akontese udan ho intensaun bo’ot.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ponte ne’ebé Ministru Obras Públika ba observa lokaliza iha suku Tashilin, postu Zumalai no ponte Lomea, Ponte Rai Ketan iha suku Labarai, postu Suai, difikulta movimentu transporte públiku tanba ponte kotu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin remata halo observsaun iha Covalima Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa desloka fali ba iha irigasaun Karau Ulun, Betano, Manufahi.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-26 06:05:51.052355','26657d5ff9020d2abefe558796b99584',1,2,'2023-10-21',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-96-1-1','None-96-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-hare-direta-konstrusaun-moru-protesaun-neebe-hetan-estragus-hosi-inundasaun-1-1',NULL,NULL),(97,'Durante Tinan Naruk Komunidade Daur Halerik Ba Eletrisidade Ministru Obras Públika Ofisiálmente Halakan','Durante Tinan Naruk Komunidade Daur Halerik Ba Eletrisidade Ministru Obras Públika Ofisiálmente Halakan \r\nManufahi 21 Outubru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompañia hosi Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empreza Públika, (EDTL, E.P)-Paulo da Silva-,Supervizor EDTL, E.P Manufahi, Diretur Ezekutivu IGE-ADI- Sonio Anunu Sarmento da Silva inklui tékniku PMU, Ofisiálmente halakan eletrisidade bá komunidade uma kain 80 resin iha  Daur, Aldeia  Loti, Suku Daisua, Postu Administrativu Same  Vila, Munisípiu Manufahi, liu-husi Programa Eletrifikasaun Komunitária (PEK).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Durante Tinan Naruk Komunidade Daur Halerik Ba Eletrisidade Ministru Obras Públika Ofisiálmente Halakan </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Manufahi 21 Outubru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompañia hosi Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empreza Públika, (EDTL, E.P)-Paulo da Silva-,Supervizor EDTL, E.P Manufahi, Diretur Ezekutivu IGE-ADI- Sonio Anunu Sarmento da Silva inklui tékniku PMU, Ofisiálmente halakan eletrisidade bá komunidade uma kain 80 resin iha  Daur, Aldeia  <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Loti, Suku Daisua, Postu Administrativu Same  Vila, Munisípiu Manufahi, liu-husi Programa Eletrifikasaun Komunitária (PEK). </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin Ofisiálmente halakan tiha ahi eletrisidade, Ministro das Obras Públicas, sente orgullu no kontenti tanba durante tinan naruk hahu’u hosi tempu Indonezia to’o mai ukun a’an, komunidade Daur ba dahuluk foin senti naroman hosi eltrisidade.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Agradese ba komunidade sira ne’ebe kontribui no kolabora ho EDTL, E.P hodi instala liña eletrisidade iha aldeia ida ne’e, hodi ohin sabado ne’e, ita bele mai halakan ahi eletrisidade, hau hatene katak durante tinan naruk imi la senti naroman hosi eletrisidade hahu’u hosi tempu Indonezia to mai mai ukun a’an, imi foin senti naroman ne’e,\"kestaun ne’e hato’o hosi Ministru Obras Públika hafoin Ofisiálmente halakan eletrisidade, iha aldeia Daur, sabado ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne’e Ministru Obras Públika, apela mos ba komunidade sira iha aldeia Daur, bainhira utiliza enerjia elétrika tenke uza ho didiak no kuida aparelu elétriku ne’ebé instala hosi tekniku atu nune’e bele uza to tempu naruk.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha sorin seluk Xefe Suku Daisua  Amorin da Costa, hato agaradese ba EDTL,E.P ne’ebe ho esforsu makas hodi dada lina eletrisidade ba komunidade sira iha Aldeia Daur no Bubur Laran, nune’e ohin Ministru Obras Públika ho Komisaun Ezekutiva EDTL, E.P, Ofisiálmente mai halakan ona.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Agradese bá EDTL,E.P. ne\'ebé esforsu makas hodi dada liña eletrisidade hodi fornese enerjia elétrika bá Komunidade sira iha aldeia Daur no Bubur Laran,\"hatete lider komunitaria ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Xefe Suku Daisua , informa,  suku Daisua rasik kompostu husi aldeia tolu, dadaun ne’e aldeia tolu ne’e assesu hotu ona  enerjia eletrisidade.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha Biban ne’e Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,E.P.-Paulo da Silva  hato apresiasaun no  agradesemente bá komunidade hotu ne’ebé mak ho vontade akompañia ekipa tekniku EDTL,E.P Munisipiu Manufahi hala’o servisu komunitaria dada lina eletrisidade ba komunidade sira iha Aldeia Daur hodi hasai sira hosi nakukun ba naroman.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Husu ba ita bo’ot sira bainhira uza eltrisidade tenke uza eletrisidade ho seguru no responsabilidade,Ahi lori naroman maibé fó risku bá vida, nune\'e husu kontaktu tékniku EDTL, E.P bainhira presiza halo ligasaun ruma,\"dehan Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,E.P.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Alende ne’e Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,E.P informa mós ba komunidade sira, iha diretu atu uza eletrisidade gratuita to\'o fulan neen (6), hafoin  fulan 6 remata ekipa tékniku sira hosi EDTL,E.P sei mai halo sosialiazasaun no hodi monta kontador.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Antes atu remata Prezidente EDTL,E.P.  informa mos ba aldeia sira ne’ebé seidauk assesu eletrisisade atu hatama proposta,nune’e bele hatama ba iha planu hodi asselera prosesu dada eletrisidade bá komunidade. EDTL iha programa rua bain-bain bolu Programa Eletrifikasaun Komunitáriu no Progama Distribuisaun Solar Panel, solar panel ne’e atu distribui bá komunidade sira ne\'ebé  hela iha areas remotas.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu reprezentante Joventude-Filomeno da Costa, hato agradese wain ba Governu liu-husi Ministériu Obras Públika no EDTL,E.P. ne’ebé servisu maka’as hodi instala ona lina eletrisidade iha Aldeia Daur hodi lorin naroman mai komunidade no transforma ona komunidade sira hosi nakukun bá naroman.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Programa Eletrifikasaun Komunitária ho distánsia liña MT 3 Kms no liña BT 1,45 Kms fo ona benifisia komunidade uma-kain 80 resin assesu eletrisidade. Prosesu dada lina eletrisidade ba komunidade Daur hahu uluk ho seremonia kultural no servisu ida ne’e rasik hetan mos apoio hosi komunidade musulmanu ne\'ebé hela iha area Bubur Laran, Luak.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-26 06:07:40.139221','e2ef524fbf3d9fe611d5a8e90fefdc9c',1,2,'2023-10-21',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-97-1-1','None-97-1-1','durante-tinan-naruk-komunidade-daur-halerik-ba-eletrisidade-ministru-obras-publika-ofisialmente-halakan-1-1',NULL,NULL),(98,'Prevene Komunidade Sira Hosi Inundasaun, Ministru Obras Públika Kontinua Hamos Foer Iha Bee Dalan Aldeia São Miguel-Aimutin.','Prevene Komunidade Sira Hosi Inundasaun, Ministru Obras Públika Kontinua Hamos Foer Iha Bee Dalan Aldeia São Miguel-Aimutin.\r\nDili, 19 Outubru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompania hosi Vogal Instituto do Gestão de Equipamentos e Apoio ao Desenvolvimento Infrastruturas (IGE-ADI), inklui oan mane hosi Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, Kay Olok Gusmão,iha kinta-feira ne\'e kontinua hamos bee dalan ne\'ebé nakonu ho foer. Atividade limpeza ne\'e rasik Ministru Obras Públika ho nia ekipa hala\'o iha aldeia São Miguel-Aimutin, Suku Komoro, Posto Administrativu Vera Cruz. Iha biban ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika,kontinua apela ba komunidade ne\'ebé hela besik iha valeta ninin Area Delta mai Aimutin, labele soe foer ba iha valeta bee dalan.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Prevene Komunidade Sira Hosi Inundasaun, Ministru Obras Públika Kontinua Hamos Foer Iha Bee Dalan Aldeia São Miguel-Aimutin.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 19 Outubru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompania hosi Vogal Instituto do Gestão de Equipamentos e Apoio ao Desenvolvimento Infrastruturas (IGE-ADI), inklui oan mane hosi Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, Kay Olok Gusmão,iha kinta-feira ne\'e kontinua hamos bee dalan ne\'ebé nakonu ho foer.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Atividade limpeza ne\'e rasik Ministru Obras Públika ho nia ekipa hala\'o iha aldeia São Miguel-Aimutin, Suku Komoro, Posto Administrativu Vera Cruz.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika,kontinua apela ba komunidade ne\'ebé hela besik iha valeta ninin Area Delta mai Aimutin, labele soe foer ba iha valeta bee dalan.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Hau kontinua apela ba komunidade sira ne\'ebe hela besik iha valeta ninin, hahu hosi area Delta mai Aimutin, labele soe foer ba iha valeta bee dalan, se ita boot sira kontinua soe foer ba iha valeta laran, bainhira udan monu rai, foer sira ne\'e halo intupidu, bele akontese inundasaun,\" hatete Ministru Obras Públika, bainhira remata hamos bee dalan, iha area Aimutin.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha limpeza ne\'e komunidade balun inklui alin mane kiik oan sira, ne\'ebé hela besik iha ne\'eba entuziaismu tebes akompañia Ministru Obras Públika, hodi tu\'un direta ba valeta laran hodi hamos foer.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-10-26 06:09:11.824170','ed3d2c21991e3bef5e069713af9fa6ca',1,2,'2023-10-19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-98-1-1','None-98-1-1','prevene-komunidade-sira-hosi-inundasaun-ministru-obras-publika-kontinua-hamos-foer-iha-bee-dalan-aldeia-sao-miguel-aimutin-1-1',NULL,NULL),(99,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Aniversariu Dala 22 Forsa Naval Iha Betano','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Aniversariu Dala 22 Forsa Naval Iha Betano\r\nManufahi, 17 Novembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha loron sesta-feira ne\'e partisipa iha serimonia aniversariu Komponente Naval ba dala 22 iha Betano, Manufahi.\r\nIha komemorasaun ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika, husu ba Betano Oan, liu-liu joven sira atu kontribui nafatin pás, tanba iha tinan hira ba oin Betano sei sai sentru ba fatin refinaria Mina.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Aniversariu Dala 22 Forsa Naval Iha Betano</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Manufahi, 17 Novembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha loron sesta-feira ne\'e partisipa iha serimonia aniversariu Komponente Naval ba dala 22 iha Betano, Manufahi.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>komemorasaun ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika, husu ba Betano Oan, liu-liu joven sira atu kontribui nafatin pás, tanba iha tinan hira ba oin Betano sei sai sentru ba fatin refinaria Mina.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Planu ne\'ebé governu trasa, Suai sei sai sentru ba Supplay Base, LNG sei tau iha parte Viqueque, Beaco i Betano sei sai fatin ba refinaria Mina, ida ne\'e ita fiar katak, sei lori dezenvolvimentu ekonomia ba Manufahi oan,\"</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tan ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika husu ba Manufahi oan sira,mantein nafatin estabilidade, hodi kria pás no dame.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Seremonia aniversariu Komponente Naval iha Betano ne\'e hetan mós partisipasaun hosi, Prezidenti Autoridade Munisípiu Manufahi, Autoridade Lokal Suku Betano, Komandante PNTL Manufahi, Korpo Bombeiros Manufahi.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Manufahi',1,0,1,0,'2023-11-23 01:21:07.418119','ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b',1,2,'2023-11-17',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-99-1-1','None-99-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-aniversariu-dala-22-forsa-naval-iha-betano-1-1',NULL,NULL),(100,'Konsellu Ministru Aprova Ona Proposta OJE 2024','Konsellu Ministru Aprova Ona Proposta OJE 2024 \r\nDili, 21 Novembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika--Samuel Marçal partisipa reuniaun estraordináriu Konsellu Ministru nian iha Palasiu Governu, tersa ne\'e.\r\nIha reuniaun estraordináriu ne\'e, Konsellu Ministru aprova ona projetu Proposta Lei Orsamentu Jeral Estadu (OJE) ba tinan 2024, ne\'ebé aprezenta husi Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, ho valór totál konsolidadu millaun rihun US$ 1,95 ba Administrasaun Sentrál, RAEOA no Seguransa Sosiál, sein Fundu Rezerva Seguransa Sosiál. Valór ida ne\'e inklui dotasaun millaun rihun US$ 1,83 ba administrasaun sentrál no millaun US$ 60 uza ba RAEOA.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Konsellu Ministru Aprova Ona Proposta OJE 2024 </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 21 Novembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika--Samuel Marçal partisipa reuniaun estraordináriu Konsellu Ministru nian iha Palasiu Governu, tersa ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>reuniaun estraordináriu ne\'e, Konsellu Ministru aprova ona projetu Proposta Lei Orsamentu Jeral Estadu (OJE) ba tinan 2024, ne\'ebé aprezenta husi Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, ho valór totál konsolidadu millaun rihun US$ 1,95 ba Administrasaun Sentrál, RAEOA no Seguransa Sosiál, sein Fundu Rezerva Seguransa Sosiál. Valór ida ne\'e inklui dotasaun millaun rihun US$ 1,83 ba administrasaun sentrál no millaun US$ 60 uza ba RAEOA.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hosi montante totál despeza ne’ebé prevee ba Administrasaun Sentrál no RAEOA, millaun US$ 468,8 uza ba saláriu no vensimentu, millaun US$ 386,3 ba bens no servisu, millaun US$ 589,7 ba transferénsias públikas, millaun US$ 34,2 ba kapitál menór no millaun US$ 411 ba kapitál dezenvolvimentu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Orsamentu Seguransa Sosiál, inklui Fundu Rezerva Seguransa Sosiál, iha montante millaun US$ 347,6.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Presiza nota katak, OJE tinan 2024 prevee ho valór millaun US$ 788,2 ba asuntu ekonómiku, millaun US$ 467,1 ba protesaun sosiál, millaun US$ 140,9 ba edukasaun, millaun US$ 66,2 ba saúde no millaun US$ 45,2 ba abitasaun no infraestruturas koletivas.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-11-23 01:23:03.391595','f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd',1,2,'2023-11-21',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-100-1-1','None-100-1-1','konsellu-ministru-aprova-ona-proposta-oje-2024-1-1',NULL,NULL),(101,'Ministru Obras Públika Simu Audiensia Hosi Embaixador UEA','Ministru Obras Públika Simu Audiensia Hosi Embaixador UEA\r\nDili, 20 Novembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompania hosi Prezedenti Konsellu Administrasaun Eletrisidade de Timor Leste, Empreza Públika (EDTL,EP)-Paulo da Silva, iha segunda-feira ne’e hasoru malu ho Embaixador Uniaun Emiradu Arabi (UEA)-Abdulla Salem Obaid Al Dhaheri,iha sala gabineti Ministru Obras Públika.(*)','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Simu Audiensia Hosi Embaixador UEA</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 20 Novembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompania hosi Prezedenti Konsellu Administrasaun Eletrisidade de Timor Leste, Empreza Públika (EDTL,EP)-Paulo da Silva, iha segunda-feira ne’e hasoru malu ho Embaixador Uniaun Emiradu Arabi (UEA)-Abdulla Salem Obaid Al Dhaheri,iha sala gabineti Ministru Obras Públika.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-11-23 01:33:12.035309','38b3eff8baf56627478ec76a704e9b52',1,2,'2023-11-20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-101-1-1','None-101-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-simu-audiensia-hosi-embaixador-uea-1-1',NULL,NULL),(102,'Prezidenti EDTL,EP Aprezenta Planu Implementasaun Solar PhotoVolthaic Ba Ministru Obras Públika','Prezidenti EDTL,EP Aprezenta Planu Implementasaun Solar PhotoVolthaic Ba\r\nMinistru Obras Públika\r\nDili, 20 Novembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha segunda-feira ne’e halao enkontru ho Prezedenti Konsellu Administrasaun Eltrisidade de Timor Leste, Empreza Públika (EDTL,EP)-Paulo da Silva ho nia ekipa, iha sala reuniaun Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Prezidenti EDTL,EP Aprezenta Planu Implementasaun Solar PhotoVolthaic Ba</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 20 Novembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha segunda-feira ne’e halao enkontru ho Prezedenti Konsellu Administrasaun Eltrisidade de Timor Leste, Empreza Públika (EDTL,EP)-Paulo da Silva ho nia ekipa, iha sala reuniaun Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Objetivu hosi enkontru ne’e mák Prezedenti Konsellu Administrasaun EDTL,EP atu halo aprezentasaun kona-ba planu implementasaun Solar PhotoVolthaic (PV) 72MW-85MW, Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) 36MWH-46MWH iha Laleia-Manatuto, ne’ebé sei realiza iha tinan oin (2024).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Fotovoltaiku mak teknolojia mudansa enerjia husi loro-matan ba eletrisidade. Ekipamentu fotovoltaiku sira forma grupu ida husi sélula solar ne\'ebé liga iha serie ida ka paralelu no halibur iha modulu solar ida.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Painél solar mak sentrál eletrisidade ida-ne\'ebé uza sélula fotovoltaika solar (PV). Teknolojia ida-ne\'e transforma radiasaun solar ba eletrisidade.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Sentrál eletrisidade ida-ne\'e forma enerjia renovavel ida-ne\'ebé uza fonte enerjia alternativa ne\'ebé amigavel ba ambiente. </div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu projeitu Fotovoltaiku (PV) ne’e rasik hetan apoio hosi Asian Development Bank (ADB).(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-11-23 01:41:27.498757','ec8956637a99787bd197eacd77acce5e',1,2,'2023-11-20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-102-1-1','None-102-1-1','prezidenti-edtlep-aprezenta-planu-implementasaun-solar-photovolthaic-ba-ministru-obras-publika-1-1',NULL,NULL),(103,'Ministériu Haat (4) Segunda nee Halo Audensia Ho Parlamentu Nasional Komisaun C, E ho G','Ministériu Haat (4) Segunda nee Halo Audensia Ho Parlamentu Nasional Komisaun C, E ho G \r\nDili, 04 Dezembru 2023\r\nMinistériu Obras Públika, Ministériu Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku, Ministériu Transporte i Telekomunikasaun  ho Ministériu Finansas, ohin halao audensia ho Komisaun C, E ho G iha Sala Plenaria, Parlamentu Nasionál.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministériu Haat (4) Segunda nee Halo Audensia Ho Parlamentu Nasional Komisaun C, E ho G </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 04 Dezembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministériu Obras Públika, Ministériu Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku, Ministériu Transporte i Telekomunikasaun  ho Ministériu Finansas, ohin halao audensia ho Komisaun C, E ho G iha Sala Plenaria, Parlamentu Nasionál. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Siklu audiénsia públika nian ne’e sei promove husi Komisaun Espesializada Permanente Parlamentu Nasionál nian, kona-ba apresiasaun inisiál ba Proposta Lei kona-ba Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) ba tinan 2024. Audénsia públika sira-ne’e hala’o to’o loron 5 fulan-Detembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Durante períodu ida-ne’e, Komisaun sira sei rona membru Governu sira, aprezentasaun no planu ezekusaun orsamentu bazeia ba proposta OJE 2024, hosi kada Ministériu ne\'ebé aprova ona iha Konsenllsu Ministru, hodi halo diskusaun no klarifikasaun kona-ba orsamentu setoriál sira ba tinan finanseiru 2024 nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Bainhira siklu audensia ne’e remata tiha, komisaun hahu\'u preprara relatoriu</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">pareser iha loron 29 fulan-novembru to\'o loron 6 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hahu\'u hosi loron 29 fulan-novembru to\'o loron 11 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Elaborasaun no aprovasaun ba relatóriu no paresér Komisaun C nian. Iha loron 12 no 13 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023, hahu hala\'o diskusaun no votasaun iha jeneralidade. Diskusaun no votasaun iha espesialidade no votasaun finál globál, loron 14 to\'o 20 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023. Loron 21 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Redasaun ikus Dekretu nian husi Komisaun C, hafoin iha loron 22 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Parlamentu Nasionál sei haruka Dekretu ba Prezidente Repúblika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu iha loron 21 fulan-novembru 2023 Konsellu Ministrus hala’o sorumutuk iha Palásiu Governu Dili, no aprova ona projetu proposta Lei Orsamentu Jeral Estadu (OJE) ba tinan 2024, ne\'ebé aprezenta husi Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, ho valór totál konsolidadu millaun rihun US$ 1,95, hodi kobre nesesidade sira husi programa no prioridade nasionál sira ne’ebé IX Governu Konstitusionál define ona. Iha </div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">loron 23 fulan-novembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Governu entrega Proposta Lei Orsamentu Jerál Estadu nian ba tinan 2024 ba Parlamentu Nasionál.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kalendáriu ba diskusaun no votasaun OJE tinan 2024 nian hahu hosi 23 novembru toó 22 dezembru.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 23 fulan-novembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Governu entrega Proposta Lei Orsamentu Jerál Estadu nian ba tinan 2024.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 27 fulan-novembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Votasaun pedidu prioridade no urjénsia husi Parlamentu Nasionál.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 30 fulan-novembru to\'o loron 5 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Audiénsia Públika sira.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 29 fulan-novembru to\'o loron 6 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Elaborasaun no aprovasaun paresér setoriál sira.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 29 fulan-novembru to\'o loron 11 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Elaborasaun no aprovasaun ba relatóriu no paresér Komisaun C nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 12 no 13 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Diskusaun no votasaun iha jeneralidade</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 14 to\'o 20 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Diskusaun no votasaun iha espesialidade no votasaun finál globál</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 21 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Redasaun ikus Dekretu nian husi Komisaun C.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Loron 22 fulan-dezembru tinan 2023</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Haruka Dekretu ba Prezidente Repúblika.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-12-05 23:43:49.780157','6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548',1,2,'2023-12-04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-103-1-1','None-103-1-1','ministeriu-haat-4-segunda-nee-halo-audensia-ho-parlamentu-nasional-komisaun-c-e-ho-g-1-1',NULL,NULL),(104,'Salva Komunidade Sira Hosi Risku Dezastre','Salva Komunidade Sira Hosi Risku Dezastre\r\n*PM Organiza Ministru Obra Publika-EDTL No Saneamentu Tesi Ai Hun Boot Moris Iha Estrada Ninin\r\nDili, 01 Dezembru 2023- Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompania hosi Ministru Obras Publika-Samuel Marçal ho Sekretariu Estado Toponomia-Germano Santa Brites Dias, inklui ekipa Bombeiros, Eletridade de Timor-Leste (EDTL) no ekipa Saneamentu Munisipiu Dili, hahu hosi Sesta-feira to Domingo kontinua kua ai-halihun boot iha Taibesi Matando Dili.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Salva Komunidade Sira Hosi Risku Dezastre</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">*PM Organiza Ministru Obra Publika-EDTL No Saneamentu Tesi Ai Hun Boot Moris Iha Estrada Ninin</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 01 Dezembru 2023- Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompania hosi Ministru Obras Publika-Samuel Marçal ho Sekretariu Estado Toponomia-Germano Santa Brites Dias, inklui ekipa Bombeiros, Eletridade de Timor-Leste (EDTL) no ekipa Saneamentu Munisipiu Dili, hahu hosi Sesta-feira to Domingo kontinua kua ai-halihun boot iha Taibesi <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Matando Dili.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu atividade kua ai hali ne’e realiza, bainhira komunidade sira ne’ebé hela besik iha area ai hun ne’e hato’o proposta ba Xefe Governo Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, hodi husu ajuda kua ai ne’e, tanba ai-halihun boot ne’e ninia kondisaun komesa dodok ona no sei monu bainhira tempu udan no anin.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Intervensaun ne\'ebé Xefe Governu halo ne\'e, ati proteze komunidade no motorista sira hosi risku dezastre, bainhira akontese udan no anin boot.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Remata kua ai hali iha Taibesi Matando, ekipa Bombeiros kontinua halo identifikasaun ba ai hun sira iha Dili laran. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin halo identifikasaun, ekipa Bombeiros hare iha parte Pertamina Kuluhun matan dukur sanak moris tama too estrada, nune\'e ekipa tun direta hodi Kua ai sanak ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Atividade tesi no koa ne’e hetan apoio mós  hosi komunidade,  hodi ajuda foti ai hirak ne’ebé tesi ona no tula kedas ba kareta saneamentu nian hodi ba soe iha faton Lixeiru Tibar.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-12-05 23:47:12.227668','c9e1074f5b3f9fc8ea15d152add07294',1,2,'2023-12-01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-104-1-1','None-104-1-1','salva-komunidade-sira-hosi-risku-dezastre-1-1',NULL,NULL),(105,'Ministériu Obras Públika Halao Audensia Ho PN Komisaun E Asuntu Infraestrutura','Ministériu Obras Públika Halao Audensia Ho PN Komisaun E Asuntu Infraestrutura\r\nDili, 30 Novembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Vise Ministru Infraestrutura Júlio do Carmo, Diretur Jeral Ministériu Obras Públika-João Amaral, Prezidenti Ezekutivu EDTL,E.P Paul da Silva, Prezidenti BTL,E.P inklui diresaun sira ne\'ebé tutela ba iha Ministru Obras Públika, halao audensia ho Parlamentu Nasionál Komisaun E Asuntu Infraestrutura.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministériu Obras Públika Halao Audensia Ho PN Komisaun E Asuntu Infraestrutura</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 30 Novembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Vise Ministru Infraestrutura Júlio do Carmo, Diretur Jeral Ministériu Obras Públika-João Amaral, Prezidenti Ezekutivu EDTL,E.P Paul da Silva, Prezidenti BTL,E.P inklui diresaun sira ne\'ebé tutela ba iha Ministru Obras Públika, halao audensia ho Parlamentu Nasionál Komisaun E Asuntu Infraestrutura.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Audensia ne\'e hala\'o iha sala Komisaun E, Parlamentu Nasional, kinta-feira ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Objetivu hosi audensia ne\'e mák atu halo aprezentasaun sobre PPL Nu.4/VI (1a) Orsamentu Jeral Estado 2024.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Sujeitu hosi audensia ne\'e mák atu halo Submisaun kalendáriu audiénsia ho membru Governu no entidade sira ne\'ebé hetan supervizaun, refere ba Proposta Lei Orsamentu Jeral Estadu nian ba tinan 2024.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu audiénsia sira ne\'e sei hala\'o iha ámbitu proposta Lei Orsamentu Jeral Estadu nian ba tinan 2024.(*)</div></div><p></p><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-12-05 23:52:27.954447','65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f',1,2,'2023-11-30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-105-1-1','None-105-1-1','ministeriu-obras-publika-halao-audensia-ho-pn-komisaun-e-asuntu-infraestrutura-1-1',NULL,NULL),(106,'Ministru Obras Públika Simu Vizita Ida Hosi Fundadora Caltech Group','Ministru Obras Públika Simu Vizita Ida Hosi Fundadora Caltech Group\r\nDili, 22 Novembru 2023\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marcal, iha loron kuarta foin lalais ne’e, simu vizita ida hosi fundadora Caltech Group- Sheilla Abilio Corte Real de Caldas, iha sala Gabineti Ministru Obras Públika, Caicoli.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Simu Vizita Ida Hosi Fundadora Caltech Group</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 22 Novembru 2023</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marcal, iha loron kuarta foin lalais ne’e, simu vizita ida hosi fundadora Caltech Group- Sheilla Abilio Corte Real de Caldas, iha sala Gabineti Ministru Obras Públika, Caicoli.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Objetivu hosi vizita ne’e mák, fundadora Caltech Group atu informa kona-ba, Caltech nia atividade resiklagem no produtu resiklagem sira ne’ebé mák Caltech prodús iha Timor Leste.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne’e Ministru Obras Públika, hato agradesementu ba fundadora Caltech Group, ne’ebé mai aprezenta ona produtu resiklagem sira ne’ebé mák Caltech produs.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Bainhira sorumutu ne’e remata Ministru Obras Públika, kaer exemplu pavimentu ida husi tipu oin-oin ne’ebé disponível, produs husi vidru no plastiku, produtu foun husi Caltech, ne’e mák hanesan Tripleks, ne’ebé bele halo husi material resiklagem ho variedade oin-oin, inklui kaixa, plastiku, kontentador bebida no seluk tan.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Produtu sira ne\'e hotu produs iha Caltech nian sentru rekuperasaun materiais no fasilidade resiklajem iha Comoro, Dili.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Fundora Caltech hatete, espera iha tempu badak bele hare produtu sira ne\'e uza iha Timor Leste hanesan benefísiu ba nasaun no ambiente. Caltech halao operasaun iha Timor Leste desde tinan 2000 no agora emprega kuase 300 Timor-oan iha industria sira ne’ebé varia.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-12-05 23:56:02.618092','f0935e4cd5920aa6c7c996a5ee53a70f',1,2,'2023-11-22',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-106-1-1','None-106-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-simu-vizita-ida-hosi-fundadora-caltech-group-1-1',NULL,NULL),(107,'Hafoin Akontese Udan Boot Rezulta Ponte Kailako Kotu Ministru Obras Públika  Orienta Ona IGE-ADI Normaliza','Hafoin Akontese Udan Boot Rezulta Ponte Kailako Kotu Ministru Obras Públika  Orienta Ona IGE-ADI Normaliza\r\nReportajen: Alberto Menezes.\r\nDILI, segunda 11/12/2023.\r\nMinistru Obras Publikas-Samuel Marçal, fo ona orientasaun ba Instututo Gestão Ekipamento no Apoio Desenvolvimento Infraestrutura (IGE-ADI),  halo normalizasaun ba ponte Kailako ne’ebé kotu, hafoin akontese udan boot, iha loron segunda (11/12/2023).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin Akontese Udan Boot Rezulta Ponte Kailako Kotu Ministru Obras Públika  Orienta Ona IGE-ADI Normaliza</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Reportajen: Alberto Menezes.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">DILI, segunda 11/12/2023.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Ministru Obras Publikas-Samuel Marçal, fo ona orientasaun ba Instututo Gestão Ekipamento no Apoio Desenvolvimento Infraestrutura (IGE-ADI),  halo normalizasaun ba ponte Kailako ne’ebé kotu, hafoin akontese udan boot, iha loron segunda (11/12/2023).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Horseik kedas hau fo ona orientasaun ba ekipa tekniku sira no ohin sira ba hare no mobiliza ona ekipamentu pezado IGE-ADI nian ba iha neeba, pelumenus bele loke dalan alternativus para ita nia komunidade sira bele liu ba mai iha fatin nee,\"dehan Ministru Obras Públika ba jornalista sira iha PN, Tersa ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika haktuir, bainhira ekipa tekniku IGE-ADI sira tun ona ba terenu máka sira labele halo normalizasaun, Ministériu Obras Públika sei loke prosesu tenderizasaun ba kompania sira, hodi hahu halo kontrusaun ba ponte foun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Agora dadaun ne\'e, hau orienta sira ba hare,se la labele halo normalizasaun, urjente mak ita bele halo ajudikasaun ba kompania sira neebe iha kapasidade atu halo normalizasaun urjenti hodi ezekuta lalais prosesu normalizasun nee,\"tenik Ministru Obras Públika. (*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2023-12-13 02:18:06.158960','a97da629b098b75c294dffdc3e463904',1,2,'2023-12-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-107-1-1','None-107-1-1','hafoin-akontese-udan-boot-rezulta-ponte-kailako-kotu-ministru-obras-publika-orienta-ona-ige-adi-normaliza-1-1',NULL,NULL),(108,'Ministru Obras Públika Kontinua ba Hare Valeta Bee Dalan ne’ebé Nakonu Ho Lixu no Sedimentasaun Iha área Fatuhada, ETDA no Manleuana','Ministru Obras Públika Kontinua ba Hare Valeta Bee Dalan ne’ebé Nakonu Ho Lixu no Sedimentasaun Iha área Fatuhada, ETDA no Manleuana\r\nDili, 11 Janeiru 2024\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hamutuk akompania hosi Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu Ministériu Obras Públika-Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, iha kinta-feira ne’e ba hare direta valeta bee dalan iha área Fatuhada, ETDA no área Manleuana, ne’ebé nakonu ho lixu no sedimentasaun.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Kontinua ba Hare Valeta Bee Dalan ne’ebé Nakonu Ho Lixu no Sedimentasaun Iha área Fatuhada, ETDA no Manleuana</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 11 Janeiru 2024</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hamutuk akompania hosi Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu Ministériu Obras Públika-Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, iha kinta-feira ne’e ba hare direta valeta bee dalan iha área Fatuhada, ETDA no área Manleuana, ne’ebé nakonu ho lixu no sedimentasaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Hafoin to iha fatin Ministru Obras Públika, hare bee dalan iha área Fatuhada, ETDA no área Manleuana, nakonu ho lixu no sedimentasaun, konaba lixu nakonu iha valeta bee dalan Ministru Obras Públika hatete, “Ita nia komunidade sira, ita hare, sira seidauk iha konsensia atu soe lixu iha nia fatin, ita hare’e dala ruma sira soe deit iha uma oin, ou valeta laran,kuandu ita iha ona konsiensia hodi soe lixu iha nia fatin, bainhira udan monu rai sei la akontese inundasaun no bee tama komunidade nia uma,”hatete Ministru Obras Públika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ligado ho sedimentasaun Ministrus Obras Públika, fo ona orientasaun ba IGE-ADI hodi koloka mós ekipamentu pejadu atu halo normalizasaun valeta bee dalan, iha área bee dalan Manleu no ETDA nian.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha sorin seluk vendedor sira kontinua faan sasan iha trotoar leten. Maske governu bandu ona vendedor sira atu labele fa’an sasan iha trotoar, maibe negosiante sira kontinua fa’an.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Sidade Dili hanesan odamatan ida ne’ebé nakloke ba mundu internasional, liu-liu bainhira iha ema bo’ot ruma ka bainaka internsional sira mai vizita “hare ita nia nasaun sabraut hela, ne’e fo imajen ladiak entaun presiza hadia,”tenik Ministru Obras Públika.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-19 06:29:36.105233','a3c65c2974270fd093ee8a9bf8ae7d0b',1,2,'2024-01-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-108-1-1','None-108-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-kontinua-ba-hare-valeta-bee-dalan-neebe-nakonu-ho-lixu-no-sedimentasaun-iha-area-fatuhada-etda-no-manleuana-1-1',NULL,NULL),(109,'Diskusaun Proposta OJE 2024 ho Montante Billaun $1,95 Pasa Iha Jeneralidade','Diskusaun Proposta OJE 2024 ho Montante Billaun $1,95 Pasa Iha Jeneralidade\r\nDili, 12 Dezembru 2023\r\nParlamentu Nasionál (PN) liuhosi votasaun jeneralidade, aprova ona proposta Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) 2024 ho billaun $1,96 ho rezultadu A-favór 43, Kontra 8 no Abstensaun 1.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Cambria Math&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Diskusaun Proposta OJE 2024 ho Montante Billaun $1,95 Pasa Iha Jeneralidade</b></span><o:p></o:p></p></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Dili, 12 Desember 2023</font></font></font></font></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Parlamentu Nasionál (PN) liuhosi votasaun jeneralidade, aprova ona proposta Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) 2024 ho billaun $1,96 ho rezultadu A-favór 43, Kontra 8 dan Abstensaun 1.</font></font></font></font></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Ho proposta OJE 2024 nian ne\'ebé aprovadu iha faze jenerálidade ne\'e, Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão dehan, nia sei la ko\'alia buat barak tanba laiha buat barak atu ko\'alia.</font></font></font></font></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Hafoin proposta OJE 2024 menyetujui jeneralidade Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão lori IX Pemerintahan Konstitusional nia naran hato\'o agradesementu ba distintu deputadus sira.</font></font></font></font></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">\"Iha ne\'e ami aprende buat barak. Ita aprende bá malu, mas hau rasik pesoalmente hau aprende buat barak intervensaun hosi deputadu sira, Ida ne\'e hanesan lisaun ida. Tanba ne\'e mák ami tenke aprende, hodi bele kaer ukun ne \'e ho di\'ak liuta,\" benci PM Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão.</font></font></font></font></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Entretantu tuir kalendariu ne\'ebé fo sai ona, hafoin proposta OJE 2024 aprova iha jeneralidade, hahu hosi loron 14 to\'o 20 Fulan-Dezembru tinan 2023,hahu diskusi no votasaun iha espesialidade no votasaun final global.(*)</font></font></font></font></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</font></font></font></font></div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2024-02-19 06:38:19.631224','2723d092b63885e0d7c260cc007e8b9d',1,2,'2023-12-12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-109-1-1','None-109-1-1','diskusaun-proposta-oje-2024-ho-montante-billaun-195-pasa-iha-jeneralidade-1-1',NULL,NULL),(110,'Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão Akompania Hosi Ministru Obras Publika Tun Direta Ba Hare Komunidade Nia Uma Ne’ebé Afeta Inundasaun iha Loron Sesta-Feira ne\'e.','Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão Akompania Hosi Ministru Obras Publika Tun Direta Ba Hare Komunidade Nia Uma Ne’ebé Afeta Inundasaun iha Loron Sesta-Feira ne\'e.\r\nDili, 18 Fevereiru 2024\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão iha sabadu ne’e, hamutuk ho Ministru Obras Publika-Samuel Marçal hahu’u hosi dadersan too lokraik tun direitu ba fatin risku ba dezastre hodi koloka ekipamentu pejadu hosi governu no setór privadu hodi suru sai raihenek, tahu no foer ne’ebé nakunu intupidu estrada no komunidade nia uma.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Primeiru Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão Akompania Hosi Ministru Obras Publika Tun Direta Ba Hare Komunidade Nia Uma Ne’ebé Afeta Inundasaun iha Loron Sesta-Feira ne\'e.</span><br></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 18 Fevereiru 2024<br></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Primeiru-Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão iha sabadu ne’e, hamutuk ho Ministru Obras Publika-Samuel Marçal hahu’u hosi dadersan too lokraik tun direitu ba fatin risku ba dezastre hodi koloka ekipamentu pejadu hosi governu no setór privadu hodi suru sai raihenek, tahu no foer ne’ebé nakunu <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>intupidu estrada no komunidade nia uma.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu udan boot ne’ebé akontese iha loron sesta-feira (16/02/24) lokraik rezulta komunidade lubuk ida nia uma hetan estragus inklui lakon sasan uma laran. Fatin hirak ne’ebé risku ba dezastre maka, Bidau Lesidere, Kuluhun, Ponte Becora,Taibesi, Lahane, STM Becora kotuk, Hera Akanunu no fatin balun tan.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Bainhira to iha fatin, Primeiru-Ministru fo kedan orientasaun hodi kompras sasán nesidade baziku sira, hodi fahe direita ba komunidade ne’ebé afeta ba inundasaun hahú hosi área Igreja Akanunu, Taibesi-Bekuse parte STM kotuk no halo obserbasaun direita ba uma kain rua ne’ebé ai-halihun boot tohar no hanehan  iha Taibesi-Matando.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Durante halao vizita ba fatin hirak ne’e, Primeiru-Ministru orienta kedan Ministru Obras Públika atu hadia emerjensia estrada, ponte inklui moru protesaun estrada nian ne’ebé mota estraga.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Ita identifika ona fatin sira ne’ebé aat, ita tun direta ajuda hadia no suru sai tiha tahu ho foer, iha uma laran no hadia kedas fatin hirak ne’e, hodi salva komunidade sira husi risku ba dezastre,”hatete PM Xanana Gusmão.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin simu tiha orientasaun husi Primeiru-Ministru, Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho ekipa Ekipa MOP no IGE-ADI ne’ebé lidera hosi Prezidentio IGE Ana Paula da Cruz ne’ebé akompania hosi Vogal I (IGE-ADI)-Almerio Caerio Alves, koloka kedan ekipamentu pejadu governu nian no hetan apoia hosi Kompaña Montana Diak, Marabia LDA, no Dili United, BTK no Star King hodi halo normalizasaun ba estrada iha área  ne’ebé afetadu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dezastre naturál ne’ebé akontese mezmu la rezulta ema ruma mate no kanek, maibé Xefe Governu Xanana orienta mós Sekretáriu Estadu Protesaun Sivil (SEPS), Domingos Mariano Reis, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponómia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias organiza direita ekipa apoia komunidade hodi lori apoia umanitaria ba vitima sira.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ekipa SEPS rekolla dadus provizoriu hosi Becora-Bekusi Kraik, Taibesi hamutuk uma kain 30 liu maka sofre makas, tanba mota sobu uma no moru protesaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Sekretáriu Estadu Protesaun Sivil (SEPS), Domingos Mariano Reis rasik hahú hodi kalan tun hamutuk ho ekipa Bombeiros no Protesaun Sivil nian tun direita hodi salva vitima sira inklui rekolla dadus vitima sira hodi   fó apoia nesidade baziku no material kontrusaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tuir agenda, ne’ebé iha, aban loron domingu (18/02/24), Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa tekniku Ministériu Obras Públika, Ekipa IGE-ADI inklui ekipa Autoriedade Protesaun Sivil (Bombeiros) sei kontinua hala’o nafatin vizita ba fatin sira ne’ebé afeta ba inundasaun, mota no valeta bee dalan sira ne’ebé sei nakonu ho sedimentasaun, sei normaliza hotu atu nune’e labele fo ameasa ba komunidade sira.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">MÍdia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-19 06:46:24.863682','5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e',1,2,'2024-02-18',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-110-1-1','None-110-1-1','primeiru-ministru-kay-rala-xanana-gusmao-akompania-hosi-ministru-obras-publika-tun-direta-ba-hare-komunidade-nia-uma-neebe-afeta-inundasaun-iha-loron-sesta-feira-nee-1-1',NULL,NULL),(111,'Ministru Obras Públika Ba Hare Direta Area Ne\'ebé Durante Sai Risku Ba Inundasaun','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marcal observa direta komunidade nia uma iha Balide Raihun, Caicoli no kondisaun  estrada diresaun Balide no bee dalan iha area Caicolu, ne\'ebé Sempre akontese inundasaun bainhira tempu Udan monu rai.','<h3 class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Impact;\">﻿</span>Ministru Obras Públika Ba Hare Direta Area Ne\'ebé Durante Sai Risku Ba Inundasaun</h3><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 09 Janeiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marcal observa direta komunidade nia uma iha Balide Raihun, Caicoli no kondisaun  estrada diresaun Balide no bee dalan iha area Caicolu, ne\'ebé Sempre akontese inundasaun bainhira tempu Udan monu rai.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Bainhira to iha fatin hodi observa, Ministru Obras Públika, orienta kedan ekipa tekniku IGE-ADI, ne\'ebé hetan apoio hosi kompania Dili United, hodi halo normalizasaun ba bee dalan iha area Balide,Rebal hodi asegura komunidade uma kain 20 resin ne\'ebé hela iha area ne\'e  atu hases sira hosi risku Inundasaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin akontese udan boot, estrada diresaun Balide Rai Huun ba to iha ekola Sekundario 4 Setembru, nakonu ho rai no tahu teen, nune\'e Ministru Obras Públika kontinua fo orienta ba ekipa tekniku IGE-ADI ho ekipa tekniku hosi kompania Dili United atu normaliza hikas kondisaun Estrada no ekipa Bombeiros mai fase tuir kedan estrada iha area refere hafoin remata normalizasaun estrada.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika hatete, sei solusiona problema inundasaun iha Balide Rai Hun, Caikoli inklui fatin sira seluk iha Kapital Dili ne\'ebé afeita mós inundasaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Prosesu normalizasun estrada  hetan akompaniamentu, hosi Vise Ministru Infraestrutura-Julio do Carmo, Deputado Jose Virgilio R.Ferreira, Adjuntu ADN, Komandante PNTL Munisípiu Dili, Prezidenti IGE-ADI, Dretur Ezekutivu Ige-ADI no Vogal IGE-ADI no Xefe Gabineti Ministériu Obras Públika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Normalizasaun ne\'e rasik hahu iha oras 16:30 to\'o 21:30.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">hafoin udan boot ne’ebé akontese iha kapitál Dili, komunidade sira hela iha area Balide Rai Hun no Caicoli, sira nia sasan kuaze hetan estragus.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',0,0,0,0,'2024-02-19 08:33:47.619944','698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668',1,2,'2024-01-09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-111-1-1','None-111-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-ba-hare-direta-area-neebe-durante-sai-risku-ba-inundasaun-1-1',NULL,NULL),(112,'Ministru Obras Públika Enkontru ho Jean Todt Enviadu Espesial ONU','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal halao enkontru ho Jean Todt-enviadu espesiál Sekretáriu-Jeral ONU nia ba asuntu Estra no Transporte, hodi koalia konaba progresu dezenvolvimentu Estrada iha Timor Leste.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Enkontru ho Jean Todt Enviadu Espesial ONU </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 09 Fevereiro 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal halao enkontru ho Jean Todt-enviadu espesiál Sekretáriu-Jeral ONU nia ba asuntu Estra no Transporte, hodi koalia konaba progresu dezenvolvimentu Estrada iha Timor Leste.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Enviadu espesial ONU ba asuntu Estrada no Transporte ne’e haktuir, nia mai iha Timor Leste, mai hanesan envidau espesial  Sekretáriu-Jeral ONU, enkontru ida ohin ho Ministru Obras Públika, ko\'alia kona-ba importánsia hosi Estrada, asegura estrada no eduka foin-sae sira oinsa utiliza estrada ne\'e ho diak no seguru.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Hau mai Timor-Leste, ha\'u-nia papel, nu\'udar enviadu espesiál Sekretáriu-Jeral ONU nia, hodi fo apoiu Prezidente José Ramos-Horta, Governu Timo Leste no stakeholders hotu iha sira-nia servisu hodi halo Estrada ne\'ebé seguru no sustentavel ba ema hotu,atu asesu no oinsá eduka foin-sae sira atu utiliza estrada ho diak,”dehan Jean Todt bainhira hasoru malu ho Ministru Obras Públika iha Caicoli, sesta ne’e.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hato agradese wain ba enviadu espesiál Sekretáriu-Jeral ONU nian, ne’ebé mai vizita ona Ministériu Obras Públika. Kona-ba Estrada Ministru Obras Públika informa ba enviado espesial ONU,kona-ba kondisaun Estrada nasional no munisipal, mesmu balun sei aat, maibe tuir planu ne’ebé iha hahu husi tinan ida ne’e, sei halo kompleta tiha Estrada hirak ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Ita hahu halo ona planu atu kompleta Estrada nasionál iha tinan ne’e no tinan oin mai, ita bele kontinua ho Estrada munisipál,”hatete Ministru Obras Públika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin enkontru ne’e remata enviadu espesiál Sekretáriu-Jeral ON-Jean Todt entrega livru ne’ebé nia rasik mak hakerek, livru ne’e ho título “Millions of Lives to save on the roads” ba Ministru Obras Públika no Ministru Obras Públika mos la haluha tara Tais no entrega emblema Ministériu Obras Públika ho Illa Timor.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-20 00:16:19.062164','7f6ffaa6bb0b408017b62254211691b5',1,2,'2024-02-09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-112-1-1','None-112-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-enkontru-ho-jean-todt-enviadu-espesial-onu-1-1',NULL,NULL),(113,'Ekipa Tékniku Gabineti SEEAS Aprezenta Dezoño no BoQ Projetu Melloramentu Bee-Mos ba Ministro Obrás Públika','Ekipa Tékniku Gabineti SEEAS Aprezenta Dezoño no BoQ Projetu Melloramentu Bee-Mos ba Ministro Obrás Públika\r\nDili, 7 Fevereiro 2024\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompania hosi Sekretáriu Estádu ba Elétrisidade Bée no Saneamentu (SEEAS)-Santos Noronha halao enkontru ho ekipa tékniku Gabinete SEEAS, iha Salaun Ministériu Obras Públika MOP Kaikoli, Quarta-feira ne\'e.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ekipa Tékniku Gabineti SEEAS Aprezenta Dezoño no BoQ Projetu Melloramentu Bee-Mos ba Ministro Obrás Públika</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 7 Fevereiro 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompania hosi Sekretáriu Estádu ba Elétrisidade Bée no Saneamentu (SEEAS)-Santos Noronha halao enkontru ho ekipa tékniku Gabinete SEEAS, iha Salaun Ministériu Obras Públika MOP Kaikoli, Quarta-feira ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Objetivu hosi reuniaun ne\'e mak, aprezenta atu kona-ba Dezeño no BoQ ba projetu melloramentu bee-mos, ne’ebe sei instala iha fatin tolu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha parte dahuluk ekipa tékniku hosi SEEAS aprezenta uluk dezeño no BoQ ba ponte suspensaun ba Illa Jaco ne\'ebé tuir plano sei dada Bée liu hosi ponte refere, parte daruak, aprezenta dezeño no BoQ ba rehabilitasaun estasaun Bée iha Aldeia Wenunuk no rehabilitasaun estasaun Bée iha Aldeia Bedois.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin halo tiha aprezentasaun BoQba melhoramentu bee iha Wenunuk no Bedois Ministro Obrás Públika, fo ona orientasaun atu aselera iha tempu badak tamba konsidera hanesan servisu emerjensia.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kona-ba, projetu ba ponte suspensaun ne’ebé tuir planu sei liga hosi Valu sere ba Illa Jaco Ministru Obras Públika husu atu hare’e fila-fali ba kustu orsamentu ba konstrusaun inklui padraun material sira ne’ebe sei utiliza atu konstrui ponte hosi Valu Sere ba Illa Jaco.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div></div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2024-02-20 00:36:10.264371','73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997',1,2,'2024-02-07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-113-1-1','None-113-1-1','ekipa-tekniku-gabineti-seeas-aprezenta-dezono-no-boq-projetu-melloramentu-bee-mos-ba-ministro-obras-publika-2-1',NULL,NULL),(114,'Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Semináriu Nasionál Regras no Prosedimentu Sira Ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura iha Timor-Leste','Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Semináriu Nasionál Regras no Prosedimentu Sira Ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura iha Timor-Leste\r\nDili, 15 Fevereiru 2024\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompania Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmã informa hodi sai orador iha “Semináriu Nasionál Regras no Prosedimentu Sira Ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura iha Timor-Leste” ne’ebé organiza husi Ministériu Planu Investimentu Estrateziku (MPIE).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika Partisipa Iha Semináriu Nasionál Regras no Prosedimentu Sira Ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura iha Timor-Leste</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 15 Fevereiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, akompania Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmã informa hodi sai orador iha “Semináriu Nasionál Regras no Prosedimentu Sira Ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura iha Timor-Leste” ne’ebé organiza husi Ministériu Planu Investimentu Estrateziku (MPIE).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Entretantu Semináriu ne’e rasik realiza iha salaun ekontru Ministériu Finansas,kinta-feira ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha siminariu ne’e Primeiru-Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão haktuir,iha tinan sira liuba orsamentu ne’ebé governu anterior uja,ninia ezekusaun la’o ladun di’ak. Tanba ne’e Xefe Governu konsidera simináriu ne’e importante tebe-tebes hodi bele kurizi no hadia sistema ho loloos.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Ita mai la’os atu Kritika deit, ita mai atu kurizi buat ne’ebe ladiak, ita hadia halo los, tamba ne’e importancte tebes, se ita kompara 800 metru ba estrada labele sukat ho osan 21 milloes, tanba ne’e ita hadia regras inklui prosedimentu hodi bele dezenvolve setor infraestrutura,” hatete PM Xanana.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Alende ne’e governu mós, iha tempu badak sei implementa desentralizasaun “poder local” iha Munisipiu hotu. Tanba ne’e tenki prepara rekursu umanu iha jestaun finansas no administrasaun di’ak hodi halo kontrolu ba implementasaun projetu oin-oin ne’ebé sei harii iha munisipiu hotu-hotu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Xefe Governu mós husu liña ministéria,setór privadu, presidente autorideden inklui entidade hotu-hotu ne’ebé partisipa iha semináriu atu tau hanoin hamutuk hadia erru sira iha Sistema, hodi kontrolu projetu ninia kualidade too kustu hodi kuidadu osan povu nian atu nune’e bele gasta ho di’ak hodi serví povu no nasaun.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha fatin hanesan, Ministériu Planu Investimentu Estrateziku (MPIE), Gastão Francisco de Sousa, informa semináriu importante tebes atu entidade relevantes sira mak kaer papél iha setór infraestruktura koñese no familiariza-an ho regra no prosedimentu sira iha setór infraestrutura hodi garante kualidade no asegura transparénsia, atu bele promove kreximentu ekonómiku no asegura moris-di\'ak ba sidadaun  hotu hanesan vizaun hosi TL nia planu Estratéjiku Dezenvolvimentu Nasionál (PEDN 2011-2030) katak  to’o 2030 Timor-Leste sei nasaun ho rendimentu médio-alto ho sosiedade ida  ne’ebé prospero no saudavél, atu konkista alvu ida ne’e dezenvolvimentu setór infaraestruktura nu’udar fator determinante. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu iha Semináriu ne’e Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal haktuir, ita presija hadia Sistema atendementu iha prosesu tenderizasaun ba Obra infraestrutura, atu nune’e bele habadak tiha Sistema birokrasia iha aprovizionamentu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">“Ita presija hadia ka habadak birokrasia iha prosesu tenderizasaun, atu nune’e bele fasilita lalais kompania sira bele ezekuta lalais projeitu ne’ebé sira manan ona, alende ne’e ita presija hatudu komitmentu atu hari’i projetu infrastrutura ne’ebé la’òs hatan de’it ba nesesidades imediata, maibé kontribui mós ba nasaun nia bem-estar no progresu,”dehan Ministru Obras Públika</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu Semináriu ne’e marka mós prezensa hosi parseirus dezenvolvimentu sira hotu ne’ebé durante ne’e fó asisténsia ba iha desenvolvimentu setór infraestruktura mak hanesan Banco Mundial,Banku Dezenvolvimentu Aziátiku (ADB), Ajénsia Koperasaun Internasional Japaun (JICA), Embaxada Austrália iha Timor-Leste, Uniaun Europeia (EU), Koperasaun Finansiamentu Internasional (IFC), UNDP, membru governu, Membrus Parlamentu Nasionál, Embaxadora  Austrália iha Timor-Leste, Caitlin Wilson, Embaxadora Japão iha Timor-Leste, Kimura Tetsuya, Prezidente CCI-TL, Jorge Sereno, Diretór BNCTL, akadémiku no Sosiedade sivil no presidente autoridade munisipiu sira.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div></div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-22 07:02:09.082617','5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add',1,2,'2024-02-15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-114-1-1','None-114-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-partisipa-iha-seminariu-nasional-regras-no-prosedimentu-sira-ba-dezenvolvimentu-infraestrutura-iha-timor-leste-1-1',NULL,NULL),(115,'Ministru Justisa Foun Ohin Simu Posse','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho membru Governu sira seluk partisipa seremonia posse ba Ministru Justisa foun-Sergio Hornai subtitui Matebian Amândio de Sa Benevides, neebe nain Maromak bolu hikas ona ba Nia kadunan Santo iha fulan Janeiru liu ba,  hodi halao mandatu ba periodo 2024 too 2028.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Justisa Foun Ohin Simu Posse</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 15 Fevereiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho membru Governu sira seluk partisipa seremonia posse ba Ministru Justisa foun-Sergio Hornai subtitui Matebian Amândio de Sa Benevides, neebe nain Maromak bolu hikas ona ba Nia kadunan Santo iha fulan Janeiru liu ba,  hodi halao mandatu ba periodo 2024 too 2028.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Seremonia posse ne\'e halao iha Palasiu Prezidénsia Nicolao, Aitarak Laran, kinta-feira ne\'e, prezide hosi Prezidente Republika Jose Ramos Horta akompania hosi Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão no Prezidenti Tribunál Rekursu-Deolindo dos Santos</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha nia diskursu Prezidente da Republika-Jose Ramos Horta lahaluha hatoo kongratulasaun ba iha Dr.Sergio Hornai, neebe ohin simu ona posse hodi asume knaar nuudar Ministru Justisa, setor Justisa setor ida neebe importante.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Tanba ne\'e hau husu atu halao knaar imparsial, independente no justisa i Ministru Justisa mos, iha knaar importante hodi halao knaar iha area Justisa nia hodi kria mos kondisaun atu apoiu ba setor justisa, ba nesesariu hotu hanesan iha area estrutura, administrasaun no finanseira parte hotu hodi halao knaar ho trankuilidade,\"</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha biban ne\'e Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmao, hatete, IX Governu Konstitusional hili, Dr. Sergio Hornai hodi subtitui Matebian Amândio de Sa Benevides, asume kargu nuudar Ministru Justisa.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Naran neebe hakerek haruka mai Prezidente Republika aseita ona mak Dr. Sergio, tanba nee, ohin Kinta simu posse,\" hatete Primeiru Ministru.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Partisipante neebe mak Partisipa iha serimonia tomada de Posse nee, mak hanesan, Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, inklui membru Governu sira hotu.*</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-22 07:35:02.247572','2b44928ae11fb9384c4cf38708677c48',1,2,'2024-02-15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-115-1-1','None-115-1-1','ministru-justisa-foun-ohin-simu-posse-1-1',NULL,NULL),(116,'GOVERNU NO IFC-WORLD BANK DESCUTE IMPLEMENTASAUN PROJETU AEROPORTU PREZIDENTE NICOLAU LOBATO','Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o enkontru ho Reprezentante International Financial Corporation (IFC- World Bank),  \r\nMelisa Day hodi deskute kona-ba kooperasaun servisu hodi implementa kontrusaun ba future projetu Aeroportu Internasionál Prezidente Nicolau Lobato, Dili.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;;\">GOVERNU NO IFC-WORLD BANK DESCUTE IMPLEMENTASAUN PROJETU AEROPORTU PREZIDENTE NICOLAU LOBATO <o:p></o:p></span></p><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><font color=\"#050505\" face=\"Segoe UI Historic, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span></font></div></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\">DILI, 09 fevereiru 2024- Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o enkontru ho Reprezentante International Financial Corporation (IFC- World Bank), <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Melisa Day hodi deskute kona-ba kooperasaun servisu hodi implementa kontrusaun ba future projetu Aeroportu Internasionál Prezidente Nicolau Lobato, </span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili.</span></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\">Enkontru ne’e akompaña direita hosi Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku, Gastão Francisco de Sousa, Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso no Ministru Obras Públiku (MOP) Samuel Marçal hodi rona direita programa no planu ne’ebé Governu no IFC-World Bank koopera.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratéjiku, Gastão informa enkontru ne’e sira deskute kona-ba kontinuasaun apoiu hosi IFC-World Bank atu haree implementasaun projetu boot sira hanesan, aeroportu, portu no estrada sira.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\"><i style=\"\"><b>\"</b>Encontru ohin hamutuk ho senhor primeiro ministro Xanana hare\'e liu ba projeitu reabilitasaun Aeroportu Dili hodi ita descute ho senho Melisa Day husi IFC Ami hare\'e oinsa ida ita dudu projeitu sira ne\'e ba oin ba aeroportu ita sei halo revizaun ba dezenu , kustu no buat hotu-hotu Depois sei halo fila fali Aprezentasaun tamba seidauk finaliza.\" informa Ministru Gastão ba jornalista iha Palasiu Governu, Dili.</i></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\">Projetu Aeroportu Dili sei hala’o liu hosi modalidade Parseiru Públiku Privadu (PPP) ne’ebé governu sei tau osan no nomos setór privadu. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\">Governu sei kontinua konvida nafatin Governu Japaun ne’ebé apoia halo dezeñu ba Aeroportu hodi haree hamutuk servisu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit;\">Iha enkontru ne’e, Reprezentante International Financial Corporation (IFC- World Bank), Melisa Day entrega mós relatóriu no programa sira ne’ebé IFC no Governu Timor-Leste trasa ona sei hala’o deskusaun klean liután molok hala’o implementasaun. </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia Mop</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-22 08:21:25.898974','c45147dee729311ef5b5c3003946c48f',1,2,'2024-02-09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-116-1-1','None-116-1-1','governu-no-ifc-world-bank-descute-implementasaun-projetu-aeroportu-prezidente-nicolau-lobato-1-1',NULL,NULL),(117,'Ekipa Tékniku Gabineti SEEAS Aprezenta Dezoño no BoQ Projetu Melloramentu Bee-Mos ba Ministro Obrás Públika','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompania hosi Sekretáriu Estádu ba Elétrisidade Bée no Saneamentu (SEEAS)-Santos Noronha halao enkontru ho ekipa tékniku Gabinete SEEAS, iha Salaun Ministériu Obras Públika MOP Kaikoli, Quarta-feira ne\'e.\r\nObjetivu hosi reuniaun ne\'e mak, aprezenta atu kona-ba Dezeño no BoQ ba projetu melloramentu bee-mos, ne’ebe sei instala iha fatin tolu.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>Ekipa Tékniku Gabineti SEEAS Aprezenta Dezoño no BoQ Projetu Melloramentu Bee-Mos ba Ministro Obrás Públika</b></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 7 Fevereiro 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal akompania hosi Sekretáriu Estádu ba Elétrisidade Bée no Saneamentu (SEEAS)-Santos Noronha halao enkontru ho ekipa tékniku Gabinete SEEAS, iha Salaun Ministériu Obras Públika MOP Kaikoli, Quarta-feira ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Objetivu hosi reuniaun ne\'e mak, aprezenta atu kona-ba Dezeño no BoQ ba projetu melloramentu bee-mos, ne’ebe sei instala iha fatin tolu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha parte dahuluk ekipa tékniku hosi SEEAS aprezenta uluk dezeño no BoQ ba ponte suspensaun ba Illa Jaco ne\'ebé tuir plano sei dada Bée liu hosi ponte refere, parte daruak, aprezenta dezeño no BoQ ba rehabilitasaun estasaun Bée iha Aldeia Wenunuk no rehabilitasaun estasaun Bée iha Aldeia Bedois.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin halo tiha aprezentasaun BoQba melhoramentu bee iha Wenunuk no Bedois Ministro Obrás Públika, fo ona orientasaun atu aselera iha tempu badak tamba konsidera hanesan servisu emerjensia.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kona-ba, projetu ba ponte suspensaun ne’ebé tuir planu sei liga hosi Valu sere ba Illa Jaco Ministru Obras Públika husu atu hare’e fila-fali ba kustu orsamentu ba konstrusaun inklui padraun material sira ne’ebe sei utiliza atu konstrui ponte hosi Valu Sere ba Illa Jaco.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-22 08:32:03.922527','eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68',1,2,'2024-02-07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-117-1-1','None-117-1-1','ekipa-tekniku-gabineti-seeas-aprezenta-dezono-no-boq-projetu-melloramentu-bee-mos-ba-ministro-obras-publika-1-1-1',NULL,NULL),(118,'Ministru Obras Publika Halo Observasaun ba Estrada Lugatoi no Estrada Urbana Iha Viqueque Vila','Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verfikasaun no Pagamentu-Aleixo Borges no Diretur Ponte no Estrada Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, halo observasaun ba Estrada Lugato\'i akompania hosi empreza Hoven II, segunda ne\'e, observa direta estrada Lugato\'i ne\'ebé lokaliza iha suku Caraubalu, postu Viqueque Vila, Munisipiu Viqueque.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>Ministru Obras Publika Halo Observasaun ba Estrada Lugatoi no Estrada Urbana Iha Viqueque Vila</b></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Viqueque, 19 Fevereiru 2024 </div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verfikasaun no Pagamentu-Aleixo Borges no Diretur Ponte no Estrada Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, halo observasaun ba Estrada Lugato\'i akompania hosi empreza Hoven II, segunda ne\'e, observa direta estrada Lugato\'i ne\'ebé lokaliza iha suku Caraubalu, postu Viqueque Vila, <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Munisipiu Viqueque.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Ohin hau mai hamutuk ho ekipa tékniku Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP), observa dalan Lugatoi atu foti desizaun. Karik estrada Lugato\'i, labele ita tenke haree mós dalan alternativu seluk. Maibé ha\'u haree ona no tékniku sira dehan bele rezolve kestaun dalan Lugato\'i,\"hateten Ministru Obras Públika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika haktuir, orsamentu ba konstrusaun Estrada Lugato\'i seidauk prevee tanba orsamentu multi anuál, katak hafoin tekniku sira haree kondisaun real mak foin bele aloka orsamentu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Ohin ha\'u mós uza kamera drone hodi haree dalan alternativu ne\'ebé loke husi aldeia Buanurak to\'o iha eskola sekundáriu 4 setembru. Xefe suku Caraubalu informa ona ba ha\'u katak dalan alternativu ne\'e ba futuru konstrui ospitál munisipál no edifísiu kamara munisipal,maibé ita sei haree iha tinan 2025. Tanba agora ita foku ba estrada lugato\'i,\" Ministru haktuir</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Hafoin observa tiha estrada Lugato\'i Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa ba hare dalan urbana iha área Boromatan suku Caraubalu ne’ebé kotu no dalan diresaun Viqueque ba Postu Uatulari.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Ha\'u mós sei ba haree direta dalan urbana sira iha kapitál Viqueque Vila,oinsa maka ita bele hadi\'a tanba kondisaun aat tebe-tebes. Ha\'u espera katak iha tinan ida-ne\'e ita bele komesa hadi\'a dalan urbana sira-ne\'e,\"Ministru Obras Públika akresenta</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Antes atu remata halo observasaun ba Estrada urbana iha Vikeke Vila  Ministru Obras Públika husu ba autoridade komunitária sira iha munisipiu Viqueque atu labele iha impedementu ruma bao bra refere.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mota Welolo</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kona-ba mota Welolo, ne\'ebé lokaliza iha aldeia Uma Boot, suku Luca, postu Viqueque Vila, Munisípiu Viqueque. Ministru Obras Públika hatete, bainhira udan para tekniku sira hahú halo normalizasaun ba mota hodi asegura komunidade ira hosi risku dezastre, ligado ho kontrusaun ponte, Ministru haktuir presija halo estudu ida klean, antes hari fila ponte foun.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"bainhira udan para ita hahú halo normalizasaun ba mota, iha futuru antes atu konstrui ponte foun, presiza halo estudu ida kle\'an di\'ak tanba ha\'u haree mota ida ne\'e uniku iha Timor tanba mota hotu- hotu nia ain bá to\'o tasi, uniku mota Welolo deit mák mota ain laiha, tanba ne’e bee hala\'i ba ne\'ebé ita lahatene. nune\'e ita presiza halo estudu ida klean ba mota welolo,\"hatete Ministru Obras Públika.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru haktuir, dadaun ne’e Governu liu Ministériu Obras Públika preve ona orsamentu hodi normaliza Ponte Welolo, hodi fasilita movimentasaun abitante.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\"Tinan ida-ne\'e ami prevee ona orsamentu purvolta millaun $1 ba normalizasaun no konstrui mota welolo, maibé orsamentu ida-ne\'e seidauk fixa loos tanba presiza halo levantamentu, atu hatene loos montante orsamentu ne’e, daudaun ne\'e, ekipamentu pezadu husi empreza JONIZE unipesoál L.da destaka ona iha mota Welolo, maibé udan halo mota korrente boot ne\'ebé afeta ba normalizasaun no konstrusaun. Ita-nia empreza la\'ós la servisu, maibé mota mak sei boot. Karik udan para ita-nia empreza hahú fali servisu hodi halo normalizasaun,”dehan Ministru Obras Públika .(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-23 01:37:00.922174','5ef059938ba799aaa845e1c2e8a762bd',1,2,'2024-02-19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-118-1-1','None-118-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-halo-observasaun-ba-estrada-lugatoi-no-estrada-urbana-iha-viqueque-vila-1-1',NULL,NULL),(119,'Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto','Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verfikasaun no Pagamentu-Aleixo Borges no Diretur Ponte no Estrada Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, ba hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto, hosi Obrato ba to\'o Laklo Vila, ne\'ebé kaer hosi empreza Jova Construction \"JV WIKA\".','<p><b><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal </span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto</span></b></p><div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Manatuto, 19 Fevereiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verfikasaun no Pagamentu-Aleixo Borges no Diretur Ponte no Estrada Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, ba hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto, hosi Obrato ba to\'o Laklo Vila, ne\'ebé kaer hosi empreza Jova Construction \"JV WIKA\".</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha vizita ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika husu ba empreza Jova Construction, atu aselera lalais obra rehabilitasaun estrada ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Alende ne\'e Nai Ministru Obras Públika husu mós ba tékniku empreza Jova Construction halao servisu  tuir dezeñu, karik la halo latuir dezeñu, sei haruka ekipa tèkniku Ministériu Obras Públika sei mai sobu tiha.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div><p><br></p>','Manatuto',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-23 01:58:15.886476','07e1cd7dca89a1678042477183b7ac3f',1,2,'0024-02-19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-119-1-1','None-119-1-1','ministru-obra-publika-samuel-marcal-hare-direta-progresu-rehabilitasaun-estrada-manatuto-1-1',NULL,NULL),(120,'hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto','Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verfikasaun no Pagamentu-Aleixo Borges no Diretur Ponte no Estrada Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, ba hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto, hosi Obrato ba to\'o Laklo Vila, ne\'ebé kaer hosi empreza Jova Construction \"JV WIKA\".','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto</b><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Manatuto, 19 Fevereiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obra Públika-Samuel Marçal, hamutuk ho Diretur Unidade Inspesaun Verfikasaun no Pagamentu-Aleixo Borges no Diretur Ponte no Estrada Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, ba hare direta progresu rehabilitasaun estrada Manatuto, hosi Obrato ba to\'o Laklo Vila, ne\'ebé kaer hosi empreza Jova Construction \"JV WIKA\".</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Iha vizita ne\'e Ministru Obras Públika husu ba empreza Jova Construction, atu aselera lalais obra rehabilitasaun estrada ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Alende ne\'e Nai Ministru Obras Públika husu mós ba tékniku empreza Jova Construction halao servisu  tuir dezeñu, karik la halo latuir dezeñu, sei haruka ekipa tèkniku Ministériu Obras Públika sei mai sobu tiha.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Manatuto',1,0,0,0,'2024-02-23 02:28:12.419288','da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642',1,2,'2024-02-19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-120-1-1','None-120-1-1','hare-direta-progresu-rehabilitasaun-estrada-manatuto-1-1',NULL,NULL),(121,'Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hetan vizita kortezia hosi Southeast Asia Department Asian Development Bank (ADB)-Winfried F. Wicklein','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hetan vizita kortezia hosi, Diretur  Jeral Southeast Asia Department Asian Development Bank (ADB)-Winfried F. Wicklein ne’ebé akompania hosi Diretur ADB Timor Leste-Stefania Dina sorumutu entre Diretur Jeral Southeast Asia Department Asian Development Bank ho Ministru Obras Públika, hala’o iha sala gabineti Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli, tersa ne’e.','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b>Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hetan vizita kortezia hosi, Diretur  Jeral Southeast Asia Department Asian Development Bank (ADB)-Winfried F. Wicklein</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b> </b></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dili, 20 Fevereiru 2024</span></p><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hetan vizita kortezia hosi, Diretur  Jeral Southeast Asia Department Asian Development Bank (ADB)-Winfried F. Wicklein ne’ebé akompania hosi Diretur ADB Timor Leste-Stefania Dina sorumutu entre Diretur Jeral Southeast Asia Department Asian Development Bank ho Ministru Obras Públika, hala’o iha sala gabineti Ministériu Obras Públika, Caicoli, tersa ne’e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Objetivu husi vizita ida ne\'e atu koalia kona ba inisiativu agora <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>nian, liu hosi suporta ne\'ebé oferese hosi ADB ba Povu Timor-Leste. Inklui progama sira ne\'ebé foka husi IX Governu Konstitusional.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-spa