-family: inherit;\">kontinua  servisu nafatin, kua ai haluhun boot ida ne’ebé tohar hanehan uma rua iha Taibesi-Matando, Domingo ne\'e.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 18 Fevereiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Hafoin to iha fatin Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal siku orientasaun husi Primeiru-Ministrus, atu ba hare ekipa tekniku IGE-ADI ne’ebé halo normalizasaun Mota hodi asegura uma komunidade no edefisiu eskola hosi risku dezastre, iha Camea Raihun.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2024-02-26 06:12:03.792113','202cb962ac59075b964b07152d234b70',1,2,'2024-02-18',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-123-1-1','None-123-1-1','dili-18-fevereiru-2024-1-1',NULL,NULL),(124,'Ministru Obras Públika Vizita Parke Solar Photovoltaic iha Laleia','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha sesta-feira ne’e, akompania hosi Prezidenti Komisaun Ezekutiva-Paulo da Silva, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Tékniku-Latino Jerónimo ho Diretora Finansas no Komersial-Idrisyah Sagran, vizita ba futuru konstrusaun projetu solar photovoltaic (Solar PV) iha Laleia.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><h4 style=\"font-family: inherit;\" class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\"> Ministru Obras Pú</span><span style=\"font-family: Impact; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">blika Vizita Parke Solar Photovoltaic iha Laleia</span> </span></b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">﻿</span></h4></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Manatuto, 23 Fevereiru 2024</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha sesta-feira ne’e, akompania hosi Prezidenti Komisaun Ezekutiva-Paulo da Silva, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Tékniku-Latino Jerónimo ho Diretora Finansas no Komersial-Idrisyah Sagran, vizita ba futuru konstrusaun projetu solar photovoltaic (Solar PV) iha Laleia.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"></span>Ajenda ba vizita ne’e mák, atu halo observasaun ba área konstrusaun projetu solar photovoltaic, sub-estasaun, armazenamentu bateria no Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) ho kapasidade 36 Megawatts ho instalasaun parke solar Photovoktaic ho nia kapasidade 72 to’o 85 Megawatts</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Media Mop</span></b></div></div>','Manatuto',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-27 06:19:45.434182','c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445',1,2,'2024-02-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-124-1-1','None-124-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-vizita-parke-solar-photovoltaic-iha-laleia-1-1',NULL,NULL),(125,'Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal vizita ba Betano hodi hare fasilidades Sentral Eletrika Betano.','Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, Akompanha hosi Presidente Komisaun Ezekutiva\r\nEletrisidades de Timor-Leste ,Emprensa Públika (EDTL,E.P)-Paula da Silva\r\n,Komisariu Ezekutivu Serviso Tekniku ,Eng.Latino Jeronimo no Directora Finansas\r\nno Komersial-Idrisyah Sagran,sesta feira ne’e halao vizita ba Betano hodi hare\r\nfatin nebe atu hari fasilidades Des-Caregamentu Mina ba Sentral Eletrika Betano.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: start;\">Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">vizita ba Betano hodi hare</span><font face=\"Segoe UI Historic, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></font></b><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">fasilidades </span></b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Sentral Eletrika Betano.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, Akompanha hosi Presidente Komisaun Ezekutiva\r\nEletrisidades de Timor-Leste ,Emprensa Públika (EDTL,E.P)-Paula da Silva\r\n,Komisariu Ezekutivu Serviso Tekniku ,Eng.Latino Jeronimo no Directora Finansas\r\nno Komersial-Idrisyah Sagran,sesta feira ne’e halao vizita ba Betano hodi hare\r\nfatin nebe atu hari fasilidades Des-Caregamentu Mina ba Sentral Eletrika Betano.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Hafoin hala’o tiha vizita ba iha fatin ne’e Ministro Obras Públika Hatete Iha tempo Badak Sei\r\nHamutuk ho Prezidente Ezekutivu Eletrisidade de Timor-Leste,Emprensa Pública\r\n(EDTL &nbsp;E.P) Hari Equipa hodi Implementa lalais Proseso Ne’e (*) </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Betano ,23\r\nFevebreiru 2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Media MOP</span></b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\r\n</p></div></div>','Same-Betano',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-27 07:02:12.309078','3def184ad8f4755ff269862ea77393dd',1,2,'2024-02-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-125-1-1','None-125-1-1','ministro-obras-publika-samuel-marcal-vizita-ba-betano-hodi-hare-fasilidades-sentral-eletrika-betano-1-1',NULL,NULL),(126,'Ministro Obras Públika Halao Monitorizasaun ba Ponte Lamara Natarbora Inklui Poste Rua Iha Betano','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hafaoin halao monitorizasaun ba Ponte Lamara,Natarbora,Manatuto inklui ponte rua (2) iha Betano, Ponte Selihasan no Ponte Kasaboka, iha sesta-feira ne’e, orienta ona ekipa tékniku hosi Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministro Obras Públika Halao Monitorizasaun ba Ponte Lamara Natarbora Inklui Poste Rua Iha Betano</span></b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> </span></p></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Dili, 23 Fevereiru 2024</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hafaoin halao monitorizasaun ba Ponte Lamara,Natarbora,Manatuto inklui ponte rua (2) iha Betano, Ponte Selihasan no Ponte Kasaboka, iha sesta-feira ne’e, orienta ona ekipa tékniku hosi Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><a tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"color: rgb(56, 88, 152); cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\"></a></span>Hafoin to iha fatin  hodi hare direta kondisaun mota Lamara no Ponte Lamara, Ministru Obras Públika orienta kedan ekipa tékniku MOP, hodi aselera lais prosesu konstrusaun ba ponte refere, atu nune’e labele fo ameasa ba movimentasaun ema no transporte.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;; font-size: 18px;\">“Ponte Lamara aat Durante tinan barak ona ,presija halo intervensaun imediata nune’e labele fo’ameasa ba ema nia vida ,tamba dadaun ne’e </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;; font-size: 18px;\">movimentasaun ema no trasporte liu de’it hosi mota laran “hatete Ministro Obras Públika.</span></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kona-ba ponte Lamara, tékniku sira informa ona katak hein verifikasaun husi Ajensia Dezenvolvimentu Nasional, Institutu Públiku (ADN,IP), hafoin ADN halo ona verifikasaun  kompania bele halao ona nia servisu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu Ponte Selihasan no Ponte Kasaboka ne’ebe lokaliza iha area Betano, Munisípiu Manufahi ekipa tékniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (UIVP-MOP), hafoin halo monitorizasaun hatete, ponte Selihasan presija halo fali estudu, hodi halo kalkulasaun ba dimensaun Mota nia luan, hodi bele halo fali dezenu foun, nune’e bele responde ba nesesidade iha terenu, kona-ba Ponte Kasaboka,Betano, UIVP-MOP relata ba Ministru Obras Públika, teknikamente presija hadia approach ponte nian.(*)</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mídia-MOP</div></div>','Same-Natarbora-Betano',1,0,0,0,'2024-02-28 01:56:47.717999','069059b7ef840f0c74a814ec9237b6ec',1,2,'2024-02-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-126-1-1','None-126-1-1','ministro-obras-publika-halao-monitorizasaun-ba-ponte-lamara-natarbora-inklui-poste-rua-iha-betano-2-1',NULL,NULL),(127,'Ministro Obras Públika Halao Monitorizasaun ba Ponte Lamara Natarbora Inklui Poste Rua Iha Betano','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, hafaoin halao monitorizasaun ba Ponte Lamara,Natarbora,Manatuto inklui ponte rua (2) iha Betano, Ponte Selihasan no Ponte Kasaboka, iha sesta-feira ne’e, orienta ona ekipa tékniku hosi Ministériu Obras Públika (MOP).