ran “hatete Ministro Obras Públika .</span><o:p></o:p></p><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Kona-ba ponte Lamara, tékniku sira informa ona katak hein verifikasaun husi Ajensia Dezenvolvimentu Nasional, Institutu Públiku (ADN,IP), hafoin ADN halo ona verifikasaun  kompania bele halao ona nia servisu.</div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Entretantu Ponte Selihasan no Ponte Kasaboka ne’ebe lokaliza iha area Betano, Munisípiu Manufahi ekipa tékniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu Ministériu Obras Públika (UIVP-MOP), hafoin halo monitorizasaun hatete, ponte Selihasan presija halo fali estudu, hodi halo kalkulasaun ba dimensaun Mota nia luan, hodi bele halo fali dezenu foun, nune’e bele responde ba nesesidade iha terenu, kona-ba Ponte Kasaboka,Betano, UIVP-MOP relata ba Ministru Obras Públika, teknikamente presija hadia approach ponte nian.(*)</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br></div></div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;;\">Media-MOP</span></b></div></div>\r\n\r\n</div></div>','Same-Natarbora-Betano',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-28 02:08:54.894316','ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2',1,2,'2024-02-23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-127-1-1','None-127-1-1','ministro-obras-publika-halao-monitorizasaun-ba-ponte-lamara-natarbora-inklui-poste-rua-iha-betano-1-1-1',NULL,NULL),(128,'Ministro Obras Públika Orienta Ona IGE-ADI Atu Monta Tetrapod iha Mota Loes','Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Iha segunda Feira ne’e akompanha hosi Vogal I IGE-ADI Almerio Caeiro Alves ho Ekipa tecniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu Ministeriu Obras Públika(UIVP-MOP) Halao Monitorizasaun ba Mota Loes.','<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministro Obras Públika Orienta Ona IGE-ADI Atu Monta Tetrapod iha Mota Loes</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Liquiça 27 Fevereiru 2024</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Iha segunda Feira ne’e akompanha hosi Vogal I IGE-ADI Almerio Caeiro Alves ho Ekipa tecniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu Ministeriu Obras Públika(UIVP-MOP) Halao Monitorizasaun ba Mota Loes.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Hafoin halo tiha Monitorizasaun ba Iha Mota Loes, Ministro Obras Publika fo Ona Orientasaun ba Vogal I IGE-ADI) Urgentimente Normaliza tiha Mota Loes hafoin monta Tedrapod iha mota ninin hodi Asegura no Proteze Rai husi Abrasaun no Asegurs mos Ponte ho Komunidade Nia Uma Inklui Natar ho To’os Nebe’e Besik Mota ninin. Ministerio Obras &nbsp;P’ublika Hatete,Monta Tetrapod ba Area Sira iha Mota ninin Loes,atu Proteze Kominidade Sira Bainhira akontese Udan bainhira Akontese Udan boot,Mota nebe Suli ba Tasi Labele Estraga Komunidade Nia Hela Fatin Inklui Natar ho Toos, Tetrapod mos nia Funsaun Proteze no Prevene Abrasaun iha Tasi ninin Mota Loes hosi Ondas Boot.(*)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Media MOP</b></span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div></div>','Liquiça-Loes',1,0,1,0,'2024-02-29 07:15:22.995758','76dc611d6ebaafc66cc0879c71b5db5c',1,2,'2024-02-27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-128-1-1','None-128-1-1','ministro-obras-publika-orienta-ona-ige-adi-atu-monta-tetrapod-iha-mota-loes-1-1',NULL,NULL),(129,'Ministru Obras Públika  Tun direita hare rasik be’e dalan entipidu iha area Audian','Ministru Obras Públika  Tun direita hare rasik be’e dalan entipidu iha area Audian Klinika foho osan mean oin no Orienta Ekipa hasai tiha  foer sira nebe entipidu hallo be’e Nalihun.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Ministru Obras Públika &nbsp;Tun direita hare rasik be’e dalan entipidu iha\r\narea Audian Klinika foho osan mean oin no Orienta Ekipa hasai tiha &nbsp;foer sira nebe entipidu hallo be’e Nalihun.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dili 01 Marsu 2024<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,iha sesta lokraik ne’e\r\nkontinua lidera ekipa Ministru Obras Públika (MOP) Akompanha ekipa Empreza Dili\r\nUnited ,tun direita ba hare rasik be’e dalan ,iha area Audian Klinika foho osan\r\nmean oin ,hodi hamos tiha sadimentasaun no hasai tiha foer sira nebe halo\r\nentipidu no satan be’e labele suli tuir be’e dalan nebe iha.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Iha biban ne’e ministro Obras Públika kontinua apela ba\r\ncomunidades sira atu labele soe foer sira iha valeta nebe hatuur ona hanesan be’e\r\ndalan karik atu soe foer tenke soe ka tau iha fatin foer nian (Lixeiru) atu\r\nnune’e bainhira udan monu rai sei la’akontese inundasaun ka be’e tama ba\r\nkomunidade nia nia uma (*)<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Média MOP.<o:p></o:p></p>','Audian-Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-04 06:26:01.266889','d1f491a404d6854880943e5c3cd9ca25',1,2,'2024-03-01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-129-1-1','None-129-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-tun-direita-hare-rasik-bee-dalan-entipidu-iha-area-audian-1-1',NULL,NULL),(130,'Ministru Obras Públika ho Ekipa Tékniku Monitoriza Prozeito Estrada Urbana no Valeta Bee Dalan','Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,iha segunda Feira ne’e Halao Monitorizasaun ba Projeto Estrada Urbana no  Valeta Be’e Dalan,iha Area Delta 1,Delta 2, Delta 4, Projeito Estrada Rai Kotu no Projeito Estrada Kristo Rei liga ba Dolok Oan .','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Tahoma;\">Ministru Obras Públika ho Ekipa Tékniku Monitoriza Prozeito\r\nEstrada Urbana no Valeta Bee Dalan.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dili 4 Marsu 2024.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ministro Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,iha segunda Feira ne’e\r\nHalao Monitorizasaun ba Projeto Estrada Urbana no &nbsp;Valeta Be’e Dalan,iha Area Delta 1,Delta 2,\r\nDelta 4, Projeito Estrada Rai Kotu no Projeito Estrada Kristo Rei liga ba Dolok\r\nOan .<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Fatin dahuk nebe Ministro Obras Públika ho Ekipa ba hare\r\nuluk mak ,Projeitu Estrada Urbana Delta 1 nebe Constroi Husi Jonize\r\nConstruction Unipesoal Lda, Ministro Obras Públika husu ba Empreza ne’ebe Kaer\r\nObra iha Area ne’e Atu Aselera Lalais Projeito Ne’e Maibe tenke ho Kualidade no\r\nMinistro Obras Mós husu Autoridades Local Xefe Aldeia Delta 1, Ministro Obras\r\nPúblika ho Ekipa Kontinua hakat kedan ba Area delta 2no delta 4, hodi kontinua\r\nba hare progreso konstrusaun Estrada ho valeta bee dalan.<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Remata Monitorizasaun iha Delta, Ministro Obras Públika Akompanha\r\nhosi Ekipa Tékniku Ministériu Obras Públika Director Unidade Inspesaun no\r\nVerifikasaun no Pagamento (UIVP)-Aleixo do Carmo ,Director Diresaun Gerál Estrada\r\n,Ponte ,Prevensaun no Kontrolu de Seias (DJEPPKS)-Nene Lobato, Director\r\nNasional &nbsp;de Construção Vias\r\nRodoviarias-Milton R. de C.Monteiro ,Diretur Geral Habitação Urbanismo (DGHU) Domingos\r\nD.J.Sequeira. (*)<o:p></o:p></p>','Dom-Alexo (Dili)',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-06 03:25:34.175144','9b8619251a19057cff70779273e95aa6',1,2,'2024-03-04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-130-1-1','None-130-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-ho-ekipa-tekniku-monitoriza-prozeito-estrada-urbana-no-valeta-bee-dalan-1-1',NULL,NULL),(131,'Equipa Futebol Salaun (Futsal) Ministerio Obras Públika ,Entrega Taça Primeiro Lugar,kopa 3 de Marsu ba Ministro Obras Públika no Vice Ministro Infraestrutura.','Equipa Futebol Salaun (Futsal) Ministerio Obras Públika ,Entrega Taça Primeiro Lugar,kopa 3 de Marsu ba Ministo Obras Públika –Samuel Marçal ne’ebe Akompanha Husi Vice Ministro Infraestrutura-Julio Carmo ,taça ne’ebe ekipa MOP simu ne’e ,hafoin halakon nia Adversariu Renetil FC','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Equipa Futebol Salaun (Futsal) Ministerio Obras Públika\r\n,Entrega Taça Primeiro Lugar,kopa 3 de Marsu ba Ministro Obras Públika no Vice\r\nMinistro Infraestrutura.</b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dili 04 de Marsu 2024 <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Equipa Futebol Salaun (Futsal) Ministerio Obras Públika\r\n,Entrega Taça Primeiro Lugar,kopa 3 de Marsu ba Ministo Obras Públika –Samuel Marçal\r\nne’ebe Akompanha Husi Vice Ministro Infraestrutura-Julio Carmo ,taça ne’ebe\r\nekipa MOP simu ne’e ,hafoin halakon nia Adversariu Renetil FC ,iha jogu finais\r\n,Kopa 3 de Marsu hodi komemora Loron Nasional Veterano ba dala 7 ,Entretantu\r\nserimonia entrega taça halao iha sala Reuniun Ministerio Obras Públika\r\n,Caicoli,Segunda-Feira ne’e (*)<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Média-MOP<o:p></o:p></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-06 06:36:03.770449','1afa34a7f984eeabdbb0a7d494132ee5',1,2,'2024-03-04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-131-1-1','None-131-1-1','equipa-futebol-salaun-futsal-ministerio-obras-publika-entrega-taca-primeiro-lugarkopa-3-de-marsu-ba-ministro-obras-publika-no-vice-ministro-infraestrutura-1-1',NULL,NULL),(132,'Feto Obras Públika Selebra Loron Mundial Feto','Ministro Obras Púlika-Samuel Marçal Partisipa Loron Mundial Feto ,Nebe Organiza Husi Funcionariu Feto Ministerio Obras públika (MOP) Selebrasaun ba Tinan Ida ne’e ho Workshop Tem aba Selebrasaun ne’e mak Invest in Women,Accelerate Progress (Investe iha Feto Asselera iha Progresu).','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\"><b>Feto Obras Públika Selebra Loron Mundial Feto</b></span> <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dili 07 Marsu 2024<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ministro Obras Púlika-Samuel Marçal Partisipa Loron Mundial\r\nFeto ,Nebe Organiza Husi Funcionariu Feto Ministerio Obras públika (MOP)\r\nSelebrasaun ba Tinan Ida ne’e ho Workshop Tem aba Selebrasaun ne’e mak Invest\r\nin Women,Accelerate Progress (Investe iha Feto Asselera iha Progresu).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ohin ita komemora loron boot ba Loron Mundial Feto, sucseso\r\nboot nebe feto sira halo iha pasado no kuaze iha mundo tomak ohin selebra, ita\r\nlembra fila fali iha tinan atus ida ba’a kotuk ,feto sira nunka hetan Oportunidades\r\natu sai lideransa hanesan kaer Aviaun, Piloto no sai hanesan Ministra. ho luta\r\nfeto nia iha tempo pasadu ohin loron feto sira ita bele dehan Feto sira mos iha Oportunidades kuaze hanesan ho Mane , Iha sira Esforsu tomak sira bele sai\r\nLideransa , bele sai Presidenti, bele sai Ministra ou Deputada ne’e faz parte\r\nluta Feto sira nian. - Dehan Ministro Obras Públika iha selebrasaun Suai Room\r\n,Timor Plaza (Dili) Kinta Feira ne’e..<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ministro Obras Públika Haktuir Loron ida Ohin Hanesan\r\nKomemrasaun Mundial Feto iha mundu tomak,hodi selebra hikas Feto nia Suseso\r\nkonaba ,Kargu Xefia sira iha Ministerio Obras Públika iha Diresaun kuaze feto\r\nAssume kargu Directora .<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ami Kuaze Xefe Departamentu ,Direktores sira Kuaze Feto hotu\r\nida ne’e laos dehan katak husi mane mak atu halo Promosaun ba Feto maibe Feto\r\nsira mak tenke hatene oinsa promove sira nia aan ,Aproveita Oportunidade nebe\r\niha hodi Kaderiza aan Rasik ho nune sira bele hetan Oportunidades nebe diak\r\nliu Dehan Ministro Obras Públika<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Iha Selebrasaun ne’e Partisipa Masimo husi Funsionariu Feto Kada Diresaun nebe tutela iha Ministerio das Obras Públika <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Workshop ne’e foka liu atu hasa’e konesemento feto sira hodi\r\nsai Servidor Públiku, Enkoraja&nbsp; Komunidades Particularmente Feto hodi uja sira nia Direito atu hatene Utulizasaun ba\r\nrekurso ne’ebe iha ,Hasae Feto sira nia Situasaun Sosio-Ekonomi halakon\r\nDiscriminasaun ne’ebe&nbsp; Difekulta laos de’eit Feto sira maibe Sosiadades em Jeral atu hakat ba oin (*)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Média MOP.<o:p></o:p></p>','Timor-Plaza Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-08 04:33:07.026168','65ded5353c5ee48d0b7d48c591b8f430',1,2,'2024-03-07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-132-1-1','None-132-1-1','feto-obras-publika-selebra-loron-mundial-feto-1-1',NULL,NULL),(133,'Konstrusaun Ponte Kasnafar Atinji Ona 20%','Ministru Oras Públika-Samuel Marçal Informa, Dezenvolvimentu Konstrusaun Ponte Kasnafar ,Atinji 20% Lansamento Fatuk dahuluk ba Konstrusaun Ponte kasnafar halao iha 26 Noveembru 2023.','<pre style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\" class=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Konstrusaun Ponte Kasnafar Atinji Ona 20%</span></b></pre><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">Dili 07 Marsu\r\n2024<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministru Oras\r\nPúblika-Samuel Marçal Informa, Dezenvolvimentu Konstrusaun Ponte Kasnafar\r\n,Atinji 20% Lansamento Fatuk dahuluk ba Konstrusaun Ponte kasnafar halao iha 26\r\nNoveembru 2023.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><i>\"Desenvolvemento\r\nkonstrusaun ponte kasnafar dadaun ne’e atinji ona 20% foin mak konstrui iha\r\nfalan 2 ka 3 nia laran ,espera katak antes fulan agostuu ou setembro ponte\r\nkasnafar bele konklui hotu ona”</i></span> <i><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\">hatete Ministru Obras Públika hafoin halao\r\nmonitorizasaun ba ponte kasnafar iha kinta feira ne’e .</span></i><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika afirma , Laos ponte kasnafar deit mak MOP husu atu asselera lais maibe\r\nProjeito sira seluk mos </span></b>.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\"><i>\"Projeito sira seluk mos ita buka\r\nasselera nafatin nune’e ,ita nia ezekusaun ba tinan ida ne’e bele lao ho diak I\r\nbele atinji progresu ne’ebe diak liu tan no bele bo’ot liu tan iha tinan ida ne’e\r\nnia laran“ </i></span>katak Ministru Obras Públika <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Kona ba Projeito Urbana nebe oras\r\nne’e dadaun lao hela,Ministro Obras Públika akresenta ,Tekniko Ministerio Obras\r\nPúblika orinta ona empreza nebe’e kaer Estrada Urbana sira para Asselera lalais\r\ntiha antes fulan 5 ou 6 mai tenke konklui ona.</span> </b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\"><i><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\">\"Dadaun ne’e sei tempo Udan tamba ne’e\r\nmak tarde oituan maibe ita esforso nafatin ho kompanha sira atu kalan ka loron\r\nbuka asselera nafatin nune Estrada urbana sira ne’ebe durante ne’e, sai hanesan\r\nproblem aba comunidades sira nebe hela iha bairro ne’e tamba rai u’ut fo ameasa\r\nba labarik no katuas ferik sira nebe moras asma,tamba impaktu husi rai u’ut\r\n,dengue no kestaun sira ne’e hotu\".</span></i><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\"><b>\"<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Oras ne’e dadaun ,ita sei iha tempo\r\nudan nia laran ,tamba ne’e mak ita esforso ghela hadia Valeta be’e dalan sira\r\natu nune Denggue labele fo amesa ba labarik kiik oan sira “Tenik Ministro Obras\r\nPúblika (*)</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Média-MOP&nbsp;</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>','Dili-Manleu Kasnafar',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-13 08:22:41.547767','9fc3d7152ba9336a670e36d0ed79bc43',1,2,'2024-03-07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-133-1-1','None-133-1-1','konstrusaun-ponte-kasnafar-atinji-ona-20-1-1',NULL,NULL),(134,'EKIPA MOP HAMUTUK HO PRIMEIRO MINISTRO-XANANA GUSMÃO KONTINUA TUN DIREITA IHA TERENU HODI REZOLVE PROBLEMA INUNDASAUN','Udan bo\'ot nebe Akantese iha domingo lokraik ne’e iha parte area foho becora karau maten Entre Balibar no Dare Folume Mota Bo’ot no halo ondas be’e  tun maka’as hodi halo uma komunidades nian iha Taibesi,Becora no Bidau Massaur inklui Santa’ana kontinua Sofre ba Inundasaun Refere.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">EKIPA MOP HAMUTUK HO PRIMEIRO MINISTRO-XANANA GUSMÃO\r\nKONTINUA TUN DIREITA IHA TERENU HODI REZOLVE PROBLEMA INUNDASAUN</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">DILI ,10 Marsu 2024.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Udan bo\'ot nebe Akantese iha domingo lokraik ne’e iha parte\r\narea foho becora karau maten Entre Balibar no Dare Folume Mota Bo’ot no halo\r\nondas be’e &nbsp;tun maka’as hodi halo uma\r\nkomunidades nian iha Taibesi,Becora no Bidau Massaur inklui Santa’ana kontinua\r\nSofre ba Inundasaun Refere. &nbsp;</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Hare ba problema ida ne’e\r\nPrimeiro Ministro-Kay Rala Sanana Gusmão kordena kedas ho ekipa ministerio das\r\nObras Públika (MOP), IGE-ADI,Secretário Estado Eletrisidades Agua no\r\nSaneamentu,Eletrisidades De Timor-Leste,Empreza Públika (EDTL, E,P),Bee\r\nTimor-Leste E.P , Sekretario Estadu Assuntu Toponómia no Org.Urbamna no\r\nSekretario Estado Reflorestasaun no Autoridades Munisipio Dili Tun direita\r\nAzuda hadia kanalizasaun bee moos ne’ebe kotu no suru sai rai no foer ne’ebe\r\nnakonu iha valeta laran.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Kompanhia Montana Diak ,BTK  no Dili United Offerese mos karreta no Eskavator ajuda suru sai tahu no foer nebe nakonu iha area metiaut nian.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15.3333px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><b>Kompanhia Montana <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diak ,BTK&nbsp; no Dili United Offerese mos karreta no Eskavator ajuda suru sai tahu no foer nebe nakonu iha area metiaut nian.</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;;color:#050505\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"></span><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;;color:#050505\"><b>Ekipa Sobu mos ponte\r\nkiik iha area Bidau Santa\'ana hodi monta fila fali manila foun nune fasilita bee dalan\r\nno mota bele liu ho di’ak hodi evita inundasaun labele no labele akontese fali\r\nba komunidades nia uma.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;;color:#050505\"><o:p><b><br></b></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Directora Nasional Manutensaun no Konservasaun\r\nVias Rodaviarias ,Letigia dos Reis Hamjam Corbafo Informa Katak Serviso nebe\r\nsira halao bazeia ba Orientasaun Xefi Governo nian.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><br></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Hahu dader to’o\r\nlokraik ne’e Ekipa Ministerio das Obras Públika (MOP) Mai tomak hodi simu\r\nOrientasaun husi Primeru Ministro-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão atu buka solusaun ba\r\nproblema inundasaun ne’e Tamba Valeta bee dalan barak intipidu nakonu ho foer\r\npersiza hadia Urgensia.” Informa Sra.Letigia.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>Ba loron Segunda\r\n(11/03/2024) Dader ne’e ekipa sira sei kontinua halao nafatin serviso to’o\r\nRemata.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b>#Média_MOP</b></span><o:p></o:p></p>','Dili-Becora',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-14 07:55:18.491928','02522a2b2726fb0a03bb19f2d8d9524d',1,2,'2024-03-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-134-1-1','None-134-1-1','ekipa-mop-hamutuk-ho-primeiro-ministro-xanana-gusmao-kontinua-tun-direita-iha-terenu-hodi-rezolve-problema-inundasaun-1-1',NULL,NULL),(135,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA-SAMUEL MARÇAL ,HATO’O AGRADESEMENTU BA SERVISU NE’EBE EMPREZA CHINA N122-HALO..','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal ,halao sorumutu ho delegasaun empreza internasional China Nuclear Industry 22nd Construction Co,Ltd (CN122)','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA-SAMUEL MARÇAL ,HATO’O\r\nAGRADESEMENTU BA SERVISU NE’EBE EMPREZA CHINA N122-HALO..</span><o:p></o:p></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili,11 Marsu 2024</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\n,halao sorumutu ho delegasaun empreza internasional China Nuclear Industry 22</span><sup><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">nd</span></sup><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">\r\nConstruction Co,Ltd (CN122),Iha sorumutu ne’e Ministru Obras Públika hato’o\r\nAgradesementu ba Servisu ne’ebe Empreza CN122 halo, Sorumutu ne’e rasik realiza\r\niha sala enkontru Gabineti Ministru Das Obras Públika ,Caicoli,segunda-feira ne’e\r\n(*)</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Média_MOP</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>','Dili-Caicoli',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-15 06:47:48.930856','7f1de29e6da19d22b51c68001e7e0e54',1,2,'2024-03-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-135-1-1','None-135-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-samuel-marcal-hatoo-agradesementu-ba-servisu-neebe-empreza-china-n122-halo-1-1',NULL,NULL),(136,'Ministru Obras Públika Halao Inkontru ho Empreza Nasional Ligado ho Prozeitu Estrada Urbana no Valeta Bee Dalan iha Kapital Dili.','Ministro Obras Públika Samuel Marçal Akompanha Husi Director Jeral Finansas no Administrasaun Ministerio das Obras Públika-João Amaral ,hala’o enkontru ho Empreza Nasional ne’ebe kaer Projeitu Estrada Urbana no Valeta Nee dalan ,Iha capital Dili.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\">Ministru Obras Públika Halao Inkontru ho Empreza Nasional\r\nLigado ho Prozeitu Estrada Urbana no Valeta Bee Dalan iha Kapital Dili.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Dili,11 Marsu 2024</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministro Obras Públika Samuel Marçal Akompanha Husi Director\r\nJeral Finansas no Administrasaun Ministerio das Obras Públika-João Amaral ,hala’o\r\nenkontru ho Empreza Nasional ne’ebe kaer Projeitu Estrada Urbana no Valeta Nee\r\ndalan ,Iha capital Dili.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>\r\n\r\n</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Iha sorumutu ne’e Ministru Obras Públika husu ba Empreza\r\nnebe Kaer Obra Estrada Urbana no Valeta Bee dalan Bainhira Kaer Ona Obra Ruma\r\nTenke Iha Ona Planu Servisu ,Atu nune Bainhira Tu’un ba iha Terenu Halao\r\nServisu Sei La Difikulta Serviso Empreza Nian iha Terenu, Bainhira Governo fo\r\nProjeito ba Empreza Nasional Signifika ,Empreza Nasional Sira Iha Ona\r\nKapasidade.</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">\"Bainhira Governo fo Prezeitu ba ita bo’ot sira,tenke servisu\r\nho laran labele hanoin buka ossan deit, prozeitu nebe’e empreza sira hetan hanesan\r\noportunidades ida ba ita bo’ot sira atu halo investimento no fo formasaun ba\r\nita bo’ot sira nia tekniku hodi haforsa liu tan setor privado sira,atu setor\r\npribadu ida ne’e bele sai diak para ita nia rai ne’e bele sai diak liu tan “Hatete\r\nMinistru Das Obras Públika bainhira halao inkontro ho Empreza Nasional Sira iha\r\nSegunda Feira ne’e..</span><o:p></o:p></b></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">Ministro Obras Públika mos husu ba Empreza Nasional Sira\r\nbainhira kaer Obra Ne\'e tenke ho Kualidades nebe Halo Servisu ho Metodu,atu\r\nnune buat hotu lao ho diak tuir nia Dezenu nune bainhira finalize Obra Refere\r\niha kualidade nebe diak\"</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">.</span></b></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Objetivu Husi Sorumutu ne’e Atu Hametin Serviso no\r\nKoordenasaun Entre Kompanhia ne’ebe Reabilita Estrada Urbana no Valeta Bee\r\nDalan iha Kapital Dili , Atu Nune’e Bele DezenvolveKordenasaun Diak ho Tekniko\r\nMinisterio Das Obras Públika.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Entretantu Iha Sorumutu Ne’e Marka Prezensa Moos Ekipa\r\nTekniko Ministerio das Obras Públikas ,Direktor Unidades Inspesaun Verifikasaun\r\nno Pagamento (UIVP)-Aleixo do Carmo ,Director Diresaun Jeral Estradas Ponte\r\nPrevensaun Controlu no Seias (DJEPPKS)-Nene Lobato ,Director Nasional no\r\nKonstrusaun Vias Rodaviarias-Milton</span> R. de <span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">C.Monteiro, Director Jeral Habitasaun\r\nUrbanismo (DGHU)-Domingos D.J.Sequeira. (*)</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">Média­-MOP</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>','Dili-Caicoli',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-15 07:55:50.471600','42a0e188f5033bc65bf8d78622277c4e',1,2,'2024-03-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-136-1-1','None-136-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-halao-inkontru-ho-empreza-nasional-ligado-ho-prozeitu-estrada-urbana-no-valeta-bee-dalan-iha-kapital-dili-1-1',NULL,NULL),(137,'Ministru Obras Públika Monitoriza Kondisaun Mota Laclo','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, Akompanha hosi Directur Exekutivu Agéncia Desenvolvementu Nasional (AND)-Rui Lorenço da Costa ,iha tersa feira ne’e Monitoriza Kondisaun Mota Laclo no Moru Protesaun Ne’ebe Hetan Estragus Hosi Dezastre Naturais ,Udan no Anin Bo’ot Nebe Akontese Iha loron 4 Abril 2021 ,hodi hamosu inundasaun no rai halai iha territorial Timor-Leste.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Ministru Obras Públika Monitoriza\r\nKondisaun Mota Laclo</b></span> <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Manatuto ,12 Marsu 2024</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal,\r\nAkompanha hosi Directur Exekutivu Agéncia Desenvolvementu Nasional (AND)-Rui Lorenço\r\nda Costa ,iha tersa feira ne’e Monitoriza Kondisaun Mota Laclo no Moru\r\nProtesaun Ne’ebe Hetan Estragus Hosi Dezastre Naturais ,Udan no Anin Bo’ot Nebe\r\nAkontese Iha loron 4 Abril 2021 ,hodi hamosu inundasaun no rai halai iha territorial\r\nTimor-Leste.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Hafoin hao tiha Monitorizasaun ba\r\nMota Laclo ,Ministru Obras Públika Hatete Sei Orienta Ekipa tecniko IGE-ADI\r\nSira atu normaliza tiha mota antes , Empreza sira atu halo moru Protesaun.</b></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">“Hau Fo Ona Orientasaun ba\r\nIGE-ADI,Atu Normaliza Mota Hodi Nune’e Bele Asegura Komunidades Sira Ne’ebe\r\nHela Iha Mota Ninin ” Hatete Ministru Obras Públika</span></b> .<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"> Iha Sorin Seluk Agelino da\r\nCosta Freitas ,Komunidades Aldeia Belebatu ,Malarahun Haktuir ,Akontese 4 Abril\r\n2022, Lori Trauma Boot ba Koomunidades Sira Nebe Hela Besik Mota Laklo Tuun to\r\nManatuto Vila ,Halo Komunidades Nia Hela Fatin ,Animal Hakiak no Ai-Horis Sira\r\n,Mota Lori Hotu ba Tasi Inklui Sobu Mos Moru Protesaun no Halo Mota Refere Tama\r\nto’o Komunidades Sira Nia Horik-Fatin.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><i style=\"\">“Agradese Wain Tamba Sua\r\nEx. Ministru das Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Mai Ona Iha Ami Nia Fatin\r\nHodi Rezolve Moru Protesaun Iha Mota Manatuto Nian hodi Labele fo Ameasa Tan Ba\r\nAmi Povu Nia Vida ,Inklui Ameasa Ba Povu Nia Kintal Natar No Ai’Horis Sira “Dehan\r\nAngelino.</i></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Nia Haktuir Relasiona ho\r\nAkontesementu Inundasaun Ne’ebe Akontese iha Loron 04 Fulan Abril Ne’ebe\r\nEstragus Popilasaun Barak Nia Uma Inklui To’Os no Natar.</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i>“Tamba ne’e Ami Husu ba\r\nMinisterio Relevante karik Bele Mai Normaliza Tiha Mota no Hadia Mos Moru\r\nProtesaun Atu Nune’e Labele Fo Ameasa Ba Ami Nia Vida “ Tenik Angelino </i><o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Média MOP<o:p></o:p></p>','Manatuto-Laclo',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-18 07:10:44.532516','3988c7f88ebcb58c6ce932b957b6f332',1,2,'2024-03-12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-137-1-1','None-137-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-monitoriza-kondisaun-mota-laclo-1-1',NULL,NULL),(138,'Ministru das Obras Públika Partisipa Lansamento Instalasaun Solar Panel no Distribuisaun Fugaun Rai ba Komunidades.','Ministro Obras Públika Samuel Marçal ,Partisipa Iha Serimonia Lansamento Instalasaun Solar Panel no Distribuisaun 1000 Ekipamentos Panel Solar no Entrega mos Fugaun Rai ba Prizidente Autoridades Munisipio Manatuto ,Manufahi no Ainaro Hodi Offerese ba Comunidades Sira Liu Husi Projeitu Promosaun ba Transformasaun Verde Iha Rejiun Pasifiku Hodi Dezenvolve Net-Zero no Klima-Reziliente,Aktividades Ne’e Realiza Entre Governo Timor-Leste no Governo Japaun Hamutuk ho UNDP.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 18px;\"><b>Ministru das Obras Públika Partisipa\r\nLansamento Instalasaun Solar Panel no Distribuisaun Fugaun Rai ba Komunidades.</b></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Dili ,15/ Marsu 2024<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Ministro Obras Públika Samuel\r\nMarçal ,Partisipa Iha Serimonia Lansamento Instalasaun Solar Panel no Distribuisaun\r\n1000 Ekipamentos Panel Solar no Entrega mos Fugaun Rai ba Prizidente\r\nAutoridades Munisipio Manatuto ,Manufahi no Ainaro Hodi Offerese ba Comunidades\r\nSira Liu Husi Projeitu Promosaun ba Transformasaun Verde Iha Rejiun Pasifiku\r\nHodi Dezenvolve Net-Zero no Klima-Reziliente,Aktividades Ne’e Realiza Entre\r\nGoverno Timor-Leste no Governo Japaun Hamutuk ho UNDP.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Iha Nia Discursu Ministru Das\r\nObras Públika Hato’o Agradese Ba Governo Japaun no UNDP tamba ,Apoio Ne’ebe Fo\r\nHahu Desde Timor-Leste Ukun Rasik A’an.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">“Agradese Ba Governo Japaun ho\r\nUNDP Tamba Iha Hanoin Iha Domin Ba Povu Timor-Leste ,Ne’ebe Persija Tebes ita\r\nBo’ot Sira Nia Tulum Hau Hanoin Apoio Sira Hanesan Ne’e ,Apar Tebes ho Povu Nia\r\nNesesidades ,Governo Hatene Nia Kapasidades To’o Iha Ne’ebe Maibe ho Ajuda Sira\r\nHanesan Ne’e Ajuda Mos Governo Nia Kapasidade”<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Aleinde Ne’e Mos Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika,Hato’o Mos Agradesementu Ba Grupu Timor Oan Ne’ebe Produs Ona Fugaun\r\nRai.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Hau Agradese Teb-tebes Alin Sira\r\nNe’ebe Produz Fugaun Rai ,Ita Komesa Hatudu Dadaun Ona,Ita Nia Produsaun Rai\r\nLaran Nian,Mesmo Fugaun N’e Simples Maibe Hatudu Ona Ita Nia Identidades\r\nProdusaun”Hateten Ministeru Obras Públika.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Entretantu Serimonia Lansamento\r\nNe’e Rasik Realiza,Iha Salaun Novo Turismu,Lesidere,Marka Mos Prezensa Husi\r\nEmbaxador Japaun Mai Timor-Leste –Kimura Tetsuya ho Delegasaun ,Ministru\r\nAdministrasaun Estatal-Thomas Do Rozario Cabral,Reprezenta UNDP-Adeline Carrier\r\nInklui mos Prezidente Autoridades Munisipal Mnatuto,Manufahi,Ainaro no\r\nAdministrador Postu Administrativu Manatuto Villa ho Laclubar*<o:p></o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><h2 style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Mídia-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;;\r\ncolor:#65676B\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100094158948731&amp;__cft__%5b0%5d=AZWcLiXY6USqGnteWuVMkRc0dMDt8FnTXA40O8zGywESyFxH-v9UxB0vNIpJYOzxTZxU4IGtUDwIyFuEm79Yv9kjPbbrymvKPBTZxz_hqgSH_fwkqiIPCaTwFo7ieNQk6-4zNPJqHCTf7peTw1Pc3l9tIzafmM-Y_LcNX_D_P9DbBDjutsc6rkyleQQ-RGxKOlI&amp;__tn__=-%5dC%2CP-R\"><span style=\"color: blue; border: 1pt none windowtext; padding: 0in;\">Gabinete do Ministro das\r\nObras Públicas-Samuel Marçal</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;inherit&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; color: rgb(101, 103, 107);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#65676B\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-19 07:48:05.303146','013d407166ec4fa56eb1e1f8cbe183b9',1,2,'2024-03-15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-138-1-1','None-138-1-1','ministru-das-obras-publika-partisipa-lansamento-instalasaun-solar-panel-no-distribuisaun-fugaun-rai-ba-komunidades-1-1',NULL,NULL),(139,'Planu Preparasaun no Atendementu Liña Integradu Fronteira Batugade ho Salele ba Pregrinasaun Papa Francisco Mai Timor-Leste','Planu Preparasaun no Atendementu Liña Integradu Fronteira Batugade ho Salele ba Pregrinasaun Papa Francisco Mai Timor-Leste','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b>Planu Preparasaun no Atendementu Liña Integradu\r\nFronteira Batugade ho Salele ba Pregrinasaun Papa Francisco Mai Timor-Leste</b></span> </span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>Batugade ,15 Marsu 2024<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika Samuel Marçal,Iha\r\nSexta-Feira Ne’e ho Diretor Geral Transporte e Comunikasaun-Costantino Ferreira\r\nSoares no mos Ekipa Tekniku Ministeriu das Obras Públika Diretor Unidade\r\nInspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu-Alexo do Carmo ho Diretor Nasional\r\nConstrução Vias Rodaviarias-Milton Ramanata R.de C.Monteiro Halao Enkontro ho\r\nDirectur Jeral Finansas-Joanico Pinto Ne’ebe Akompanha Hosi Kordenador Jeral\r\nPostu Integradu Batugade, Iha Sala Reuniaun Posto Integradu Batugade ,Sesta\r\nFeira Ne’e. </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; Objetivu hosi Inkontru Ne’e Mak Koalia\r\nKona ba Planu Atendemento Iha Postu Integrado Batugade ho Salele Hodi Simu\r\nBainaka Sira Hosi Timor Oeste, Ne’e Sei Mai Partisipa Pregrinasaun Sua Eminensia\r\nPapa Francisco Mai Timor iha Fulan Agustu 2024 Ne\'e.</span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; Tuir Planu ne’ebe Iha Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika ho Ekipa Iha Semana Oin Sei Halao Vizita ba Iha Postu Integradu Salele\r\n,Hodi Hare Direita Fasilidades Públiko ne’ebe Sei Offerese ba Bainaka Sira\r\nBainhira Atu Tama Mai Liu Hosi Fronteira Terestre*</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><o:p></o:p></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Midia-MOP</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>','Batugade',1,0,1,0,'2024-03-20 08:24:44.000865','e00da03b685a0dd18fb6a08af0923de0',1,2,'2024-03-15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-139-1-1','None-139-1-1','planu-preparasaun-no-atendementu-lina-integradu-fronteira-batugade-ho-salele-ba-pregrinasaun-papa-francisco-mai-timor-leste-1-1',NULL,NULL),(140,'MOP AKOMPAÑIA HUSI SEATOU MONITORIZA PROJEITO ESTRADA URBANA NO DREINAJEN IHA DILI LARAN','Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal ho Sekretariu Estadu Toponomia no Organizasaun Urbana-Germano Santa Brites inklui ekipa tekniku Unidades Insepsaun Verifikasaun no Pagamento Ministerio Obras MOP, segunda feira ne’e hafoin fila husi laleia-Manatuto kontinua kedas hodi halo munitorizasaun ba projeito Estrada urbana no mos hodi hare dreinajen sira ne’ebe iha sidade laran ,nebe sempre intipidu iha tempo udan.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MOP AKOMPAÑIA HUSI SEATOU MONITORIZA\r\nPROJEITO ESTRADA URBANA NO DREINAJEN IHA DILI LARAN</b></span> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Dili,27 Maio 2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal ho\r\nSekretariu Estadu Toponomia no Organizasaun Urbana-Germano Santa Brites inklui\r\nekipa tekniku Unidades Insepsaun Verifikasaun no Pagamento Ministerio Obras\r\nMOP, segunda feira ne’e hafoin fila husi laleia-Manatuto kontinua kedas hodi\r\nhalo munitorizasaun ba projeito Estrada urbana no mos hodi hare dreinajen sira\r\nne’ebe iha sidade laran ,nebe sempre intipidu iha tempo udan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Fatin hirak nebe’e ministro obras públika\r\nba halo monitorizasaun mak Projeito Estrada Aitaral-Laran ,Estrada no Drainajen\r\niha Rai-kotu mai rotunda Nicolau Lobato no Projeito Estrada Kanafar ,Manleu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha Monitorijasaun ne’e Ministro Obras\r\nPúblika Akompanha Husi Director Nasional de Construcção Vias Rodoviarias-Milton\r\nR.de.C.Monteiro ,Tecniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamento Ministério\r\nObras Públika (UIVP-MOP).*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>',NULL,1,0,0,0,'2024-06-10 06:38:54.548488','1385974ed5904a438616ff7bdb3f7439',1,2,'2024-05-27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-140-1-1','None-140-1-1','mop-akompania-husi-seatou-monitoriza-projeito-estrada-urbana-no-dreinajen-iha-dili-laran-1-1',NULL,NULL),(141,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS RONA APREZENTASAUN RELATÓRIU FISIKALIZASAUN HUSI EKIPA VISE-INFRASTRUTURA MOP','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha tersa-feira ne’e rona aprezentasaun relatóriu servisu','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS RONA APREZENTASAUN\r\nRELATÓRIU FISIKALIZASAUN HUSI EKIPA VISE-INFRASTRUTURA MOP</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Dili ,28 Maio 2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha\r\ntersa-feira ne’e rona aprezentasaun relatóriu servisu ne’ebe Aprezenta husi\r\nVice-Ministru Infraestrutura-Julio do Carmo,kona ba relatóriu fisikalizasaun ba\r\nprojeto iha municipio 10(sanulu) inklui relatóriu konaba servisu sira ne’ebe\r\nlatuir padraun téknika no mós estragus foun sira ne’ebe presiza atendementu\r\nurgente i hato’o mós problema no rekomendasaun sira,ba Ministro Obras Públika,iha\r\nsala enkontru Ministeriu Obras Públikas,Caikoli.*<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Caicoli',1,0,0,0,'2024-06-10 07:18:12.010158','0f28b5d49b3020afeecd95b4009adf4c',1,2,'2024-05-28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-141-1-1','None-141-1-1','ministru-obras-publikas-rona-aprezentasaun-relatoriu-fisikalizasaun-husi-ekipa-vise-infrastrutura-mop-2-1',NULL,NULL),(142,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS RONA APREZENTASAUN RELATÓRIU FISIKALIZASAUN HUSI EKIPA VISE-INFRASTRUTURA MOP','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha tersa-feira ne’e rona aprezentasaun relatóriu servisu','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS RONA APREZENTASAUN\r\nRELATÓRIU FISIKALIZASAUN HUSI EKIPA VISE-INFRASTRUTURA MOP</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Dili ,28 Maio 2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, iha\r\ntersa-feira ne’e rona aprezentasaun relatóriu servisu ne’ebe Aprezenta husi\r\nVice-Ministru Infraestrutura-Julio do Carmo,kona ba relatóriu fisikalizasaun ba\r\nprojeto iha municipio 10(sanulu) inklui relatóriu konaba servisu sira ne’ebe\r\nlatuir padraun téknika no mós estragus foun sira ne’ebe presiza atendementu\r\nurgente i hato’o mós problema no rekomendasaun sira,ba Ministro Obras Públika,iha\r\nsala enkontru Ministeriu Obras Públikas,Caikoli.*</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Caicoli',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-10 07:18:50.550440','a8baa56554f96369ab93e4f3bb068c22',1,2,'2024-05-28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-142-1-1','None-142-1-1','ministru-obras-publikas-rona-aprezentasaun-relatoriu-fisikalizasaun-husi-ekipa-vise-infrastrutura-mop-1-1-1',NULL,NULL),(143,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA IHA SORUMUTU MILENIUM CHALLENGE CORPORATION NE’EBE REALIZA IHA TIMOR-PLAZA .','Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal Akompanha husi Chefi G-Ministro Obras Públikas-Cristovão Fausto Guterres ,Partisipa iha sorumutu Koordenasaun Servisu Entre Governu Timor-Leste ho Millennium Challenge Corporation (MCC) NEBE Organiza husi MMC.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA IHA\r\nSORUMUTU MILENIUM CHALLENGE CORPORATION NE’EBE REALIZA IHA TIMOR-PLAZA .</b></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Dili ,28 Maio 2024 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal\r\nAkompanha husi Chefi G-Ministro Obras Públikas-Cristovão Fausto Guterres\r\n,Partisipa iha sorumutu Koordenasaun Servisu Entre Governu Timor-Leste ho\r\nMillennium Challenge Corporation (MCC) NEBE Organiza husi MMC.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Sorumutu Koordenasaun Servisu ne’e halao\r\niha Orchid Room Timor Plaza ,Tersa feira ne’e Organiza no Prezide hosi Director\r\nEzekutivu MCA-TL-Embaixador Constançio Pinto. Objetivu husi sorumutu ne’e atu\r\nkoalia konaba rekezitu ho risku abordajen,Ligadu ho assuntu rai hari sentru\r\ntreinamentu Bee foer nian iha Be’ebonuk.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Entertantu Partisipa iha sorumutu ne’e\r\nMinistra Finansas-Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso,Ministru Justisa-Sérgio\r\nde Jesus Fernandes da Costa Hornai ,Secretariu Estado Terras no Propriedades-Jaime\r\nXavier Lopes, Secretário Estadu Desenvolvemento Lokál-Mateus dos Santos Tallo\r\nho Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva BTL,E,P.-Eng.Carlos dos Reis ho Ekipa .*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili,Timor-Plaza',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-11 07:11:15.388850','903ce9225fca3e988c2af215d4e544d3',1,2,'2024-05-28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-143-1-1','None-143-1-1','ministru-obras-publikas-partisipa-iha-sorumutu-milenium-challenge-corporation-neebe-realiza-iha-timor-plaza-1-1',NULL,NULL),(144,'MOP HO SEATOU AKOMPAÑIA TANENTE JENERAL DOMINGOS RAÚL (FALUR RATE LAEK) BA HARE’E FATIN ATU INSTALA KAZERNA FOUN BA F-FDTL.','Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal ho Secretáriu Estado Toponómia no Organizasaun Urbana-Germano Santa Brites,Akompanho Xefe Estado Maior General das F-FDTL ,Tanente General Domingos Raúl “Falur Rate Laek','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MOP HO SEATOU AKOMPAÑIA TANENTE JENERAL\r\nDOMINGOS RAÚL (FALUR RATE LAEK) BA HARE’E FATIN ATU INSTALA KAZERNA FOUN BA\r\nF-FDTL.</b></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Likisa,29 Maio 2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal ho\r\nSecretáriu Estado Toponómia no Organizasaun Urbana-Germano Santa\r\nBrites,Akompanho Xefe Estado Maior General das F-FDTL ,Tanente General Domingos\r\nRaúl “Falur Rate Laek” ba hare rai nebe’e atu instala kazerna foun ba (F-FDTL),\r\nIha Beduku-Tibar,Kuarta Feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-TIBAR',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-11 07:32:32.845692','0a09c8844ba8f0936c20bd791130d6b6',1,2,'2024-05-29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-144-1-1','None-144-1-1','mop-ho-seatou-akompania-tanente-jeneral-domingos-raul-falur-rate-laek-ba-haree-fatin-atu-instala-kazerna-foun-ba-f-fdtl-1-1',NULL,NULL),(145,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS RONA APREZENTASAUN DEZEÑU DREINAJEN KAPITAL DILI HOSI BTL,EP','Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal iha Sesta-feira ne’e rona aprezentasaun dezeñu kona-ba melhoramento drainajen iha kapital Dili ,Aprezentasaun ne’e hato’o husi BTL,EP.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS RONA APREZENTASAUN\r\nDEZEÑU DREINAJEN KAPITAL DILI HOSI BTL,EP</b></span> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Dili ,31 Maio 2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públikas-Samuel Marçal iha\r\nSesta-feira ne’e rona aprezentasaun dezeñu kona-ba melhoramento drainajen iha\r\nkapital Dili ,Aprezentasaun ne’e hato’o husi BTL,EP.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha aprezentasaun ne’e Prezidente komisaun\r\nEzekutiva BTL,E.P Eng.Carlos Peloi dos Reis ,Akompaña Vise-Prezidente Komisaun\r\nEzekutiva BTL,E,P ba Assuntu Sistema Bee Saneamentu no Dreinajen ,Director DEI,Jestór\r\nRP/GIZ BTL,E.P no Ekipa PMU-MOP/BTL,E.P.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Aprezentasaun dezeñu ba melhoramento\r\ndrainajen iha kapital Dili ne’e ho Objetivu atu halo rehabilitasaun no\r\nalargamentu drainajen ,atu nune’e bele kaptura be’e nebe ho nia volume bo’ot\r\niha tempo udan,hodi evita kalamidade ka inundasaun iha sidade Dili.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-11 08:02:26.794843','2b24d495052a8ce66358eb576b8912c8',1,2,'2024-05-31',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-145-1-1','None-145-1-1','ministru-obras-publikas-rona-aprezentasaun-dezenu-dreinajen-kapital-dili-hosi-btlep-1-1',NULL,NULL),(146,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU PROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Acompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente Comisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo , halo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu, Progresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre Estado.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU\r\nPROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL&nbsp;</b></span> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Dili ,10 Juñu &nbsp;2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\nAcompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente\r\nComisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu\r\nAdministrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo ,\r\nhalo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu,\r\nProgresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre\r\nEstado.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha Aprezentasaun Ministro Obras Públika\r\nhateten “Iha nivel Aldeia Prosesso Eletrifikasaun ba Komunidades sira sei falta\r\n10 % ka 15 % &nbsp;,hosi sira nebe’e seidauk\r\nasseso, dadaun ne’e sei atende hela ho solar panel ,dadaun ne’e mos\r\nfornesementu Eletrisidade ba populasaun iha Timor-Leste Laran tomak Atinji ona\r\n91%.”<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; “Politika IX Governu konstituisional iha\r\n2025-2026 komunidades hotu iha Teritorio Timor-Leste Laran 100% sei assesu hotu\r\nenergia eletrisidades, alende ne’e ita mos sei hadia ita nia kualidade enerjia\r\n, atu nune’e ita bele atrai Investedor bele mai halo investemento iha ita nia\r\nrain Eletrisidade no hatun Preso ba Eletrisidade” dehan Miistru Obras Públika\r\nbainhira halo aprezentasaun iha sala Plenaria Parlamento Nasional.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Ministru Obras Públika haktuir Planu ida\r\ntan mak atu halo Dijitalizasaun ba Eletrisidade aumenta tan Sub-Estasaun hodi\r\nhadiak liu tan kualidade Fornesementu Energia Eletrisidade no hatun presu\r\nEletrisidade ,amenta sub-estasaun ida tan iha komoro dadaun ne’e ms MOP ho\r\nEDTL.EP Esforsu hela atu halo instalasaun solar Pv 72-85 Megawatts.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Kona ba atauro nia dadaun ne’e Ekipa\r\ntékniko halo ona inkontro koordenasaun serviso entre autoridade Munisipio &nbsp;atauro liga ho produsaun no distribuisaun enerjia\r\nElétrika iha Atauro ,” Hatete Ministro Das Obras Públika.(*)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Parlamento Nasional TL',1,0,0,0,'2024-06-12 01:38:41.032027','a5e00132373a7031000fd987a3c9f87b',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-146-1-1','None-146-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-aprezenta-planu-progresu-no-dezafiu-servisu-edtlep-nian-iha-parlamento-nasional-6-1',NULL,NULL),(147,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU PROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Acompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente Comisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo , halo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu, Progresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre Estado.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU\r\nPROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL&nbsp;</b></span> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili ,10 Juñu &nbsp;2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\nAcompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente\r\nComisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu\r\nAdministrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo ,\r\nhalo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu,\r\nProgresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre\r\nEstado.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha Aprezentasaun Ministro Obras Públika\r\nhateten “Iha nivel Aldeia Prosesso Eletrifikasaun ba Komunidades sira sei falta\r\n10 % ka 15 % &nbsp;,hosi sira nebe’e seidauk\r\nasseso, dadaun ne’e sei atende hela ho solar panel ,dadaun ne’e mos\r\nfornesementu Eletrisidade ba populasaun iha Timor-Leste Laran tomak Atinji ona\r\n91%.”<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; “Politika IX Governu konstituisional iha\r\n2025-2026 komunidades hotu iha Teritorio Timor-Leste Laran 100% sei assesu hotu\r\nenergia eletrisidades, alende ne’e ita mos sei hadia ita nia kualidade enerjia\r\n, atu nune’e ita bele atrai Investedor bele mai halo investemento iha ita nia\r\nrain Eletrisidade no hatun Preso ba Eletrisidade” dehan Miistru Obras Públika\r\nbainhira halo aprezentasaun iha sala Plenaria Parlamento Nasional.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Ministru Obras Públika haktuir Planu ida\r\ntan mak atu halo Dijitalizasaun ba Eletrisidade aumenta tan Sub-Estasaun hodi\r\nhadiak liu tan kualidade Fornesementu Energia Eletrisidade no hatun presu\r\nEletrisidade ,amenta sub-estasaun ida tan iha komoro dadaun ne’e ms MOP ho\r\nEDTL.EP Esforsu hela atu halo instalasaun solar Pv 72-85 Megawatts.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Kona ba atauro nia dadaun ne’e Ekipa\r\ntékniko halo ona inkontro koordenasaun serviso entre autoridade Munisipio &nbsp;atauro liga ho produsaun no distribuisaun enerjia\r\nElétrika iha Atauro .” Hatete Ministro Das Obras Públika.(*</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Parlamento Nasional TL',1,0,0,0,'2024-06-12 01:40:14.300834','8d5e957f297893487bd98fa830fa6413',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-147-1-1','None-147-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-aprezenta-planu-progresu-no-dezafiu-servisu-edtlep-nian-iha-parlamento-nasional-1-1-1',NULL,NULL),(148,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU PROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Acompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente Comisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo , halo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu, Progresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre Estado.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU\r\nPROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL&nbsp;</b></span> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili ,10 Juñu &nbsp;2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\nAcompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente\r\nComisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu\r\nAdministrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo ,\r\nhalo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu,\r\nProgresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre\r\nEstado.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha Aprezentasaun Ministro Obras Públika\r\nhateten “Iha nivel Aldeia Prosesso Eletrifikasaun ba Komunidades sira sei falta\r\n10 % ka 15 % &nbsp;,hosi sira nebe’e seidauk\r\nasseso, dadaun ne’e sei atende hela ho solar panel ,dadaun ne’e mos\r\nfornesementu Eletrisidade ba populasaun iha Timor-Leste Laran tomak Atinji ona\r\n91%.”<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; “Politika IX Governu konstituisional iha\r\n2025-2026 komunidades hotu iha Teritorio Timor-Leste Laran 100% sei assesu hotu\r\nenergia eletrisidades, alende ne’e ita mos sei hadia ita nia kualidade enerjia\r\n, atu nune’e ita bele atrai Investedor bele mai halo investemento iha ita nia\r\nrain Eletrisidade no hatun Preso ba Eletrisidade” dehan Miistru Obras Públika\r\nbainhira halo aprezentasaun iha sala Plenaria Parlamento Nasional.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Ministru Obras Públika haktuir Planu ida\r\ntan mak atu halo Dijitalizasaun ba Eletrisidade aumenta tan Sub-Estasaun hodi\r\nhadiak liu tan kualidade Fornesementu Energia Eletrisidade no hatun presu\r\nEletrisidade ,amenta sub-estasaun ida tan iha komoro dadaun ne’e ms MOP ho\r\nEDTL.EP Esforsu hela atu halo instalasaun solar Pv 72-85 Megawatts.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Kona ba atauro nia dadaun ne’e Ekipa\r\ntékniko halo ona inkontro koordenasaun serviso entre autoridade Munisipio &nbsp;atauro liga ho produsaun no distribuisaun enerjia\r\nElétrika iha Atauro .” Hatete Ministro Das Obras Públika.(*)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Parlamento Nasional TL',1,0,0,0,'2024-06-12 01:40:53.808462','47d1e990583c9c67424d369f3414728e',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-148-1-1','None-148-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-aprezenta-planu-progresu-no-dezafiu-servisu-edtlep-nian-iha-parlamento-nasional-2-1-1',NULL,NULL),(149,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU PROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Acompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente Comisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo , halo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu, Progresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre Estado.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU\r\nPROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL&nbsp;</b></span> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili ,10 Juñu &nbsp;2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\nAcompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente\r\nComisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu\r\nAdministrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo ,\r\nhalo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu,\r\nProgresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre\r\nEstado.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha Aprezentasaun Ministro Obras Públika\r\nhateten “Iha nivel Aldeia Prosesso Eletrifikasaun ba Komunidades sira sei falta\r\n10 % ka 15 % &nbsp;,hosi sira nebe’e seidauk\r\nasseso, dadaun ne’e sei atende hela ho solar panel ,dadaun ne’e mos\r\nfornesementu Eletrisidade ba populasaun iha Timor-Leste Laran tomak Atinji ona\r\n91%.”<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; “Politika IX Governu konstituisional iha\r\n2025-2026 komunidades hotu iha Teritorio Timor-Leste Laran 100% sei assesu hotu\r\nenergia eletrisidades, alende ne’e ita mos sei hadia ita nia kualidade enerjia\r\n, atu nune’e ita bele atrai Investedor bele mai halo investemento iha ita nia\r\nrain Eletrisidade no hatun Preso ba Eletrisidade” dehan Miistru Obras Públika\r\nbainhira halo aprezentasaun iha sala Plenaria Parlamento Nasional.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Ministru Obras Públika haktuir Planu ida\r\ntan mak atu halo Dijitalizasaun ba Eletrisidade aumenta tan Sub-Estasaun hodi\r\nhadiak liu tan kualidade Fornesementu Energia Eletrisidade no hatun presu\r\nEletrisidade ,amenta sub-estasaun ida tan iha komoro dadaun ne’e ms MOP ho\r\nEDTL.EP Esforsu hela atu halo instalasaun solar Pv 72-85 Megawatts.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Kona ba atauro nia dadaun ne’e Ekipa\r\ntékniko halo ona inkontro koordenasaun serviso entre autoridade Munisipio &nbsp;atauro liga ho produsaun no distribuisaun enerjia\r\nElétrika iha Atauro .” Hatete Ministro Das Obras Públika.(*)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Parlamento Nasional TL',1,0,0,0,'2024-06-12 01:42:45.669040','f2217062e9a397a1dca429e7d70bc6ca',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-149-1-1','None-149-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-aprezenta-planu-progresu-no-dezafiu-servisu-edtlep-nian-iha-parlamento-nasional-3-1-1',NULL,NULL),(150,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU PROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Acompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente Comisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo , halo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu, Progresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre Estado.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU\r\nPROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL .</b></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili ,10 Juñu &nbsp;2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\nAcompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente\r\nComisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu\r\nAdministrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo ,\r\nhalo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu,\r\nProgresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre\r\nEstado.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Iha Aprezentasaun Ministro Obras Públika\r\nhateten “Iha nivel Aldeia Prosesso Eletrifikasaun ba Komunidades sira sei falta\r\n10 % ka 15 % &nbsp;,hosi sira nebe’e seidauk\r\nasseso, dadaun ne’e sei atende hela ho solar panel ,dadaun ne’e mos\r\nfornesementu Eletrisidade ba populasaun iha Timor-Leste Laran tomak Atinji ona\r\n91%.”<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; “Politika IX Governu konstituisional iha\r\n2025-2026 komunidades hotu iha Teritorio Timor-Leste Laran 100% sei assesu hotu\r\nenergia eletrisidades, alende ne’e ita mos sei hadia ita nia kualidade enerjia\r\n, atu nune’e ita bele atrai Investedor bele mai halo investemento iha ita nia\r\nrain Eletrisidade no hatun Preso ba Eletrisidade” dehan Miistru Obras Públika\r\nbainhira halo aprezentasaun iha sala Plenaria Parlamento Nasional.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Ministru Obras Públika haktuir Planu ida\r\ntan mak atu halo Dijitalizasaun ba Eletrisidade aumenta tan Sub-Estasaun hodi\r\nhadiak liu tan kualidade Fornesementu Energia Eletrisidade no hatun presu\r\nEletrisidade ,amenta sub-estasaun ida tan iha komoro dadaun ne’e ms MOP ho\r\nEDTL.EP Esforsu hela atu halo instalasaun solar Pv 72-85 Megawatts.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Kona ba atauro nia dadaun ne’e Ekipa\r\ntékniko halo ona inkontro koordenasaun serviso entre autoridade Munisipio &nbsp;atauro liga ho produsaun no distribuisaun enerjia\r\nElétrika iha Atauro .” Hatete Ministro Das Obras Públika.(*)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Parlamento Nasional TL',1,0,0,0,'2024-06-12 01:48:27.102818','7ef605fc8dba5425d6965fbd4c8fbe1f',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-150-1-1','None-150-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-aprezenta-planu-progresu-no-dezafiu-servisu-edtlep-nian-iha-parlamento-nasional-4-1-1',NULL,NULL),(151,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU PROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL.','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Acompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente Comisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo , halo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu, Progresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre Estado.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA PLANU\r\nPROGRESU NO DEZAFIU SERVISU EDTL.EP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTO NASIONAL</b></span>.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili ,10 Juñu &nbsp;2024</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal\r\nAcompanha husi Vise Ministru Assuntus Parlamentares-Aderito Hugo da Costa ,Prezidente\r\nComisaun Ezekutiva EDTL,EP Paulo da Silva,Vise-Prezidente Konsellu\r\nAdministrasaun-Júlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Komisario Tekniku-Latino Jeronimo ,\r\nhalo Aprezentasaun ba iha Parlamento Nasional kona-bá Ezekusaun Orsamento, Planu,\r\nProgresu, dezafiu servisu inklui reseita ne’ebe EDTL,EP hatama ona ba Kofre\r\nEstado.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Iha Aprezentasaun Ministro Obras Públika\r\nhateten “Iha nivel Aldeia Prosesso Eletrifikasaun ba Komunidades sira sei falta\r\n10 % ka 15 % &nbsp;,hosi sira nebe’e seidauk\r\nasseso, dadaun ne’e sei atende hela ho solar panel ,dadaun ne’e mos\r\nfornesementu Eletrisidade ba populasaun iha Timor-Leste Laran tomak Atinji ona\r\n91%.”</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">“Politika IX Governu konstituisional iha\r\n2025-2026 komunidades hotu iha Teritorio Timor-Leste Laran 100% sei assesu hotu\r\nenergia eletrisidades, alende ne’e ita mos sei hadia ita nia kualidade enerjia\r\n, atu nune’e ita bele atrai Investedor bele mai halo investemento iha ita nia\r\nrain Eletrisidade no hatun Preso ba Eletrisidade” dehan Miistru Obras Públika\r\nbainhira halo aprezentasaun iha sala Plenaria Parlamento Nasional.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministru Obras Públika haktuir Planu ida\r\ntan mak atu halo Dijitalizasaun ba Eletrisidade aumenta tan Sub-Estasaun hodi\r\nhadiak liu tan kualidade Fornesementu Energia Eletrisidade no hatun presu\r\nEletrisidade ,amenta sub-estasaun ida tan iha komoro dadaun ne’e ms MOP ho\r\nEDTL.EP Esforsu hela atu halo instalasaun solar Pv 72-85 Mwt.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Kona ba atauro nia dadaun ne’e Ekipa\r\ntékniko halo ona inkontro koordenasaun serviso entre autoridade Munisipio &nbsp;atauro liga ho produsaun no distribuisaun enerjia\r\nElétrika iha Atauro ,” Hatete Ministro Das Obras Públika.(*)</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-12 01:57:48.474108','a8f15eda80c50adb0e71943adc8015cf',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-151-1-1','None-151-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-aprezenta-planu-progresu-no-dezafiu-servisu-edtlep-nian-iha-parlamento-nasional-5-1-1',NULL,NULL),(152,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HALA’O ENKONTRO HO EKIPA F-FDTL NE\'EBE SEI TUIR FORMASAUN IHA IGE-ADI.','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Akompañia hosi Prezidente instituto de Gestão de Equipamentos e Apoio Infrastruturas, Instituto au Desenvolvimento Publico (IGE-ADI,IP)-Ana da Cruz, hala’o enkontro ho ekipa FALINTIL-Força Defesa de Timor-Leste (F-FDTL), iha sala Gabinete Ministériu Obras Públika ,Caicoli ,Segunda-Feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">MINISTRU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKA HALA’O ENKONTRO HO EKIPA F-FDTL NE’EBE SEI TUIR FORMASAUN IHA\r\nIGE-ADI.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">Dili ,10 Juñu 2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Akompañia hosi Prezidente\r\ninstituto de Gestão de Equipamentos e Apoio Infrastruturas, Instituto au\r\nDesenvolvimento Publico (IGE-ADI,IP)-Ana da Cruz, hala’o enkontro ho ekipa\r\nFALINTIL-Força Defesa de Timor-Leste (F-FDTL), iha sala Gabinete Ministériu\r\nObras Públika ,Caicoli ,Segunda-Feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">Objetivu hosi Enkontru ne’e mák atu informa prosesu no\r\nlalaok formasaun membru F-FDTL ne’ebe sei hola parte iha treinamentu oinsa atu\r\nhalo operasaun ba makina pezado sira, formasaun ne’e rasik sei oferese hosi\r\nekipa tékniku IGE-ADI.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">Entretanto Enkontro ne’e rasik kontinuasaun husi vizita\r\nMinistru Defeza-Donaciano do Rosário Gomes, mai IGE-ADI, iha loron 16 Outubro\r\n2023, nia objetivu mák husu apoio ba IGE-ADI atu fo Formasaun ba membru\r\nFALINTIL-Força Defeza Timor-Leste (F-FDTL) hodi bele Opera ekipa Pezado .(*)<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-12 07:02:29.401877','37a749d808e46495a8da1e5352d03cae',1,2,'2024-06-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-152-1-1','None-152-1-1','ministru-obras-publika-halao-enkontro-ho-ekipa-f-fdtl-neebe-sei-tuir-formasaun-iha-ige-adi-1-1',NULL,NULL),(153,'PROGRESU FIZIKU PONTE KASNAFAR ATINZI ONA 50%','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal Haktuir,Konstrusaun Poonte Kasnafar ne’ebe lansa fatuk dahuluk iha loron 26 fulan Novembru 2023, Nia Progresu Fiziku dadaun ne’e atinji ona 50% konstrusaun Ponte Kasnafar tuir Medida nebe’e mensiona iha Kontratu 70 Metru maibe husi empreza Carya Timor-Leste,Lda oferese tan 10 Metru ba Governo Timor-Leste ho nune’e Ponte Kasnafar nia Medida hamutuk 80 metru.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>PROGRESU FIZIKU PONTE KASNAFAR ATINZI ONA 50%</b></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Dili ,12/Juñu 2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; color: windowtext;\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"PT\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel\r\nMarçal Haktuir,Konstrusaun Poonte Kasnafar ne’ebe lansa fatuk dahuluk iha loron\r\n26 fulan Novembru 2023, Nia Progresu Fiziku dadaun ne’e atinji ona 50%\r\nkonstrusaun Ponte Kasnafar tuir Medida nebe’e mensiona iha Kontratu 70 Metru\r\nmaibe husi empreza Carya Timor-Leste,Lda oferese tan 10 Metru ba Governo\r\nTimor-Leste ho nune’e Ponte Kasnafar nia Medida hamutuk 80 metru.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\"><a href=\"https://web.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=326584310490198&amp;set=pcb.326584920490137&amp;__cft__%5b0%5d=AZV44FplDJAXsg2TzCSnRLZJu3pGovTV4oblu4t6ZJrt37XRSkX0uFeT__87bEA9H5L-5vDNgdkAQ1MIxtpsCXYKgqvxigh0AzSRIKcUyyDqP2ZGpNb4WaS9x1QlOML_IdxiCjOiGkxNtjNjxW14Xai0juljWp2XhWGxmLS9oeHwUK-SaEwulZYAwBU3fB1erYy4OwqIPZPeZHXBIFbOx3Jl93F38sJY4OACWgQ0bZ4ycQ&amp;__tn__=*bH-R\"><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">“IX Governo Konstitusional Prevei ona Orsamento husi Fundus das\r\nInfrastruturas (FI) ho Montante $3.632.896.18. Progresu fisiku atinji ona 50%\r\nno Progresu ba Pagamento foin atinzi 24,90% Empreza Carya Timor-Leste,Lda Asina\r\nKontratu iha dia 24 de Novembru de 2023,tuir planu konstrusaun ponte refere sei\r\nremata iha fulan Aostu ninan ne’e,” Hateten Ministru Obras Públika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Desizaun IX Governu Konstitusional liu husi Ministerio Obras Públika,konstrui\r\nponti foun kasnafar iha Suko Bokolelo no Suku Dare ,Ponstu Administrativu\r\nLaulara Munisipio Aileu no Postu Administrativu Vera-Cruz, Munisipio Dili atu\r\nbele Fasilita Movimento Transporte no ema.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Antes ne’e iha loron 26 fulan Novembro 2023 Vise-Primeiru Ministro no\r\nMinistro Koordenador &nbsp;Assuntu Ekonomiko\r\nno Ministru Turismu no Ambiente-Francisco Kalbuadi Lay akompaña husi Ministru Obra\r\nPúblika-Samuel Marçal no Ministru Planeamento Estratejiku-Gastão de Sousa hala’o\r\nLansamentu Lansamento dahuluk ba Ponte Kanafar.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Entretantu Numero\r\nKontratu husi Projetu ne’e mak,SSS/051/MOP/2023 no Naran Projetu Construction\r\nof New Bridge 70 m, 2 Span Pre-Stressed Box Grider Double Cell, Be’e mos,\r\nKasnafar ,Dare Municipility of Dili.*</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">Mídia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Kasnafar',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-13 07:13:28.641856','b3e3e393c77e35a4a3f3cbd1e429b5dc',1,2,'2024-06-12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-153-1-1','None-153-1-1','progresu-fiziku-ponte-kasnafar-atinzi-ona-50-1-1',NULL,NULL),(154,'MOP HALA’O ENKONTRU HO KOMPAÑIA NASIONAL NO INTERNASIONAL SIRA,LIGADU HO KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA SIRA NE’EBE OSAN EMPRESTIMU.','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha tersa feira ne’e, akompanha husi ekipa tékniku Ministériu das Obras Públika (MOP) halo Enkontro ho Kompania Nasional no Internasional, Ligado ho Projetu Estrada Urbana iha Maliana, Ermera inklui Projetu Estrada sira iha Baucau,Ne’ebé uja osan emprestimu husi Asian Devalopment Bank (ADB).','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>MOP\r\nHALA’O ENKONTRU HO KOMPAÑIA NASIONAL NO INTERNASIONAL SIRA,LIGADU HO\r\nKONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA SIRA NE’EBE OSAN EMPRESTIMU.</b></span> <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Dili ,11 Juñu 2024.</span><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha\r\ntersa feira ne’e, akompanha husi ekipa tékniku Ministériu das Obras Públika\r\n(MOP) halo Enkontro ho Kompania Nasional no Internasional, Ligado ho Projetu\r\nEstrada Urbana iha Maliana, Ermera inklui Projetu Estrada sira iha Baucau,Ne’ebé\r\nuja osan emprestimu husi Asian Devalopment Bank (ADB).</span><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Iha Enkoontru ne’e Ministro Obras Públika,\r\nhusu kompania sira atu aprezenta progressu servisu no dezafiu ne’ebé sira\r\nenfrenta iha terenu, Enkontru ne’e rasik halao iha sala reuniaun Ministério\r\nObras Públika ,Caicoli.*</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Mídia-MOP</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Caicoli',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-14 00:54:06.469925','1d7f7abc18fcb43975065399b0d1e48e',1,2,'2024-06-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-154-1-1','None-154-1-1','mop-halao-enkontru-ho-kompania-nasional-no-internasional-siraligadu-ho-konstrusaun-estrada-sira-neebe-osan-emprestimu-1-1',NULL,NULL),(155,'MINISTRO OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONTINUA HALO MONITORIZASAUN BA KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA ROTUNDA NICOLAU LOBATO.','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha kinta-feira ne’e halo monitorizasaun ba prosessu konstrusaun estrada Rotunda Nicolao Lobato, ne’ebé konstrui husi kompania Montana Diak Unipessoal Lda.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#050505;mso-ansi-language:PT\">MINISTRO OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONTINUA HALO\r\nMONITORIZASAUN BA KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA ROTUNDA NICOLAU LOBATO.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;color:#050505;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;color:#050505;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><b>Dili,06 Maio 2024.</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;;color:#050505;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\">&nbsp; <b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Ministru\r\nObras Públika-Samuel Marçal iha kinta-feira ne’e halo monitorizasaun ba prosessu\r\nkonstrusaun estrada Rotunda Nicolao Lobato, ne’ebé konstrui husi kompania\r\nMontana Diak Unipessoal Lda.</span><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b>Entretantu iha Monitorizasaun ne’e\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Akompanha husi Directór Nasional de Construcção Vias\r\nRodoviarias-Milton R.C.Monteiro,Assesor Tékniku Infraestrutura Laboratoriu\r\nMinistru Obras Públika-Joni Rodrigues Varela inklui ekipa tékniku Ministériu\r\nObras Públika.*</b></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\"><b>Mídia-MOP</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-14 01:19:40.223808','2a79ea27c279e471f4d180b08d62b00a',1,2,'2024-05-06',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-155-1-1','None-155-1-1','ministro-obras-publika-kontinua-halo-monitorizasaun-ba-konstrusaun-estrada-iha-rotunda-nicolau-lobato-1-1',NULL,NULL),(156,'REHABILITA ESTRADA TURISKAI BA MAUBISSE,MOP SELEBRA AKORDU HO EMPREZA MONTANA DIAK.','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, Liu husi Ministerio Obra Públika, Iha loron Kinta feira ne’e selebreda kotratu ho empreza MONTANA DIAK UNIPESOAL. Lda. Ba Projetu Rehabilitasaun Estrada Diresaun hosi Postu administrativu Turiskai, Munisipio Manufahi to Postu Administrativu Maubisse,Munisipio Ainaro.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><b><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">REHABILITA\r\nESTRADA TURISKAI BA MAUBISSE,MOP SELEBRA AKORDU HO EMPREZA MONTANA DIAK.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><b><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Manufahi 13 Juñu 2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal, Liu husi Ministerio Obras Públika, Iha\r\nloron Kinta feira ne’e selebreda kotratu ho empreza MONTANA DIAK UNIPESOAL.\r\nLda. Ba Projetu Rehabilitasaun Estrada Diresaun hosi Postu administrativu\r\nTuriskai, Munisipio Manufahi to Postu Administrativu Maubisse,Munisipio Ainaro.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Ohin ita mai assisti no akompaña Prosesso assina Kontratu ho empreza\r\nMontana diak ba rehabilitasaun Estrada turiskai ba Maubisse iha salaun Bitani\r\nPostu Administrasaun Turiskai .<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Ministru Obras Públika Haktuir Montante Projetu nebe’e alloka ba estrada\r\nligasaun turiskai ba maubisse nia montante ho Millaun $3.4.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">“Montante Orsamento ba Prejetu Rehabilitasaun Estrada Turiskai ba Maubisse\r\nho Montante $3.4. Ita fo tempo ba fulan ida atu Mobiliza nia Ekipamento Pezadu\r\nmai iha ne’e para hahu ona projetu ne’e no projetu rehabilitasaun estrada\r\nturiskai ne’e tenke tuir nia tempu” Dehan Ministro Obras Públika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Iha biban ne’e Ministro Obras Públika husu ba Komunidades sira atu\r\nkontribui ba projetu ne’e no labele halo impedemento ba empreza nebe’e halao\r\nprojetu, Nune’e projetu rehabilitasaun estrada bele lao tuir tempu nebe termina\r\nona iha kontratu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">“hau husu ba kmunidade sira iha turiskai favor ida kontribui ba projetu ida\r\nne’e . hau mos husu ba autoridades lokal ,liliu ba administrador postu, Xefi do\r\nSuku sira Inklui Xefi Aldea sira iha postu turiskai ,tenke tau matan ba projetu\r\nne’e para ita nia Desenvolvimento bele lao ho diak ”Tenik Ministru Obras.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Ihafatin hanesan Vice Ministru Assuntu Parlamentar-Aderito Hugo da Costa\r\n,Hatete ,Ohin hetan Oportunidade ita bele sai sassin ba selebrasaun kontratu\r\nprojetu Rehabilitasaun Estrada husi Turiskai ba Maubisse.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Estrada husi turiskai ba maubisse ne’e aat desde uluk ,laos turiskai det\r\nmaibe estrada sira seluk iha Munisipio Manufahi mos .maibe Governu hahu’u tau\r\nimportansia hodi hadia Estrada turiskai ba Maubisse. Ohin hau hola parte iha ne’e\r\nsai hanesan sassin ba assina kontratu Governo ho empreza ba rehabilitasaun\r\nEstrada Turiskai “hatete Vise Ministro Assuntu Parlamentar –Aderito Hugo da\r\nCosta.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Vise Ministru Assuntu Parlamentar ,haktuir ,Rai Turiskai nudar fatin Moris\r\nSaudozu FRANCISCO XAVIER DO AMARAL hanesan Primeiru Prezidente Repúblika\r\nDemokratika de Timor-Leste no Hanesan mos PROKLAMADOR ba INDEPENDENSIA\r\nTIMOR-LESTE IHA 28 Novenmbro 1975.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Rehabilitasaun Estrada ida ne’e fo Valorizasaun ida ba ita nian Proklamador\r\nno turiskai oan sira katak sira nia sofrementu hahu ohin Governo Rezolve ona ”\r\nnia haktuir <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Vise-Ministro Parlamentar Afirma ,IX Governo iha Komprimisiu sei halo\r\nrehabilitasaun ba Estrada sira iha Teritorio Timor laran tomak .<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Entertanto Director Empreza Montana Diak Lay Fu Sen ,Kompremetidu projetu\r\nEstrada Turiskai ba Maubisse ,sei halo ho kualidade diak ,bainhira implementa\r\nProjetu sei halao tuir kontratu ne’ebe assina ona Governo liu husi Ministerio\r\nObras Públika.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">“Ami sei halo projetu ne’e ho diak no kualidade no termina tuir kntratu ne’ebe\r\niha ona” Dehan Director Empreza Montana Diak.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\">Mídia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Minisipio Manufahi TURISKAI BA MAUBISSE',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-18 02:53:47.227430','1c9ac0159c94d8d0cbedc973445af2da',1,2,'2024-06-13',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-156-1-1','None-156-1-1','rehabilita-estrada-turiskai-ba-maubissemop-selebra-akordu-ho-empreza-montana-diak-1-1',NULL,NULL),(157,'IX GOVERNO CONSTITUSIONAL   Ministériu das Obras Públicas','IX GOVERNO CONSTITUSIONAL\r\n Ministeriu das Obras Públicas.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\"><b>IX GOVERNO CONSTITUSIONAL</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><u><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\"></span></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b style=\"\">