t-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><i><b><br></b></i></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><i><b> <o:p></o:p></b></i></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><i><b><u>Aniversario 78<sup>Anos</sup>............</u></b></i></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">﻿</span><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><i><b><o:p></o:p></b></i></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><i><b>Nafatin Ami hato’o Dezeija Longga Vida............</b></i></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><i><b><br></b></i></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:\r\njustify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nPT\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><b>Mídia-MOP</b></span><i><b><br></b></i></span></p>','Dili-Caicoli',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-21 02:34:24.843863','6c4b761a28b734fe93831e3fb400ce87',1,2,'2024-06-20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-157-1-1','None-157-1-1','ix-governo-constitusional-ministeriu-das-obras-publicas-1-1',NULL,NULL),(158,'MINISTRO OBRAS PÚBLIKA PARTISIPA IHA LANSAMENTU INSTALASAUN  DAHULUK BA KABU SUBMARINU IHA BEBONUK.','Ministru Obras Públika-Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho membru Governo sira seluk ,akompania Primeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão,Partisipa iha Realizasaun serimonia Selebrasaun entrega ‘Golden Boy’ no Instalasaun dahuluk kabu submarinu fibra óbtika ”Timor-Leste South Submarine Cable (TLSSC), Iha estasaun Aterrajen ka Cable Landing Station(CLS), ne’ebe sei sai pontu koneksaun kabu husi Bebonuk-Dili ba Darwin.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><b><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">MINISTRO OBRAS PÚBLIKA PARTISIPA IHA LANSAMENTU\r\nINSTALASAIN&nbsp; DAHULUK BA KABU SUBMARINU\r\nIHA BEBONUK.</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Dili\r\n,24/JUÑU/2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Ministru\r\nObras Públika-Samuel Marçal hamutuk ho membru Governo sira seluk ,akompania\r\nPrimeiru Ministru-Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão,Partisipa iha Realizasaun serimonia Selebrasaun entrega ‘<b>Golden Boy</b>’ no Instalasaun dahuluk kabu submarinu fibra\r\nóbtika <b>”Timor-Leste South Submarine Cable (TLSSC),</b> Iha estasaun Aterrajen ka\r\nCable Landing Station<b>(CLS</b>), ne’ebe sei sai pontu koneksaun kabu husi\r\nBebonuk-Dili ba Darwin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Seremonia\r\nSelebrasaun entrega <b>\'Golden Boy</b>\' no instalasaun dahuluk kabu submarinu fibra\r\noptika organiza ne’ebe Organiza husi Ministerio Transporte no Komunikasaun (MTK),\r\nSegunda Feira ne’e <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Iha Nia\r\nDiskursu ,PM Xanana hateten ,<b>\"<i>Lansamentu Instalasaun Dahuluk ba Kabu Submarinu\r\nfibra optika ne’e bele halo mudansa signifikativu ba Desenvolvimentu infraestrutura\r\nhodi responde ba komprimisu dezenvolvimentu no modernizasaun Timor-Leste</i>\". </b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Ohin\r\nloron ita halibur hamutuk iha ne’e marka tan istoria ida iha ita nia viajen ba\r\ntransformasaun digital, sistema kabu submarinu sul Timor-leste .Eventu ida ne’e\r\nlaos deit hanesan marka signifikativu ida iha ita nia Desenvolvimentu\r\ninfraestrutura,maibe ida ne’e sai hanesan sasin ida ba ita nia komprimisu ne’ebe\r\nboot ba desenvolvimentu no Modernizasaun Timor-Leste, ”Hatete Primeiru Ministru\r\nKay Rala Xanana Gusmão iha serimonia lansamentu instalasaun dahuluk ba kabu\r\nsubmarinu iha bebonuk.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Hafoin\r\nIX Guverno konstituisional simu pose iha dia 1 de Julhu 2023 IX Governu\r\nKonstituisional esklarese kedas kompromisu 17 ne’ebe atu realiza iha mandatu\r\ntinan 5 nia laran ,tamba ne’e iha tinan dahuluk Governasaun IX Governu nebe\r\nlidera husi Primeiro Ministro Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hahu’u konklui uluk\r\ninstalasaun kabu fibra optika atu nune’e bele garante ligasaun internet ida ne’ebe\r\nho kualidade, hodi Linha internet ho velosidade a’as ba sidadaun sira iha\r\nterritoriu Timor-Leste.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\">Mídia\r\nMOP.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili-Be\'ebonuk',1,0,1,0,'2024-06-26 03:39:45.514403','06409663226af2f3114485aa4e0a23b4',1,2,'2024-06-24',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'None-158-1-1','None-158-1-1','ministro-obras-publika-partisipa-iha-lansamentu-instalasaun-dahuluk-ba-kabu-submarinu-iha-bebonuk-1-1',NULL,NULL),(159,'MOP KONTINUA HALA’O ASINA KONTRATU  PROJEITU P44 HO EMPREZA NE’EN (6)','Ministério Obras Públika iha SegundA Feira ne’e Kontinua Asina tan kontratu ba Projeitu P44 ho Empreza Ne’en (6), Iha serimonia asina kntratu ne’e realiza iha sala Reuniaun Ministério Obras Públika Caicoli - Dili','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOP\r\nKONTINUA HALA’O ASINA KONTRATU&nbsp; PROJEITU P44 HO EMPREZA NE’EN (6)</span></b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b style=\"\">Dili,25\r\nJuñu 2024</b></span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Ministério\r\nObras Públika iha SegundA Feira ne’e Kontinua Asina tan kontratu ba Projeitu\r\nP44 ho Empreza Ne’en (6), Iha serimonia asina kntratu ne’e realiza iha sala\r\nReuniaun Ministério Obras Públika Caicoli - Dili </span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-ansi-language:PT\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Tuir\r\nAjenda ne’ebe iha, Hamutuk Empreza Ualu (8) mak atu asina kontratu, Maibe Empreza\r\nrua ne’ebe la marka prezensa tamba sei halao hela servisu iha terenu,\r\nentretantu empreza hirak nebe’e kontinua asina tan Prejetu P44 maka hanesan\r\nkompania :</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:PT\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asia