aun, Verifikasaun no Validasaun pagamentu ba Emprezariu Lokal sira hosi Munisipiu 3, Bobonaro, Ermera no Liquiça iha salaun Betania Training Center Diosece Maliana.\r\n\r\nObjetivu husi sosializasaun ne’e mak atu eleva koñesimentu Emprezariu Lokal sira nia kapasidade, oinsa bele priense dokumentus tender tuir kompetisaun liga ba pedidu pagamentu husi Ministeriu no Diresaun Finansas.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;tab-stops:center 299.95pt right 451.65pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA REALIZA\r\nATIVIDADES SOSIALIZASAN BA EMPREZA LOKAL SIRA IHA KOÑESIMENTU IHA AREA\r\nAPROVISIONAMENTU, MONITORIZASAUN, INSPESAUN, VERIFIKASAUN NO VALIDASAUN\r\nPAGAMENTU</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Maliana, 08 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal\r\nakompanha hosi Prezidente Autoridade Munisipiu Bobonaro, abertura atividade\r\nsosializasaun konaba prosesu Aprovizionamentu, Monitorizasaun, Inspesaun,\r\nVerifikasaun no Validasaun pagamentu ba Emprezariu Lokal sira hosi Munisipiu 3,\r\nBobonaro, Ermera no Liquiça iha salaun Betania Training Center Diosece Maliana.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">Objetivu husi sosializasaun ne’e mak\r\natu eleva koñesimentu Emprezariu Lokal sira nia kapasidade, oinsa bele priense\r\ndokumentus tender tuir kompetisaun liga ba pedidu pagamentu husi Ministeriu no\r\nDiresaun Finansas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">Iha intervensaun Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika hatete objetivu hosi atividade sosializasaun ne’e atu fahe informasaun\r\nba setor privadu sira inklui rona mos Empreza Lokal sira nia Preokupasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">“Objetivu hosi sosializasaun ida ne’e\r\nita atu fahe informasaun sobre prosesu Aprovisionamentu, Monitorizasaun,\r\nInspesaun, Verifikasaun no Validasaun pagamentu ba Emprezariu Lokal sira nia\r\npreokupasaun problema saida mak sira enfrenta durante ne’e no saida mak governu\r\nbele ajuda hodi nune’e ita bele hadia ita nia setor privadu sira, hodi nune’e\r\nsira bele dezenvolve aan ho diak iha futuru, bainhira sira iha ona kapasidade\r\nsira bele halo investimentu no loke kampu traballu ba jovem sira” hatete\r\nMinistru Obras Públika. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">Iha biban ida ne’e Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika&nbsp; informa ba Empreza Lokal sira\r\niha tempu badak ne’e MOP sei oferese Sertifikadu ba empreza lokal ne’ebe liu\r\nona faze kualifikasaun, empreza ne’e iha direitu atu bele tuir prosesu\r\ntenderizasaun ba empreza ne’ebe la iha Sertifikadu sei la iha direitu atu tuir\r\nprosesu tenderizasaun. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-no-proof:yes\">Atividade sosializasaun ne’e partisipa mos husi Diretor Jeral\r\nEstrada Ponte Prevensaun no Kontrolu, Nene Lobato, Diretor Nasional Konstrusaun\r\nVias Rodaviarias, Milton Ramanata de Castro Monteiro, Koordenador Unidade\r\nInspesaun verifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, Prezidente CCI-TL\r\nMunisipiu Bobonaro no Prezidente CCI-TL Liquiça, Ermera no Emprezario Lokal\r\nsira.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:150%;tab-stops:center 299.95pt right 451.65pt\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Maliana',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:20:16.943074','e96ed478dab8595a7dbda4cbcbee168f',1,2,'2025-05-08','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--4-1-1','--4-1-1','ministeriu-obras-públika-realiza-atividades-sosializasan-ba-empreza-lokal-sira-iha-koñesimentu-iha-area-aprovisionamentu-monitorizasaun-inspesaun-verifikasaun-no-validasaun-pagamentu-1-1-1','-','-'),(219,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EKIPA TEKNIKU MONITORIZA PROJEITU ESTRADA MALIANA POKOTE I-II','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EKIPA TEKNIKU MONITORIZA PROJEITU ESTRADA MALIANA POKOTE I-II\r\n\r\nBobonaro, 08 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika iha kinta-feira ne’e akompanha hosi Prezidente Autoridade Munisipiu Bobonaro, Alexandre Pires, Diretor Jeral Estrada Ponte Prevensaun no Kontrolu, Nene Lobato, Diretor Nasional Konstrusaun Vias Rodaviarias, Milton Remanata de Castro Monteiro, Koordenador Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamento, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, Xefe Unidade Planeamento, Tito Edegar halo monitorizasaun ba projeitu rehabilitasaun Estrada pakote I-II iha Maliana. Antes halo monitorizasaun Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa ne’ebe akompanha hosi Prezidente Autoridade Bobonaro hala’o ho empreza Hutama Karya ho empreza Bina Mitra ho rona aprezentasaun konaba progressu servisu no dezafiu ne’ebe empreza rua ne’e hasoru iha terenu.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EKIPA TEKNIKU\r\nMONITORIZA PROJEITU ESTRADA MALIANA POKOTE I-II</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Bobonaro, 08 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:yes\">Ministru Obras Públika</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\"> iha\r\nkinta-feira ne’e akompanha hosi Prezidente Autoridade Munisipiu Bobonaro,\r\nAlexandre Pires, Diretor Jeral Estrada Ponte Prevensaun no Kontrolu, Nene\r\nLobato, Diretor Nasional Konstrusaun Vias Rodaviarias, Milton Remanata de\r\nCastro Monteiro, Koordenador Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamento,\r\nAleixo Amaral do Carmo, Xefe Unidade Planeamento, Tito Edegar halo\r\nmonitorizasaun ba projeitu rehabilitasaun Estrada pakote I-II iha Maliana.\r\nAntes halo monitorizasaun Ministru Obras Públika ho ekipa ne’ebe akompanha hosi\r\nPrezidente Autoridade Bobonaro hala’o ho empreza Hutama Karya ho empreza Bina\r\nMitra ho rona aprezentasaun konaba progressu servisu no dezafiu ne’ebe empreza\r\nrua ne’e hasoru iha terenu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Hafoin remata\r\nenkontru Ministru Obras Públika ho delegasaun tun direita terenu hodi\r\nmonitoriza trabalhador sira halo servisu iha terenu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Bainhira to iha\r\nfatin konstrusaun Estrada obra balu ne’e konstrui ona la prense rekezitus\r\nMinistru Obras Públika orienta traballador sira hapara atividade Prim Coat,\r\ntamba konstrusaun Estrada la priense padraun atu halo Prime Coat ho razaun ne’e\r\nMinistru Obras Públika orienta hapara servis hodi fo tempu ekipa tekniku hosi\r\nLaboratoriun Naional Ministeriu Obras Públika mai halo teste hodi hare nia\r\nkondisaun Estrada ne’e antes empreza nahe alkatraun.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:\r\nyes\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Mídia MOP</span></p>','Bobonaro',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:24:10.588258','c0e190d8267e36708f955d7ab048990d',2,2,'2025-05-08','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-1-1','--5-1-1','ministru-obras-públika-ho-ekipa-tekniku-monitoriza-projeitu-estrada-maliana-pokote-i-ii-1-1-1','-','-');
INSERT INTO `news_news` VALUES (220,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO XEFE ESTADU APRESIA HO MOP NIA SERVISU','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO XEFE ESTADU APRESIA HO MOP NIA SERVISU\r\n\r\nDili, 09 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika Ministru, Samuel Marçal ho ekipa ohin hala’o enkontru ho S.E. Prezidente da Repúblika, Dr. José Ramos Horta iha Palasiu Prezidensial Aitarak-Laran.\r\n\r\nHafoin remata enkontru, Ministru Obras Públika informa “ Ohin Prezidente Repúblika bolu hau mai reprezenta Ministru Obras Públika aumesmu tempu hanesan mos Ministru Finansas Interinu, hodi aprezenta servisu Ministeriu rua nian ba Prezidente ba Repúblika, iha enkontru ne’e Xefe Estadu laiha kestaun seluk atu koalia, Xefe Estadu husu MOP apoiu atu servisu tekniku nian hodi suporta servisu balun”. Alem ne’e aprezenta mos ba Xefe Estado servisu governu ninian “MOP” konaba estrada rural sira iha Munisipal no Xefe Estado apresia tebes servisu governu ninian ne’ebe kontinua foka liu ba estrada rural sira iha Munisipal no Prezidente da Repúblika Kontente.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.1pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO XEFE\r\nESTADU APRESIA HO MOP NIA SERVISU</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili, 09 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-no-proof:yes\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru,\r\nSamuel Marçal ho ekipa ohin hala’o enkontru ho S.E. Prezidente da Repúblika,\r\nDr. José Ramos Horta iha Palasiu Prezidensial Aitarak-Laran.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:\r\nyes\">Hafoin remata enkontru, </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras Públika informa “ Ohin Prezidente\r\nRepúblika bolu hau mai reprezenta Ministru Obras Públika aumesmu tempu hanesan mos\r\nMinistru Finansas Interinu, hodi aprezenta servisu Ministeriu rua nian ba\r\nPrezidente ba Repúblika, iha enkontru ne’e Xefe Estadu laiha kestaun seluk atu\r\nkoalia, Xefe Estadu husu MOP apoiu atu servisu tekniku nian hodi suporta\r\nservisu balun”. Alem ne’e aprezenta mos ba Xefe\r\nEstado servisu governu ninian “MOP” konaba estrada rural sira iha Munisipal no\r\nXefe Estado apresia tebes servisu governu ninian ne’ebe kontinua foka liu ba\r\nestrada rural sira iha Munisipal no Prezidente da Repúblika Kontente.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:\r\nyes\">Mensajem Xefe Estado mak husu atu aselera servisu sira ne’e atu bele\r\nlalais liu tan hodi bele responde povu nia nesesidade sira iha baze nian.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-no-proof:\r\nyes\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:29:10.255146','ec8ce6abb3e952a85b8551ba726a1227',1,2,'2025-05-09','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--6-1-1','--6-1-1','ministru-obras-públika-enkontru-ho-xefe-estadu-apresia-ho-mop-nia-servisu-1-1-1','-','-'),(221,'PRIMEIRU MINISTRU ABERTURA FUTSAL COPA FUNSAUN PÚBLIKA','PRIMEIRU MINISTRU ABERTURA FUTSAL COPA FUNSAUN PÚBLIKA\r\n\r\n\r\nDili, 09 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal aumesmu tempu asume mos kargu Ministru Finansas Interinu hamutuk ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika, Agostinho Letêncio akompanha Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão abertura Kopa Funsaun Públika iha kampo Futebol Salaun Bebora, Sexta Loraik ne’e.\r\n\r\n Iha okaziaun ida ne’e Ministru Obras Públika hetan fiar hodi reprezenta Ministru Finansas hodi hato’o diskursu iha Kopa Funsaun Públika. Entretantu Kopa Funsaun Públika ba tinan Komisaun Organizadora hosi Ministeriu Finansas, eventu ne’e partisipa hosi Ministeriu no Instituisaun Estadu.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PRIMEIRU MINISTRU ABERTURA FUTSAL COPA\r\nFUNSAUN PÚBLIKA</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\">\r\n\r\n<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili, 09 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-no-proof:yes\">, Samuel Marçal aumesmu\r\ntempu asume mos kargu Ministru Finansas Interinu hamutuk ho Prezidente Komisaun\r\nFunsaun Públika, Agostinho Letêncio akompanha Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão abertura Kopa Funsaun Públika iha kampo Futebol Salaun Bebora,\r\nSexta Loraik ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;Iha\r\nokaziaun ida ne’e </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras Públika hetan fiar hodi reprezenta\r\nMinistru Finansas hodi hato’o diskursu iha Kopa Funsaun Públika. Entretantu\r\nKopa Funsaun Públika ba tinan Komisaun Organizadora hosi Ministeriu Finansas,\r\neventu ne’e partisipa hosi Ministeriu no Instituisaun Estadu.*</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:33:23.058258','060ad92489947d410d897474079c1477',1,2,'2025-05-09','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--7-1-1','--7-1-1','primeiru-ministru-abertura-futsal-copa-funsaun-públika-1-1-1','-','-'),(222,'EKIPA TEKNIKU MOP HALO MONITORIZASAUN PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HABIBIE-KULUHUN-BECORA NO DOUBLE BOX IHA AREA BEE TUDAK FATISI-AILEU','EKIPA TEKNIKU MOP HALO MONITORIZASAUN PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HABIBIE-KULUHUN-BECORA NO DOUBLE BOX IHA AREA BEE TUDAK FATISI-AILEU \r\n\r\nDili, 12 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nKoordenador Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo akompanha hosi Xefe Unidade Planeamentu, Tito Edegar no ekipa tekniku Ministeriu Obras Públika halo monitorizasaun ba projeitu rehabilitasaun Estrada husi Habibie to’o Kuluhun ba Becora no Double Box iha area Bee Tudak, Fatisi-Aileu.\r\n\r\nIha prosesu monitorizasaun projeitu hirak ne’e, Koordenador Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu husu enjineru ne’ebe mak implementa obra konstrusaun sira, tenke lao tuir dezenu ne’ebe ekipa tekniku MOP prepara ona.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambri