ambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministeriu Obras Públika halo monitorizasaun\r\nba projeitu rehabilitasaun Estrada husi Habibie to’o Kuluhun ba Becora no\r\nDouble Box iha area Bee Tudak, Fatisi-Aileu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.65pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Iha prosesu monitorizasaun projeitu\r\nhirak ne’e, Koordenador Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu husu\r\nenjineru ne’ebe mak implementa obra konstrusaun sira, tenke lao tuir dezenu\r\nne’ebe ekipa tekniku MOP prepara ona.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:38:35.941982','bcbe3365e6ac95ea2c0343a2395834dd',2,2,'2025-05-12','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--8-1-1','--8-1-1','ekipa-tekniku-mop-halo-monitorizasaun-projeitu-rehabilitasaun-estrada-habibie-kuluhun-becora-no-double-box-iha-area-bee-tudak-fatisi-aileu-1-1-1','-','-'),(223,'KONSELLU MINISTRU DELIBERA ONA ESTENSAUN KONTRATU BA SERVISU KONSULTORIA SUPERVIZAUN BA PROJEITU ESTRADA BAUCAU-VENILALE-VIKEKE','KONSELLU MINISTRU DELIBERA ONA ESTENSAUN KONTRATU BA SERVISU KONSULTORIA SUPERVIZAUN BA PROJEITU ESTRADA BAUCAU-VENILALE-VIKEKE \r\n\r\nDili, 22 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nReuniaun Konsellu Ministru ne’ebe realiza iha Palásiu Governu, Kinta-Feira ne’e delibera hodi autoriza estensaun kontratu ba servisu konsultoria supervizaun nian to’o 31 fulan-Janeiru 2026, iha Lote 1 hosi projeitu estrada no ponte Baukau-Venilale no Lote 2 Venilale-Vikeke.\r\n\r\nEstensaun ida ne’e implika aumentu iha valor kontratu nian, ne’ebe  sae hosi dolar Amerikanu Millaun 5,78 ba dolar Amerikanu Millaun 6,73 ne’ebe korresponde ba aumentu maizumenus dolar Amerikanu rihun 954.*','<p><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">KONSELLU MINISTRU DELIBERA ONA ESTENSAUN KONTRATU BA\r\nSERVISU KONSULTORIA SUPERVIZAUN BA PROJEITU ESTRADA BAUCAU-VENILALE-VIKEKE</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili, 22 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&q