úblika, Samuel Marçal akompanha hosi Prezidente Komisaun ezekutiva EDTL,E.P.,\r\nPaulo da Silva, Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Tekniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal ho\r\nkomitiva realiza enkontru ho konsorsiu ITHOCHU-EDF hodi rona aprezentasaun\r\nesbosu final PPA (Power Purchase Agreement) ba implementasaun projeitu solar PV\r\nne’ebe sei implementa iha Laleia-Manatutu ho kapasidade 72MV-80MV, iha sala\r\nreuniaun EDTL, Kaikoli, Kinta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 165.9pt 318.85pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 165.9pt 318.85pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Entretantu iha\r\nenkontru ne’e Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal husu ba Prezidente\r\nEDTL,E.P. no ekipa tomak atu kontinua esforsu no halo diskusaun hodi aselera\r\nlalais esbosu sira ne’e ho nune’e bele hahu ona prosesu implementasaun projeitu\r\nsolar PV ne’ebe sei implementa iha Laleia-Manatutu ho nia kapasidade 72MV-80MV.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 165.9pt 318.85pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Partisipa iha\r\nenkontru ne’e mak Country Director ADB iha Timor-Leste, Stefania Dina,\r\nreprezentante IFC iha Timor-Leste, David Freedman, Trade Invest, reprezentante\r\nMinisteriu Finansas no Dirijentes EDTL,E.P.*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:45:56.156856','13fe9d84310e77f13a6d184dbf1232f3',1,2,'2025-05-22','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--1-1','--1-1','ministru-obras-públika-enkontru-iha-edtl-e-p-hodi-rona-aprezentasaun-esbosu-final-power-purchase-agreement-hosi-kompañia-ithochu-edf-1-1','-','-'),(225,'EKIKA UIVP-MOP MONITORIZASAUN BA PROJEITU BIDAU SENGOL, CULUHUN BA BECORA NO FATUHADA','EKIKA UIVP-MOP MONITORIZASAUN BA PROJEITU BIDAU SENGOL, CULUHUN BA BECORA NO FATUHADA \r\n\r\nDili, 23 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nEkipa Tekniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu-Ministeriu Obras Públika lidera husi Eng. Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, iha Sexta-feira ne’e hala’o monitorizasaun ba projeitu rehabilitasaun Estrada husi Habibie to’o Kuluhun ba Becora no Fatuhada.\r\n\r\nIha prosesu monitorizasaun projeitu hirak ne’e ekipa Tekniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu husu ba empreza sira ne’ebe mak implementa obra konstrusaun sira, tenki implementa ho responsabilidade ho kualidade.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.05pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;fon