 sabado ne’e akompanha hosi ekipa Unidade Inspesaun\r\nVerifikasaun no Pagamentu ho Assesor Tekniku Ministeriu Obras Públika\r\nmonitoriza konstrusaun Double-Box ne’ebe konstrui hosi empreza Arquiris\r\nUnipessoal,Lda iha area Bee Tudak, Fatisi-Aileu no Ponte kasnafar.*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.6pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Aileu',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:52:40.405074','9cfdf10e8fc047a44b08ed031e1f0ed1',2,2,'2025-05-24','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--3-1','--3-1','ministru-obras-públika-monitoriza-konstrusaun-double-box-bee-tudak-fatisi-1-1','-','-'),(227,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO EMPREZARIU NASIONAL','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO EMPREZARIU NASIONAL \r\n\r\nDili, 26 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompanha hosi Vice Infraestrutura, Julio do Carmo hala’o enkontru iha sala reuniaun edifisiu Vice-Ministru Infraestrutura Farol, Dili.\r\n\r\nObjetivu hosi enkontru ne’e mak atu fahe informasaun ba emprezariu nasional sira konaba planu Ministeriu Obras Públika (MOP) nian ne’ebe sei entrega sertifikadu ba Empreza Nasional ne’ebe liu ona faze kualifikasaun.\r\nHafoin hetan ona sertifikadu rekoñesimentu hosi MOP, empreza sira ne’e iha direitu tomak atu hola parte ka tuir prosesu tenderizasaun ba projeitu infraestrutura sira iha teritoriu nasional.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.3pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO EMPREZARIU NASIONAL&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.3pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili, 26 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika, Samuel Marçal akompanha hosi Vice Infraestrutura, Julio do Carmo\r\nhala’o enkontru iha sala reuniaun edifisiu Vice-Ministru Infraestrutura Farol,\r\nDili.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Objetivu hosi\r\nenkontru ne’e mak atu fahe informasaun ba emprezariu nasional sira konaba planu\r\nMinisteriu Obras Públika (MOP) nian ne’ebe sei entrega sertifikadu ba Empreza\r\nNasional ne’ebe liu ona faze kualifikasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Hafoin hetan\r\nona sertifikadu rekoñesimentu hosi MOP, empreza sira ne’e iha direitu tomak atu\r\nhola parte ka tuir prosesu tenderizasaun ba projeitu infraestrutura sira iha\r\nteritoriu nasional.*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n110%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 07:58:39.564989','705f2172834666788607efbfca35afb3',1,2,'2025-05-26','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--4-1','--4-1','ministru-obras-públika-enkontru-ho-emprezariu-nasional-1-1','-','-'),(228,'MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA RELATORIU EZEKUSAUN TRIMESTRE BA PARLAMENTU NASIONAL KOMISAUN C','MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA RELATORIU EZEKUSAUN TRIMESTRE BA PARLAMENTU NASIONAL KOMISAUN C \r\n\r\nDili, 29 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratejiku, Gastão Francisco de Sousa ho Ministro Transporte no Komunikasaun, Miguel Marques Gonçalves Manetelu akompanha Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso hala’o audensia ho membru Parlamentu Nasional, Komisaun C ne’ebe trata asuntu finansas públika iha Plenaria PN, Kinta-feira.\r\n\r\nObjetivu hosi audensia ne’e mak atu halo aprezentasaun ba Parlamentu Nasional Komisaun C konaba ezekusaun orsamentu trimester dahuluk tinan 2025 nian.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:7.25pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA APREZENTA\r\nRELATORIU EZEKUSAUN TRIMESTRE BA PARLAMENTU NASIONAL KOMISAUN C</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:7.25pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili, 29 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 175.35pt right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika, Samuel Marçal, Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu Estratejiku,\r\nGastão Francisco de Sousa ho Ministro Transporte no Komunikasaun, Miguel\r\nMarques Gonçalves Manetelu akompanha Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues\r\nF. Viegas Cardoso hala’o audensia ho membru Parlamentu Nasional, Komisaun C\r\nne’ebe trata asuntu finansas públika iha Plenaria PN, Kinta-feira.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 175.35pt right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 175.35pt right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Objetivu hosi\r\naudensia ne’e mak atu halo aprezentasaun ba Parlamentu Nasional Komisaun C\r\nkonaba ezekusaun orsamentu trimester dahuluk tinan 2025 nian.*</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,0,0,'2025-07-04 08:02:20.309112','74db120f0a8e5646ef5a30154e9f6deb',1,2,'2025-05-29','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--1','--1','ministeriu-obras-públika-aprezenta-relatoriu-ezekusaun-trimestre-ba-parlamentu-nasional-komisaun-c-1','-','-'),(229,'MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA SOSIALIZA PROSESU APROVISIONAMENTU PAGAMENTU VERIFIKASAUN NO SUPERVIZAUN PROJEITU BA EMPREZA LOKAL HOSI MUNISIPIU TOLU IHA AINARU','MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA SOSIALIZA PROSESU APROVISIONAMENTU PAGAMENTU VERIFIKASAUN NO SUPERVIZAUN PROJEITU BA EMPREZA LOKAL HOSI MUNISIPIU TOLU IHA AINARU\r\n\r\nAinaro, 30 Maio 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, iha Sexta-feira ne’e akompanha hosi Sekretariu Munisipal Planeamentu Investimentu Dezenvolvimentu Integrado, Albertino de Araújo partisipa iha atividade sosializasaun prosesu aprovisionamentu, pagamentu Verifikasaun no Supervizaun projeitu ba empreza Lokal hosi munisipiu tolu “Manufahi, Ainaro no Covalima” atividade ne’e realiza iha salaun Autoridade Munisipiu  Ainaro.\r\n\r\nIha intervensaun Ministru Obras Públika hatete sosializasaun ida ne’e importante teb-tebes ba oin Governu sei tau matan no buka meius hodi suporta setor privadu sira inklui rona direita preokupasaun no problema ne’ebe mak sira hasoru durante ne’e no Governu atu bele ajuda hadia sira nia setor privadu sira, nune’e sira mos bele dezenvolve a’an diak iha futuru mai, kuandu sira iha ona kapasidade sira bele halo investimentu no loke kampo traballu ba joven sira.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA SOSIALIZA\r\nPROSESU APROVISIONAMENTU PAGAMENTU VERIFIKASAUN NO SUPERVIZAUN PROJEITU BA\r\nEMPREZA LOKAL HOSI MUNISIPIU TOLU IHA AINARU</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Ainaro, 30 Maio</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal,\r\niha Sexta-feira ne’e akompanha hosi Sekretariu Munisipal Planeamentu\r\nInvestimentu Dezenvolvimentu Integrado, Albertino de Araújo partisipa iha\r\natividade sosializasaun prosesu aprovisionamentu, pagamentu Verifikasaun no\r\nSupervizaun projeitu ba empreza Lokal hosi munisipiu tolu “Manufahi, Ainaro no\r\nCovalima” atividade ne’e realiza iha salaun Autoridade Munisipiu&nbsp; Ainaro.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:110%\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Iha\r\nintervensaun Ministru Obras Públika hatete sosializasaun ida ne’e importante\r\nteb-tebes ba oin Governu sei tau matan no buka meius hodi suporta setor privadu\r\nsira inklui rona direita preokupasaun no problema ne’ebe mak sira hasoru\r\ndurante ne’e no Governu atu bele ajuda hadia sira nia setor privadu sira,\r\nnune’e sira mos bele dezenvolve a’an diak iha futuru mai, kuandu sira iha ona\r\nkapasidade sira bele halo investimentu no loke kampo traballu ba joven sira.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">“Objetivu hosi\r\nsosializasaun ida ne’e mak atu eleva koñesimentu Emprezariu Lokal hodi hasae\r\nkoñesimentu oinsa bele priense dokumentus ligadu ho prosesu Aprovisionamentu,\r\nPagamentu, Verifikasaun no Supervisaun projeitu, hodi bele tuir tenderizasaun.\r\nTamba ida ne’e ita (MOP) hahu’u atu halo prakualifikasaun ba empreza sira.\r\nHafoin hetan ona sertifikadu rekoñesimentu hosi MOP, ita boot sira iha direitu\r\ntomak atu hola parte ka tuir prosesu tenderizasaun ba projeitu infraestrutura\r\nsira iha teritoriu nasional” hatete Ministru Obras Públika iha nia\r\nintervensaun.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika haktuir, bainhira Governu liu hosi MOP prontu ona atu fo apoiu ba emprezariu\r\nsira. Governu prontu promove setor privadu, tamba ne’e hau husu ba emprezariu\r\nne’ebe hatoman a’an hodi husu % para ona ho aktu ida ne’e, karik ita boot sira\r\nhakarak join venture. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Iha fatin\r\nhanesan, Sekretariu Munisipal Planeamentu Investimentu Dezenvolvimentu\r\nIntegradu, Albertino de Araújo husu ba Sua Exelênsia Ministru Obras Públika atu\r\nhare estrada urbana Ainaro Villa nafatin aat difikulta komunidade atu lori sira\r\nnia produtu asesu ba merkadu, nune’e mos estrada Fleixa liga ba Postu\r\nAdministrativu Hato-Builico, tamba iha futuru Ramelau sei fo rendimentu diak ba\r\nGovernu.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Atividade sosializasaun ne’e partisipa\r\nhosi Diretor Jeral Administrasaun Finansas, João Amaral, Koordenador Unidade\r\nInspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, Xefe Unidade\r\nPlaneamentu, Tito Edegar, Diretora Aprovisionamentu, Isabel Maria Lay Guterres,\r\nPrezidente CCI-TL Munisipiu Ainaro no Emprezariu Lokal sira husi Munisipiu\r\nAinaro, Manufahi no Covalima.*</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 110%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:150%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Ainaro',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:06:22.303387','57aeee35c98205091e18d1140e9f38cf',2,2,'2025-05-30','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-2-1','--5-2-1','ministeriu-obras-públika-sosializa-prosesu-aprovisionamentu-pagamentu-verifikasaun-no-supervizaun-projeitu-ba-empreza-lokal-hosi-munisipiu-tolu-iha-ainaru-1-1','-','-'),(230,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO AMBASSADOR KIMURA TETSUYA','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO AMBASSADOR KIMURA TETSUYA\r\n\r\nDili, 03 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal iha Tersa-feira ne’e hafoin remata enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Mundial iha Timor-Leste, kontinua hala’o enkontru ho Ambassador Japaun ba Timor-Leste, KIMURA Tetsuya, iha sorumutu ho Ambassador Japaun, Ministru Obras Públika  akompanha hosi Koordenador Unidade Inspesaun verifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, iha sala Gabinete Ministeriu Obras Públika.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO\r\nAMBASSADOR KIMURA TETSUYA</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">03 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-no-proof:yes\">, Samuel Marçal iha\r\nTersa-feira ne’e hafoin remata enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Mundial iha\r\nTimor-Leste, kontinua hala’o enkontru ho Ambassador Japaun ba Timor-Leste,\r\nKIMURA Tetsuya, iha sorumutu ho Ambassador Japaun, </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp; akompanha hosi Koordenador Unidade Inspesaun\r\nverifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo, iha sala Gabinete Ministeriu\r\nObras Públika.*</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:14:26.938745','6da9003b743b65f4c0ccd295cc484e57',1,2,'2025-06-03','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-3-1','--5-3-1','ministru-obras-públika-enkontru-ho-ambassador-kimura-tetsuya-1-1','-','-'),(231,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO DELEGASAUN BANKU MUNDIAL IHA TIMOR-LESTE','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO DELEGASAUN BANKU MUNDIAL IHA TIMOR-LESTE \r\n\r\nDili, 03 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika , Samuel Marçal iha Tersa-feira ne’e akompanha hosi Xefe Project Management Unit-Ministeriu Obras Públika (PMU-MOP), Amilcar da Costa Victor ho Koordendor Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo hala’o enkontru reprezentante Banku Mundial iha Timor-Leste, Sr. Bernard Harbone iha sala Gabinete Ministru Obras Públika.\r\n\r\nObjetivu hosi enkontru ne’e mak koalia konaba emprestimu ba projeitu sira ne’ebe mak dau-daun ne’e iha hela prosesu nia laran, hanesan projeitu “Bee Mos” inklui projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada Ermera no projeitu infraestrutura sira seluk.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKA ENKONTRU HO DELEGASAUN BANKU MUNDIAL IHA TIMOR-LESTE</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">03 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-no-proof:yes\"> , Samuel Marçal iha\r\nTersa-feira ne’e akompanha hosi Xefe Project Management Unit-Ministeriu Obras\r\nPúblika (PMU-MOP), Amilcar da Costa Victor ho Koordendor Unidade Inspesaun\r\nVerifikasaun no Pagamentu, Aleixo Amaral do Carmo hala’o enkontru reprezentante\r\nBanku Mundial iha Timor-Leste, Sr. Bernard Harbone iha sala Gabinete Ministru\r\nObras Públika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-no-proof:yes\">Objetivu hosi enkontru ne’e mak koalia konaba emprestimu ba\r\nprojeitu sira ne’ebe mak dau-daun ne’e iha hela prosesu nia laran, hanesan\r\nprojeitu “Bee Mos” inklui projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada Ermera no projeitu\r\ninfraestrutura sira seluk.*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:112%\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:8.2pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia\r\nMOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:17:27.160938','9b04d152845ec0a378394003c96da594',1,2,'2025-06-03','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-4-1','--5-4-1','ministru-obras-públika-enkontru-ho-delegasaun-banku-mundial-iha-timor-leste-1-1','-','-'),(232,'KONSELLU MINISTRU APROVA LANSAMENTU PROJEITU PILOTO REDE ELETRISIDADE SUBTERRANIA ENTRE PONTE HABIBIE NO BECORA','KONSELLU MINISTRU APROVA LANSAMENTU PROJEITU PILOTO REDE ELETRISIDADE SUBTERRANIA ENTRE PONTE HABIBIE NO BECORA \r\n\r\nDili, 04 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nReuniaun Konsellu Ministru ne’ebe realiza iha Palásiu Governu, Kinta-feira ne’e deside hodi aprova lansamentu projeitu-pilotu ida ne’ebe propoin hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal ba konstrusaun rede eletrisidade subterranea iha parte entre ponte Habibie no Bekora, iha Dili.\r\n\r\nInisiativa ida ne’e hakarak atu moderniza infraestrutura eletrika sira ne’ebe eziste, hadia fiabilidade fornesimentu enerjia nian no hamenus risku sira ne’ebe relasiona ho redes eletrika iha leten, liu-liu iha situasaun udan, anin no rai-lakan ka asidentes.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">KONSELLU MINISTRU APROVA LANSAMENTU\r\nPROJEITU PILOTO REDE ELETRISIDADE SUBTERRANIA ENTRE PONTE HABIBIE NO BECORA</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">04 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.05pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:112%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Reuniaun Konsellu Ministru ne’ebe realiza\r\niha Palásiu Governu, Kinta-feira ne’e deside hodi aprova lansamentu\r\nprojeitu-pilotu ida ne’ebe propoin hosi </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras Públika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:112%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">, Samuel Marçal ba konstrusaun rede\r\neletrisidade subterranea iha parte entre ponte Habibie no Bekora, iha Dili.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Inisiativa ida ne’e hakarak atu\r\nmoderniza infraestrutura eletrika sira ne’ebe eziste, hadia fiabilidade\r\nfornesimentu enerjia nian no hamenus risku sira ne’ebe relasiona ho redes\r\neletrika iha leten, liu-liu iha situasaun udan, anin no rai-lakan ka asidentes.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:20:44.685748','be83ab3ecd0db773eb2dc1b0a17836a1',2,2,'2025-06-04','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-5-1','--5-5-1','konsellu-ministru-aprova-lansamentu-projeitu-piloto-rede-eletrisidade-subterrania-entre-ponte-habibie-no-becora-1-1','-','-'),(233,'MOP-SEATOU INAGURA PROJEITU ELETRIFIKASAUN NASIONAL, NE’EBE MAKA EDTL,E.P. KOMPLETA ONA IHA SUKU BETULAU-LIQUIDOE','MOP-SEATOU INAGURA PROJEITU ELETRIFIKASAUN NASIONAL, NE’EBE MAKA EDTL,E.P. KOMPLETA ONA IHA SUKU BETULAU-LIQUIDOE\r\n\r\nAileu, 05 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompanha hosi Sekretariu Estado Assuntu Toponímia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias, Prezidente Ezekutivu EDTL,E.p., Paulo da Silva, Prezidente Autoridade Munisipiu Aileu, João Bosco dos Santos hamutuk ho Autoridade Lokal halo inagurasaun ba projeitu eletrifikasaun nasional (PEN) iha Liquidoe Betulau Naumata-Sabere-Builoko, Munisipiu Aileu.\r\n\r\nIha intervensaun Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal hatete Nasaun ida ne’e povu mak hari’i tanba ne’e hanesan membru Governu ida ne’ebe lidera hosi Primeiro-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão prontu atu servi povu  no rai ida ne’e, ohin ita inagura eletrisidade iha suku Betulau.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MOP-SEATOU\r\nINAGURA PROJEITU ELETRIFIKASAUN NASIONAL, NE’EBE MAKA EDTL,E.P. KOMPLETA ONA\r\nIHA SUKU BETULAU-LIQUIDOE</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Aileu, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">05 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">,\r\nSamuel Marçal akompanha hosi Sekretariu Estado Assuntu Toponímia no\r\nOrganizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias, Prezidente Ezekutivu EDTL,E.p.,\r\nPaulo da Silva, Prezidente Autoridade Munisipiu Aileu, João Bosco dos Santos\r\nhamutuk ho Autoridade Lokal halo inagurasaun ba projeitu eletrifikasaun\r\nnasional (PEN) iha Liquidoe Betulau Naumata-Sabere-Builoko, Munisipiu Aileu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha intervensaun </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika, Samuel Marçal hatete Nasaun ida ne’e povu mak hari’i tanba ne’e\r\nhanesan membru Governu ida ne’ebe lidera hosi Primeiro-Ministru, Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão prontu atu servi povu&nbsp; no\r\nrai ida ne’e, ohin ita inagura eletrisidade iha suku Betulau.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">“Betulau suku ikus ne’ebe foin asesu\r\nona eletrisidade ba futuru Governu sei hamutuk EDTL,E.p. sei foku ba\r\nimplementasaun programa eletrifikasaun komunitaria no programa enerjia rural ba\r\naldeia sira ne’ebe ita identifika ona seidauk asesu enerjia eletrika. Parabens\r\nba imi hotu iha Betulau tanba desde tempu Portugues mai to tempu Indonezia,\r\nohin imi bele asesu ona eletrisidade” dehan </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras Públika.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika apela mos ba joven sira atu nafatin hadomi Paz hodi nune’e\r\ndezenvolvimentu bele lao to’o mai iha nivel suku no aldeia.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Iha fatin\r\nhanesan Sekretariu Estadu Assuntu Toponímia no Urbana, Germano Santa Brites\r\nDias husu ba komunidade sira utiliza eletrisidade ho didiak, dehan SEATOU.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Prezidente\r\nAutoridade Munisipiu Aileu, João Bosco dos Santos haktuir Betulau suku ida ikus\r\nliu iha tertarik Timor Laran asesu ona eletrisidade, tekniku administrador\r\nmunisipiu Aileu. Apela mos ba autoridade seguransa sira liu-liu membru PNTL\r\n(OPS) ne’ebe destaka iha kada suku atu asegura.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Entretantu\r\nPrezidente Komisaun ezekutiva, Dr. Paulo da Silva informa dadaun ne’e EDTL,E.p.\r\nprepara ona dezenu BoQ ba aldeia 127 ne’ebe seidauk asesu enerjia eletrika,\r\ntuir estimasaun EDTL,E.p. sei konklui taxa 100% asesu enerjia eletrika iha\r\nteritoriu nasional&nbsp; iha tinan 2026.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">“Rasio\r\neletrifikasaun nivel suku to’o ona 100%. Presija kooperasaun diak ho komunidade\r\nagradese ba kompanha ne’ebe mai instala ona eletrisidade iha suku Betulau”,\r\nhatete Prezidente EDTL,E.p.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Projeitu Eletrifikasaun\r\nNasional iha suku Betulau implementa hosi kompanha Lemalaku ho volume servisu\r\ninstalasaun Liña media tensaun 2 kilometro sirkuitu, Liña baixa tensaun 9.9\r\nkilometru sirkuitu, instalasaun transformador ho kapasidade 50 kVA, total\r\nbenifisiariu uma-kain 231.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 451.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Implementasaun\r\nProjeitu Eletrifikasaun Nasional iha suku Betulau hanesan suku ikus ne’ebe\r\nasesu ona enerjia eletrika ho nune’e EDTL,E.p konklui ona taxa 100% asesu\r\neletrisidade nivel suku iha teritoriu Timor-Leste.*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Aileu',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:24:41.619400','e165421110ba03099a1c0393373c5b43',2,2,'2025-06-05','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-6-1','--5-6-1','mop-seatou-inagura-projeitu-eletrifikasaun-nasional-ne-ebe-maka-edtl-e-p-kompleta-ona-iha-suku-betulau-liquidoe-1-1','-','-'),(234,'GOVERNU XINA LIU HUSI UNICEF FO APOIU TANKI BEE RUA NULU RESIN LIMA BA BTL,E.P.','GOVERNU XINA LIU HUSI UNICEF FO APOIU TANKI BEE RUA NULU RESIN LIMA BA BTL,E.P.\r\n\r\nDili, 09 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal segunda-feira ne’e akompanha Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun no Komisaun Ezekutivu BTL,E.p., Gustavo da Cruz partisipa iha serimonia entrega tanki Bee 25 ne’ebe oferese husi Governu Xina liu husi UNICEF fahe ba komunidade sira hodi responde ba area inundsaun no rai-monu, atividade ne’e realiza iha Armazen BTL,Ep. Avenida 20 de Maio, Kolmera.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">GOVERNU XINA LIU HUSI UNICEF FO APOIU\r\nTANKI BEE RUA NULU RESIN LIMA BA BTL,E.P.</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">09 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-no-proof:yes\">, Samuel Marçal\r\nsegunda-feira ne’e akompanha Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun no Komisaun\r\nEzekutivu BTL,E.p., Gustavo da Cruz partisipa iha serimonia entrega tanki Bee\r\n25 ne’ebe oferese husi Governu Xina liu husi UNICEF fahe ba komunidade sira\r\nhodi responde ba area inundsaun no rai-monu, atividade ne’e realiza iha Armazen\r\nBTL,Ep. Avenida 20 de Maio, Kolmera.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:.35pt;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.25pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.5pt;line-height:110%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-no-proof:yes\">Iha serimonia entrega tanki Bee ne’e reprezentante País\r\nUNICEF ba Timor-Leste, Patrizia DiGiovanni akompanha direta husi Embaixador\r\nRepublika Popular Xina ba Timor-Leste, Wang Wenli ho prezensa hosi\r\nVice-Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva Bee Timor-Leste, Empreza Publika (BTL,E.P.),\r\nba assuntu Tekniku, Sr. José Filipe Ximenes Smith, Vise-Prezidente Komisaun\r\nEzekutiva Bee Timor-Leste,Empreza Publika (BTL,E.P.), ba Asuntu Korporativu,\r\nSr. Manuel Tomas Amaral de Carvalho, Jestor DAK, reprezentante SEEAS no DNRAS\r\ninklui ofisial sira husi BTL,E.P.*</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-no-proof:yes\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.9pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:27:57.346437','289dff07669d7a23de0ef88d2f7129e7',1,2,'2025-06-09','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-7-1','--5-7-1','governu-xina-liu-husi-unicef-fo-apoiu-tanki-bee-rua-nulu-resin-lima-ba-btl-e-p--1-1','-','-'),(235,'KONSELLU MINISTRU ALTERA DEKRETU LEI NO.11/2006 NO APROVA PROJEITU DEKRETU LEI KONA UTILIZASAUN MAKINA NO EKIPAMENTUS HO RISKU A’AS','KONSELLU MINISTRU ALTERA DEKRETU LEI NO.11/2006 NO APROVA PROJEITU DEKRETU LEI KONA UTILIZASAUN MAKINA NO EKIPAMENTUS HO RISKU A’AS\r\n\r\nDili, 11 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nSorumutu Konsellu Ministru ne’ebe hala’o iha Palásiu Governu, Kuata-feira ne’e aprova ona projetu Dekretu Lei, ne’ebe aprezenta hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal konaba alternasaun daruak ba Dekretu Lei no. 11/2006, loron 12 fulan-Abril ne’ebe kria Instituisaun Jestaun Ekipamentus no Apoiu ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura no projetu Dekretu Lei   ne’ebe ho objetivu atu estabelese regras konaba utilizasaun makina no ekipamentus sira ho rikus a’as.\r\n\r\nEntretantu ho alternasaun ida ne’e, IGE-ADI nia ambitu atividade sira habelar hodi permite atu fornese formasaun teknika espesializada no sertifikada ba ninia rekursus umanus rasik ba professional husi Instituisaun sira seluk no ba sidadaun sira ein-jeral.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">KONSELLU MINISTRU ALTERA DEKRETU LEI\r\nNO.11/2006 NO APROVA PROJEITU DEKRETU LEI KONA UTILIZASAUN MAKINA NO\r\nEKIPAMENTUS HO RISKU A’AS</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 11</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"> Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Sorumutu Konsellu Ministru ne’ebe\r\nhala’o iha Palásiu Governu, Kuata-feira ne’e aprova ona projetu Dekretu Lei,\r\nne’ebe aprezenta hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal konaba alternasaun\r\ndaruak ba Dekretu Lei no. 11/2006, loron 12 fulan-Abril ne’ebe kria\r\nInstituisaun Jestaun Ekipamentus no Apoiu ba Dezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura no\r\nprojetu Dekretu Lei&nbsp; &nbsp;ne’ebe ho objetivu atu estabelese regras\r\nkonaba utilizasaun makina no ekipamentus sira ho rikus a’as.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Entretantu ho alternasaun ida ne’e,\r\nIGE-ADI nia ambitu atividade sira habelar hodi permite atu fornese formasaun\r\nteknika espesializada no sertifikada ba ninia rekursus umanus rasik ba\r\nprofessional husi Instituisaun sira seluk no ba sidadaun sira ein-jeral.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Treinamentu ne’e sei foka liu ba\r\nUtilizasaun, Jestaun no Manutensaun ba makina no ekipamentus ho risku aas\r\nne’ebe utiliza iha konstrusaun sivil no Obras Públika. Ba ida ne’e Instituisaun\r\nbele estabelese parseria ho entidade públika ka privada, nasional ka\r\nestranjeiru ho esperiensia ne’ebe komprovadu iha area sira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Estatutu sira IGEADI nia mos hetan\r\natualizasaun atu garante kumprimentu ba norma sira ne’ebe vigora konaba rejime\r\nAdministrasaun Direta no Indireta estadu nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Nune’e mos ho proposta hosi </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika, Samuel Marçal, Konsellu Ministru aprova projetu Dekretu Lei ne’ebe ho\r\nobjetivu atu estabelese regras konaba utilizasaun makina no ekipamentus sira ho\r\nrisku aas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Diploma ne’e\r\ndefine rejime lisensiamentu obrigatoriu ba operador makina sira hanesan\r\ngindaste, eskavadora, empillador, retroeskavadora, Plataforma elevatorio no\r\nekipamentus pezadu sira seluk ne’ebe uza iha konstrusaun Sivil no Obras\r\nPúblika. Ninia objetivu mak atu reforsa seguransa ba traballador no komunidade\r\nsira, hodi bele prevene asidentes no garante katak profisional sira ne’ebe\r\ntreinadu no sertifikadu ho diak deit mak opera tipu ekipamentus ida ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Entre medida\r\nprincipal sira ne’e, imklui kria kursu formasaun espesifika ho komponente teorika\r\nno Pratika ne’ebe organiza hosi institute Jestaun Ekipamentus no apoiu ba\r\nDezenvolvimentu Infraestrutura (IGEADI, Akronimu iha lian Portugues), ne’ebe\r\nsei responsavel mos ba emisaun lisensa professional. Diploma ne’e mos\r\nestabelese norma minima sira seguransa teknika nian hodi utiliza ekipamentus\r\nsira, regra sirkulasaun iha dalan publika sira no iha area servisu nian no\r\nprosedimentu ba fiskalizasaun no aplikasaun koimas bainhira akontese\r\ninfrasaun.*</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-ID\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:31:10.881866','577ef1154f3240ad5b9b413aa7346a1e',3,2,'2025-06-11','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-8-1','--5-8-1','konsellu-ministru-altera-dekretu-lei-no-11-2006-no-aprova-projeitu-dekretu-lei-kona-utilizasaun-makina-no-ekipamentus-ho-risku-a-as-1-1','-','-'),(236,'EKIPA ADB HALO APREZENTASAUN BA MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONA-BA PROGRAMA BEE MOOS NO KAPTASAUN BEE IHA RAILAKU KRAIK','EKIPA ADB HALO APREZENTASAUN BA MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONA-BA PROGRAMA BEE MOOS NO KAPTASAUN BEE IHA RAILAKU KRAIK\r\n\r\nDili, 12 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, iha kinta-feira ne’e akompanha husi Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun no Komisaun Ezekutivu BTL,E.P., Gustavo da Cruz, Project Manager Bee no Saneamentu- Ministeriu Obras Públika, Nelson Mesquita inklui ekipa UIVP Bee no Saneamento- Ministeriu Obras Públika enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Dezenvolvimentu Azia ne’ebe lidera hosi Senora Stefania Dina hodi rona aprezentasaun ekipa tekniku ADB Chris Dunlop, espesialista rekursu Bee nian konaba DAM no programa Bee mos iha Baucau, same no Projeetu kaptasaun Bee iha Railaku Kraik hodi fornese Bee mos mai sidade Dili.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">EKIPA ADB HALO APREZENTASAUN BA\r\nMINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONA-BA PROGRAMA BEE MOOS NO KAPTASAUN BEE IHA RAILAKU\r\nKRAIK</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 12</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"> Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:right 447.4pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">Ministru Obras\r\nPúblika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-no-proof:yes\">, Samuel Marçal, iha\r\nkinta-feira ne’e akompanha husi Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun no Komisaun\r\nEzekutivu BTL,E.P., Gustavo da Cruz, Project Manager Bee no Saneamentu- Ministeriu\r\nObras Públika, Nelson Mesquita inklui ekipa UIVP Bee no Saneamento- Ministeriu\r\nObras Públika enkontru ho delegasaun Banku Dezenvolvimentu Azia ne’ebe lidera\r\nhosi Senora Stefania Dina hodi rona aprezentasaun ekipa tekniku ADB Chris\r\nDunlop, espesialista rekursu Bee nian konaba DAM no programa Bee mos iha Baucau,\r\nsame no Projeetu kaptasaun Bee iha Railaku Kraik hodi fornese Bee mos mai\r\nsidade Dili.* </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-ID\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:.35pt;\r\nmargin-left:-.75pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;tab-stops:center 360.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:110%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; color: black;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-04 08:34:08.986447','01161aaa0b6d1345dd8fe4e481144d84',1,2,'2025-06-12','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-9-1','--5-9-1','ekipa-adb-halo-aprezentasaun-ba-ministru-obras-públika-kona-ba-programa-bee-moos-no-kaptasaun-bee-iha-railaku-kraik-1-1','-','-'),(237,'MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONTINUA NORMALIZA ESTRADA GLENO BA LETEFOHO, HODI HEIN KONKURSU PÚBLIKA NE’EBE MAKA PROSESU IHA CNA','MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA KONTINUA NORMALIZA ESTRADA GLENO BA LETEFOHO, HODI HEIN KONKURSU PÚBLIKA NE’EBE MAKA PROSESU IHA CNA\r\n\r\nErmera, 23 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão iha Segunda-feira ne’e akompaña hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal observa direita progressu normalizasaun estrada diresaun Kapital Gleno ba to’o Postu Administrativu Letefoho, Munisipiu Ermera. \r\n\r\nHafoin to’o iha fatin normalizasaun hodi observa direita progresu normalizasaun estrada diresaun Kapital Gleno ba to’o Postu Administrativu Letefoho, Munisipiu Ermera, Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão fo orientasaun ba MOP, Samuel Marçal atu kontinua halo normalizasaun hodi hein konkursu públiku ne’ebe maka prosesu hela iha CNA.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA\r\nKONTINUA NORMALIZA ESTRADA GLENO BA LETEFOHO, HODI HEIN KONKURSU PÚBLIKA NE’EBE\r\nMAKA PROSESU IHA CNA</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ermera, 23 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru Ministru, Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão iha Segunda-feira ne’e akompaña hosi Ministru Obras Públika,\r\nSamuel Marçal observa direita progressu normalizasaun estrada diresaun Kapital Gleno\r\nba to’o Postu Administrativu Letefoho, Munisipiu Ermera. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hafoin to’o iha fatin\r\nnormalizasaun hodi observa direita progresu normalizasaun estrada diresaun Kapital\r\nGleno ba to’o Postu Administrativu Letefoho, Munisipiu Ermera, Primeiru-Ministru,\r\nKay Rala Xanana Gusmão fo orientasaun ba MOP, Samuel Marçal atu kontinua halo\r\nnormalizasaun hodi hein konkursu públiku ne’ebe maka prosesu hela iha CNA.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha biban ne’e mos Primeiru\r\nMinistru IX Governu Konstituisional kontinua enkoraza populasaun sira atu hein\r\nprosesu hotu-hotu ne’ebe oras ne’e daudaun lao hela hodi hein konkursu ba projeitu\r\nkonstrusaun estrada hosi Postu Administrativu Gleno ba Letefoho.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Agora daudaun prosesu ba\r\nkonstrusaun estrada hosi Gleno mai Letefoho lao hela iha CNA, ita presiza halo\r\nuluk estudu ba buat barak molok implementa projeitu ne’e. Tenke haree didiak\r\nninia kualidade, kalkulasaun distansia no alokasaun orsamentu, tanba osan ne’e\r\npovu nian. Maibe atu dehan ba imi katak estrada hosi Gleno sei mai to iha\r\nLetefoho”, hateten Primeiru Ministru.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha oportunidade ne’e\r\nPrimeiru Ministru husu ba populasaun atu kolabora ho Governu bainhira\r\nimplementa projeitu konstrusaun estrada ne’e iha tempu balun mai. Bainhira to’o\r\niha Suku Goulolo, populasaun balun ho estudante sira konserta iha Sede Suku\r\nhodi simu Primeiru Ministru no hato’o sentidu agradesimentu tanba normalizasaun\r\nestrada ne’e fasilita tebes movimentu komunidade.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha fatin Xefe\r\nPlaneamentu MOP, Tito Edegar hateten MOP halo normalizasaun ba estrada hosi Gleno\r\nba to’o Letefoho tanba ezijensia hosi populasaun, liu-liu atu fasilita\r\nmovimentu transporte públiku.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ho ezijensia populasaun ne’e\r\nmaka Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal husu rasik ba Primeiru-Ministru atu\r\nhalo normalizasaun no Xefe Governu mos konkorda katak tenke halo duni, nune’e\r\nprovizoriamente bele fasilita movimentu transporte públiku hodi hein prosesu\r\ntenderizasaun ba konstrusaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Ita hare kondisaun estrada\r\nantes ita normaliza grave tebes. Ezemplu agora daudaun tempu kú kafe,\r\nkomunidade sira atu tula deit kafe mai Dili ho kuantidade tonelade lima to’o\r\nneen labele. Ho razaun hirak ne’e maka ita halo normalizasaun hodi hein prosesu\r\ntenderizasaun ba konstrusaun iha Comissão Nacional Aprovisionamento (CNA) durante\r\nfulan ualu seidauk konklui”, hateten Xefe Planeamento MOP, Tito Edigar.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Xefe planeamentu MOP ne’e\r\ndehan prosesu normalizasaun lao lais tebes tanba durante iha terenu, ekipa\r\ntraballu hetan akompañamentu direita no korazen hosi Ministru Obras Públika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Nune’e mos pároku, Parókia\r\nNossa Senhora do Carmo Letefoho, Padre Elio Pereira Fernandes observa katak\r\nkomunidade kontente tebes ba normalizasaun estrada ne’e. Loos duni, populasaun\r\nkontente tanba durante ne’e estrada grave tebes, Bee Naliun, Rai kuak barak,\r\ndifikulta duni movimentu populasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Pároku ne’e louva no\r\nagradese ba Governu liu hosi &nbsp;Ministru\r\nObras Públika, Samuel Marçal ne’ebe tun direita hodi akompaña ekipa durante\r\ntempu tomak no normalizasaun ne’e lao lais tebes.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Ida-ne’e hatudu katak,\r\nGovernante ne’e iha duni vontade ba kompromissu atu responde preokupasaun\r\npopulasaun iha area rural. Populasaun mos kontente ho esperansa boot ba Governu\r\nkatak sei implementa duni projeitu konstrusaun estrada tama to’o Letefoho”,\r\nhateten Padre Elio.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Normalizasaun ne’e hahu\r\nkedan hosi Gleno ba Humboe, Eraulu tama to’o Letefoho ho total kilometru 28 ne’ebe\r\ntuir planu sei konklui iha loron rua tan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Prosesu normalizasau ne’e\r\nekipa traballu Ministeriu Obras Públika utiliza ekipamentus hosi Instituto&nbsp; de Gestão de Equipamentos e Apoio ao Desemvolvimento\r\nInfraestrutura, Instituto Público (IGEADI),IP).*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Ermera',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-07 06:19:04.329689','539fd53b59e3bb12d203f45a912eeaf2',2,2,'2025-06-23','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-10-1-1','--5-10-1-1','ministeriu-obras-públika-kontinua-normaliza-estrada-gleno-ba-letefoho-hodi-hein-konkursu-públika-ne-ebe-maka-prosesu-iha-cna-1-1-1','-','-'),(238,'REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA URBANA LUGATOI ATINJI ONA 57%','REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA URBANA LUGATOI ATINJI ONA 57%\r\n\r\nViqueque, 26 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nRehabilitasaun Estrada Urbana Lugatoi ne’ebe konstrui hosi Kompaña HOVEN II Unip.Lda, lokaliza iha Suku Beloi, Postu Administrativu Viqueque Vila daudaun ne’e ninia progresu atinji ona 57%.\r\n\r\nOhin mos ekipa konjunta kompostu hosi UIVP-MOP, tekniku destakadu MOP Viqueque no ADN,I.P halo mos monitorizasaun ba obra refere ne’ebe hahu ona halo instalasaun ba Terramesh.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA URBANA\r\nLUGATOI ATINJI ONA 57%</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Viqueque, 26 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Rehabilitasaun Estrada Urbana\r\nLugatoi ne’ebe konstrui hosi Kompaña HOVEN II Unip.Lda, lokaliza iha Suku\r\nBeloi, Postu Administrativu Viqueque Vila daudaun ne’e ninia progresu atinji\r\nona 57%.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ohin mos ekipa konjunta\r\nkompostu hosi UIVP-MOP, tekniku destakadu MOP Viqueque no ADN,I.P halo mos\r\nmonitorizasaun ba obra refere ne’ebe hahu ona halo instalasaun ba Terramesh.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Viqueque',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-07 06:24:01.194193','ac1dd209cbcc5e5d1c6e28598e8cbbe8',2,2,'2025-06-26','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-10-1','--5-10-1','rehabilitasaun-estrada-urbana-lugatoi-atinji-ona-57--1-1','-','-'),(239,'CNA NO MOP OHIN ABERTURA BA PRESU LISITASAUN NIAN BA PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN NO MANUTENSAUN ESTRADA LETEFOHO-GLENO','CNA NO MOP OHIN ABERTURA BA PRESU LISITASAUN NIAN BA PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN NO MANUTENSAUN ESTRADA LETEFOHO-GLENO\r\n\r\nDili, 26 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nOhin ekipa Juri Tender/191/MOP-2024 ne’ebe kompostu hosi reprezentante hosi Komisaun Nasional Aprovisionamentu (CNA-MPIE)-Hermingardo A. Soares, Project Manager unit (PMU-MOP)-Amilcar da Costa Victor ho Unidade Verifikasaun para pagamentu-Ministeriu Obras Públika (UIVP-MOP)-Tito Edegar hala’o abertura ba presu lisitasaun seksaun Estrada Letefoho-Gleno.\r\n\r\n“ASUNTU: ATUALIZASAUN NO MANUTENSAUN BA SEKSAUN ESTRADA LETEFOHO-GLENO, NÚ: TENDER/191/MOP-2024”\r\n\r\nIX Governu Konstituisional fo enfaze maka’as ba kualifikasaun teknika no presu realistiku ba obra konstrusaun sira hodi asegura katak prestasaun projeitu nian aliña ho padraun kualidade nian, espetativa orsamentu nian no prazu implementasaun nian.','<p><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:\r\nAR-SA\">CNA NO MOP OHIN ABERTURA BA PRESU LISITASAUN NIAN BA PROJEITU\r\nREHABILITASAUN NO MANUTENSAUN ESTRADA LETEFOHO-GLENO</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 26 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ohin ekipa Juri\r\nTender/191/MOP-2024 ne’ebe kompostu hosi reprezentante hosi Komisaun Nasional\r\nAprovisionamentu (CNA-MPIE)-Hermingardo A. Soares, Project Manager unit (PMU-MOP)-Amilcar\r\nda Costa Victor ho Unidade Verifikasaun para pagamentu-Ministeriu Obras Públika\r\n(UIVP-MOP)-Tito Edegar hala’o abertura ba presu lisitasaun seksaun Estrada Letefoho-Gleno.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“ASUNTU: ATUALIZASAUN NO\r\nMANUTENSAUN BA SEKSAUN ESTRADA LETEFOHO-GLENO, NÚ: TENDER/191/MOP-2024”<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">IX Governu\r\nKonstituisional fo enfaze maka’as ba kualifikasaun teknika no presu realistiku ba\r\nobra konstrusaun sira hodi asegura katak prestasaun projeitu nian aliña ho\r\npadraun kualidade nian, espetativa orsamentu nian no prazu implementasaun nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Kompaña sira ne’ebe\r\npartisipa iha etapa ida ne’e maka sira ne’ebe pasa ona ho susesu iha avaliasaun\r\ndokumentu tekniku ho pontuasaun sira ne’ebe maka louvavel, hatudu sira nia\r\nkapasidade teknika no prontidaun atu hala’o projeitu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ekipa Juri Konkursu hetan\r\nonra hosi prezensa Sua Exelensia Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu\r\nEstratejiku (MPIE)-Gastão de Sousa, nia partisipasaun subliña kompromisu Governu\r\nnian ba prosesu aprovisionamentu ne’ebe transparente no responsabiliza.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha loron hirak tuir mai,\r\nEkipa Juri nian sei hala’o verifikasaun klean ida ba proposta finanseira sira\r\nne’ebe hatama hosi lisitante sira ne’ebe kualifikadu, bainhira remata relatoriu\r\navaliasaun final sei submete ba Governu hodi halo revizaun no aprovasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Prosesu ida ne’e reflete\r\nesforsu kontinuadu Governu nian atu tane a’as transparensia, Integridade no\r\nefisiensia iha dezenvolvimentu infraestrutura públika.* <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-07 06:27:38.090583','555d6702c950ecb729a966504af0a635',2,2,'2025-06-26','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-11-1','--5-11-1','cna-no-mop-ohin-abertura-ba-presu-lisitasaun-nian-ba-projeitu-rehabilitasaun-no-manutensaun-estrada-letefoho-gleno-1-1','-','-'),(240,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EDTL,E.P. OFISIALMENTE EXTENDE ENERJIA ELETRIKA BA ORAS 18 IHA ATAÚRO','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EDTL,E.P. OFISIALMENTE EXTENDE ENERJIA ELETRIKA BA ORAS 18 IHA ATAÚRO\r\n\r\nAtaúro, 27 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Tekniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Korporativu, Julio de Jesus Gonçalves no Prezidente Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo ofisialmente extende durasaun enerjia eletrika ba oras 18 iha Ataúro.\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika iha nia intervensaun, hato’o apresiasaun ba estrutura atual EDTL,E.P. inklui funsionariu tekniku sira tanba ho sira nia servisu makaas nune’e ohin ita bele extende tan enerjia eletrisidade iha Ataúro.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO\r\nEDTL,E.P. OFISIALMENTE EXTENDE ENERJIA ELETRIKA BA ORAS 18 IHA ATAÚRO</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ataúro, 27 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públika,\r\nSamuel Marçal akompaña hosi Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Tekniku, Roberto Manuel\r\nMarçal, Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Korporativu, Julio de Jesus Gonçalves no\r\nPrezidente Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo ofisialmente extende\r\ndurasaun enerjia eletrika ba oras 18 iha Ataúro.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públika\r\niha nia intervensaun, hato’o apresiasaun ba estrutura atual EDTL,E.P. inklui\r\nfunsionariu tekniku sira tanba ho sira nia servisu makaas nune’e ohin ita bele\r\nextende tan enerjia eletrisidade iha Ataúro.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Daudaun ne’e ahi eletrisidade\r\niha Ataúro, ita extende ona ba oras 18, kona-ba estrada, hau mai iha ne’e atu\r\nrona preokupasaun komunidade nian ligadu estrada no Bee moos hanesan Ministru\r\nObras Públika no hau prontu atu rona povu Ataúro nia lian hodi nune’e bele\r\ndezenvolve Ataúro sai diak liu hosi hadia infraestrutura públiku sira hanesan Estrada,\r\nBee mos no Eletrisidade.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ataúro daudaun ne’e sai\r\nona fatin Turistiku ida tanba ne’e ita presiza dezenvolve illa Ataúro hodi bele\r\natrai Turista sira hodi mai vizita Ataúro, se estrada, ahi eletrisidade no Bee\r\nmos la iha ema sei la mai vizita Ataúro”,&nbsp;\r\nhateten Ministru Obras Públika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha okaziaun ne’e\r\nMinistru Obras Públika husu mos ba Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro inklui Ataúro\r\noan tomak atu fo rai ida ba EDTL,E.P. hodi bele halo armajen kombustivel tanba\r\ndaudaun ne’e fatin ba rai mina nian la iha ho razaun hirak ne’e ohin produsaun\r\nenerjia eletrika labele funsiona durante oras 24 nia laran.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha oportunidade hanesan\r\nPrezidente Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo hateten lori povu Ataúro\r\nnia naran hato’o agradese wain ba Ministru Obras Públika no EDTL,E.P. ba extensaun\r\neletrisidade, espera ho extensaun ida ne’e sei tulun tebes komunidade Ataúro\r\nhodi hala’o servisu ho negosiu sira, tanba durante ne’e Ataúro asesu enerjia\r\neletrisidade durante oras 14 maibe ho extensaun ida ne’e Ataúro bele asesu oras\r\n18 nia laran.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Entretantu serimonia\r\nextende durasaun enerjia eletrika ba oras 18 ne’e realiza iha salaun enkontru\r\nMPC Ataúro.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Ataúro',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-07 06:30:45.328582','335f5352088d7d9bf74191e006d8e24c',1,2,'2025-06-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-12-1','--5-12-1','ministru-obras-públika-ho-edtl-e-p-ofisialmente-extende-enerjia-eletrika-ba-oras-18-iha-ataúro-1-1','-','-'),(241,'KOMUNIDADE UARO-ANA SUKU BIQUELI KONTENTE MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EDTL,E.P. INAUGURA PROJEITU ELETRIFIKASAUN IHA SIRA NIA ALDEIA','KOMUNIDADE UARO-ANA SUKU BIQUELI KONTENTE MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EDTL,E.P. INAUGURA PROJEITU ELETRIFIKASAUN IHA SIRA NIA ALDEIA\r\n\r\nAtaúro, 27 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal iha Sexta-feira ne’e akompaña hosi Komisariu Ezekutivu  Servisu Tekniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Korporativu, Julio de Jesus Gonçalves, Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo ofisialmente inaugura projeitu eletrifikasaun iha aldeia Uaru-Ana, Suku Biqueli hodi oferese enerjia eletrika ba uma kain hamutuk atus ida lima nulu resin lima (155) liu hosi implementasaun projeitu eletrifikasaun PEN-7.\r\n\r\nIha intervensaun Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal hato’o parabens ba komunidade sira tanba asesu ona enerjia eletrika, daudaun ne’e IX Governu Konstituisional liu hosi MOP-EDTL,E.P. sei nafatin esforsu hodi dada liña eletrisidade ba aldeia sira ne’ebe seidauk asesu eletrisidade, Bee mos no Estrada.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">KOMUNIDADE UARO-ANA SUKU\r\nBIQUELI KONTENTE MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA HO EDTL,E.P. INAUGURA PROJEITU\r\nELETRIFIKASAUN IHA SIRA NIA ALDEIA</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ataúro, 27 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públika,\r\nSamuel Marçal iha Sexta-feira ne’e akompaña hosi Komisariu Ezekutivu&nbsp; Servisu Tekniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisariu\r\nEzekutivu Servisu Korporativu, Julio de Jesus Gonçalves, Autoridade\r\nAdministrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo ofisialmente inaugura projeitu\r\neletrifikasaun iha aldeia Uaru-Ana, Suku Biqueli hodi oferese enerjia eletrika\r\nba uma kain hamutuk atus ida lima nulu resin lima (155) liu hosi implementasaun\r\nprojeitu eletrifikasaun PEN-7.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha intervensaun Ministru\r\nObras Públika, Samuel Marçal hato’o parabens ba komunidade sira tanba asesu ona\r\nenerjia eletrika, daudaun ne’e IX Governu Konstituisional liu hosi\r\nMOP-EDTL,E.P. sei nafatin esforsu hodi dada liña eletrisidade ba aldeia sira ne’ebe\r\nseidauk asesu eletrisidade, Bee mos no Estrada.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Horseik ita halo\r\ninaugurasaun eletrisidade iha Suku Biqueli, aldeia Uaru-Ana ba familia hamutuk\r\natus ida lima nulu resin lima (155), ne’ebe desde tempu Portugeza mai to’o\r\ntempu indonezia no depois ita ukun a’an tinan ruan ulu resin ona sira foin\r\nasesu eletrisidade, tanba ne’e mak horseik hau haree hafoin ita inaugural inan\r\naman ho idozu sira balun tanis no kontenti tanba iha tinan naruk nia laran sira\r\nfoin senti naroman hosi eletrisidade lakan iha sira nia aldeia laran”, hateten Ministru\r\nObras Públika hafoin halo inaugurasaun ba projeitu eletrifikasaun iha aldeia Auro-Ana.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públika\r\nmos informa ba komunidade sira katak dadaun ne’e rasiu eletrifikasaun nasional\r\niha nivel suku atinje ona 100% no ba aldeia sira ne’ebe seidauk asesu\r\neletrisidade Ministeriu Obras Públika liu hosi EDTL,E.P. sei halo esforsu atu\r\niha tinan ida ne’e ka tinan oin mai sei implementa projeitu eletrifikasaun ba\r\naldeia sira ne’ebe seidauk asesu hodi nune’e sira bele asesu enerjia eletrika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha biban ne’e Xefi Suku\r\nBiqueli, Daniel Martins hato’o agradese ba Governu no ba parte hotu ne’ebe\r\nesforsu maka’as, nune’e ohin aldeia Uaru-Ana bele asesu ona enerjia eletrika. Suku\r\nBiqueli iha aldeia hamutuk 4 no aldeia 3 mak daudaun ne’e asesu ona enerjia\r\neletrika hela aldeia ida mak seidauk, maibe daudaun ne’e iha ona prosesu\r\nkonstrusaun nia laran, espera iha tempu badak bele asesu ona enerjia eletrika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Implementasaun projeitu\r\neletrifikasaun iha aldeia Uaru-Ana no Bairo Akrema, Suku Biqueli Ataúro ho\r\ndistansia liña MT 5,3kms, BT 6,2kms transformador 50kVA unidade 1 no benifisia\r\nkomunidade hamutuk&nbsp; uma-kain 155 obra\r\nrefere implementa hosi kompaña Irmaun, Unip,Lda.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Ataúro',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-07 06:44:19.192509','f340f1b1f65b6df5b5e3f94d95b11daf',2,2,'2025-06-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-13-1','--5-13-1','komunidade-uaro-ana-suku-biqueli-kontente-ministru-obras-públika-ho-edtl-e-p-inaugura-projeitu-eletrifikasaun-iha-sira-nia-aldeia-1-1','-','-'),(242,'MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA PARTISIPA IHA ABERTURA FESTIVAL KULTURA IHA SUKU MAKILI ATAÚRO','MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA PARTISIPA IHA ABERTURA FESTIVAL KULTURA IHA SUKU MAKILI ATAÚRO\r\n\r\nAtaúro, 27 Juñu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal iha Sexta-feira ne’e akompaña hosi Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Tekniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Korporativu, Julio de Jesus Gonçalves, Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo partisipa iha festival São Pedro nu’udar festa kultural Relijioza ne’ebe eziste iha Suku Makili.\r\n\r\nFesta Kultural São Pedro ne’e selebra kada tinan ho nia atividade serimonia kultural ba peskador sira, feira no misa eukaristia, envolve komunidade no turista sira ba fins ekonomia, sosial no kultural.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA\r\nPARTISIPA IHA ABERTURA FESTIVAL KULTURA IHA SUKU MAKILI ATAÚRO</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ataúro, 27 Juñu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públika,\r\nSamuel Marçal iha Sexta-feira ne’e akompaña hosi Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu\r\nTekniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisariu Ezekutivu Servisu Korporativu, Julio\r\nde Jesus Gonçalves, Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo partisipa iha\r\nfestival São Pedro nu’udar festa kultural Relijioza ne’ebe eziste iha Suku\r\nMakili.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Festa Kultural São Pedro\r\nne’e selebra kada tinan ho nia atividade serimonia kultural ba peskador sira, feira\r\nno misa eukaristia, envolve komunidade no turista sira ba fins ekonomia, sosial\r\nno kultural.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Festival Kultural ne’e\r\nloke direita hosi Prezidente Autoridade Administrativa Ataúro, Mateus Belo no\r\npartisipa hosi entidade relevante sira.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Antes atu fila Ministru\r\nObras Públika ho kominitiva la haluha sosa mos produtu lokal hanesan artezatu,\r\nnuu kaku’uk halo sai ba sikra, pasta ho xapeo ne’ebe homan hosi akadiru tahan.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Ataúro',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-07 06:46:46.824414','e4a6222cdb5b34375400904f03d8e6a5',1,2,'2025-06-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-14-1','--5-14-1','ministeriu-obras-públika-partisipa-iha-abertura-festival-kultura-iha-suku-makili-ataúro-1-1','-','-'),(243,'PM XANANA AKOMPAÑA DIREITA PROSESU MONTAJEN KULUHUN','PM XANANA AKOMPAÑA DIREITA PROSESU MONTAJEN KULUHUN\r\n\r\nDili, 06 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompaña direita prosesu montajen (cor) ponte Kuluhun hosi kompaña responsavel BTK roup, Dominu ne’e.\r\n\r\nPrimeiru Ministru akompaña prosesu montajen ne’e, hahu kedan hosi tuku 7:00 dader to’o finaliza iha tuku 15:00 lorokraik.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA AKOMPAÑA\r\nDIREITA PROSESU MONTAJEN KULUHUN</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 06 Jullu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompaña\r\ndireita prosesu montajen (cor) ponte Kuluhun hosi kompaña responsavel BTK roup,\r\nDominu ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru Ministru akompaña prosesu montajen ne’e, hahu\r\nkedan hosi tuku 7:00 dader to’o finaliza iha tuku 15:00 lorokraik.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Durante iha terenu, Primeiru Ministru akompaña hosi\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no\r\nOranizasaun Urbana (SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites Dias no tekniku sira hosi\r\nMinisteriu Obras Públika (MOP).*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-10 05:28:32.906534','cb70ab375662576bd1ac5aaf16b3fca4',2,2,'2025-07-06','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-15-1','--5-15-1','pm-xanana-akompaña-direita-prosesu-montajen-kuluhun-1-1','-','-'),(244,'PM XANANA OBSERVA PROGRESU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA SURIKMAS, HUDI-LARAN NO AI-MUTIN','PM XANANA OBSERVA PROGRESU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA SURIKMAS, HUDI-LARAN NO AI-MUTIN\r\n\r\nDili, 06 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o observasaun ba progressu konstrusaun Estrada hahu hosi Hudi-Laran tun to’o Fatuhada area edifisiu kuartel Jeneral FALINTIL Forsa Defeza Timor Leste (F-FDTL) nia sorin, parte Osindo-Surikmas no mos Ai-Mutin, Domingu ne’e.\r\n\r\nDurante hala’o observasaun, Xefe Governu fo hanoin nafatin ba tekniku sira atu akompaña no monitoriza nafatin iha terenu, nune’e mantein kualidade obra.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA OBSERVA\r\nPROGRESU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA SURIKMAS, HUDI-LARAN NO AI-MUTIN</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 06 Jullu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o\r\nobservasaun ba progressu konstrusaun Estrada hahu hosi Hudi-Laran tun to’o\r\nFatuhada area edifisiu kuartel Jeneral FALINTIL Forsa Defeza Timor Leste\r\n(F-FDTL) nia sorin, parte Osindo-Surikmas no mos Ai-Mutin, Domingu ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Durante hala’o observasaun, Xefe Governu fo hanoin\r\nnafatin ba tekniku sira atu akompaña no monitoriza nafatin iha terenu, nune’e\r\nmantein kualidade obra.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">No kontinua monitoriza rehabilitasaun Estrada iha area\r\nHudi-Laran, Bairo Pite.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Observasaun ne’e, Xefe Governu akompaña hosi Ministru\r\nObras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no Oranizasaun\r\nUrbana (SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites Dias no tekniku sira hosi Ministeriu\r\nObras Públika (MOP).*</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Mídia MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-10 05:32:25.057494','9188905e74c28e489b44e954ec0b9bca',2,2,'2025-07-06','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-16-1','--5-16-1','pm-xanana-observa-progresu-konstrusaun-estrada-iha-surikmas-hudi-laran-no-ai-mutin-1-1','-','-'),(245,'PM XANANA OBSERVA PROGRESSU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA BEBONUK','PM XANANA OBSERVA PROGRESSU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA IHA BEBONUK\r\n\r\nDili, 06 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o observasaun ba progressu alargamentu no konstrusaun Estrada iha area Bebonuk, Domingo ne’e.\r\n\r\nXefe Suku Bebonuk, Alfredo da Costa Simu Primeiru Ministru no agradese tanba IX Governu Konstituisional loke Estrada no halo luan, oras ne’e fui tan ona alkatraun iha Bairu sira.\r\n\r\nTuir Xefe Suku ne’e katak komunidade kontente ho obra hosi IX Governu Konstituisional nian tanba komunidade ninia hakarak maki da ne’e duni, laiha buat seluk.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA OBSERVA PROGRESSU KONSTRUSAUN\r\nESTRADA IHA BEBONUK</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 06 Jullu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o\r\nobservasaun ba progressu alargamentu no konstrusaun Estrada iha area Bebonuk,\r\nDomingo ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Xefe Suku Bebonuk, Alfredo da Costa Simu Primeiru\r\nMinistru no agradese tanba IX Governu Konstituisional loke Estrada no halo\r\nluan, oras ne’e fui tan ona alkatraun iha Bairu sira.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Tuir Xefe Suku ne’e katak komunidade kontente ho obra\r\nhosi IX Governu Konstituisional nian tanba komunidade ninia hakarak maki da\r\nne’e duni, laiha buat seluk.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Durante observasaun ne’e Xefe Governu akompaña hosi\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no\r\nOranizasaun Urbana (SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites Dias no tekniku sira hosi\r\nMinisteriu Obras Públika (MOP).*<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-10 05:35:38.031156','0266e33d3f546cb5436a10798e657d97',2,2,'2025-07-06','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-17-1','--5-17-1','pm-xanana-observa-progressu-konstrusaun-estrada-iha-bebonuk-1-1','-','-'),(246,'PM XANANA OBSERVA KONSTRUSAUN DOUBLE BOX IHA BETUDAK FATISI','PM XANANA OBSERVA KONSTRUSAUN DOUBLE BOX IHA BETUDAK FATISI\r\n\r\nAileu, 06 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompaña hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no Oranizasaun Urbana (SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites Dias halo observasaun ba konstrusaun ponte Betudak iha area Fatisi, Munisipiu Aileu ne’ebe konstrui hosi kompaña Arquiris Unip.Lda, Domingo ne’e.\r\n\r\nDurante observasaun, Primeiru Ministru IX Governu Konstituisional ho ekipa akompaña hosi ekipa tekniku sira hosi Ministeriu Obras Públika (MOP).*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA OBSERVA KONSTRUSAUN DOUBLE BOX\r\nIHA BETUDAK FATISI</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Aileu, 06 Jullu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompaña\r\nhosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia\r\nno Oranizasaun Urbana (SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites Dias halo observasaun ba\r\nkonstrusaun ponte Betudak iha area Fatisi, Munisipiu Aileu ne’ebe konstrui hosi\r\nkompaña Arquiris Unip.Lda, Domingo ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Durante observasaun, Primeiru Ministru IX Governu\r\nKonstituisional ho ekipa akompaña hosi ekipa tekniku sira hosi Ministeriu Obras\r\nPúblika (MOP).*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Aileu',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-10 05:38:21.288614','38db3aed920cf82ab059bfccbd02be6a',2,2,'2025-07-06','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-18-1','--5-18-1','pm-xanana-observa-konstrusaun-double-box-iha-betudak-fatisi-1-1','-','-'),(247,'MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA REALIZA ENKONTRU AVALIASAUN RELATORIU EZEKUSAUN II TRIMESTRE OJE 2025 NO PREPARASAUN PAKOTE FISKAL OJE 2026','MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA REALIZA ENKONTRU AVALIASAUN RELATORIU EZEKUSAUN II TRIMESTRE OJE 2025 NO PREPARASAUN PAKOTE FISKAL OJE 2026\r\n\r\nDili, 07 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi Diretor Geral Administrasaun no Finansas, João Amaral hahu deskute preparasaun pakote fiscal Orsamentu Jeral Estadu (OJE) 2026, Ministeriu Obras Públika nian inklui halo mos avaliasaun relatoriu ezekusaun II trimester OJE 2025, iha salaun Delta Nova, Segunda-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA\r\nREALIZA ENKONTRU AVALIASAUN RELATORIU EZEKUSAUN II TRIMESTRE OJE 2025 NO\r\nPREPARASAUN PAKOTE FISKAL OJE 2026</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 07 Jullu 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi\r\nDiretor Geral Administrasaun no Finansas, João Amaral hahu deskute preparasaun\r\npakote fiscal Orsamentu Jeral Estadu (OJE) 2026, Ministeriu Obras Públika nian\r\ninklui halo mos avaliasaun relatoriu ezekusaun II trimester OJE 2025, iha\r\nsalaun Delta Nova, Segunda-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Partisipa iha enkontru ne’e Diretor Jeral, Diretor\r\nNasional, Kargu Xefia sira, reprezentante Xefe Gabinete Vise-Ministru\r\nInfraestrutura, Sekretariu Estadu Eletrisidade Bee no Saneamentu, Prezidente\r\nEzekutivu EDTL,E.P., Prezidente IGE-ADI,I.P. ho\r\nfunsionariu MOP.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Mídia MOP</span><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></b></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-10 05:40:55.025525','3cec07e9ba5f5bb252d13f5f431e4bbb',1,2,'2025-07-07','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-19-1-1','--5-19-1-1','ministeriu-obras-públika-realiza-enkontru-avaliasaun-relatoriu-ezekusaun-ii-trimestre-oje-2025-no-preparasaun-pakote-fiskal-oje-2026-1-1-1','-','-'),(248,'HAFOIN FINALIZA DISKUSAUN SISTEMA ELETRONIKA, FULAN AGOSTU MOP HAHU IMPLEMENTA','HAFOIN FINALIZA DISKUSAUN SISTEMA ELETRONIKA, FULAN AGOSTU MOP HAHU IMPLEMENTA\r\n\r\nDili, 08 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nHafoin simu orientasaun hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Assesor Rekursu Humanu Ministeriu Obras Públika, Tomas Magno do Carmo akompaña hosi Diretora Rekursu Humanu MOP, Faustina Brites hala’o enkontru ho Diretor Geral, Diretor Nasional no Kargu Xefia sira hodi koalia kona-ba Sistema eletronik mak hanesan Baze de Dados, GIS E-mail system, Absence electronic system hodi dezenvolve Sistema rekursu umanu iha MOP.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">HAFOIN FINALIZA DISKUSAUN\r\nSISTEMA ELETRONIKA, FULAN AGOSTU MOP HAHU IMPLEMENTA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Dili, 08 Jullu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hafoin\r\nsimu orientasaun hosi Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal, Assesor Rekursu Humanu\r\nMinisteriu Obras Públika, Tomas Magno do Carmo akompaña hosi Diretora Rekursu\r\nHumanu MOP, Faustina Brites hala’o enkontru ho Diretor Geral, Diretor Nasional\r\nno Kargu Xefia sira hodi koalia kona-ba Sistema eletronik mak hanesan Baze de\r\nDados, GIS E-mail system, Absence electronic system hodi dezenvolve Sistema\r\nrekursu umanu iha MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Enkontru\r\nne’e rasik realiza iha sala reuniaun Ministeriu Obras Públika, Caicoli,\r\nTersa-feira ne’e hetan partisipasaun hosi Diretor Geral, Diretor Nasional,\r\nKargu Xefia no Funsionariu MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha\r\nenkontru ne’e Assesor Rekursu Humanu Ministeriu Obras Públika husu ba Diretor\r\nGeral, Diretor Nasional, Kargu Xefia no Funsionariu MOP hotu-hotu atu apoiu\r\nhodi bele realiza no estabelese Sistema baze de dados, GIS E-mail system,\r\nabsence Electronic System hodi dezenvolve Sistema Rekursu Humanu iha MOP. Tuir\r\nplanu sei lansa iha fulan Agustu tinan ne’e.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mídia MOP</span></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-07-10 05:43:30.118425','621bf66ddb7c962aa0d22ac97d69b793',1,2,'2025-07-08','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--5-20-1-1','--5-20-1-1','hafoin-finaliza-diskusaun-electronik-system-fulan-agostu-mop-hahu-implementa-1-1-1','--','-'),(249,'PM XANANA HO MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA INAUGURA PROJEITU KANALIZASAUN BEE MOOS IHA FOHOREM','PM XANANA HO MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKA INAUGURA PROJEITU KANALIZASAUN BEE MOOS IHA FOHOREM\r\n\r\nCovalima, 10 Jullu 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão ho Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi Sekretariu Estadu Dezenvolvimentu Lokal, Mateus dos Santos Tallo, Sekretariu Estadu Asuntus Toponímia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias, Deputadu CNRT, Saul Salvador H. J., Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutivu BTL,E.P., Gustavo da Cruz ho nia komitiva inaugura projeitu Melhoramentu Sistema Bee Moos ba komunidade iha Suku Fohorem, Postu Administrativu Fohorem, Munisipiu Covalima, Kinta-feira ne’e.\r\n\r\nAntes tama ba serimonia inaugurasaun Bee moos lia nain sira hosi Suku Fohorem, simu Primeiru Ministru ho lia dadolin tuir kultura Fohorem, Munisipiu Covalima. Hafoin simu ho lia dadolin, PM Xanana kontinua presta homenajen hodi tau ai-funan no sunu lilin iha rate matebian Alferis Ricardo ne’ebe mate iha 1975.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA HO MINISTRU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKA INAUGURA PROJEITU KANALIZASAUN BEE MOOS IHA FOHOREM</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Covalima, 10 Jullu 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p><br></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru, Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão ho Ministru Obras Públika, Samuel Marçal akompaña hosi\r\nSekretariu Estadu Dezenvolvimentu Lokal, Mateus dos Santos Tallo, Sekretariu\r\nEstadu Asuntus Toponímia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias,\r\nDeputadu CNRT, Saul Salvador H. J., Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutivu BTL,E.P.,\r\nGustavo da Cruz ho nia komitiva inaugura projeitu Melhoramentu Sistema Bee Moos\r\nba komunidade iha Suku Fohorem, Postu Administrativu Fohorem, Munisipiu\r\nCovalima, Kinta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Antes tama ba serimonia\r\ninaugurasaun Bee moos lia nain sira hosi Suku Fohorem, simu Primeiru Ministru\r\nho lia dadolin tuir kultura Fohorem, Munisipiu Covalima. Hafoin simu ho lia\r\ndadolin, PM Xanana kontinua presta homenajen hodi tau ai-funan no sunu lilin\r\niha rate matebian Alferis Ricardo ne’ebe mate iha 1975.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Ohin ita inaugura tiha\r\nfornesimentu Bee-moos hanesan parte ida ami lori ona no responde imi nia\r\nhalerik sira”, Xefe Governu hato’o kestaun ne’e iha serimonia inaugurasaun\r\nfornesimentu Bee-moos iha postu Fohorem.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha biban ne’e\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão kontinua rona mos preokupasaun\r\nkomunidade sira ne’ebe mak administrador postu Fohorem aprezenta konaba\r\ninfraestrutura bazika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Durante prezensa,\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão iha postu administrativu Fohorem,\r\nPrezidente Autoridade Munisipiu Covalima ho nia estrutura hamutuk ho komunidade\r\nsira simu ho entusiazmu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha intervensaun Ministru\r\nObras Públika, Samuel Marçal haktuir hafoin simu posse iha loron 01 Jullu 2023,\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru IX Governu Konstituisional fo orientasaun hodi tau atensaun\r\nba infraestrutura sira iha teritoriu Timor laran.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Hafoin hau simu tiha\r\nposse Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão bolu hau hodi fo orientasaun,\r\natu tau atensaun ba infraestrutura sira iha area rural, konaba Estrada ita sei\r\npreve orsamentu iha OJE 2026 hodi implementa iha tinan oin”, hateten Ministru\r\nObras Públika.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Iha fatin hanesan,\r\nPrezidente Konsellu Administrasaun BTL,E.P., Gustavo da Cruz informa projeitu\r\nmelloramentu Sistema Bee moos hodi fornese ba komunidade Fohorem ne’e fahe ba\r\npakote II kanalizasaun no instalasaun ba tanke rezervatoriu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">“Projeitu kanalizasaun no\r\ninstalasaun tanke ita gasta osan rihun $700-resin bele fornese Bee-moos ba\r\numa-kain 200-resin ho total populasaun 2000-resin iha postu Administrativuu\r\nFohorem, Munisipiu Covalima,” hateten Prezidente Konsellu Administrasaun\r\nBTL,E.P.. Entretantu prosesu implementasaun projeitu melloramentu Sistema Bee\r\nmoos iha Fohorem, realiza durante fulan neen (6), maibe kestaun klima nune’e\r\nprojeitu ne’e remata tarde uitoan, nune’e foin mak halo inaugurasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Governu kompromitivu baze\r\nba Planu Estratejiku Dezenvolvimentu Nasional iha kapital postu Administrativu\r\n51 ne’ebe iha prioridade no iha faze implementasaun projeitu iha kapital\r\nmunisipiu sira ne’ebe finaliza ona iha postu administrativu hitu no daudaun\r\nne’e finaliza ona hein faze inaugurasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Projeitu Melloramentu\r\nSistema Bee-moos iha postu Administrasaun (PA) Fohorem, Munisipiu Covalima.\r\nProjeitu ne’e fahe ba pakote rua : konstrusaun Sistema kanalizasaun Bee moos\r\nimplementa hosi kompaña Roman Junior Unip,Lda ho montante kontratu US$\r\n449,563.69. Fornesimentu no instalasaun tanki rezervatoriu (liner tanks) –\r\nimplementa hosi kompaña Azra Unip,Lda ho montante kontratu US$ 71,517.1.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:42.9pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Tanki\r\nRezervatoriu 26</span><!--[if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMath><m:sSup><m:sSupPr><span\r\n   style=\'font-size:14.0pt;mso-ansi-font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:14.0pt;\r\n   font-family:\"Cambria Math\",serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\"Cambria Math\";\r\n   mso-hansi-font-family:\"Cambria Math\";mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:sSupPr><m:e><i\r\n   style=\'mso-bidi-font-style:normal\'><span style=\'font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n   115%