n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-04 08:29:38.471011','5737c6ec2e0716f3d8a7a5c4e0de0d9a',1,2,'2025-10-21','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--29-2','--29-2','ministru-obras-públika-hamutuk-ho-vise-ministru-asuntu-infraestrutura-halao-enkontru-ho-kámara-komersiu-no-industria-timor-leste-1-1','-','-'),(323,'MOP HO INSTITUISAUN TUTELADA AUDENSIA HO PARLAMENTU NASIONAL KOMISAUN C SOBRE EZEKUSAUN OJE 2025 SEGUNDU TRIMESTRE','MOP HO INSTITUISAUN TUTELADA AUDENSIA HO PARLAMENTU NASIONAL KOMISAUN C SOBRE EZEKUSAUN OJE 2025 SEGUNDU TRIMESTRE\r\n\r\nDili, 22 Outubru 2025\r\n\r\nMinistériu Obras Públikas ho institusaun tutela sira ohin audénsia ho Komisaun C Parlamentu Nasionál. Objetivu husi audensia ho Komisaun C PN atu diskuti konaba progreso ezekusaun Orsamentu Jerál Estado Segundu Trimestre tinan 2025, iha sala plenária do Parlamento Nacional.\r\nEntretantu audensia ne\'e rasik lidera direta hosi Presidenti Komisaun Finansas Públikas, Deputada Cedelizia Faria dos Santos no partisipa iha audição refere, Ministru Obras Públicas nia representante ho instituisaun tutela, Ministro dos Transportes e Comunicações, Miguel Marques Gonçalves Manetelu, Ministro Planeamento Estratégico, Gastão de Souza inklui Diretores Gerais.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MOP HO INSTITUISAUN TUTELADA\r\nAUDENSIA HO PARLAMENTU NASIONAL KOMISAUN C SOBRE EZEKUSAUN OJE 2025 SEGUNDU\r\nTRIMESTRE<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 22 Outubru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministériu Obras Públikas ho\r\ninstitusaun tutela sira ohin audénsia ho Komisaun C Parlamentu Nasionál.\r\nObjetivu husi audensia ho Komisaun C PN atu diskuti konaba progreso ezekusaun\r\nOrsamentu Jerál Estado Segundu Trimestre tinan 2025, iha sala plenária do\r\nParlamento Nacional.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu audensia ne\'e\r\nrasik lidera direta hosi Presidenti Komisaun Finansas Públikas, Deputada\r\nCedelizia Faria dos Santos no partisipa iha audição refere, Ministru Obras\r\nPúblicas nia representante ho instituisaun tutela, Ministro dos Transportes e\r\nComunicações, Miguel Marques Gonçalves Manetelu, Ministro Planeamento\r\nEstratégico, Gastão de Souza inklui Diretores Gerais.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-04 08:31:01.368985','bc6dc48b743dc5d013b1abaebd2faed2',3,2,'2025-10-22','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--31-1','--31-1','mop-ho-instituisaun-tutelada-audensia-ho-parlamentu-nasional-komisaun-c-sobre-ezekusaun-oje-2025-segundu-trimestre-1','-','-'),(324,'MOP-UNDP HO EMBAIXADOR JAPAUN INAUGURA SISTEMA SOLAR PAINEL SOLAR IHA INSTITUTU NASIÓNAL FARMASIA NO PRODUTU MÉDIKU INKLUI SENTRU SAÚDE BOBE NO SENTRU SAÚDE HATU-CONAN','MOP-UNDP HO EMBAIXADOR JAPAUN INAUGURA SISTEMA SOLAR PAINEL SOLAR IHA INSTITUTU NASIÓNAL FARMASIA NO PRODUTU MÉDIKU INKLUI SENTRU SAÚDE BOBE NO SENTRU SAÚDE HATU-CONAN\r\n\r\nDili, 23 Outubru 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Katyna Argueta ho Embaixador Japaun mai Timor Leste, Kimura Tetsuya ho Diretora Ezekutivu Institutu Nasionál Farmásia no Produtos Médiku (INFPM), Paulina Mendonça Maher ofisialmente inagura sistema solar painél solár iha Institutu Nasionál Farmásia no Produtu Médiku (INFPM), Sentru Saúde Bobe no Sentru Saúde Hatu-Conan.\r\n\r\nAtividade ne’e realiza iha edefisiu sentral Institutu Nasionál Farmásia no Produtu Médiku (INFPM), aldeia Mahon, suku Kampung Alor, kinta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MOP-UNDP HO EMBAIXADOR\r\nJAPAUN INAUGURA SISTEMA SOLAR PAINEL SOLAR IHA INSTITUTU NASI</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ó</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">NAL\r\nFARMASIA NO PRODUTU M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin\">É</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">DIKU INKLUI SENTRU SA</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">DE\r\nBOBE NO SENTRU SA</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">DE HATU-CONAN<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 23 Outubru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Ministru\r\nObras Públikas, Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Katyna Argueta ho Embaixador\r\nJapaun mai Timor Leste, Kimura Tetsuya ho Diretora Ezekutivu Institutu Nasionál\r\nFarmásia no Produtos Médiku (INFPM), Paulina Mendonça Maher ofisialmente\r\ninagura sistema solar painél solár iha Institutu Nasionál Farmásia no Produtu\r\nMédiku (INFPM), Sentru Saúde Bobe no Sentru Saúde Hatu-Conan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Atividade\r\nne’e realiza iha edefisiu sentral Institutu Nasionál Farmásia no Produtu Médiku\r\n(INFPM), aldeia Mahon, suku Kampung Alor, kinta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Entretantu\r\natividade ne’e bainhira realiza Governu halo parseria ho Programa Nasoins\r\nUnidas ba Dezenvolvimentu (PNUD) no hetan apoiu finanseiru husi Governu Japaun,\r\nhodi instala sistema enerjia solár panel ba iha Institutu Nasionál Farmásia no\r\nProdutus Médikus (INFPM) inklui mós Sentru Saúde Bobe no Sentru Saúde\r\nHatu-Conan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Inisiativa\r\nida-ne’e halo parte iha projetu “Promosaun ba Transformasaun Verde iha Rejiaun\r\nPasífiku kona-ba Dezenvolvimentu Zero Líkidu no Reziliente Klimátiku, ne’ebé ho\r\nobjetivu atu promove enerjia renovaveis hodi hasa’e reziliénsia klimátika iha\r\nTimor-Leste no país illa ki’ik sira seluk.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Projetu\r\nne’e finansia husi Governu Japaun, ne’ebé lansa iha tinan 2023 no ho objetivu\r\natu transforma INFPM ba ezemplu ida husi sustentabilidade enerjétika, liuhusi\r\ninstalasaun painél solár ne’ebé sei garante fornesimentu enerjia ida kontínua\r\nno estavel. Fornesimentu ida-ne’e importante tebes atu konserva ho adekuadu\r\nmedikamentus, vasinas no produtu saúde nian sira seluk ne’ebé esensiál, atu\r\nnune’e bele garante ninia manutensaun ba temperatura ne’ebé seguru. Aleinde\r\nasegura estabilidade fornesimentu elétriku, sistema enerjia solár sei permite\r\natu hamenus kustu operasionál ne’ebé boot no pegada karbonu instituisaun nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Partisipa\r\niha seremónia inaugurasaun ne’e Xefe Gabineti Ministru Obras Públikas, Cristovão\r\nFausto Guterres, reprezentante Ministra Saude inklui funsionariu INFPM.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-04 08:33:17.867987','f2fc990265c712c49d51a18a32b39f0c',2,2,'2025-10-23','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--32-1','--32-1','mop-undp-ho-embaixador-japaun-inaugura-sistema-solar-painel-solar-iha-institutu-nasiónal-farmasia-no-produtu-médiku-inklui-sentru-saúde-bobe-no-sentru-saúde-hatu-conan-1','-','-'),(325,'PM XANANA VIZITA BA MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS','PM XANANA VIZITA BA MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS\r\n\r\nDili, 23 Outubru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o vizita supreza bá Ministériu Obras Públikus (MOP), iha Kaicoli, kinta-feira.\r\nObjetivu vizita ne’e hodi haree rasik servisu sira ne’ebé funsionáriu liu-liu parte tékniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun ba Pagamentu (UIVP-MOP) hodi atualiza progresu infraestrutura ne’ebé implementa iha Timor-Leste.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA VIZITA BA MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n23 Outubru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Primeiru-Ministru\r\n(PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hala’o vizita supreza bá Ministériu Obras Públikus\r\n(MOP), iha Kaicoli, kinta-feira.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Objetivu\r\nvizita ne’e hodi haree rasik servisu sira ne’ebé funsionáriu liu-liu parte\r\ntékniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun ba Pagamentu (UIVP-MOP) hodi atualiza\r\nprogresu infraestrutura ne’ebé implementa iha Timor-Leste.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\nvizita ne’e, Xefe Governu rona direta aprezentasaun hosi Ministru Obras\r\nPùblika, Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Koordenador Jeral UIVP-MOP, Aleixo Amaral\r\ndo Carmo no Xefe Seksaun Unidade Ponte no Estrada no Koordenador UGPRR, Tito\r\nEdgas de Fatima de Jesus hodi introdus mos programa implementasaun projetu sira\r\niha Timor-Leste.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Hafoin\r\nenkontru, Xefe Governu hala’o vizita tama sai servisu fatin kada diresaun hodi\r\nkonversa ho funsionáriu&nbsp; hodi fó\r\nmotiviasaun ba servisu ne’ebé sira hala’o iha MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\noportunidade ne’e, funsionáriu agradese hodi uza oportunidade murak ne’e hasai\r\nfotografia hamutuk nu’udar momentu importante ida.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-04 08:34:43.596028','89f0fd5c927d466d6ec9a21b9ac34ffa',1,2,'2025-10-23','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--33-1','--33-1','pm-xanana-vizita-ba-ministeriu-obras-públikas-1','-','-'),(326,'PM XANANA OFISIALMENTE LANSA PROJETU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HOSI LAUTEM BA SUKU COM','PM XANANA OFISIALMENTE LANSA PROJETU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HOSI LAUTEM BA SUKU COM\r\n\r\nLautem, 30 Outubru 2025\r\n\r\nNonu (IX) Governu Konstituisionál ne’ebé lideradu husi atual Primeiru Ministru (PM) akompañia husi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal no Membru sira seluk ofisialmente lansa projetu rehabilitasaun estrada husi Posto Administrativu Lautem bá Suku Com, Munisipiu Lautem.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA OFISIALMENTE LANSA PROJETU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HOSI LAUTEM BA SUKU\r\nCOM<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Lautem,\r\n30 Outubru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Nonu\r\n(IX) Governu Konstituisionál ne’ebé lideradu husi atual Primeiru Ministru (PM)\r\nakompañia husi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal no Membru sira seluk\r\nofisialmente lansa projetu rehabilitasaun estrada husi Posto Administrativu\r\nLautem bá Suku Com, Munisipiu Lautem.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\nnia intervensaun Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, suntu\r\ninfraestrutura ne\'e pertinente tebes iha programa nonu governu konstituisionál\r\nne’ebé Planeamentu Estratéjiku Dezemvolvimentu Nasionál (PEDN) 2011 to\'o 2030,\r\nne\'ebé define katak infraestrutura bázika mak sai hanesan baze ba\r\ndezenvolvimentu ne\'ebé klasifika tiha ona estrada nasionais, rejionais, lokais\r\nno estrada rurais.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\"Ohin\r\nha\'u mai iha ne\'e liuliu imi komunidade sira hodi asiste asinatura kontratu\r\nentre Governu ho kompania atu hadia estrada ba imi komunidade sira, tamba iha\r\nfatin balun sempre iha indemnizasaun no lakoi fo fatin atu hadia estrada\",\r\nXefe Governu ne\'e afirma iha ninia diskurus ne\'ebé realiza iha suku Com, Munisípiu\r\nLautem.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Xefe\r\nGovernu dehan, kontente tebes tanba atividade ohin Governante sira balun mai\r\npartisipa iha seremónia ne’e i kontente tebes haree ferik katuas sira marka mós\r\nprezensa iha ne\'e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Entretantu\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal hatete iha okaziaun ida ne\'e nia hato\'o\r\nagradese wai’in bá ekipa ne\'ebé servisu hamutuk hodi realiza obra ida ne\'e bele\r\nla\'o.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\"Kuazé\r\nita hotu ninia servisu maka\'as durante tinan ida to\'o ohin loron ita konsege\r\nrealiza projeitu reabilitasaun estrada ne’e. Tanba ne’e hau husu bá ita hotu\r\nnia kolaborasaun, atu nune’e obra ida ne\'ebé ita lansa, bele konklui tuir\r\nkontratu ne\'ebé iha, tanba osan ne\'e povu nian, husu ba ita hotu-hotu atu tau\r\nmatan no fó apoiu atu labele halo impedimentu”, hatete Ministru Obras Públikas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\nfatin hanesan, Prezidente Autoridade Munisípiu Lautem, Mélio de Jesus hateten\r\nhanesan ita hotu hatene durante tinan barak nia laran komunidade Munisípiu\r\nLautem infrenta difikuldade iha setór infraestrutura bázika, hanesan iha\r\nLospalos ba Lautem no Lautem ba Com, nu\'udar loron importante tebes ita hotu\r\nhalibur iha ftin ida ne\'e atu marka signifikante iha istória dezenvolvimentu Lautem\r\nnian maka lansamentu ofisiál ba projetu reabilitasaun estrada diresaun Lautem\r\nba Com.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">“Tanba\r\nne’e aproveita oportunidade ida ne’e, reprezenta komunidade Munisípiu Lautém\r\nhakarak hatoo Obrigadu wain ba “Kaka-Lafai” Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão nia esforsu\r\ntomak ne’ebe lahatene kolen, sempre hadomi nia Povu no ohin loron sei kontinua\r\nluta ba prospriedade povu Timor-Leste iha rai laran no mós iha nivel\r\nInternasionál.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PAM\r\nLautem haktuir lansamentu projetu ida ne\'e nu\'udar resposta konkretu ba\r\npreokupasaun no ejijénsia komunidade sira-nia, maibé agora di\'ak ona ba sira\r\natu halo movimentu hodi lori sira-nia produtu ba faan.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Projetu\r\nreabilitasaun estrada diresaun ida ne\'e kuazé kilometru 19.760 no sei\r\nimplementa husi kompania internasionál Shananxi Construction Engineering Group\r\ndurante tinan ida ho balun ho montante $11,213,813.90.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Enkuantu\r\niha atividade lansamentu ne\'e partisipa husi entidades Governu, Autoridade Lokál,\r\nAutoridade seguransa PNTL, parséria dezenvolvimentu no komunidade sira.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Lautem',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-04 08:36:31.504116','a666587afda6e89aec274a3657558a27',2,2,'2025-10-30','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--34-1','--34-1','pm-xanana-ofisialmente-lansa-projetu-rehabilitasaun-estrada-hosi-lautem-ba-suku-com-1','-','-'),(327,'PM XANANA KONTINUA HATUUR FATUK DAHULUK BA ESTRADA LAUTEM BA LOSPALOS NO PROJEITU MELHORAMENTU NO FORNESIMENTU BEE MOOS IHA LOSPALOS VILA','PM XANANA KONTINUA HATUUR FATUK DAHULUK BA ESTRADA LAUTEM BA LOSPALOS NO PROJEITU MELHORAMENTU NO FORNESIMENTU BEE MOOS IHA LOSPALOS VILA\r\n\r\nLautem, 31 Outubru 2025\r\n\r\nNonu Governu Konstituisionál Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompania hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, kontinua hatur fatuk dahuluk bá projetu reabilitasaun estrada Lautém ba Lospalos ho kilometru 27.980 no projeitu melloramentu no fornesimentu bee moos iha munisípiu Lautein, postu-administrativu Lospalos, sesta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA KONTINUA HATUUR FATUK DAHULUK BA ESTRADA LAUTEM BA LOSPALOS NO PROJEITU\r\nMELHORAMENTU NO FORNESIMENTU BEE MOOS IHA LOSPALOS VILA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Lautem,\r\n31 Outubru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Nonu\r\nGovernu Konstituisionál Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompania hosi\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, kontinua hatur fatuk dahuluk bá projetu\r\nreabilitasaun estrada Lautém ba Lospalos ho kilometru 27.980 no projeitu\r\nmelloramentu no fornesimentu bee moos iha munisípiu Lautein,\r\npostu-administrativu Lospalos, sesta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\noportunidade ne\'e Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, hateten, ohin\r\nmarka istoria foun hadi mai asisti hamutuk asina akordu entre Governu ho\r\nkompania rua, kona-ba projeitu reabilitasaun estrada no instalasaun bee moos.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">“Ohin\r\nita hotu mai hamutuk iha ne\'e hodi haree hamutuk asina akordu entre Governu ho\r\nkompania rua, ida kona-ba estrada no ida kona-ba bee moos. Hanesan ohin temi\r\ntiha ona infraestrutura bázika mak sai fundasi ba dezenvolvimentu hanesan\r\nestrada, bee, ponte, eletrisidade, entaun bainhira buat sira ne\'e mak iha ona\r\nita bele la\'o ba hasoru dezenvolvimentu”, dehan PM Xanana.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXanana afirma hafoin Membru Governu da-sia simu posse, hahu’u kria orden atu\r\nhalo servisu hodi servi povu no hatan ba povu tomak nia halerik.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\nfatin hanesan, Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal hateten orgullu tebes\r\nbele mai iha Lospalos hodi bele partisipa iha atividade serimónia hatur fatuk\r\ndahuluk bá projeitu reabilitasaun estrada no projeitu melloramentu ba\r\nfornesimentu bee moos, ne\'e hatudu imi-nia unidade, maske iha diferente\r\npolítika maibé iha prosesu dezenvolvimentu imi hotu hamutuk nafatin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\"Ohin\r\nmai iha ne\'e atu lansa projetu boot rua ida ba estrada no ida seluk maka\r\nmelloramentu ba fornesimentu bee moos, ne\'ebé ninia prosesu ne\'e kuaze tinan\r\nida liu\", dehan Ministru Obras Públikas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Ministru\r\nObras Públikas haktuir ohin asina kontratu ho kompania manán na\'in sira iha\r\nkomunidase nia oin tamba osan ne\'e, osan povu nian entaun tenke envolve ema\r\nhotu hodi sai sasin ba iha asina kontratu ne’e, tamba ne\'e ema hotu ne’ebé\r\nmarka prezensa iha ne’e iha direitu atu tau matan ba prosesu dezenvolvimentu\r\nida ne\'e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\"Osan\r\nne’e povu nian, entaun tenke envolve ema hotu hodi sai sasin ba iha asina\r\nkontratu ne’e, tamba ne\'e ema hotu ne’ebé marka prezensa iha ne’e iha direitu\r\natu tau matan. Husu bai ta bo’ot sira labele halo impedimentu atu servisu ne\'e\r\nbele konklui tuir tempu tamba iha fatin seluk mós sei presiza Governu atu\r\nhadi\'a estrada,\"hatete Ministru Obras Públikas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Iha\r\noportunida ne\'e Ministru Administrasaun Estatal, Tomas do Rosário Cabral,hatete\r\nnia sei la ko\'alia barak tamba ohin autoridade ko\'alia ona, maibé nia sei\r\norienta bá autoriedade lokal sira iha munisípiu inklui xefe suku sira atu tau\r\nmatan ba projetu sira ne\'ebé lansa ona.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\"Lansamentu\r\nba estrada no bee moos ne\'e la\'o tiha lakleur imi ba halo impedimentu, hanesan\r\nmunisípiu balun la fó apoiu ba projetu sira ne\'e, tamba ne\'e mak projetu atu\r\nbenefísiu ba povu entaun autoridade lokál sira tenke ba halo fiskalizasaun hodi\r\najuda programa ne\'e bele la\'o ho di\'ak,\"tenik Ministru Administrasaun\r\nEstatal.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Entretantu\r\nPrezidente autoridade munisípiu Lautein, Mélio de Jesus, iha biban ne’e, hato\'o\r\nagradese bá Governu da-sia ne\'ebé ho komitmentu boot no kompromisu hodi lori\r\ndezenvolvimentu ba timor laran tomak.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">\"Aproveita\r\noportunidade ida ne\'e lori komunidade tomak iha lospalos agradese ba Governu\r\nda-sia nia esforsu tomak, maibé ami husu mós atu mellora reabilitasaun estrada\r\nba parte seluk hanesan, Iliomar, Loré,\"dehan PAM Lospalos.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Enkuantu\r\nprojetu reabilitasaun estrada ne\'e sei implementa husi kompania internasionál\r\nChongQing durante tinan ida ho balun ho montante orsamentu $18,836,713.10.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Lautem',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-04 08:39:49.272576','b83aac23b9528732c23cc7352950e880',2,2,'2025-10-31','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--35-1','--35-1','pm-xanana-kontinua-hatuur-fatuk-dahuluk-ba-estrada-lautem-ba-lospalos-no-projeitu-melhoramentu-no-fornesimentu-bee-moos-iha-lospalos-vila-1','-','-'),(328,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA SORUMUTU KONSELLU MINISTRU DESKUTI PROPOSTA REZOLUSAUN PARLAMENTU NASIONAL NE’EBE APREZENTA HUSI MINISTRU NEGOSIUS ESTRANJEIRUS NO KOOPERASAUN','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA SORUMUTU KONSELLU MINISTRU DESKUTI PROPOSTA REZOLUSAUN PARLAMENTU NASIONAL NE’EBE APREZENTA HUSI MINISTRU NEGOSIUS ESTRANJEIRUS NO KOOPERASAUN\r\n\r\nDili, 04 November 2025\r\n\r\nSorumutu Konsellu Ministru ne’ebé hala’o iha Palásiu Governu, Tersa-feira ne’e aprova projetu Proposta Rezolusaun Parlamentu Nasionál, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Ministru Negósius Estranjeirus no Kooperasaun, Bendito dos Santos Freitas ba Ratifikasaun Deklarasaun Admisaun Repúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste ba Asosiasaun Nasoins Sudeste Aziátiku (ASEAN).','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MINISTRU OBRAS P</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">BLIKAS\r\nPARTISIPA SORUMUTU KONSELLU MINISTRU DESKUTI PROPOSTA REZOLUSAUN PARLAMENTU\r\nNASIONAL NE’EBE APREZENTA HUSI MINISTRU NEGOSIUS ESTRANJEIRUS NO KOOPERASAUN<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 04 November 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Sorumutu Konsellu Ministru ne’ebé\r\nhala’o iha Palásiu Governu, Tersa-feira ne’e aprova projetu Proposta Rezolusaun\r\nParlamentu Nasionál, ne’ebé aprezenta husi Ministru Negósius Estranjeirus no\r\nKooperasaun, Bendito dos Santos Freitas ba Ratifikasaun Deklarasaun Admisaun\r\nRepúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste ba Asosiasaun Nasoins Sudeste Aziátiku\r\n(ASEAN).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Proposta rezolusaun ida-ne’e\r\nho intensaun atu ratifika deklarasaun kona-ba Admisaun Repúblika Demokrátika\r\nTimor-Leste ba ASEAN ne’ebé asina iha Malázia, iha loron 26 fulan-outubru tinan\r\n2025 durante serimónia adezaun plena Timor-Leste nian ba organizasaun rejionál\r\nne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Deklarasaun ne’e reprezenta\r\naseitasaun polítika husi Estadus-Membrus ASEAN kona-ba inkluzaun Timor-Leste\r\nnian nu’udar Estadu-Membru plenu direitu, tuir n. 4 artigu 6.º husi Karta ASEAN\r\nne’ebé nu’udar etapa esensiál ida ba integrasaun plena Timor-Leste nian iha\r\nmekanizmu no estrutura sira organizasaun nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha parte daruak Konsellu\r\nMinistru deskuti mós projetu ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Ministru Defeza, Donaciano\r\ndo Rosário Gomes, Konsellu Ministrus delibera hodi ratifika Akordu Kooperasaun\r\niha Área Defeza entre Governu Malázia no Governu Repúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu objetivu\r\nprinsipál sira hosi akordu ne’e maka hametin relasoins bilaterais iha área\r\nmilitár, liuliu liuhosi diálogu polítiku-estratéjiku regulár, fahe informasaun\r\nno esperiénsia sira, interkámbiu pesoál no formasaun téknika no mós militár,\r\nhala’o ezersísiu hamutuk no kooperasaun iha área siénsia, teknolojia no\r\nindústria defeza nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dokumentu ne’e mós rekoñese\r\nkna’ar Malázia nian nu’udar parseiru defeza konfiavel Timor-Leste nian dezde\r\nrestaurasaun independénsia, ne’ebé reafirma kompromisu hosi Governu rua ne’e\r\nhodi promove pás, seguransa no estabilidade rejionál iha ámbitu ASEAN, ne’ebé\r\nTimor-Leste agora sai membru plenu direitu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha parte datoluk sorumutu\r\nne’e, Konsellu Ministru deside autoriza despeza ba \"Dezenvolvimentu kampu\r\ngás Greater Sunrise nian no atu garante katak kadoras ne\'e dada mai\r\nTimor-Leste\", tuir projetu ne\'ebé aprezenta hosi Ministru Petróleu no\r\nRekursus Minerais, Francisco da Costa Monteiro.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ho deliberasaun ida-ne’e,\r\nKonsellu Ministru autoriza despeza ho montante totál dolar amerikanu 16.055.897\r\nne’ebé sei ezekuta entre tinan 2025 no 2027, ne’ebé ho objetivu atu implementa\r\nPrograma A13 hosi Orsamentu Jerál Estadu nian, ne’ebé inklui dezenvolvimentu\r\nhosi kampu gás Greater Sunrise no realizasaun estudu no inisiativa nesesáriu\r\nsira hodi garante kadoras dada mai Timor-Leste.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Montante autorizadu ne’e\r\nkobre realizasaun levantamentu jeofíziku no sízmiku ho rezolusaun ultra-alta\r\n(UHRS) relasiona ho gazodutu esportasaun gás Greater Sunrise no gazodutu Bayu\r\nUndan, ne’ebé esensiál ba faze téknika no planeamentu projetu nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Parte ikus liu Konsellu\r\nMinistrus atribui podér tomak ba Ministra Edukasaun, Dulce de Jesus Soares, atu\r\nasina Memorandu Entendimentu ida ho Governu Singapura, ba kooperasaun iha\r\námbitu edukasaun, liuliu iha formasaun ba profesór sira.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-05 00:33:18.189245','cd00692c3bfe59267d5ecfac5310286c',1,2,'2025-11-04','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--27','--27','ministru-obras-públikas-partisipa-sorumutu-konsellu-ministru-deskuti-proposta-rezolusaun-parlamentu-nasional-ne-ebe-aprezenta-husi-ministru-negosius-estranjeirus-no-kooperasaun-1','-','-'),(329,'PM XANANA LIDERA MEMBRU IX GOVERNU KONSTITUISIONAL HALO APREZENTASAUN OJE 2026 FAZE JENERALIDADE IHA SALA PLENARIA','PM XANANA LIDERA MEMBRU IX GOVERNU KONSTITUISIONAL HALO APREZENTASAUN OJE 2026 FAZE JENERALIDADE IHA SALA PLENARIA\r\n\r\nDili, 05 November 2025\r\n\r\nNonu (IX) Governu Konstituisionál ne’ebé lideradu husi atual Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompañia husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, Ministru Koordenadór Asuntus Ekonómikus no Ministru Turizmu no Ambiente, Francisco Kalbuadi Lay, Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, Ministru Negósius Estranjeirus no Kooperasaun, Bendito dos Santos Freitas, Ministru Asuntus Kombatentes Libertasaun Nasionál, Gil da Costa Monteiro “Oan Soru”, Ministru Defeza, Donaciano do Rosário Gomes ho Vise-Ministru Asuntus Parlamentares, Adérito Hugo da Costa aprezenta Orsamentu Jerál Estadu 2026 (OJE-2026) faze jerenalidade iha sala Plenaria Parlamentu Nasionál,kuarta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA LIDERA MEMBRU IX GOVERNU KONSTITUISIONAL HALO APREZENTASAUN OJE 2026\r\nFAZE JENERALIDADE IHA SALA PLENARIA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n05 November 2025</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Nonu (IX) Governu\r\nKonstituisionál ne’ebé lideradu husi atual Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão akompañia husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, Ministru Koordenadór\r\nAsuntus Ekonómikus no Ministru Turizmu no Ambiente, Francisco Kalbuadi Lay,\r\nMinistra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, Ministru Negósius\r\nEstranjeirus no Kooperasaun, Bendito dos Santos Freitas, Ministru Asuntus\r\nKombatentes Libertasaun Nasionál, Gil da Costa Monteiro “Oan Soru”, Ministru\r\nDefeza, Donaciano do Rosário Gomes ho Vise-Ministru Asuntus Parlamentares,\r\nAdérito Hugo da Costa aprezenta Orsamentu Jerál Estadu 2026 (OJE-2026) faze\r\njerenalidade iha sala Plenaria Parlamentu Nasionál,kuarta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Sekuensia aprezentasaun\r\nOrsamentu Jerál Estadu 2026, hafoin hetan aprovasaun husi Konsellu Ministrus\r\niha sorumutu estraordinária loron 30 fulan-setembru tinan 2025, no submisaun ba\r\nParlamentu Nasionál iha loron 1 fulan-outubru tinan 2025, Proposta Lei Orsamentu\r\nJerál Estadu (OGE) tinan 2026 nian tuirmai ba apresiasaun parlamentár, bazeia\r\nba kalendáriu tuirmai:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Loron 16 to’o 17 fulan-Outubru: Semináriu\r\nKomisaun C kona-ba “Panorama Orsamentu tinan 2026”;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Loron 17, 20 to’o 24 fulan-Outubru:\r\nAudiénsias públikas;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Loron 5 to’o 7 fulan-novembru: Debate no\r\nvotasaun iha jeneralidade;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Loron 10 to’o 24 fulan-Novembru: Debate no\r\nvotasaun iha espesialidade no votasaun finál globál;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Loron 25 fulan-Novembru: Dekretu sei haruka\r\nba Prezidente Repúblika atu promulga</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ho tema “Investe iha\r\nTransformasaun Nasionál, Integrasaun Rejionál no Dezenvolvimentu Inkluzivu”,\r\nproposta orsamentál, ho montante globál konsolidadu hamutuk dolar amerikanu\r\nbiliaun 2,291, formula bazeia ba objetivus estratéjikus Governu Konstitusionál\r\nIX nian, ne’ebé ho objetivu atu:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Promove dezenvolvimentu sosioekonómiku\r\nsustentável;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hasa’e investimentu iha infraestruturas\r\nestratéjikas;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hametin setór ekonómiku;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hadi\'a sidadaun sira-nia moris-di\'ak<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">OJE 2026 reflete kompromisu\r\nIX Governu Konstitusionál nian atu hasa’e kreximentu sustentável no inkluzivu,\r\nne’ebé bele fó benefísiu ba sidadaun hotu-hotu Timor-Leste nian.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-06 05:33:09.945638','6faa8040da20ef399b63a72d0e4ab575',1,2,'2025-11-05','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--28','--28','pm-xanana-lidera-membru-ix-governu-konstituisional-halo-aprezentasaun-oje-2026-faze-jeneralidade-iha-sala-plenaria-1','-','-'),(330,'LORON DARUAK DISKUSAUN OJE 2026 IHA JENERALIDADE MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS HALO APREZENTASAUN KONA-BA ORSAMENTU MOP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTU NASIONAL','LORON DARUAK DISKUSAUN OJE 2026 IHA JENERALIDADE MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS HALO APREZENTASAUN KONA-BA ORSAMENTU MOP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTU NASIONAL\r\n\r\nDili, 05 Novembro 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal iha loron daruak diskusaun OJE faze jeneralidade akompania Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão halo aprezentasaun orsamentu 2026 ba membru Parlamentu Nasionál iha sala plenaria parlamentu nasionál kinta-feira ne’e, kona-ba atividade sira ne’ebé Ministériu Obras Públikas ezekuta ona mak hanesan projeitu melloramentu bee mos, projeitu eletrifikasaun nivel aldeia, estrada inklui projeitu emerjensia iha teritoriu Timor Leste.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">LORON\r\nDARUAK DISKUSAUN OJE 2026 IHA JENERALIDADE MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS HALO APREZENTASAUN\r\nKONA-BA ORSAMENTU MOP NIAN IHA PARLAMENTU NASIONAL<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n05 Novembro 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas,\r\nSamuel Marçal iha loron daruak diskusaun OJE faze jeneralidade akompania\r\nPrimeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão halo aprezentasaun orsamentu\r\n2026 ba membru Parlamentu Nasionál iha sala plenaria parlamentu nasionál\r\nkinta-feira ne’e, kona-ba atividade sira ne’ebé Ministériu Obras Públikas\r\nezekuta ona mak hanesan projeitu melloramentu bee mos, projeitu eletrifikasaun\r\nnivel aldeia, estrada inklui projeitu emerjensia iha teritoriu Timor Leste.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu iha diskusaun\r\nJeneralidade ne’e Ministru Obras Públikas aprezenta mós preparasaun atividade\r\nsira ne’ebé iha relasaun ho OJE tinan 2025 nian, kona-ba projeitu infrestrutura\r\nsira ne’ebé inaugura ona inklui projeitu balun ne’ebé sei iha iha prosesu\r\nkontrusaun nian laran.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-09 23:59:57.005878','fe73f687e5bc5280214e0486b273a5f9',1,2,'2025-11-05','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--31','--31','loron-daruak-diskusaun-oje-2026-iha-jeneralidade-ministru-obras-públikas-halo-aprezentasaun-kona-ba-orsamentu-mop-nian-iha-parlamentu-nasional-1','-','-'),(331,'ORSAMENTU JERAL ESTADU 2026 HO MONTANTE DOLAR AMERIKANU MILLAUN RIHUN 2,291 PASA IHA JENERALIDADE','ORSAMENTU JERAL ESTADU 2026 HO MONTANTE DOLAR AMERIKANU MILLAUN RIHUN 2,291 PASA IHA JENERALIDADE\r\n\r\nDili, 07 Novembro 2025\r\n\r\nOrsamentu Jerál Estado 2026 (OJE-2026) ho nia montante hamutuk dolar amerikanu millaun rihun 2,291, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, hahu’u husi loron 5-7 fulan-novembro 2025, Parlamentu Nasionál (PN) ohin aprova ona proposta lei Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) 2026 iha faze jeneralidade ho votu afavór 42, kontra 0, abstensaun 23. Depois ne\'e, diskusaun ba espesialidade sei kontinua hosi loron 10 to’o 24 fulan-novembru 2025, no votasaun finál sei akontese iha tempu ikus ne\'e.*','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">ORSAMENTU\r\nJERAL ESTADU 2026 HO MONTANTE DOLAR AMERIKANU MILLAUN RIHUN 2,291 PASA IHA\r\nJENERALIDADE<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n07 Novembro 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Orsamentu\r\nJerál Estado 2026 (OJE-2026) ho nia montante hamutuk dolar amerikanu millaun\r\nrihun 2,291, ne’ebé aprezenta hosi Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana\r\nGusmão, hahu’u husi loron 5-7 fulan-novembro 2025, Parlamentu Nasionál (PN)\r\nohin aprova ona proposta lei Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) 2026 iha faze\r\njeneralidade ho votu afavór 42, kontra 0, abstensaun 23. Depois ne\'e, diskusaun\r\nba espesialidade sei kontinua hosi loron 10 to’o 24 fulan-novembru 2025, no\r\nvotasaun finál sei akontese iha tempu ikus ne\'e.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-10 00:01:52.811756','6da37dd3139aa4d9aa55b8d237ec5d4a',1,2,'2025-11-07','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--29-3','--29-3','orsamentu-jeral-estadu-2026-ho-montante-dolar-amerikanu-millaun-rihun-2-291-pasa-iha-jeneralidade-1','-','-'),(332,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS AKOMPAÑIA SUA EMINENSIA DOM VIRGILIO KARDEAL DO CARMO DA SILVA INAUGURA KAPELA NOSSA SENHORA MARIA AUXILIADORA DOS CRISTÃOS SUKU SABORIA','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS AKOMPAÑIA SUA EMINENSIA DOM VIRGILIO KARDEAL DO CARMO DA SILVA INAUGURA KAPELA NOSSA SENHORA MARIA AUXILIADORA DOS CRISTÃOS SUKU SABORIA\r\n\r\nAileu, 08 Novembro 2024\r\n\r\nSua Eminensia Dom Virgilio Kardeal do Carmo da Silva,SDB hamutuk ho Ministeriu Obras Públika (MOP), Samuel Marçal akompañia husi Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponomia no Organizasaun Urbana (SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites ho Sekretáriu Estadu formasaun Profisional no Empregu (SEFOPE) inklui Padre, Madre, Autoridade Lokál, Lia Nain no Sarani sira hotu iha Suku Saboria, Inagura Kapela Nossa Señora Maria Auxiliadora dos Cristãos iha suku Saboria.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKAS AKOMPAÑIA SUA EMINENSIA DOM VIRGILIO KARDEAL DO CARMO DA SILVA\r\nINAUGURA KAPELA NOSSA SENHORA MARIA AUXILIADORA DOS CRISTÃOS SUKU SABORIA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Aileu,\r\n08 Novembro 2024<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Sua Eminensia Dom Virgilio\r\nKardeal do Carmo da Silva,SDB hamutuk ho Ministeriu Obras Públika (MOP), Samuel\r\nMarçal akompañia husi Sekretariu Estadu Asuntu Toponomia no Organizasaun Urbana\r\n(SEATOU), Germano Santa Brites ho Sekretáriu Estadu formasaun Profisional no\r\nEmpregu (SEFOPE) inklui Padre, Madre, Autoridade Lokál, Lia Nain no Sarani sira\r\nhotu iha Suku Saboria, Inagura Kapela Nossa Señora Maria Auxiliadora dos\r\nCristãos iha suku Saboria.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha intervensaun Sua\r\nEminensia Dom Virgilio Kardeal do Carmo da Silva,SDB hato\'o agradese bá\r\nGovernu, tanbá iha ona inisiativa tulun sarani sira iha suku Saboria hodi\r\nrehabilita kapela ne\'ebé sai uma kreda atu halo orasaun no hametin ida-idak nia\r\nfiar.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">\"Ami nafatin agradese\r\nbá Governu liu husi Ministeriu Obras Públikas (MOP) ne\'ebé laran luak bele\r\nharii kapela furak ba sarani sira liu-liu ba devotu Maria Auxiliadora sira,\r\nohin mós ha\'u haree devotu balun mak iha ne\'e ona\", dehan Sua Eminensia\r\nDom Virgilio Kardeal do Carmo da Silva SDB.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Igreja ne\'e fatin bá ita\r\nsarani atu hasa\'e ida-idak nia fiar, entaun ida ne\'e sai sinál ida tanbá\r\nnu\'udar ema fiar na\'in uma kreda nian sai fatin ba ema hotu, la haree ba kór ka\r\npolítiku ida nian, iha kapela ida ne\'e ita hotu nu\'udar sarani ninia mahein\r\nmaka na\'in-feto Maria Auxiliadora.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha biban ne’e Sua Eminensia\r\nDom Virgilio Kardeal do Carmo da Silva,SDB husu ba sarani sira iha ne\'e atu\r\ntau-matan hodi garante fatin ne\'e matak nafatin.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">\"Imi sira hela besik\r\niha ne\'e tau matan hodi ita garante nia di\'ak no matak nafatin, nune\'e tinan\r\nhirak mai tan bainhira vizita fatin ne\'e nafatin furak, ida ne\'e mak sinál\r\ngratidaun boot ida, la\'ós simu de\'it maibé tenke uza didi\'ak”, hateten Sua\r\nEminensia Dom Virgilio Kardeal do Carmo da Silva SDB.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha biban ne\'e Ministru\r\nObras Públikas (MOP), Samuel Marçal haktuir tuir loloos ohin Primeiru-Ministru\r\nmarka prezensa iha ne\'e, maibé tanbá iha ajenda importante balun ne\'ebé presija\r\natende, maibé agradese teb-tebes bá sarani sira iha ne\'e bele koopera ho\r\nGovernu hodi konklui obra ida ne\'e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">\"Ha\'u agradese tebes bá\r\nita boot sira bele koopera ona ho Governu, hodi konklui Obra ne’e, konstrusaun\r\nne\'e ita halo la to\'o tinan ida, hau mós husu ba sarani sira atu utilija kapela\r\nka igreja ne\'e sai fatin ne\'ebé atu transforma mudansa ba ita nia a\'an liu-liu\r\nmorál, atitude hodi dezenvolve bá nasaun ida ne\'e,\" hatete Ministru Obras\r\nP</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ú</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">blikas,\r\nSamuel Marçal.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas husu\r\nba sarani sira atu labele halo igreja sai fatin Ospitál bainhira moras ona foin\r\nmai halo orasaun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">\"Sarani sira labele\r\nkonsidera kapela ne\'e hanesan Ospitál, bainhira moras mak hakbesik an mai halo\r\norasaun ne\'e laloos, tanbá ne\'e imi atu kuidadu fatin ida ne\'e sai fatin\r\nsagradu no furak ba ema hotu\", hateten MOP.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu Projetu\r\nreabilitasaun kapela Nossa Señora Maria Auxiliadora dos Cristãos hahu\'u\r\nrehabilita iha loron 01 fulan-Novembru 2024 to\'o loron 31 fulan-Maiu 2025 rehabilita\r\nhusi Kompañia Quatro Colegas, Lda no hetan fundus husi Ministrériu Obras\r\nPúblikas ho nia montante Orsamentu hamutuk $ 218,833.56 .*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Aileu',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-10 07:06:23.860090','c042f4db68f23406c6cecf84a7ebb0fe',1,2,'2025-11-08','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--29','--29','ministru-obras-públikas-akompañia-sua-eminensia-dom-virgilio-kardeal-do-carmo-da-silva-inaugura-kapela-nossa-senhora-maria-auxiliadora-dos-cristãos-suku-saboria-1','-','-'),(333,'PM XANANA NO MINISTRIU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS LANSA PROJEITU REABILITASAUN ESTRADA HOSI SELOI-KRAIK, AILEU BA TOKOLULI, ERMERA','PM XANANA NO MINISTRIU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS LANSA PROJEITU REABILITASAUN ESTRADA HOSI SELOI-KRAIK, AILEU BA TOKOLULI, ERMERA\r\n\r\nAileu, 08 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal inklui membru governu sira seluk lansa fatuk dahuluk bá projeitu reabilitasaun estrada diresaun husi Seloi-Kraik \"Aileu\"  bá Tokoluli \"Gleno, Ermera\".','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA NO MINISTRIU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS LANSA PROJEITU REABILITASAUN ESTRADA HOSI\r\nSELOI-KRAIK, AILEU BA TOKOLULI, ERMERA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Aileu,\r\n08 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal inklui\r\nmembru governu sira seluk lansa fatuk dahuluk bá projeitu reabilitasaun estrada\r\ndiresaun husi Seloi-Kraik \"Aileu\"&nbsp;\r\nbá Tokoluli \"Gleno, Ermera\".<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha intervensaun\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Nonu Governo Konstitusionál, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hatete hafoin\r\nlansa tiha projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada&nbsp;\r\nne\'e, bainhira implementa husu komunidade sira atu koopera labele bá\r\nimpede kompania bainhira sira halo servisu, se komunidade sira halo impedimentu\r\nprojeitu ne\'e sei lala\'o.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">\"Hanesan iha fatin balu\r\nkomunidade sira sunu tiha ekipamentus, se ida ne\'e akontese entaun di\'ak liu\r\nita labele hadia estrada. Ne\'e duni ami hotu ne\'ebé hamriik iha ne\'e fiar katak\r\nkomunidade liuliu joven sira atu hotu-hotu partisipa aselera lalais projetu ida\r\nne\'e hodi ita halo fali buat seluk\", dehan Primeiru Ministru bá komunidade\r\nsira iha seremónia hatuur fatuk dahuluk ba projeitu reabilitasaun estrada Seloi\r\nkraik, sabado ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Tamba ne\'e bainhira projeitu\r\nne’e implementa ona, pessoal balun mai impede obra ne\'e maka sei muda tiha\r\nprojeitu ne\'e bá munisípiu sira seluk ne\'ebé presiza.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha fatin hanesan Ministru\r\nObras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, hateten orgllu tanba kompania Timor Oan ida bele\r\nkompete ho kompania internasionál ba projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada ne\'e no\r\nkonsege manan iha prosesu tenderizasaun internasionál.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hau orgullu tamba foin\r\nprimeira vez kompania timoroan ida kompete ho kompania internasionál hodi sai\r\nvensedor ba projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada hosi Seloi Kraik ba Tokoluli. Ohin\r\nita hotu mai iha ne\'e ita la\'ós hatuur de\'it fatuk maibé lori mós kontratu mai\r\nasina iha povu nia oin, tamba projeitu ne’e gasta osan povu nian no projetu\r\nne\'e sai na\'in ba ita hotu-hotu\", hateten Ministru Obras Públikas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas\r\nhaktuir bainhira kompañia refere mai implementa ona povu mós iha direitu atu\r\ntau matan no involve iha prosesu dezenvolvimentu ne\'e, signifika joven sira\r\nne\'ebé hakarak servisu bele ba rejistu iha kompañia hodi hetan oportunidade.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">\"Husu bá joven sira,\r\nimi bele ajuda hada fatuk, hadia valeta, hodi bele ajuda ekonómia família uma\r\nlaran\", hateten Ministru Obras Públikas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Kona-ba aldeia balun ne\'ebé\r\nseidauk asesu ba eletrisidade Ministru Obras Públikas hateten iha tinan 2026\r\nfulan-Janeiru bele hahú asina kontratu ba aldeia sira, nune\'e husu komunidade\r\nkalma uitoan tamba prosesu ne\'e la\'o hela.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Prezidente Autoridade Munisípiu\r\nAileu, João Bosco dos Santos iha nia intervensaun hato\'o agradese ba Nonu\r\nGovernu konstitusionál tamba foin ukun tinan rua, konsege halo lansamentu ba\r\nestrada diresaun Seloi kraik ba Tokoluli Glenu, aleinde ne\'e dezenvolvimentu ba\r\nestrada antes ne\'e mós implementa tiha ona iha Lekidoe entaun lakleur tan\r\nkondisaum estrada sei di\'ak ba ema hotu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha biban ne\'e mós PAM Aileu\r\nnafatin husu ba Governu atu reabilita estrada urbana iha Aileu laran.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Enkuantu projetu rehabilitasaun\r\nestrada hosi Seloi Kraik ba Tokoluli ne\'e implementa husi kompania Marabia, Lda\r\nho nia durasaun servisu tinan ida ho balun ho montante orsamentu hamutuk\r\nmillaun $14,034,102.63.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Partisipa iha seremónia\r\nlansamentu projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada ne\'e Ministra Finansas, Santina José\r\nRodrigues F. Viegas Cardoso, Ministru Justisa, Sérgio de Jesus Fernandes da\r\nCosta Hornai,&nbsp; Ministru Agrikultura,\r\nPekuária, Peska no Florestas, Marcos da Cruz, Ministru Planeamentu no Investimentu\r\nEstratéjiku, Gastão Francisco de Sousa, Vise-Ministru ba Infraestruturas, Júlio\r\ndo Carmo, Vise-Ministru Administrasaun Estatál, Jacinto Rigoberto G. de Deus,\r\nSekretáriu Estadu Komunikasaun Sosiál Expedito Dias Ximenes, Sekretáriu Estadu\r\nFormasaun Profisionál no Empregu, Rogério Araújo Mendonça, Sekretáriu Estadu ba\r\nProtesaun Sivíl, Domingos Mariano Reis, Komando PNTL Munisípiu Aileu,\r\nAutoriedade Postu-Administrativu Aileu, Prezidente Autoridade Munisípiu Ermera,\r\nAutoriedade lokal sira inklui komunidade hosi Seloi Kraik no komunidade sira\r\nhosi Tokoluli.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Aileu',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-10 07:07:59.568706','310dcbbf4cce62f762a2aaa148d556bd',2,2,'2025-11-08','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--32','--32','pm-xanana-no-ministriu-obras-públikas-lansa-projeitu-reabilitasaun-estrada-hosi-seloi-kraik-aileu-ba-tokoluli-ermera-1','-','-'),(334,'PM XANANA AKOMPAÑIA RITUAL HODI HUSU LISENSA KE’E SAI HALI HUN NO HASAI HALI ABUT BA PROSESU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA IHA KULUHUN','PM XANANA AKOMPAÑIA RITUAL HODI HUSU LISENSA KE’E SAI HALI HUN NO HASAI HALI ABUT BA PROSESU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA IHA KULUHUN\r\n\r\nDili, 09 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompaña husi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Ministru Justisa, Sérgio Hornai no Sekretáriu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias ho lia-na\'in sira Kuluhun realiza serimónia rituál hodi husu lisensa ke\'e sai hali hun inklui hasai tiha hali abut nune’e bele fo biban ba ekipa tékniku hosi kompañia Montana Diak, Unip,Lda hodi aselera lalais projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada husi Kuluhun ba Becora.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA AKOMPAÑIA RITUAL HODI HUSU LISENSA KE’E SAI HALI HUN NO HASAI HALI ABUT\r\nBA PROSESU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA IHA KULUHUN<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n09 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão akompaña husi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Ministru\r\nJustisa, Sérgio Hornai no Sekretáriu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no Organizasaun\r\nUrbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias ho lia-na\'in sira Kuluhun realiza serimónia\r\nrituál hodi husu lisensa ke\'e sai hali hun inklui hasai tiha hali abut nune’e\r\nbele fo biban ba ekipa tékniku hosi kompañia Montana Diak, Unip,Lda hodi\r\naselera lalais projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada husi Kuluhun ba Becora.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu ritual kulturál\r\nida ne\'e halo hodi husu lisensa bá natureza atu labele impede konstrusaun\r\nestrada iha Kuluhun, seremónia ritual kulturál ne’e realiza iha Ponte Kuluhun,\r\nloron Domingo ne’e.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-13 23:51:05.571020','2f2b265625d76a6704b08093c652fd79',1,2,'2025-11-09','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--38','--38','pm-xanana-akompañia-ritual-hodi-husu-lisensa-ke-e-sai-hali-hun-no-hasai-hali-abut-ba-prosesu-rehabilitasaun-estrada-iha-kuluhun-1','-','-'),(335,'PM XANANA AKOMPAÑIA HOSI MOP NO SEATOU OBSERVA PROGRESSU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA BEBONUK-LURUMATA','PM XANANA AKOMPAÑIA HOSI MOP NO SEATOU OBSERVA PROGRESSU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA BEBONUK-LURUMATA\r\n\r\nDili, 10 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão iha loron segunda-feira ne’e akompañia husi Ministru Obra Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Ministru Justisa, Sérgio Hornai no Sekretáriu Estadu Asuntu Toponímia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias halo observasaun bá progresu konstrusaun estrada Bebonuk ho Lurumata.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA AKOMPAÑIA HOSI MOP NO SEATOU OBSERVA PROGRESSU KONSTRUSAUN ESTRADA\r\nBEBONUK-LURUMATA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n10 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru, Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão iha loron segunda-feira ne’e akompañia husi Ministru Obra Públikas,\r\nSamuel Marçal, Ministru Justisa, Sérgio Hornai no Sekretáriu Estadu Asuntu\r\nToponímia no Organizasaun Urbana, Germano Santa Brites Dias halo observasaun bá\r\nprogresu konstrusaun estrada Bebonuk ho Lurumata.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-13 23:52:22.196285','f9b902fc3289af4dd08de5d1de54f68f',2,2,'2025-11-10','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--33-2','--33-2','pm-xanana-akompañia-hosi-mop-no-seatou-observa-progressu-konstrusaun-estrada-bebonuk-lurumata-1','-','-'),(336,'MOP LIU HUSI EDTL,E.P. HALO KOORDENASAUN SERVISU BA IMPLEMENTASAUM PROJEITU KONSTRUSAUN KABU ELETRISIDADE SUBTERRANEO HOSI KULUHUN BA BEKORA','MOP LIU HUSI EDTL,E.P. HALO KOORDENASAUN SERVISU BA IMPLEMENTASAUM PROJEITU KONSTRUSAUN KABU ELETRISIDADE SUBTERRANEO HOSI KULUHUN BA BEKORA\r\n\r\nDili, 10 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva, Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empresa Pública (EDTL, E.P), Dr. Paulo da Silva akompaña husi Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Tékniku, Eng. Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Korporativu, Sr. Jùlio de Jesus Gonçalves  no Diretòr Tèkniku sira, Koordenador Unidade Inspeção Verificação para Pagamento UIVP, Eng. Aleixo Amaral do Carmo ho Prezidente BTL, E.P. Eng. Gustavo kompaña TBEA inklui enjiñeiru sira husi Ministériu Obras Públikas hodi  halo kordenasaun servisu kona-ba implementasaun projetu pilotu  konstrusaun kabu eletrisidade subterrâneo Kuluhun-Bekora.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MOP LIU HUSI EDTL,E.P. HALO KOORDENASAUN\r\nSERVISU BA IMPLEMENTASAUM PROJEITU KONSTRUSAUN KABU ELETRISIDADE SUBTERRANEO\r\nHOSI KULUHUN BA BEKORA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 10 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Prezidente Komisaun\r\nEzekutiva, Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empresa Pública (EDTL, E.P), Dr. Paulo\r\nda Silva akompaña husi Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Tékniku, Eng. Roberto Manuel\r\nMarçal, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Korporativu, Sr. Jùlio de Jesus\r\nGonçalves&nbsp; no Diretòr Tèkniku sira,\r\nKoordenador Unidade Inspeção Verificação para Pagamento UIVP, Eng. Aleixo\r\nAmaral do Carmo ho Prezidente BTL, E.P. Eng. Gustavo kompaña TBEA inklui\r\nenjiñeiru sira husi Ministériu Obras Públikas hodi&nbsp; halo kordenasaun servisu kona-ba\r\nimplementasaun projetu pilotu&nbsp;\r\nkonstrusaun kabu eletrisidade subterrâneo Kuluhun-Bekora.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Implementasaun projetu\r\nkonstrusaun kabu eletrisidade subterrâneo ne’e, kompaña konstrui ona Room\r\nSubstation iha Kulu-hun, Becora.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Tékniku EDTL, E.P&nbsp; no BTL,E.P. inklui enjineiru MOP sei akompaña\r\nprosesu servisu iha terrenu, hodi nune’e implementasaun projetu ne’e lao ho\r\nsussesu.</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp; #</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">?????????????????<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-13 23:53:42.082801','6855456e2fe46a9d49d3d3af4f57443d',2,2,'2025-11-10','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--34-2','--34-2','mop-liu-husi-edtl-e-p-halo-koordenasaun-servisu-ba-implementasaum-projeitu-konstrusaun-kabu-eletrisidade-subterraneo-hosi-kuluhun-ba-bekora-1','-','-'),(337,'MINISTRIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA SELEBRA KONTRATU HO KOMPAÑIA HODI KONSTRUI EDIFISIU MOP INKLUI KONTRATU MELLORAMENTU SISTEMA BEE MOS IHA MUNISIPIU MANUFAHI','MINISTRIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA SELEBRA KONTRATU HO KOMPAÑIA HODI KONSTRUI EDIFISIU MOP INKLUI KONTRATU MELLORAMENTU SISTEMA BEE MOS IHA MUNISIPIU MANUFAHI\r\n\r\nDili, 11 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Vise-Ministru Infrastrutura, Júlio do Carmo ho Sekretário Estado Eletricidade, Água no Saneamentu, Santos Noronha lori Ministériu Obras Públikas nia naran realiza serimónia asina kontratu ho kompania PT. NUSA KONSTRUKSI ENJINERING TBK. Indonesia ba konstrusaun edifísiu foun Ministériu Obras Públikas (MOP) inklui asina mós kontratu ho komapña CNI22 bá projetu melloramenu sistema bee mos iha Munisípiu Manufahi.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MINISTRIU OBRAS P</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">BLIKA\r\nSELEBRA KONTRATU HO KOMPA</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ñ</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">IA HODI KONSTRUI EDIFISIU\r\nMOP INKLUI KONTRATU MELLORAMENTU SISTEMA BEE MOS IHA MUNISIPIU MANUFAHI<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 11 Novembru 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas,\r\nSamuel Marçal akompañia hosi Vise-Ministru Infrastrutura, Júlio do Carmo ho\r\nSekretário Estado Eletricidade, Água no Saneamentu, Santos Noronha lori\r\nMinistériu Obras Públikas nia naran realiza serimónia asina kontratu ho\r\nkompania PT. NUSA KONSTRUKSI ENJINERING TBK. Indonesia ba konstrusaun edifísiu\r\nfoun Ministériu Obras Públikas (MOP) inklui asina mós kontratu ho komapña CNI22\r\nbá projetu melloramenu sistema bee mos iha Munisípiu Manufahi.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha nia intervensaun,\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal hatete hafoin selebra tiha kontratu ho\r\nPT. NUSA KONSTRUKSI ENJINERING TBK. Indonesia husu bá diresaun Jerais sira\r\ninklui instituisaun tuteladas sira hotu-hotu tenke hamutuk atu tau matan bá\r\nobra ne’e, hodi garante kualidade konstrusaun refere.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">“Hau husu bá empreza PT.\r\nNUSA KONSTRUKSI ENJINERING TBK. Indonesia, atu servisu ho responsabilidade tuir\r\nkontratu ne’ebé asina ona”, hatete Ministru Obras Públikas iha seremónia asina\r\nkontratu ne’ebé realiza iha salaun MOP, Kaicoli, Tersa-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Partisipa iha serimónia\r\nasina kontratu ne’e, Prezidenti&nbsp;\r\nInstitutu Gestaun Ekipamento reprezentante Ana Paula da Cruz, Prezidenti\r\nBTL.EP, Vise-Prezidente KE BTL, E.P, José Filipe Ximenes Smith, Prezidente\r\nKomisaun Ezekutiva, Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empresa Pública (EDTL, E.P),\r\nPaulo da Silva, Diretór Jerál Administrasaun no Finansas, João Amaral, Diretór\r\nNasionál Estrada Ponte no Kontrolu Cheia (DNEPCC), Nene Lobato,&nbsp; Diretór Gerál Habitasaun no Urbansimu (DGHU),\r\nSr. Domingos D. J. Sequeira, kargu xefias sira inklui dirijenti kompañia rua\r\nne’ebé ohin selebra kontratu ho MOP.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-13 23:55:09.742880','357a6fdf7642bf815a88822c447d9dc4',2,2,'2025-11-11','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--35-2-1','--35-2-1','ministriu-obras-públika-selebra-kontratu-ho-kompañia-hodi-konstrui-edifisiu-mop-inklui-kontratu-melloramentu-sistema-bee-mos-iha-munisipiu-manufahi-1-1','-','-'),(338,'GOVERNU HO PARLAMENTU NASIONAL HAHU’U DEBATE OJE 2026 IHA ESPESIALIDADE','GOVERNU HO PARLAMENTU NASIONAL HAHU’U DEBATE OJE 2026 IHA ESPESIALIDADE \r\nDili, 13 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nNonu (IX) Governu Konstituisionál ne’ebé lideradu husi atual Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompañia husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, MKAE no MTA, Francisco Kalbuadi Lay, Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, MKAS no MDRHC, Mariano Assanami Sabino, MPCM, Agio Pereira, MPIE, Gastão Francisco de Sousa, Ministru Defeza, Donaciano do Rosário Gomes ho Vise-Ministra Finansas, Felícia Claudinanda Cruz Carvalho aprezenta Orsamentu Jerál Estadu 2026 (OJE-2026) orsamentu ho nia montante hamutuk dolar amerikanu millaun rihun 2,291 faze espesialidade iha sala Plenaria Parlamentu Nasionál,  kinta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">GOVERNU HO PARLAMENTU\r\nNASIONAL HAHU’U DEBATE OJE 2026 IHA ESPESIALIDADE <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 13 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Nonu (IX) Governu\r\nKonstituisionál ne’ebé lideradu husi atual Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala\r\nXanana Gusmão akompañia husi Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, MKAE no MTA, Francisco\r\nKalbuadi Lay, Vise-Primeiru-Ministru, MKAS no MDRHC, Mariano Assanami Sabino,\r\nMPCM, Agio Pereira, MPIE, Gastão Francisco de Sousa, Ministru Defeza, Donaciano\r\ndo Rosário Gomes ho Vise-Ministra Finansas, Felícia Claudinanda Cruz Carvalho\r\naprezenta Orsamentu Jerál Estadu 2026 (OJE-2026) orsamentu ho nia montante\r\nhamutuk dolar amerikanu millaun rihun 2,291 faze espesialidade iha sala\r\nPlenaria Parlamentu Nasionál, &nbsp;kinta-feira\r\nne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entrentantu diskusaun\r\norsamentu ho nia montante hamutuk dolar amerikanu millaun rihun 2,291, ne’ebé\r\naprezenta hosi Primeiru Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hahu’u iha loron\r\n13 sei remata iha loron 26 de Novembru 2025.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu proposta\r\norsamentál, ho montante globál konsolidadu hamutuk dolar amerikanu biliaun\r\n2,291, formula bazeia ba objetivus estratéjikus Governu Konstitusionál IX nian,\r\nne’ebé ho objetivu atu:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Promove dezenvolvimentu sosio-ekonómiku\r\nsustentável;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hasa’e investimentu iha infraestruturas\r\nestratéjikas;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hametin setór ekonómiku;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hadi\'a sidadaun sira-nia moris-di\'ak<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">OJE 2026 reflete kompromisu\r\nIX Governu Konstitusionál nian atu hasa’e kreximentu sustentável no inkluzivu,\r\nne’ebé bele fó benefísiu ba sidadaun hotu-hotu Timor-Leste nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Sesaun Plenária ne’e,\r\nprezide hosi Prezidente Parlamentu Nasionál, Maria Fernanda Lay, akompaña hosi\r\nMembru Meza sira, prezente mós membru Governu sira ho entidade relevante sira.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-13 23:56:31.858719','819f46e52c25763a55cc642422644317',1,2,'2025-11-13','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--37-1','--37-1','governu-ho-parlamentu-nasional-hahu-u-debate-oje-2026-iha-espesialidade-1','-','-'),(339,'PARLAMENTU NASIONAL APROVA OJE 2026 BA MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA $ 237,108,892','PARLAMENTU NASIONAL APROVA OJE 2026 BA MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA $ 237,108,892\r\n\r\nDili, 17 Novembru 2026\r\n\r\nOrsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE) tinan fiskál 2026 bá Ministériu Obras Públikas (MOP) ho totál submisaun $237,108,892 aprova ona ho votus a favór 42, abstensaun 23 no kontra zero, iha debate faze espesialidade loron da-haat parte dader, tersa-feira ne’e (18/11/2025).','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PARLAMENTU\r\nNASIONAL APROVA OJE 2026 BA MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA $ 237,108,892<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n17 Novembru 2026<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Orsamentu Jerál Estadu (OJE)\r\ntinan fiskál 2026 bá Ministériu Obras Públikas (MOP) ho totál submisaun\r\n$237,108,892 aprova ona ho votus a favór 42, abstensaun 23 no kontra zero, iha\r\ndebate faze espesialidade loron da-haat parte dader, tersa-feira ne’e (18/11/2025).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Orsamentu ne’e fahe bá\r\nkategoria Saláriu no Vensimentu $7, 354,614, Bens no Servisus Rekorrentes\r\n$17,274,303, Transferénsias Públikas $129,918,321, Kapitál Menór $5,250,000 no\r\nKapital Dezenvolvimentu $77,311,654.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu debate\r\nespesialidade ne’e lidera hosi Prezidente Parlamentu Nasionál, Maria Fernanda\r\nLay no partisipa hosi Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão, Membru\r\nGovernu sira inklui entidade relevante seluk.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Proposta Lei OJE 2026\r\nBilliaun $2.214.689,195 ho kategoria Saláriu no Vensimentu $476.870.249, Bens\r\nno Servisu Korrente $447.904.446, Transferénsia Públika $820.710.160, Kapitál\r\nMenór $32.556.96 no Kapitál Dezenvolvimentu $436.647.37.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-19 05:31:46.404463','04025959b191f8f9de3f924f0940515f',1,2,'2025-11-17','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--33','--33','parlamentu-nasional-aprova-oje-2026-ba-ministeriu-obras-públika-237-108-892-1','-','-'),(340,'MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA MONITORIZA IMPLEMENTASAUN PROJEITU PILOTU KONSTRUSAUN KABU SUBTERRANEO HOSI KULUHUN BA BEKORA','MINISTERIU OBRAS PÚBLIKA MONITORIZA IMPLEMENTASAUN PROJEITU PILOTU KONSTRUSAUN KABU SUBTERRANEO HOSI KULUHUN BA BEKORA\r\n\r\nDili, 18 Novembru 2025 \r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel  Marçal akompañia hosi Prezidente Komisaun Ezekutiva, Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empresa Públika (EDTL, E.P), Paulo da Silva, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Tékniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Korporativu, Jùlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Prezidente BTL,E.P., Gustavo da Cruz, Prezidenti Autoridade Munisipiu Dili, Francisco do Santos,diretòr DPSE inklui ekipa tékniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no Pagamentu-Ministériu Obras Públikas halo monitorizasaun bá progresu  implementasaun projetu pilotu  konstrusaun kabu eletrisidade subterrâneo hosi Kuluhun bá Bekora, tersa-feira ne\'e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTERIU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKA MONITORIZA IMPLEMENTASAUN PROJEITU PILOTU KONSTRUSAUN KABU\r\nSUBTERRANEO HOSI KULUHUN BA BEKORA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n18 Novembru 2025 <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel&nbsp; Marçal akompañia hosi Prezidente Komisaun\r\nEzekutiva, Eletricidade de Timor-Leste, Empresa Públika (EDTL, E.P), Paulo da\r\nSilva, Komisáriu Ezekutivu Serbisu Tékniku, Roberto Manuel Marçal, Komisáriu\r\nEzekutivu Serbisu Korporativu, Jùlio de Jesus Gonçalves, Prezidente BTL,E.P.,\r\nGustavo da Cruz, Prezidenti Autoridade Munisipiu Dili, Francisco do\r\nSantos,diretòr DPSE inklui ekipa tékniku Unidade Inspesaun Verifikasaun no\r\nPagamentu-Ministériu Obras Públikas halo monitorizasaun bá progresu&nbsp; implementasaun projetu pilotu&nbsp; konstrusaun kabu eletrisidade subterrâneo\r\nhosi Kuluhun bá Bekora, tersa-feira ne\'e.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-19 05:35:06.228904','40008b9a5380fcacce3976bf7c08af5b',2,2,'2025-11-18','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--34','--34','ministeriu-obras-públika-monitoriza-implementasaun-projeitu-pilotu-konstrusaun-kabu-subterraneo-hosi-kuluhun-ba-bekora-1','-','-'),(341,'PARLAMENTU NASIONAL APROVA FINAL GLOBAL OJE 2026 NE’EBE GOVERNU APREZENTA HO TOTAL $ 2,291 BILOENS','PARLAMENTU NASIONAL APROVA FINAL GLOBAL OJE 2026 NE’EBE GOVERNU APREZENTA HO TOTAL $ 2,291 BILOENS\r\n\r\nDili, 21 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nParlamentu Nasionál liu husi reuniaun Plenária Extraordinária, iha loron Sesta-feira ne\'e, aprova Final Global Orsamentu Jeral Estadu ba tinan 2026, ne’ebé Governu aprezenta ho total 2.291 biloens ho nia Lema “Investe iha transformasaun nasionál, integrasaun rejionál no dezenvolvimentu inkluzivu”, rezultadu votasaun a favor 42, kontra 0 no abstensaun 23.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PARLAMENTU\r\nNASIONAL APROVA FINAL GLOBAL OJE 2026 NE’EBE GOVERNU APREZENTA HO TOTAL $ 2,291\r\nBILOENS<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n21 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Parlamentu Nasionál liu husi\r\nreuniaun Plenária Extraordinária, iha loron Sesta-feira ne\'e, aprova Final\r\nGlobal Orsamentu Jeral Estadu ba tinan 2026, ne’ebé Governu aprezenta ho total\r\n2.291 biloens ho nia Lema “Investe iha transformasaun nasionál, integrasaun\r\nrejionál no dezenvolvimentu inkluzivu”, rezultadu votasaun a favor 42, kontra 0\r\nno abstensaun 23.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hafoin Parlamentu Nasionál\r\nhalo aprovasaun final global ba OJE 2026, Komisaun C ne’ebé trata asuntu\r\nFinansas Públikas sei elabora redasaun final antes haruka ba Presidente\r\nRepúblika hodi promulga.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP<o:p></o:p></span></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-11-23 23:54:32.339717','3dd48ab31d016ffcbf3314df2b3cb9ce',1,2,'2025-11-21','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--35','--35','parlamentu-nasional-aprova-final-global-oje-2026-ne-ebe-governu-aprezenta-ho-total-2-291-biloens-1','-','-'),(342,'PM XANANA OBSERVA KONSTRUSAUN EDIFISIU FOUN BA KDTL','PM XANANA OBSERVA KONSTRUSAUN EDIFISIU FOUN BA KDTL\r\n\r\nDili, 21 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão hamutuk ho Ministru Obras Públikas (MOP), Samuel Marçal observa kontrusaun edifisiu foun ne’ebé sei oferese ba grupu Klibur Defisiénsia Tilun Timor-Leste (KDTL), iha área Kampu Hudi-Laran, Fatuhada, Dili, Sesta-Feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA OBSERVA KONSTRUSAUN EDIFISIU FOUN BA KDTL<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Dili,\r\n21 Novembru 2025</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão hamutuk ho Ministru Obras Públikas (MOP), Samuel Marçal\r\nobserva kontrusaun edifisiu foun ne’ebé sei oferese ba grupu Klibur Defisiénsia\r\nTilun Timor-Leste (KDTL), iha área Kampu Hudi-Laran, Fatuhada, Dili, Sesta-Feira\r\nne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Antes ne’e, iha loron 1\r\nSetembru 2025, Primeiru-Ministru Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão&nbsp; hala\'o vizita bá maluk sira ne\'ebé halibur-an\r\niha Klibur Defisiénsia Tilun Timor-Leste (KDTL) hodi observa sira nia fatin la\r\niha kondisoes atu hala’o servisu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">KDTL halibur maluk sira\r\nneʼebé ho problema tilun ka maluk sira ne\'ebé labele rona no labele ko\'alia ka\r\nbaibain bolu defisiénsia tilun.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">KDTL ne\'e hanesan mós membru\r\nhosi Assosiasaun Defisiénsia Timor-Leste (ADTL) ne\'ebé eziste hodi haree\r\nespesífiku-liu bá maluk sira ho defisiénsia tilun ho nia koordenadora maka\r\nCrecênsia Madeira de Deus.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">KDTL foin mak hetan apoiu\r\noitoan hosi ADTL ho Ministériu Solidariedade Sosiál no Inkluzaun (MSSI) hodi\r\nhalo no dezenvolve formasaun sira mak hanesan dezenvolve Lian Jestuál,\r\ndezenvolve Lian Jestu Nasionál. Iha mós apoiu hosi Sekretária Estadu Igualdade\r\n(SEI) bá atividade sensibilizasaun nian.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Edifisiu foun ne’e tuir\r\nplanu, KDTL sei uza hodi oferese formasaun bá maluk defisiénsia tilun 100-resin\r\nmai-hosi Munisípiu neʼebé diferente.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Maluk defisiénsia sira ne\'e\r\nhela iha ida-idak ninia uma privada iha Dili laran no lorloron bá tuir\r\nformasaun iha sentru ne\'e.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:41:59.046556','58238e9ae2dd305d79c2ebc8c1883422',2,2,'2025-11-21','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--39-2','--39-2','pm-xanana-observa-konstrusaun-edifisiu-foun-ba-kdtl-1-1','-','-'),(343,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA SERIMONIA ASINATURA AKORDU KONA-BA PROJEITU CLIMATE-RESILIENT CONNECTIVITY IHA TIMOR-LESTE','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA SERIMONIA ASINATURA AKORDU KONA-BA PROJEITU CLIMATE-RESILIENT CONNECTIVITY IHA TIMOR-LESTE\r\n\r\nDili, 24 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal iha Segunda-feira ne\'e akompañia hosi Kordenador PMU-MOP, Amilcar da Costa Victor partisipa iha serimónia asinatura akordu kona-bá projeitu Climate-Resilient Connectivity Enhancement iha Timor Leste, atividade ne\'e realiza iha salaun,  Ministériu Finansas.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MINISTRU OBRAS P</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">BLIKAS\r\nPARTISIPA SERIMONIA ASINATURA AKORDU KONA-BA PROJEITU CLIMATE-RESILIENT CONNECTIVITY\r\nIHA TIMOR-LESTE<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Dili, 24 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel\r\nMarçal iha Segunda-feira ne\'e akompañia hosi Kordenador PMU-MOP, Amilcar da\r\nCosta Victor partisipa iha serimónia asinatura akordu kona-bá projeitu\r\nClimate-Resilient Connectivity Enhancement iha Timor Leste, atividade ne\'e\r\nrealiza iha salaun,&nbsp; Ministériu Finansas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Seremónia asinatura akordu\r\nne\'e realiza entre governu Timor Leste ho Banku Dezenvolvimentu Azia (ADB).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu Governu Timor\r\nLeste reprezenta husi Ministra Finansas, Santina José Rodrigues F. Viegas\r\nCarlos no ADB reprezenta husi Country Director ADB iha Timor Leste,&nbsp; Sra. Stefania Dina.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Dili',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:43:51.693868','3ad7c2ebb96fcba7cda0cf54a2e802f5',2,2,'2025-11-24','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--37-2-1','--37-2-1','ministru-obras-públikas-partisipa-serimonia-asinatura-akordu-kona-ba-projeitu-climate-resilient-connectivity-iha-timor-leste-1-1','-','-'),(344,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS LANSA FATUK DAHULUK BA PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HUSI CASA BA ZUMALAI','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS LANSA FATUK DAHULUK BA PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HUSI CASA BA ZUMALAI\r\n\r\nCovalima, 25 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públiku, Samuel Marçal akompañia hosi Ministru Asuntus Kombatentes Libertasaun Nasionál, Gil da Costa Monteiro “Oan Soru”, Vise-Ministru ba Infraestruturas, Júlio do Carmo, Vise-Ministru ba Fortalesimentu Institusionál Saúde, José dos Reis Magno, Sekretáriu Estadu Dezenvolvimentu Lokál, Mateus dos Santos Tallo ho Prezidenti Autoridade Munisipiu Ainaro no Kovalima, hatur fatuk dahuluk ba projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada hosi Suku Casa, Munisipiu Ainaro bá Suku Webaba, Postu Adminsitrativu Zumalai, Munisipiu Kovalima,Tersa-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">MINISTRU\r\nOBRAS PÚBLIKAS LANSA FATUK DAHULUK BA PROJEITU REHABILITASAUN ESTRADA HUSI CASA\r\nBA ZUMALAI<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">Covalima,\r\n25 Novembru 2025</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públiku,\r\nSamuel Marçal akompañia hosi Ministru Asuntus Kombatentes Libertasaun Nasionál,\r\nGil da Costa Monteiro “Oan Soru”, Vise-Ministru ba Infraestruturas, Júlio do\r\nCarmo, Vise-Ministru ba Fortalesimentu Institusionál Saúde, José dos Reis\r\nMagno, Sekretáriu Estadu Dezenvolvimentu Lokál, Mateus dos Santos Tallo ho\r\nPrezidenti Autoridade Munisipiu Ainaro no Kovalima, hatur fatuk dahuluk ba\r\nprojeitu rehabilitasaun estrada hosi Suku Casa, Munisipiu Ainaro bá Suku\r\nWebaba, Postu Adminsitrativu Zumalai, Munisipiu Kovalima,Tersa-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Antes tama ba hatur dahuluk,\r\nlia-nain sira husi suku Raimea ho Mape, Postu Administrativu Zumalai hala\'o\r\nritual kultura nian hodi husu matak malirin ba beiala sira.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha nia deskursu hafoin\r\nlansa hatur tiha fatuk dahuluk ba projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada, Ministru\r\nObras Públiku, Samuel Marçal husu ba Komunidade, Joven no Autoridade Lokal sira\r\nne’ebé hela besik iha area konstrusaun hotu-hotu iha dever atu tau matan ba\r\nobra ida ne\'e, bainhira obra ne’e remata, obra ne’e sei fo benefisiu ba\r\npopulasaun hosi Munisipiu rua ne\'e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">“Hafoin ita hatur tiha fatuk\r\ndahuluk ba projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada hosi Suku Casa, Munisipiu Ainaro bá Suku\r\nWebaba, Postu Adminsitrativu Zumalai, Munisipiu Kovalima, hau husu ba\r\nautoriedade lokal ho komunidade hotu tenki tau matan ba obra ne\'e. Ne\'ebe ohin\r\nofisialmente ita lansa, konstrusaun Estrada ne’e konstrui durante tinan ida.\r\nOsan ne’ebé uja ba projetu ida ne\'e, osan povu nian, povu ida ne\'e maka luta fo\r\nsira nia vida tomak hodi hetan ukun rasik aan, tanba ne\'e ohin ita mai iha ne\'e\r\npartisipa no involve sente katak projetu ida ne\'e ita hotu nian, tan ne\'e ita\r\nhotu tenke tau matan\", hatete Ministru Obras Públikas iha nia diskursu.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas\r\nhaktuir, rehabilitasaun estrada husi Casa, Ainaro ba Webaba, Kovalima ne’ebé\r\nlansa ona ne’e konstrui husi empreza Aitula Unipessoal, Lda no China Overseas\r\nEngineering Group Co., Ltd. (COVEC).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">“Tanba ne’e Hau husu ba\r\nempreza rua ne’e, bainhira ezekuta projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada ne’e tenke\r\nezekuta tuir kontratu, tenke halo ho kualidade, husu mós ba PAM na\'in rua atu\r\ntau matan hodi obra ne’e bele halo lalais ba komunidade sira, labele tuda ema\r\nnia ekipamentus, tesi ema nia fiu makina nian, tanba makina sira nee sosa karun\r\nhodi bele halo dezenvolvimentu diak ba ita nia rai rasik”, hateten Ministru\r\nObras Públikas.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha fatin hanesan, Prezidenti\r\nAutoridade Munisipiu Ainaro, Manuela Georgina Carmo Bucar Corte Real lori povu\r\nhusi Munisipiu rua agradese ba Governu liu husi Ministru Obras P</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ú</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">blikas<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">“Agradese wain ba Governu\r\nliu husi Ministeriu Obras P</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ú</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">blika, ami kontenti tebes\r\nreprezenta povu Ainaro suku Cassa espresa ami nia kontenti, tanba estrada nee\r\nprinsipal tebes ba atividade hotu ohin halo lansamentu ba estrada Ainaru Cassa\r\nliga ba Covalima Zumalai neebe mak durante nee sai preokupasaun ba komunidade\r\nsira povu iha Munisipiu rua nee”, hateten PAM Ainaru.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Nia mos husu ba empreza sira\r\ntenki halo ho kualidade, laos deit Obras P</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ú</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">blikas\r\nmak tun halo akompañia maibe PAM mos akompañia.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">“Laos deit Obras P</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">ú</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">blikas\r\ndeit mak tun akompañia imi maibe ami Prezidenti Autoridade mos iha obrigasaun\r\nakompañia ita boot sira halo hotu lalais atu nunee ita nia komunidade sira liu\r\nba mai lori sira nia produtu bele lao ho livre, seguru ho kondisaun estrada\r\nneebe mak diak”, hateten PAM Ainaru.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha sorin seluk, Prezidenti\r\nAutoridade Munisipiu Covalima, Miguel Armada Cardoso hato’o Bemvindo no\r\nagradese ba Ministru Obras Públikas no Membru Governu balun ne’ebé marka\r\nprezensa iha seremonia hatur fatuk dahuluk ba projeitu rehabilitasaun estrada\r\niha Munisipiu Ainaru no Covalima.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">“Iha tinan hirak nia laran\r\nami halerik, maibe ohin liu husi lansamentu fatuk dahuluk ida nee bele halo\r\nkmaan komunidade sira hodi bele asesu Estrada ne’ebé diak, hau fiar katak tinan\r\nida ka rua bainhira projeitu ne’e remata ona komunidade sira sei la halerik tan\r\nba estrada, tanba ne’e husu ba kualker se deit ita hotu tenke tau matan hodi\r\nobra nee bele lao ho diak”, dehan PAM Covalima.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu projetu\r\nrehabilitasaun ne\'e iha pakote rua, pakote ida kaer husi Kompañia Aitula\r\nUnipessoal, Lda Timor-Leste ho Orsamentu montante $4.023,143.73, Pakote ida\r\nkaer husi Kompañia Xina Overseas Engineering Group,Co.Ltd Xina ho&nbsp; Orsamentu $4,856,254.24, rehabilitasaun\r\nestrada husi Ainaru Cassa liga bá Zumalai ho nia durasaun tinan ida.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Covallima',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:45:26.975608','b3967a0e938dc2a6340e258630febd5a',2,2,'2025-11-25','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','--','-','--39-1-1','--39-1-1','ministru-obras-públikas-lansa-fatuk-dahuluk-ba-projeitu-rehabilitasaun-estrada-husi-casa-ba-zumalai-1-1','-','-'),(345,'MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA SERIMONIA KOMEMORASAUN TINAN-50 PROKLAMASAUN INDEPENDENSIA RDTL IHA RAEOA','MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS PARTISIPA SERIMONIA KOMEMORASAUN TINAN-50 PROKLAMASAUN INDEPENDENSIA RDTL IHA RAEOA\r\n\r\nOe-cusse, 26 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nMinistru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal ho komitiva hafoin to iha posto integrado fronteira Sacato, Suco Nipane, kuarta-feira ne’e simu direta hosi entidade tutelar no superintendençia dos orgão executiva RAEOA iha Região Administrativa Especial De Oé-Cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), akompañiadu husi Membrus Comissão Organizadora ba komemorasaun Loron Proklamasaun Unilaterál Independénsia Republika Demokratika de Timor Leste  (RDTL), bá dala-50 (28 Novembru 1975-28 Novembru 2025). Tuir lisan Atoni Oé-cusse nian, Lian Nain Suco Nipani sei simu ho matak malirin no haklaken dadolin versaun “Mahein Odamatan parti loro sae nian”.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">MINISTRU OBRAS P</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">BLIKAS\r\nPARTISIPA SERIMONIA KOMEMORASAUN TINAN-50 PROKLAMASAUN INDEPENDENSIA RDTL IHA\r\nRAEOA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Oe-cusse, 26 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel\r\nMarçal ho komitiva hafoin to iha posto integrado fronteira Sacato, Suco Nipane,\r\nkuarta-feira ne’e simu direta hosi entidade tutelar no superintendençia dos\r\norgão executiva RAEOA iha Região Administrativa Especial De Oé-Cusse Ambeno\r\n(RAEOA), akompañiadu husi Membrus Comissão Organizadora ba komemorasaun Loron\r\nProklamasaun Unilaterál Independénsia Republika Demokratika de Timor Leste&nbsp; (RDTL), bá dala-50 (28 Novembru 1975-28\r\nNovembru 2025). Tuir lisan Atoni Oé-cusse nian, Lian Nain Suco Nipani sei simu\r\nho matak malirin no haklaken dadolin versaun “Mahein Odamatan parti loro sae\r\nnian”.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Prezensa Ministru Obras\r\nPúblikas, Samuel Marçal iha Oe-cusse atu partisipa serimónia komemorasaun Loron\r\nProklamasaun Unilaterál Independénsia bá dala-50 (28 Novembru 1975-28 Novembru\r\n2025).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Alende ne\'e, atu halo mós\r\nvizita da-huluk hodi haree direta servisu autoridade atuál ne\'ebé simu\r\nkonfiansa iha fulan Setembru liu-bá.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:50:15.409844','d81f9c1be2e08964bf9f24b15f0e4900',1,2,'2025-11-26','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--39','--39','ministru-obras-públikas-partisipa-serimonia-komemorasaun-tinan-50-proklamasaun-independensia-rdtl-iha-raeoa-1','-','-'),(346,'PM XANANA PARTISIPA MISA ASAUN DE GRASA HODI SELEBERA TINAN-50 LORON PROKLAMASAUN UNILATERAL INDEPENDENSIA RDTL IHA RAEOA','PM XANANA PARTISIPA MISA ASAUN DE GRASA HODI SELEBERA TINAN-50 LORON PROKLAMASAUN UNILATERAL INDEPENDENSIA RDTL IHA RAEOA\r\n\r\nOe-cusse, 27 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Julio do Carmo, Sekretariu Estadu ba Eletrisidade, Bee no Saneamentu, Santos Noronha ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika (KFP), Agostinho Letêncio de Deus, Komandante Unidade Patrullamentu Fronteira (UPF), Superintendente Xefe Polisía Euclides Bello ho sarani sira partisipa misa asaun de grasa hodi selebra Loron Proklamasaun Unilaterál Independénsia bá dala-50 (28 Novembru 1975-28 Novembru 2025), Republika Demokratika De Timor Leste  (RDTL)  , iha Igreja Párokia Numbei, Oécusse Ambeno.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA PARTISIPA MISA\r\nASAUN DE GRASA HODI SELEBERA TINAN-50 LORON PROKLAMASAUN UNILATERAL INDEPENDENSIA\r\nRDTL IHA RAEOA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Oe-cusse, 27 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise\r\nMinistru Infraestrutura, Julio do Carmo, Sekretariu Estadu ba Eletrisidade, Bee\r\nno Saneamentu, Santos Noronha ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika (KFP), Agostinho\r\nLetêncio de Deus, Komandante Unidade Patrullamentu Fronteira (UPF),\r\nSuperintendente Xefe Polisía Euclides Bello ho sarani sira partisipa misa asaun\r\nde grasa hodi selebra Loron Proklamasaun Unilaterál Independénsia bá dala-50\r\n(28 Novembru 1975-28 Novembru 2025), Republika Demokratika De Timor Leste&nbsp; (RDTL)&nbsp;\r\n, iha Igreja Párokia Numbei, Oécusse Ambeno.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:51:58.604584','13f9896df61279c928f19721878fac41',1,2,'2025-11-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--37-2','--37-2','pm-xanana-partisipa-misa-asaun-de-grasa-hodi-selebera-tinan-50-loron-proklamasaun-unilateral-independensia-rdtl-iha-raeoa-1','-','-'),(347,'PM XANANA AKOMPAÑIA MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS HALO OBSERVASAUN BA PROJEITU INFRAESTRUTURA SIRA IHA RAEOA','PM XANANA AKOMPAÑIA MINISTRU OBRAS PÚBLIKAS HALO OBSERVASAUN BA PROJEITU INFRAESTRUTURA SIRA IHA RAEOA\r\n\r\nOe-cusse, 27 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompania hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise Ministru Infraestrutura,Julio do Carmo, Sekretariu Estadu ba Eletrisidade Bee no Saneamnetu Santos Noronha ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika (KFP),Agostinho Letêncio de Deus, Komandante Unidade Patrullamentu Fronteira (UPF), Superintendente Xefe Polisía Euclides Bello, halo vizita traballu hodi observasaun ba projeitu infraestrutura sira iha Região Administrativa Especial De Oé-Cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), kinta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA AKOMPA</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Ñ</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">IA\r\nMINISTRU OBRAS P</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin\">Ú</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">BLIKAS HALO OBSERVASAUN BA PROJEITU INFRAESTRUTURA\r\nSIRA IHA RAEOA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Oe-cusse, 27 Novembru 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão akompania hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise\r\nMinistru Infraestrutura,Julio do Carmo, Sekretariu Estadu ba Eletrisidade Bee\r\nno Saneamnetu Santos Noronha ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika (KFP),Agostinho\r\nLetêncio de Deus, Komandante Unidade Patrullamentu Fronteira (UPF),\r\nSuperintendente Xefe Polisía Euclides Bello, halo vizita traballu hodi\r\nobservasaun ba projeitu infraestrutura sira iha Região Administrativa Especial\r\nDe Oé-Cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), kinta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Projeitu infraestrutra\r\nne’ebé PM Xanana ho ekipa vizita uluk mák projetu emergency CYCLOP iha mota\r\nNoefefan ne’ebé konstrui husi husi Kompanhia HEDGE Construction Unipessoal,\r\nLda.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hafoin remata PM Xanana ho\r\nekipa kontinua hakat kedan ba fatin lansamentu perfurasaun Be Moos ho modelu\r\nTube well – iha Barasantu, suku Lalisuk.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:54:01.831729','c5ff2543b53f4cc0ad3819a36752467b',2,2,'2025-11-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--40','--40','pm-xanana-akompañia-ministru-obras-públikas-halo-observasaun-ba-projeitu-infraestrutura-sira-iha-raeoa-1','-','-'),(348,'PM XANANA HO EKIPA KUDA DU’UT VETIVER IHA RAI LOLON FRONTEIRA OESILO','PM XANANA HO EKIPA KUDA DU’UT VETIVER IHA RAI LOLON FRONTEIRA OESILO\r\n\r\nRAEOA, 27 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão ho ekipa hafoin remata, monitoriza projetu Estrada Tono – Oesilo, kontinua kedan ba atividade, kuda Du’ut Vetiver iha rai lolon estrada foun projetu Estrada Tono – Oesilo (Asuntu protesaun bio-engineering) no kontinua observa dezenvolvimentu iha área fronteira Oesilo liga ba PLBN Napan – TTU, Kinta-feira ne\'e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">PM\r\nXANANA HO EKIPA KUDA DU’UT VETIVER IHA RAI LOLON FRONTEIRA OESILO<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\">RAEOA,\r\n27 Novembru 2025</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão ho ekipa hafoin remata, monitoriza projetu Estrada Tono –\r\nOesilo, kontinua kedan ba atividade, kuda Du’ut Vetiver iha rai lolon estrada\r\nfoun projetu Estrada Tono – Oesilo (Asuntu protesaun bio-engineering) no\r\nkontinua observa dezenvolvimentu iha área fronteira Oesilo liga ba PLBN Napan –\r\nTTU, Kinta-feira ne\'e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Objetivu prinsipál husi kuda\r\ndu\'ut vetiver maka atu prevene erozaun no rai-halai iha area foho-lolon.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha atividade ne\'e Xefe\r\nGoverno&nbsp; akompania hosi Ministru Obras\r\nPúblikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo,\r\nSekretáriu Estadu Eletrisidade, Água no Saneamentu, Santos Noronha, Autoridade\r\nRAEOA ho ZEEDOA, Autoridade Seguransa ho Defeza, konsuladu Timor Leste iha\r\nAtambua, Indonezia inklui Komandante Posto Seguransa Indonezia nian ne\'ebé\r\ndestaka iha Fronteira entre Timor Leste ho Indonezia (Napan).*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 01:55:42.981683','01386bd6d8e091c2ab4c7c7de644d37b',1,2,'2025-11-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--37-3','--37-3','pm-xanana-ho-ekipa-kuda-du-ut-vetiver-iha-rai-lolon-fronteira-oesilo-1','-','-'),(349,'PM XANANA ENSERA JOGU XANANA CUP IHA KAMPU FUTEBOL OEBAU OE-CUSSE','PM XANANA ENSERA JOGU XANANA CUP IHA KAMPU FUTEBOL OEBAU OE-CUSSE\r\n\r\nOe-cusse, 28 November 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise Ministru Infraestrutura, Julio do Carmo, Sekretariu Estadu ba Eletrisidade Bee no SaneameNtu Santos Noronha ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika (KFP), Agostinho Letêncio de Deus, Komandante Unidade Patrullamentu Fronteira (UPF), Superintendente Xefe Polisía, Euclides Bello, ho Prezidente Autoridade Rejiaun Administrativa Espesial Oe-Cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), Régio Servantes Romeia da Cruz Salu, hamutuk ho Koordenador Zona Ekonomika Espesiál Dezenvolvimentu Oe-Cusse Ambeno (ZEEDOA) Erkulanu de Sousa ho estrutura RAEOA, ensera Torneo Tasa Rotativa jogu Futebol Xanana Copa tinan 2025 iha RAEOA, Sesta-feira ne’e iha kampo Futebol Oe-cusse Vila.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA ENSERA JOGU XANANA\r\nCUP IHA KAMPU FUTEBOL OEBAU OE-CUSSE<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Oe-cusse, 28 November 2025<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise\r\nMinistru Infraestrutura, Julio do Carmo, Sekretariu Estadu ba Eletrisidade Bee\r\nno SaneameNtu Santos Noronha ho Prezidente Komisaun Funsaun Públika (KFP),\r\nAgostinho Letêncio de Deus, Komandante Unidade Patrullamentu Fronteira (UPF),\r\nSuperintendente Xefe Polisía, Euclides Bello, ho Prezidente Autoridade Rejiaun\r\nAdministrativa Espesial Oe-Cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), Régio Servantes Romeia da Cruz\r\nSalu, hamutuk ho Koordenador Zona Ekonomika Espesiál Dezenvolvimentu Oe-Cusse\r\nAmbeno (ZEEDOA) Erkulanu de Sousa ho estrutura RAEOA, ensera Torneo Tasa\r\nRotativa jogu Futebol Xanana Copa tinan 2025 iha RAEOA, Sesta-feira ne’e iha\r\nkampo Futebol Oe-cusse Vila.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Entretantu iha jogu final FC\r\nSuku Naimeko sai hanesan Primeru Lugar hafoin halakon nia adversariu FC Suku\r\nLalisuk hodi sai kampeaun iha jogu final no FC suku Lalisuk okupa segundu Lugar\r\nno FC Suku Costa Terseiru.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 02:00:55.017044','0bb4aec1710521c12ee76289d9440817',5,2,'2025-11-28','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--37','--37','pm-xanana-ensera-jogu-xanana-cup-iha-kampu-futebol-oebau-oe-cusse-1','-','-'),(350,'FILA HUSI MONITORIZA PROJEITU ESTRADA TONO-OESILO PM XANANA HO EKIPA KONTINUA KUDA AI-FUNAN IHA RAEOA','FILA HUSI MONITORIZA PROJEITU ESTRADA TONO-OESILO PM XANANA HO EKIPA KONTINUA KUDA AI-FUNAN IHA RAEOA\r\n\r\nRAEOA, 27 November 2025\r\n\r\nHafoin remata monitoriza projetu Estrada Tono – Oesilo Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão ho ekipa kontinua kedan ba kuda ai-funan iha sidade kapitál Rejiaun Administrativa Espesiál Oe-cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), kinta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">FILA HUSI MONITORIZA PROJEITU\r\nESTRADA TONO-OESILO PM XANANA HO EKIPA KONTINUA KUDA AI-FUNAN IHA RAEOA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">RAEOA, 27 November 2025</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hafoin remata monitoriza\r\nprojetu Estrada Tono – Oesilo Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão ho\r\nekipa kontinua kedan ba kuda ai-funan iha sidade kapitál Rejiaun Administrativa\r\nEspesiál Oe-cusse Ambeno (RAEOA), kinta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Kuda ai-funan simbólika\r\nne’ebé hala’o iha área Santa Rosa, hafoin kuda simbólika, traballadór sira hosi\r\nempreza PAX kontinua kedan halo asaun konkreta hodi kuda ai-funan iha sidade Oe-cusse.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Iha serimónia ne’e kuda ai\r\nfunan ne’e Xefe Governo akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal,\r\nVise Ministru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo, Sekretáriu Estadu Eletrisidade,\r\nÁgua no Saneamentu, Santos Noronha, Autoridade RAEOA ho ZEEDOA inklui\r\nAutoridade Seguransa ho Defeza.*<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">M</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">í</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">dia-MOP</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 02:02:49.817594','9de6d14fff9806d4bcd1ef555be766cd',2,2,'2025-11-27','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--37-4','--37-4','fila-husi-monitoriza-projeitu-estrada-tono-oesilo-pm-xanana-ho-ekipa-kontinua-kuda-ai-funan-iha-raeoa-1','-','-'),(351,'PM XANANA SAI INSPETOR IHA SERIMONIA KOMEMORASAUN LORON PROKLAMASAUN INDEPENDENSIA RDTLBA DALA-50 IHA RAEOA','PM XANANA SAI INSPETOR IHA SERIMONIA KOMEMORASAUN LORON PROKLAMASAUN INDEPENDENSIA RDTLBA DALA-50 IHA RAEOA\r\n\r\nOe-cusse, 28 Novembru 2025\r\n\r\nPrimeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay Rala Xanana Gusmão sai  inspetór iha serimónia Isar Bandeira hodi komemora loron Proklamasaun Unilateral Independensia Repúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste (RDTL) ba dala-50, iha Kampu 1 de Maiu, Palaban, Oecusse, Sesta-feira ne’e.','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">PM XANANA SAI INSPETOR IHA\r\nSERIMONIA KOMEMORASAUN LORON PROKLAMASAUN INDEPENDENSIA RDTLBA DALA-50 IHA RAEOA<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Oe-cusse, 28 Novembru 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Primeiru-Ministru (PM), Kay\r\nRala Xanana Gusmão sai&nbsp; inspetór iha\r\nserimónia Isar Bandeira hodi komemora loron Proklamasaun Unilateral Independensia\r\nRepúblika Demokrátika Timor-Leste (RDTL) ba dala-50, iha Kampu 1 de Maiu,\r\nPalaban, Oecusse, Sesta-feira ne’e.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Serimónia Isar Bandeira ne’e\r\nXefe Governo akompañia hosi Ministru Obras Públikas, Samuel Marçal, Vise\r\nMinistru Infraestrutura, Júlio do Carmo, Sekretáriu Estadu Eletrisidade, Água\r\nno Saneamentu, Santos Noronha, Autoridade RAEOA ho ZEEDOA, Autoridade Seguransa\r\nho Defeza, konsuladu Timor Leste iha Atambua, Indonezia inklui konvidado\r\nespesial sira husi Indonezia Bupati Timor Tenggah Utara, Bupati Timor Tengah\r\nUtara (TTU) adalah Yosep Falentinus Delasalle Kebo.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif\">Hafoin Serimónia hatun\r\nBandeira remata Xefe Governu ho nia membru sira akompañia hosi bainaka espesial\r\nsira presta homenajen ba Martires da patria sira hodi tau ai funan iha area\r\ntasi ibun Palaban.*</span> <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">M</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;\r\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">í</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:&quot;Cambria Math&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-ID;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">dia-MOP</span></b></p>','Oe-cusse',1,0,1,0,'2025-12-01 02:05:01.831250','efe937780e95574250dabe07151bdc23',1,2,'2025-11-28','<p>-</p>','<p>-</p>','-','-','--41-1','--41-1','pm-xanana-sai-inspetor-iha-serimonia-komemorasaun-loron-proklamasaun-independensia-rdtlba-dala-50-iha-raeoa-1','-','-');
